4.1	37.5335481	127.1358269	2026-02-16 19:10:30.909652	2026-03-17 20:35:13.70505	019c65ee-217d-7fb6-932c-5f9320be9615	CAFE	ChIJ_2C3xfyvfDUR-YIlWEr6_MI	23150275	카페 온도	[{"author": "MI YOUNG Go", "rating": 3, "content": "협소하지만 코지한 느낌을 주는 카페입니다. 커피음료가 아닌 라테류의 드링크는 많이 달아요. 단것 싫어하시는 분들은 참고하세요~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUfcRU_NX5L0cNpOry4sOtXbenzNxlW3NR1eJ6q9M3y2UVKY41Jig=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "umbra", "rating": 4, "content": "가격대도 괜찮고 인테리어도 아기자기하고 음료 디저트 둘다 괜찮은편", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXLQQM7aPAKVi9_2iIhnKEFvaJ9L-xwyNW8B60dEMUEcAeIQTwC=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "hyewon july", "rating": 4, "content": "일본 어느카페같은 느낌. 분위기가 참 좋은데 사장님이 살짝 무뚝뚝", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUVjXxtJEFm0hrxTkErAqlmTHkqQwBcXQErmTU56TQJ-lGkD-Tfcw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Do Remi", "rating": 4, "content": "아이스아메리카노 얼그레이초콜릿라떼 주문했어요.\\n매장 깔끔하고 커피, 음료도 맛있네요~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX3JD-puz3SxdtMmqfDu6PuG7CnWitJLQ7JRuqcFjjrA6k4mNRVGA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "seung hwan Cho", "rating": 5, "content": "음료와 디저트의 퀄리티가 정말 독보적입니다\\n그냥 가격만 봐서는 그냥 싸지않은 동네 평범한 카페지만 맛과 퀄리티는 정말 최고급 카페수준입니다\\n주차장이 없습니다만\\n가게 앞에 한두대 정도 주차가능한것 같습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUXFtgloumaSLF1fbuzSgdU3ifyv6WUEZmQQDBRZIgtn2hazoPA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "박순찬", "rating": 4, "content": "커피숍이 아늑하고 분위기도 굿굿 커피 맛도 최고고\\n흡연실이 따로 있어 흡연하시는 분들한테는 좋을듯요 카페 밖에 의자가 있는데 통풍도 잘되고 교통편이 좋아요~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL4PrIfDIMTD4Fl7WG5MjBNgTYKz6AkeqINz2U3gwUlgzVExw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "조현경", "rating": 5, "content": "요즘 카페 문을 일찍닫는데\\n11시까지 영업해서 좋았어요\\n사장님 진짜 친절하시고 크로플 맛있습니다!!!\\n커피도 저렴해요!!! 아아 3300원이었어요!!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUgJ66DN_mecRY22smmp3x5-tmHWGcbAjU__kgdPW1Z8InoBJdk-A=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "지영훈", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기좋고 커맛있고 최고예요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXQsidtpwGLmMIibV_1oCIUPhWMH1WEN2RnYYUDOCkchhuKwuk9=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ_2C3xfyvfDUR-YIlWEr6_MI/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ_2C3xfyvfDUR-YIlWEr6_MI/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ_2C3xfyvfDUR-YIlWEr6_MI/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ_2C3xfyvfDUR-YIlWEr6_MI/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ_2C3xfyvfDUR-YIlWEr6_MI/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ_2C3xfyvfDUR-YIlWEr6_MI/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [0, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [0, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [0, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [0, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [0, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [0, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000B15A4F63B1C85F40E52BDC4D4BC44240
