4.3	37.5400041	127.1279684	2026-02-16 19:10:30.914155	2026-03-17 20:34:02.742474	019c65ee-2182-75a1-a641-20dc90ec296f	CAFE	ChIJCb8jMACwfDUR-JEU0mPYNAA	26856403	카페알마	[{"author": "최고일", "rating": 5, "content": "흡연을 동시에\\n넓고 쾌적하고 매장이 이쁘고\\n책읽거나 사색에 잠길때  꼭 찾는다\\n물이 좋다 ㅋㅋ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLokkbw4tF0QFYLA8M4yeNl4yfPQn-gCEugXm4SlFnrrpUZUA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "최서윤", "rating": 5, "content": "앉아서 흡연이 가능한 아주 드문 카페. 무슨 사유인지는 모르겠음. 가격은 개인카페 치고 싸진 않은데 양이 많음.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJT_8vGFtfgBsL7yIfZtBEBTJ6wyqKIw3aKT77Lr2hxrPKu=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "윤정환 (수컷여우)", "rating": 5, "content": "천호동의 유일한 흡연카페. 미성년자 출입관리가 안되어 저녁시간대에 매우 시끄러운 단점이 있지만 그 외의 모든 것이 완벽", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUPwjU0O0TbZkaqVOMABlTQVPeR6uqwWhqC_2jJtNsRi0Fmpsy9PA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "자라", "rating": 5, "content": "윗층은 흡연가능. 흡연자랑 어른이들 핫플레이스. 커피맛은 그닥", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVnbKUMDZa6f45u-6SZ_RVvCo4jPVvilARShPlRO_pwLbLZrL4o=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "김인숙", "rating": 5, "content": "연유라떼 아이스도 핫도 맛있어요\\n꼭 먹어봐야함\\n12시 오픈", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIuGbcPm-KJ6SadP24fPIInDs9VeyJsU7pemgFWDFsYRD5Ckw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "eol Lee", "rating": 4, "content": "곰돌이 세절귀 포토스팟/ 2층 흡연가능 /단독메뉴많아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLmXlnSHt19iNCkjV_wInSn_uYcfmLpjZwj9oKJejpg1goRXts=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Erica Choi", "rating": 4, "content": "👍🏻", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXSfLpW7uGc1J8PYh2AMzaDjJPAOz8x4QDt8ZyW9FE1-SYKqbk=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "최송규 # 만남나무TV", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXA1PQ4BJRhodPCqHLej2CQuswHmwOJrgeW6km1_eTw_DQbfbjf=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJCb8jMACwfDUR-JEU0mPYNAA/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJCb8jMACwfDUR-JEU0mPYNAA/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJCb8jMACwfDUR-JEU0mPYNAA/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJCb8jMACwfDUR-JEU0mPYNAA/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000F93A5FA230C85F405B9AB6DA1EC54240
