4.2	37.486387	126.8542763	2026-02-16 19:10:33.747796	2026-03-17 20:27:03.829928	019c65ee-2c93-7234-b64e-7affacdc2373	CAFE	ChIJJTuW9whiezUR6tB4iC4H1Ig	791485761	드립하우스	[{"author": "Mandatory Service", "rating": 5, "content": "키위 스무디가 꽤 맛있습니다. 개인적으로 설탕을 퍼부은 음료같은 맛을 안좋아하는데, 생 과일의 순수한 당도만 살린 맛이 너무 좋아요. 심지어 사이즈가 상당히 커요 ㄷㄷ;", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI24iPl2SuD3DsbGEoKqz3X2dsMXp07kCvRA6TWm1Y3kHMFKOEA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "코스모스", "rating": 4, "content": "아아메 맛있네요. 원두를 좋으거 쓰는거\\n같아요. 본점에 첫방문했는데 가격도 착하고 맛도 좋아서 만족했어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLMnsr0L-aT-lN654nClzNuUUdbxJH7UlofmbenUs_iujx9oQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Jin Soichiro", "rating": 4, "content": "커피 맛있어요\\n끄레마도 잘나와있는거같아서 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWLmAftWfm59JvQvoAXvsq4q4-GA_KQW_A3SMW1JINsqUrs1eyO=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Matthew Seunghyun Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "매우 좋아요!!\\n커피도 맛있고 다른 음료도 맛있어요!!\\n베이커리도 짱입니다!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJVHt4X64jyLm2I3oIdCSKA3AuOKdkI-50CM-r9Q7Yst-Wptv4=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "이준호", "rating": 5, "content": "음료 가 최고\\n\\n영수증 리뷰 증정 커피 팩 이 최고", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJDdDtLgnBexhEsnBEf25eslQnPBdORqPTM0_4tvvFz2GJWqA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "오노노키요츠기", "rating": 5, "content": "원두 직접 로스팅하는 개봉에선 제일 맛있는 커피집", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVjjT_bCy58oy-nQVOO4hTUJXx9PamRl3Nm8eqdN8yWInCDZUi1=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "김신호", "rating": 5, "content": "커피가 맛있어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXpbPyS8Lwz13r8jNYTc3_6kg5qipZyWpxtAwikOB9KIrz1RfqLVQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "송유림", "rating": 5, "content": "여기 커피가 제 기준입니다👍", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWmcPvPPHDu6qR4RBwzvbOU77VvKThCngQVtOOVLrP1Epc_SiR1=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJJTuW9whiezUR6tB4iC4H1Ig/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJJTuW9whiezUR6tB4iC4H1Ig/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJJTuW9whiezUR6tB4iC4H1Ig/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000DD8F8076ACB65F408B19E1ED41BE4240
