4.5	37.7620921	127.0461794	2026-02-16 19:10:39.241035	2026-03-17 20:33:36.057845	019c65ee-4209-782e-86a0-80bfe35f56a1	CAFE	ChIJzWbORxbHfDURz51rKEAALwc	1599289435	투시즌 카페	[{"author": "syoung w", "rating": 5, "content": "베이커리 카페인데 피자가 유명한 곳.\\n카페 음료와 베이커리, 피자를 함께 먹을 수 있으며\\n넉넉한 주차공간과 1,2층 매장 내부가 넓다.\\n테이블간 거리가 멀어서 대화하기 좋음.\\n단체로 이용하기도 좋다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJqWbqcRAUEsXm_bFkHAXjpKuJBDeiokcoAYR1KjUK47b3itw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "꼴통두더지", "rating": 5, "content": "커피맛있어요\\n사장님께서 커피원두나 베이커리재료는 최상급을사용하신다고하네요\\n가격도 합리적이고 직원분들친절하고 분위기도좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKT3N2T3chRBADoJs9xU_8VS0I-faQTcC3HyEnLnZtJLd4ewQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "향기나는백조", "rating": 3, "content": "사장님이 무지 친절하시고 빵도 맛나서 한동안 엄청 자주 갔었는데, 언제인가부터 여사장님이 그전같지 않더라구요. 바쁜 건 알겠는데 더이상 친절하시지도 않고 손님 응대할 때 말 끝나기도 전에 딱딱 말 자르고 항상 인상쓰는 얼굴에.......--;;\\n그래도 빵은 맛나요~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLJj1O4jDCAYR229oBCwB7YAqcXSFguxZ0HdJDKoQ1BcQ0tjQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "조영애", "rating": 5, "content": "저희 단골카페예요\\n커피맛이 아주 좋아요~\\n고급원두를 사용하셔서 저희는 만족하며 자주 방문한답니다.\\n사장님도 친절하시고 편안한 분위기..특히 저희는 다락공간 찜~~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKubYnWHWF6lSEOMzYZiBFQo3Z_VollX2MyR5JBZV621VscIw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "손재열", "rating": 4, "content": "주차장도 넓고 빵과 피자도 맛있어요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIZaiDotXJcOClOCoi3c1jH9y2CH97gmxaogdrDzXtQ8P7n9Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "김소영", "rating": 5, "content": "가족끼리 편하게.맛나게.아주 기분좋게 다녀올수있는곳인것같슺니다.피자.커피 참 맛있네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ3H0zI9js-L1muojOx68aF9LuH5a2rT3y5mrP5F0UTcSrynQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Jeongeun Lee", "rating": 4, "content": "테이블 배치가 별로임.2층 있으나 더움.\\n시끄러움. 뭔가...아늑한 까페 느낌이 없음.\\n주차장 넓음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJO9hWYjOGgFFc88YfrMJmo-xy7cSBro1daNMzVY1dbmw03hg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Hunjae Ryu", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW46-slAvSso73lhF_pTSeVMQK7BUGxLiFubDpVCxVLsri_pmA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJzWbORxbHfDURz51rKEAALwc/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJzWbORxbHfDURz51rKEAALwc/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJzWbORxbHfDURz51rKEAALwc/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJzWbORxbHfDURz51rKEAALwc/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000EE2F719AF4C25F401D05E33B8CE14240
