4.3	37.5398424	126.94888689999999	2026-02-16 19:10:40.6048	2026-03-17 20:37:14.399791	019c65ee-475c-76fc-aacd-04506dd64090	CAFE	ChIJqdh5q6iYfDURQQlHBCP1zx0	12572454	커피 비상구	[{"author": "Jimmie Hwang", "rating": 4, "content": "마포에 오면 종종 들르는 카페.\\n분위기도 좋고, 테이블도 적당하고.\\n친절하세요. 차도 맛있어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKzWs1XHaPrkl1nM9J7JA-j_Sg2LIOLoFVbmNxhuHI5iTelOg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "고기람", "rating": 4, "content": "마포역 카페를 검색하면 온통 프릳츠만 나오는데 은근 커피맛 좋은 카페가 많다. 이곳도 마찬가지. 뛰어난 기교는 없지만 조용하고 편안한 분위기에서 로스팅 커피를 마실 수 있는 ‘동네카페’", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW2hO_2KJMJfnjEgfcEWdCBoaoswWcHZQBlJMrPQlqNdNXvpbI=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Seo Yeong Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "커피잔 이쁘고 분위기도 엄청 아늑하고 좋았어여! 비엔나 커피 완전 맛있게 먹었습니다! 굿 ㅎㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWxMnsVmugSWYOr7Nhhxuo8WpvSSyd4On7DRNzHJOe8KJZNZCnqrQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Maxx", "rating": 4, "content": "맛있어요. 회사 근처에 있었으면 매일 갔을텐데..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUBMGNPOYFvCkOT3nQfi-MQ20Cv5T0Jdsq7S8UuVtreiBzTHYO93w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "DKA S", "rating": 5, "content": "커피 핸드드립으로 내려주시고 수제 스콘 맛있음. 깨찰빵 과 자몽청 풍성한 자몽차 가 시그니처인듯", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLqNCnYzfRoPUxFGfDnJJ1c3XtOTg81le3syrMHPgg_-mF0zQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "invite9864", "rating": 5, "content": "자가 로스팅한 원두와 직접 만든 생크림의 비엔나커피 (아인슈패너)", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKVKkbws7SqthexvAQ4yP3YLcyf6kKKHeQisl9nKmoreaIIww=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "표표", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님 알바분들 친절하시고 커피싸고 맛있어요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU7jDtGgrlN_hvYPBiyj-ff87ED05ABEqpULnQrSQUXSnhM1VZx=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "SIHYUN JUN", "rating": 5, "content": "너무나 친절하신 사장님^^ 수제자몽에이드 뿐만 아니라 바닐라라떼라 너무나 맛있는 마포 핫플입니다^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ78kfYZAHTaQ-XCPARwy4Gp95EDuW9GH9yhrJhch6XiELmNg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJqdh5q6iYfDURQQlHBCP1zx0/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJqdh5q6iYfDURQQlHBCP1zx0/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJqdh5q6iYfDURQQlHBCP1zx0/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJqdh5q6iYfDURQQlHBCP1zx0/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJqdh5q6iYfDURQQlHBCP1zx0/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJqdh5q6iYfDURQQlHBCP1zx0/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [11, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E610000094C61E90BABC5F40407F468E19C54240
