4.6	37.553846799999995	127.09376879999999	2026-02-16 19:10:45.958986	2026-03-17 23:56:11.530338	019c65ee-5c47-7f80-8ab7-85ef86653770	CAFE	ChIJP21a6k-7fDUR-Y96uYWWA_E	1892508629	카페로	[{"author": "shinjohnss", "rating": 5, "content": "영화사 삼거리에  술 한잔 하러 오면~\\n언제 부턴가  꼭  들리게   되는\\n커피집이다~~~~~~~~\\n\\n카페를  보고 있으면~\\n페퍼민트  아이스크림이  생각난다~~\\n\\n가게의  색감이 이뻐서  지나면서\\n반드시 보게  되는   집이다~~~~\\n\\n웬지  아재들끼리 가기에는\\n뭔가  좀   어색한....  ㅋㅋㅋ\\n\\n커피맛도  아주  좋다~~\\n애스프레소, 아아  ,뜨아\\n다    스벅  보다   맛 있다!!!!!!!\\n\\n뭔가  선명하고  브라이트한\\n느낌   좋아 하시는  분들은\\n분명  좋아 하실듯 하다~~~\\n\\n사진  함께  올리니  보시길 바랍니다^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUtoxuj0fIFXwZz2mpu8jBHyZ_zDnx1E8LaY0-3YWT0W-nllnIY=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "J Persona (myaongjji)", "rating": 5, "content": "친절하고 아늑한 동네 카페. 크로플 맛집으로 소문나있음 !", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWU-M4Icf7dhZx3FbRpqoaUlq_bYYAqGmFhvxj33C2yRu-nBffdBA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "산인", "rating": 4, "content": "분위기도 좋고 여러 가지 다 좋고 솝 씨드 좋은데 커피맛이 약간 내 입맛에 맞지 않았다. 커피가 쓴 맛이 조금 강했다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIEGQ2Ed-6ZYkSs4Xr4wHApBqubaBw-m4rFTYWRp9jqihlujg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "YEJIN HAN", "rating": 5, "content": "내부가 민트색으로 화사하게 이뻐요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLgR3IFmvHPUV_rWJQlFNvn3mQhVNHaRu11GJp5uyVt4YVZXQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "정혜정", "rating": 4, "content": "커피가 아주 맛나요 ^^ 조용하고 특히 사장님이 매우친절 하심니다^^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJK7Ch1EBwQve-imcwLS-hGeQRrtzq5ZOxy9nKbyTsNI1jLQg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "캐논데일 F300", "rating": 4, "content": "아차산 주변에 직원들이 친절한 카페입니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVNVfHzDpw996newycSOY8mPQC91cWP-WEZzi3zyg4K4oMzdc770Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "이희경", "rating": 5, "content": "커피도 맛있고 분위기도 굿~^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWb0bftPMsO0pjM1aoRQ7BPoMq4ErlxQHT4jTzynHygwfA3OUk8qA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Seung Pil Hyun", "rating": 5, "content": "조용하고 아늑한 분위기가 좋아합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIppJCDWOgJg7ykMoh_SOl3gAG9C2PHD4MuLzasWT32WJgiTxFB=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJP21a6k-7fDUR-Y96uYWWA_E/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJP21a6k-7fDUR-Y96uYWWA_E/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJP21a6k-7fDUR-Y96uYWWA_E/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJP21a6k-7fDUR-Y96uYWWA_E/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}]	0101000020E6100000A658DA4E00C65F40437FB273E4C64240
