4.3	37.501176099999995	126.8828394	2026-02-16 19:10:47.133551	2026-03-17 20:42:10.675954	019c65ee-60dd-7200-992b-faaa822ddbbb	CAFE	ChIJ9e6319yffDUR9Rz8AgwndF8	649401592	스타벅스 구로NC점	[{"author": "Sun Sin (말리)", "rating": 4, "content": "커피와 음료: 타매장과 동일\\n빵과 케익: 바질크림 베이글 및 베이글 매진\\n분위기: 오후6시30분전까지는 사람들이 너무 많아 시끄러워요. 그이후에는 한가하네요\\n장점:쇼핑몰내 2층에 있어 위치가 좋고 매장이 넓음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWBI0O6MnZfTmuvUDmDA997ALoTuRXNVqDp9E5qbVWJDvk5nNIa=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "JY Park", "rating": 4, "content": "아침에는 조용해서 집중하기 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWigtH8TnFNTA_y--i4QhQhsuZsRq7xHueMicHvRW-ToQRif0bA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Soonhee Kwon", "rating": 4, "content": "여긴 자리 앉아서 무언가 하려고 하면 안되는곳입니다. 그냥 음료 빨리주문해서 탈출하셔야합니다. 뛰어다니는 아이들 목소리큰 어른들 시장 한복판도 이보다는 조용할듯 일하시는 직원분들 귀는 괜찮으신가요??", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUgHw39uJO5GA8nrpDC-jzM2egdJS3EmtlbCk6M0FxPKneAMs8-=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "bitna yoo", "rating": 5, "content": "매장 넓고 친절해서 좋아요 특히 집앞이라 너무 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUiFk-6wIYw7rtNcIhgaaCkyEQv-YE_jyTduS7SL8HJd98XJ4s=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "HYUNG-WOO DO", "rating": 4, "content": "늘 똑갈은 커피맛을 느끼는 스타벅스.\\n구로역에서 내려 바로 있어 가기가 편합니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXAFLsbk5BqEsmuhYcDBdQgOLdTDfpsThsTg6nUQlAtqXkmAi_jfg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "이지현", "rating": 5, "content": "CGV서 영화 보고 커피 한잔\\n넓고 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL-oW3axWsfnGPmv0K8vcc_a9q_9FBHt20jaxrnR1fXENogmg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "한솔 작은누나TV", "rating": 5, "content": "백화점과 바로 연결되어 있어서 편리해요. 좌석 거리두기도 잘 실천되고 있습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXJfyElq84hLHUBDNha_vnzei81bpmbS6_Txi2j4YJ6-vdp_jlOtg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "muning", "rating": 5, "content": "조금 시끌시끌하지만 깔끔하고 좋네요.\\n직원분들 친절하고 잘 움직이세요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWmQvhm6y4MsnW6X-chDy_jgQqW6WcVFCxET3HZYEgFy6hiNL-n=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ9e6319yffDUR9Rz8AgwndF8/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ9e6319yffDUR9Rz8AgwndF8/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ9e6319yffDUR9Rz8AgwndF8/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ9e6319yffDUR9Rz8AgwndF8/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000B2A7D37080B85F40B684D78926C04240
