4.4	37.547869399999996	127.1556177	2026-02-16 19:10:48.753848	2026-03-17 20:44:02.638724	019c65ee-6731-777d-a3d2-253421ac4824	CAFE	ChIJUcGnJpqxfDURvDzChjoWI5k	141911281	고희	[{"author": "DK GM", "rating": 5, "content": "딸기케잌 꼭 드세요!\\n분위기 좋고 아메리카노 원두도 2가지(산미 있음/고소함)고 인테리어도 이뻐요. 강아지도 케이지에 넣으면 데려갈 수 있어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJgtxkxkkn39qdC5wyjx35REOvdBVhO2R5NtiMa_ek7qAO_jQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Dulcamara M", "rating": 4, "content": "새로 생겨서 깨끗하고 테이블 간격도 넓어 쾌적하다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVkDQNf0jkDUr4iwTnqASrGQ27XkC9bpn-tCckMN_3R9T5xmq4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "yukyoung park", "rating": 5, "content": "점심 후 커피나 음료 한 잔하기 좋아요. 음악도 부드러운 재즈풍이라 편안해요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIFEia8zD6lzEMUjeEFCi09wQ9EHMFHOHvK14ffrPBbtLQ6Xg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "hoh H", "rating": 5, "content": "깔끔한 분위기와 깔끔한 커피의 맛에 하루의 피로가 사라진듯..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVurQPr237MfQmzsjW8gENdAr3rNJ36Ee_J5_mggLupwuA8qZxGxQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "김지선", "rating": 2, "content": "소음이 심하고 울림.\\n떠들어 재낄사람들은 좋지만 혼자만의 시간을 갖고 싶은분은... 좀...\\n커피는 맛나요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLpAyf5p_XH5dPQ1pzs_14StXKZ_qKFQ4ftWxFigKnHazeXmg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "김다은", "rating": 5, "content": "깔끔하고 베이커리도 맛있음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ8Zqh3xdHKC5Mwi8VpHTuklYL0oYXWfD686U5YnOQLVU9zhQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Y.s Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "케익,휘낭시에 다 맛있어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXRtYQGnuTTF1jJgyLoU-g7Omihc1G8_t2XturC6OmV9NFXygk0rg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Seokwon Park", "rating": 4, "content": "넓어서 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ6eV4rz3E1T6MPvRkyfwCORi1MXBOg3M0elaCHey9o6fKI5g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJUcGnJpqxfDURvDzChjoWI5k/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJUcGnJpqxfDURvDzChjoWI5k/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJUcGnJpqxfDURvDzChjoWI5k/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJUcGnJpqxfDURvDzChjoWI5k/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJUcGnJpqxfDURvDzChjoWI5k/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJUcGnJpqxfDURvDzChjoWI5k/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJUcGnJpqxfDURvDzChjoWI5k/photos/6.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000700BF1A3F5C95F4054BDA19520C64240
