끝.\\n창가자리도 넉넉하고 노트북 들고 죽치기 좋은 곳. 화장실도 깨끗함", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV63Eyh6twRm2lhXBpUCHRUQznJ3lOKG6M8Bc7xxt121nUxrKY=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "BH BH", "rating": 3, "content": "가서 블루베리 요거트 어쩌고 저쩌고 사먹었는데 솔직히 그냥 마트에서 파는 블루베리 요거트 맛이나서 좀 실망함\\n심지어 가격이 5000 원임  ㄷㄷ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUokH_eJinE30_Vdz6SyXl0ZxVww0zUZMu13XYytgwNxKLtAl0v=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJLa6ukrqBfDUR4uSas28cGAs/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJLa6ukrqBfDUR4uSas28cGAs/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJLa6ukrqBfDUR4uSas28cGAs/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJLa6ukrqBfDUR4uSas28cGAs/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJLa6ukrqBfDUR4uSas28cGAs/photos/4.png"}]	[]	0101000020E6100000ED6DE98747AB5F4025D0BB0C5AC84240
