4.2	37.4398093	127.12738859999999	2026-02-16 19:10:51.917206	2026-03-17 20:46:56.27109	019c65ee-738d-7ce7-bed5-37ecac72a410	CAFE	ChIJ1zTtEZ2ofDURyJ0O1JH6WQ4	750001171	온더스트릿	[{"author": "강윤지", "rating": 4, "content": "처음갔을때는 조용해서 좋았는데 요즘엔 사람이 많은것같아요. 그게 조금 아쉽지만 커피도 괜찮고 공간도 쾌적한편인것같아요. 사진찍기도 예쁘구요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXBAlXH0fwf_dlJ7SJd6Tt-7rFdFUApzXj4c5-wsfT_JNiHw1CU=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "반향", "rating": 4, "content": "카페 2층 홍굴이짬뽕집 홍굴이 짬뽕 가격대비 양도많고 맛도 괜찮았던거같네요 홍합이 무진장많이들어가있습니다\\n한그릇다먹으면 ㅂㅐ부름", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXLMeLt7QXCuJVvnQ1og1vre5Crd8x52lZhURyHN7Ly2KfLvoGu=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "유승진", "rating": 5, "content": "태평역 출구에 있어서 접근성이 좋구요~\\n아메리카노를 진하게 연하게 2종류로 주문가능\\n화장실이 내부에 있어 좋아요\\n여름철 아이스라떼는음~진리", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLVRaDGMXv4WcmOlIESRhDHOjUXAEOyZavAjdfpcuBfpYv50g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "A Han", "rating": 5, "content": "너무이쁘고 편해요.\\n친절하고 :-)\\n\\n케잌맛은잘모르겠지만 커피나음료는 맛나요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIZLypB0n-OU27kD0mspeCisCq8kMC807Nm0em279wxYjn9QQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Wanjong Lee", "rating": 4, "content": "1층과 지하가 예쁘게 꾸며져 있어서 넓고 좋네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWb2DyfdaiXS0gRfmMoA6-yrA8b3DIyUIOjGaEGfgNChMKq94xd=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "최지은", "rating": 5, "content": "진짜 커피 미쳤어요ㅜㅜ\\n최애커피숖♡♡♡", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVH_JEuZpcil2yJ8JXn6cNYO75fRVN7J6eArjVLCOHcS_kTMxw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "이경석", "rating": 4, "content": "집앞에 가까운 카페 커피맛 조코 여사장님인지 이쁘시고 ㅋㅋㅋ 조와요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocITO8V5jRs-VOCCMKpSJaWqa25bBKGJ34Dv4XEro1k3odrxMQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "JUAE KIm", "rating": 4, "content": "지하1층  분위기도 괜찮고 넓어서 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVFKvoBfwUAafpUYkM4Fea3LCOWEJRtYawi5dqwMOdA48MafLc=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ1zTtEZ2ofDURyJ0O1JH6WQ4/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ1zTtEZ2ofDURyJ0O1JH6WQ4/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ1zTtEZ2ofDURyJ0O1JH6WQ4/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ1zTtEZ2ofDURyJ0O1JH6WQ4/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ1zTtEZ2ofDURyJ0O1JH6WQ4/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E610000086B8832227C85F4003FDCFAB4BB84240
3.8	37.3147865	126.82384409999999	2026-02-16 19:10:51.917462	2026-03-17 20:47:02.32688	019c65ee-738d-7ce7-bed6-d88aab5c3ace	CAFE	ChIJkV8KdVVuezUR2C9f1Pkju1c	366803102	이디야커피 안산고잔역점	[{"author": "권기운", "rating": 5, "content": "고잔역  뒤쪽  먹자골목에 위치.\\n\\n팥인절미 눈꽃빙수, 아메리카노. 수박쥬스.\\n눈꽃빙수는 인절미가 들어 있어서 씹는 맛도 있고 좋습니다. 많이들 드시는 메뉴인듯.\\n아메리카노 아이스는 커피숍에서는 진리이고.\\n수박쥬스가 있습니다.\\n베트남에서는 카페에 가면 항상 설탕을 빼달라고 해서 두잔씩은 마셨는데.\\n다른곳은 생과일 쥬스가 없는곳도 있던데.\\n\\n한국에 와서 이디야 커피숍만 3번째입니다.\\n각각 다른곳에 위치해 있었지만\\n이곳 여사장님이신지 서빙하시는 분인지\\n정말 친절하시고 좋으시네요.\\n혼자 일을 하시던데 손님들도 많은듯 한데 혼자서 다하시고  계시네요.\\n대단하시다는.\\n근처에 갈일이 있으면 다시 들르겠습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWTQCOfOuWshVDWhaLLr5cMl_Vbd62tsYpGlPRYp3C57_Tvaw9H8w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "잔자먕", "rating": 1, "content": "메가커피 옆집\\n옆에 메가커피\\n빽다방 앞집\\n앞에 빽다방", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIW0xtxZHwxM2iOT_iE69sNE8aJnnQoR4pU0KLZxVZ1_-7TtA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "수호신", "rating": 3, "content": "직원분도 친절하고 커피도맛있구", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUUbS6ewb5tDCm49tBMVY-xB8P-SmRc-6GgPggaS-C4n8oVhPmY=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "서종원", "rating": 4, "content": "가격 최고,   음식  👍", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIdNecSpJqGWqeFjfGeS-PNoX3LDbv5xToH2lUp_pLR2RWREg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Melissa", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVpOEtJ9cxqB6o7wufJq_yURXyl_76vQvwtnxjuQjhhSCBWrJxc9g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Valky Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW87VmS-wgodOI0f2JTPTCNzuNq74Vc00B09dZK0SQ