4.5	37.5999774	126.7679058	2026-02-16 19:10:52.626012	2026-03-17 14:57:54.737176	019c65ee-7652-755b-a54f-25598568ae1b	CAFE	ChIJf2AUjaaEfDUREXt21JNGfQk	622296084	롱블랙	[{"author": "Eden", "rating": 5, "content": "에그타르트 맛있어요! 강아지 동반 가능해서  좋고, 멍푸치노도 맛있는지 강아지가 잘 마셔요~~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVyvnw2ZVYgDTrDMux-cRgeyhqPSVWktmz0IYk3gvAEnaq8Xpxf=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "남임영섭", "rating": 5, "content": "동네 카페지만  아메리카노  한잔의 맛은 짙은 크레마에서 뿜어주는 향긋함이 함께해 넘 좋아습니다~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUvTKDBG0gP3miRp3AbGQfdAtyXSez63LQqHnBRQThO0u_xleY=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "봄날에(봄날에)", "rating": 5, "content": "단골.  조용햐 커피타임 즐길 수 있는곳.\\n에그타르트 와 따아의 조화^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIh8rZq-n2y4Wwtu9-TxoA8H46l2EpMJO67VCm7KsW3wwGmPA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "신승현", "rating": 4, "content": "여기 제집과 가까운데 서비스가 매우좋아요!하지만 시끄러운게 단점이지요..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX8NcdHPnautleViesvOMNRREPR317zBwgnnUknjczP52HEjPQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "soonkwan kwon", "rating": 3, "content": "마살거리만...이용\\n씹는 건... 맛난게 없어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUGtdfIy6aR1_qRAHhjTWV4otOrOak0tJp-8S32IOeRhIMbR3HP=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "플레이어예준-승현", "rating": 5, "content": "굿", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUJEFlKjNTcanB6T2sbO9sox9FkuL56QpMcw31G7hAhDsUMzxB11Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "유미현", "rating": 5, "content": "Here is good place to have a good quality coffee.\\nDessert is super delicious espeacilly Egg tart.\\nEgg tart is very big and soft🤙🏻\\n