3.9	37.537828499999996	127.0851423	2026-02-16 19:10:56.54882	2026-03-17 20:48:35.063182	019c65ee-85a4-78eb-a33c-d64cec05b6bf	CAFE	ChIJo0CwSSClfDURRqcEIzxKih8	16651153	제이제이카페	[{"author": "임병욱", "rating": 1, "content": "빙수 생각이 나서 들렸는데, 아이스크림, 커피 그리고 직접 제조하는 과일 음료가 이렇게 맛없는곳은 처음 입니다. 별도의 주차장은 없고 카페앞에 자리가 있으면 주차하는곳 입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK6moAFCNTVz1lPLyC9N6CIWhx54h5WV4jqkqLljY_USr9-QQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "윤준일", "rating": 3, "content": "메가커피 의자가 불편할때 방문하는 곳이에요\\n가격은 메가보다 비싸고 커피맛은 평타는 합니다.\\n번화가 중심부에 이써서 위치가 갑입니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL5jkKHCpn-DZduT4WcuJlfO974KJ4HmzloodJ_qaDg5HY6KQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Pilwoon Kang", "rating": 5, "content": "가볍게 차한잔 하거나, 맥주한잔 하며 대화하기 좋은 곳. 확장해서 쾌적해졌어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUCY3yuAzh2eniss1EXs_Zckhf9cQefUEXroCE9qFt9CzlmjyPnAw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "박광제", "rating": 5, "content": "커피코너로 미팅장소로 아늑합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLMwPBqARY_l01dGxz6g6jR1ncloFZTj3zXCyndS1SneEka0A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "김진호", "rating": 4, "content": "평범한  분위기에...커피숍   입니다...!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJWlWhW4xfT0htBqcZPCl28Bus0QEDv64sY6ar9hSJl6oEwGQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "뭉치뭉치는말안들어", "rating": 5, "content": "조용해서 공부하긴좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVobcT92Q7_pNqogtOzSvavLdDJR3AgXvvsUE76CqtlgxocH1mj=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "송인화", "rating": 5, "content": "커피맛이 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLsnGsAfe1fmzU9JoY5F46s9kP7xiLIdp-osaKn8dd1dxBH1g=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "june kim", "rating": 5, "content": "매장이 이뻐요 깔끔합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWF-LTyeEHT5uZCRsUe49LIwFUo_nCWm8Ue7TapC5xEUXcMyqtQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJo0CwSSClfDURRqcEIzxKih8/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJo0CwSSClfDURRqcEIzxKih8/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJo0CwSSClfDURRqcEIzxKih8/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJo0CwSSClfDURRqcEIzxKih8/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E61000006680B0F872C55F40A92D7590D7C44240
