4	37.2946264	127.11720659999999	2026-02-16 19:10:56.550357	2026-03-17 20:48:23.390946	019c65ee-85a6-780c-a678-94ea960811ce	CAFE	ChIJ9XZxZXBaezURSeLc_wJqlPA	400846819	이알커피앤로스티드	[{"author": "H.B Lee", "rating": 4, "content": "커피도 괜찮고 몇종류의 샌드위치나 쿠키등도 먹을수있는 카페 ! 공부하는 학생들도 눈에띄고 분위기도 좋아 가끔 들르는곳 ! 일정 금액 이상 구매하면 1+1 커피 쿠폰을 사용가능 !", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU9AAgAjC6D45xHqpgH94xcRPC3J44-PTw4GCu-EC97E7NDY7yJ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Jiwoo Seo", "rating": 4, "content": "커피가 맛있고\\n크로플도 맛있었는데\\n시럽이 많아서 너무 달긴 했어요\\n가운데 카운터가 있어서\\n자리에 앉아있으면 조금 시끄럽긴 합니다\\n직원분이 들어가고 나올때 인사를 잘하셔서 좋네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIy-EobcQobqdO-arXIosRxkXFzTKesbu4sOEmQBq-D-x6iY0-l=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "힛꿀나잇", "rating": 5, "content": "일단 커피가 참 맛있습니다.\\n알바분 한분이신데 주문 후 일단 15분은 기다려야 나옴주의ㅎㅎ\\n브리치즈 샌드위치 맛있고요 레몬 파운드케이크랑 밤치즈케이크도 굿\\n디카페인 커피도 맛있어서 주말마다 가요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW8_9n5dFclReNnGEgQ_BjBoCvjpO3bhV_M5jQJFeiuL9XLHVMF=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "조태형", "rating": 5, "content": "커피맛 좋고 뷰도좋고 루프탑이 있는곳", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL-GhFYxcpyA2Yw1h7juqyGvjlBmxwPjvRnhT7-NvfEaHrUEg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "한정선", "rating": 4, "content": "직접로스팅하는곳이라 원두 자주구입하는곳.  신선하고 맛있습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJzPSpiFv3t9CQs2t78G_0G5-_vVMuHBf-RTD9besFWyESoDA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "JAY LIM", "rating": 1, "content": "무표정한 응대, 커피 맛 없음!\\n*3번 방문의 결과임", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXFa9vaKivHYccMALzPg7hCmtYE3mqvnUPfvswb-YwwWo5lFvkC=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Korea “johnny” Good", "rating": 3, "content": "커피 맛있지만 불친절", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV6lECFxTHLYKlHGupvtShOdFk2Xtwph9tzK0tz-52p2-iSJeGN5Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "이수진", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXCng4gZ09kzdjcgcyPMe12vCdFfggUlo64qfrtV5COzo_JhsR-Uw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ9XZxZXBaezURSeLc_wJqlPA/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ9XZxZXBaezURSeLc_wJqlPA/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ9XZxZXBaezURSeLc_wJqlPA/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ9XZxZXBaezURSeLc_wJqlPA/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ9XZxZXBaezURSeLc_wJqlPA/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ9XZxZXBaezURSeLc_wJqlPA/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ9XZxZXBaezURSeLc_wJqlPA/photos/6.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E610000005781C5080C75F40E4446051B6A54240
