4.2	37.536748599999996	127.13937829999999	2026-02-16 19:11:01.214898	2026-03-17 20:29:58.810385	019c65ee-97de-7e0e-949c-3a952f09a275	CAFE	ChIJ4yXCQ7exfDURqTazoRGE7sU	1195736847	메가MGC커피 길동역점	[{"author": "우동희", "rating": 5, "content": "메가커피 지점이 워낙 많아서 메뉴들은 비슷하겠지만 유독 길동역점은 점장님부터 직원들까지 친절하고 꿀조합 레시피를 잘 알아서 추천 해줄때마다 꿀맛이었고 오늘도 디카페인 꿀아메리카노와 치즈케이크 조합 엄지척이었고 집에서 제일 가까운 단골 카페라서 자주 방문하는데 진짜 서비스는 만점입니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL_UoisNGoP-2aMTx8696KMIYyZ2kHGHRpFOpwmTEPknFegtQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "Super Genius", "rating": 4, "content": "가성비 괜찮아서 자주 사먹어요\\n매장안에서 마신건 첨인데\\n손님이 많아서인지 좀 복잡하고\\n좁게 느껴졌어요\\n옆에 말하는 소리도 컸고..\\n그거말곤 만족해요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVsGD9PpxqXriqrsj1PbRf4deP3hV1VxGlzZ_U0rhG19gsVCAq3=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Rouis Park", "rating": 4, "content": "사거리 코너라 위치 좋고\\n젊은친구들이 열심히 하네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUoi-UE5utsZIm2NkTAwHQ09QZ0ulw6sfdtvM_c6SdzX-oQKcc=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "w kim", "rating": 5, "content": "넓고. 매장 쾌적 키오스크로 주문 메가리카노 양많음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUjO7Hd7OPhE4leB1pO5fAC6tFzZkG5oBMOwYwrDOy1whbhwe0=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "박영훈", "rating": 4, "content": "가격이저렴하고맛도괞찮았다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLB5CaxI9yUlDmqA5cxXoB7dNPIR1VutLGDW4gNLvZdjxZwGA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "김세일김세일", "rating": 1, "content": "메가중에 맛두없고 불친절에 시끄럽다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU2qBgRBbJd-eEBSvjWUOBWDZVmSIj9bLslQPLT6gYNh6DVQpWd=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Dongjun Kweon", "rating": 3, "content": "조금 내부공간이 좁아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXcIjQdZW6PBWUUHXEJpmzfYnQc82W5ObSHz5uaK0uNiw9RzwVC=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "최이철", "rating": 5, "content": "직원들 친절해요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKMKT7-TYnfIy10M2pk6-r3dw77oV9GJtD5JYbbbvkzlppp=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ4yXCQ7exfDURqTazoRGE7sU/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ4yXCQ7exfDURqTazoRGE7sU/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ4yXCQ7exfDURqTazoRGE7sU/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ4yXCQ7exfDURqTazoRGE7sU/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ4yXCQ7exfDURqTazoRGE7sU/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ4yXCQ7exfDURqTazoRGE7sU/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E61000006911F692EBC85F403E96992DB4C44240
4.9	37.360229499999996	126.9323766	2026-02-16 19:11:01.214658	2026-03-17 20:52:24.905081	019c65ee-97de-7e0e-949b-8b0c230c183b	CAFE	ChIJB-eTSw1nezUR0qj2cXLgYGc	1862191921	카페언타이	[{"author": "JEONGYOON LEE", "rating": 5, "content": "컴포즈커피와 누루, 이삭토스트가 있는 건물 2층에있습니다!\\n\\n내부 인테리어는 조도가 낮지만 릴렉스하게 해주는 느낌을 주었습니다\\n\\n커피는 예쁜 잔에 담겨와서 기분내기 훌륭했습니다\\n\\n쿠키와 같은 커피랑 같이 먹기좋은 것들이 종류별로 있고 맛있어서 쿠키만 먹기위해서 오셔도 좋을것 같습니다!!\\n\\n내부는 생각보단 넓어서 좋았습니다~!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLykIEII4vYiUOeK3YcIId-FZiekJOhRXKCM4FFEO-Y0azlWA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "이현주", "rating": 5, "content": "커피맛, 디저트맛 다 너무 좋아요! 특히 사장님표 수제쿠키 최고ㅎㅎ 맛난 커피생각날때마다 갑니다 :)", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ6l9-MxyZlGzsnRLN3w3QBl3SLeb84T0stcNksGh9I1TXxvw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "네르브네온", "rating": 5, "content": "인테리어 커피 분위기 다 수준급입니다. 사진찍기도 좋고 커피도 맛있고.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIweh5qYL0UOA4_eCIKBrXVydv9I7AP8cSsEnpqom5-7eG4AA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "장어힘힘힘", "rating": 5, "content": "카페 너무 예쁘고 커피도 맛있어요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXXVqP30Zq2h1z9D-IgQfGcsbhpIDB5So7jKiy-xE1S1491od1FPA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "PLANNER ACE", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLAgMdxjHKFIAshVrZms6yPL-SfVsYGjCou8DBrxcc3_9hunpdW=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "최지원", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVrfmsv1BELO5ZPRqz9AKEjATUEmUYCh_k5Ucl1B91rgSJZn1TQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "JAMES CHOI", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translat