 {"author": "김희보", "rating": 3, "content": "원두커피의 독창적인 방법으로\\n맛이 좋네요\\n직접 만든 빵과 함께하니 더욱더\\n즐겁습니다\\n실내는 편안한 분위기 네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXPYfByIUDfGDfsduy69mN7GIPapXuDki7cCb686mL6yxafwBeFUg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "지구마을TV", "rating": 4, "content": "간단한. 파스타와 식사 음료가 가능합니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKTVCB7KPj-k28X-hinT2cWZMKLnN8zU0RRLq6bb_K_2-YUzw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWXis1HvEfDURH6rzXN-2M9Q/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWXis1HvEfDURH6rzXN-2M9Q/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWXis1HvEfDURH6rzXN-2M9Q/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWXis1HvEfDURH6rzXN-2M9Q/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000F27B9BFEECC25F40049D5AC702E94240
