rine ginger tea was fragrant and perfectly balanced, not too sweet. The espresso frozen was rich in flavor, and the shaved ice on top perfectly complemented the espresso. They had a choice of coconut shaved ice and lime shaved ice, and both were phenomenal! Highly recommend if you’re looking for a cozy stop to rest and recharge.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV7zfqnZQSS7BTonDTAw0b_yDVHk75aBVxejH9F7qpJWc2p32Tw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "まぷ", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVcrJ4aMgx8nmlYglSo1tYJrhr-BIr3oRbbQFqaNFrQoVPskRU=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJXyu9Y9WffDURpeRpG7Dmcrw/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJXyu9Y9WffDURpeRpG7Dmcrw/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJXyu9Y9WffDURpeRpG7Dmcrw/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJXyu9Y9WffDURpeRpG7Dmcrw/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [19, 0]}]	0101000020E61000002D0E1DF19ABB5F40F6DA221FAAC14240
