4.7	37.4988369	127.0566904	2026-02-16 19:11:10.417593	2026-03-17 20:53:37.976989	019c65ee-bbd1-7d78-bc44-8386f59e551a	CAFE	ChIJoaidhBmkfDURVcwT_FbacAc	171652459	그렌그로운	[{"author": "Bomin", "rating": 4, "content": "크로플 먹으려고 다른 카페에 가는 길에\\n우연히 마주친 너무 예쁜 꽃집 그리고 카페\\n\\n밀크티 마셨는데 너무 맛있었구요\\n꽃들은 어쩜 그렇게 이쁜지\\n데크위에 화분들은 제멋대로 올매나 예쁘던지\\n\\n따뜻한 분위기가 너무 좋았어요\\n사장님도 너무 친절하시고\\n와인 한잔 생각나던 편안한 곳\\n\\n재방문의사 무조건 👍🏻", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX29eytCuCafV-LlxU9eJ9_H6dDCOt5TNnoaKe4lO72kgE2HF7j1w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "byungmoon Ahn", "rating": 5, "content": "화분키우는 카페가 있다해서 가봤는데\\n화분도 이쁘게 키우시고\\n커피맛도 좋아요\\n친절하시고...", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIF7vWXsEkBcTqAlsjv7Cm6MM8FkjyWA9KijmsoKsl1NrHb3g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Junhyun Bae (준현)", "rating": 4, "content": "분위기 있는 대치동 주택가의 플라워카페\\n커피, 케익 모두 맛 평타 이상이다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU5O7eJoljUwQA_SlJ5_45FyrUz7c3K9e9WQ3vvCRjPY7-rrw9XAQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "peh0326", "rating": 5, "content": "동네 예뿐 꽃집, 향기로운 꽃 내음 맡으면서 커피에 수제 케익 드셔보세요 여기 케익은 달지 않아서 최고에요 !", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIn3vIZBtMFethKknM-v8OyqPOXyp18TDq_npmjhjAb4YOKaA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "JY Lee", "rating": 3, "content": "분위기는 좋고 음료도 괜찮았는데 동네 카페라 그런지 손님과 계속 크게 대화를 나누어서, 저는 불편했습니다. 사람에 따라 그런 부분을 좋아할수도 있습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKBcSJ2qaFPsQHSBb3_yoovjFoIm0FwLV50BSUVzuErrtR8fryg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "rian cho", "rating": 5, "content": "이쁜 꽃들도 많고 직접 구운 디저트들과 계절 메뉴가 진짜 최고입니다^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKAs0SbvxBQzj3-NKtJNZuBMyLRnT2ck4nTeuFSHntUKgrTWw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "hyeyoung park", "rating": 5, "content": "젊은부부가 운영하는곳인데 꽃도 예쁘고 분위기도 아늑하고 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUM00S9tFzQlpLNndORDCPBS0bUhLSaYMnhAzfpBKMMca_431Y6=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Kim Yeontan", "rating": 5, "content": "나는 식물로 장식된 장소를 좋아한다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXz5iX7ekaM_mEPSD-juEDmKO6W-LDTNl9A20k1WwIw2YlAyH0=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJoaidhBmkfDURVcwT_FbacAc/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJoaidhBmkfDURVcwT_FbacAc/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJoaidhBmkfDURVcwT_FbacAc/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJoaidhBmkfDURVcwT_FbacAc/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJoaidhBmkfDURVcwT_FbacAc/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJoaidhBmkfDURVcwT_FbacAc/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJoaidhBmkfDURVcwT_FbacAc/photos/6.png"}]	[]	0101000020E6100000D17FC5D0A0C35F40DEC435E3D9BF4240
