4	37.5944198	126.6946462	2026-02-16 19:11:22.516647	2026-02-16 19:11:22.516647	019c65ee-eb14-77cd-9c68-79740209a9d1	CAFE	ChIJG7HUWmWBfDURP23ifzzJO2A	26293856	커피볶는집리베	[]	[]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000009AD2551575AC5F40248CB0F215CC4240
4.4	37.3435347	126.9388022	2026-02-16 19:11:13.705421	2026-03-17 20:53:19.368303	019c65ee-c8a9-7ffc-a394-fd2f11e5552c	CAFE	ChIJ_azbCCFnezURO-lTjxqlF44	1959781157	베어메이드	[{"author": "강형주", "rating": 4, "content": "의외의. 곳에 있는 카페\\n커피 맛있어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUnJk3a3s5ULztqxLNLapg1Zr6YqzY_wrahl_DAiT-EYy62GYM=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "kid bright", "rating": 5, "content": "흑임자슈페너가 맛있어서 갈때마다 마십니다ㅎㅎ 디카페인으로도 변경가능해서 정말 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVztYZJz_T818jAhS_iJ9YF64dpG7G4BMTUcPCekMr2fU8ve7JZ2Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "김은정", "rating": 5, "content": "엄마와 브런치 먹으러 갔는데,\\n다양한 음료와 디저트가 있어 좋았고요.\\n흑임자썸머라떼는 아주 달지도 않고, 그 고소함이 더욱 풍미롭네요.\\n\\n실내에 자리도 많아서, 방해받지 않고 대화할 수 있어 넘 좋더라구요. 분위기도 푸근해요~\\n배가 든든하네요. 스콘도 겉은 바삭, 속은 부드러워요~\\n커피볶는 기계도 있어서 여쭤보니, 직접 커피를 볶고 디저트도 몇 가지 빼고는 다 직접 만드신다고 하네요.\\n굿굿~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVJbjCnYsTYJDNjhwLt3f4ctSSwYFhdHk6CdtR3jVmS-1iY8n0o1g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "momo c", "rating": 5, "content": "주차 편하고, 좌석도 많아서 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUH8DzBJHOaiYxDGhiVb1nQR1OV-vde7zBWhw_45bxK-X4eyT0O=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "G.N JUNG", "rating": 5, "content": "식사후 후식으로 끝내주네요.^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJJzArsxk9wlIw7_3gshO3mYlwXd0atogVU0gor1jjjPYuKHA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "최민정", "rating": 4, "content": "맛은 무난하고 분위기도 좋은데 가격대비 양은 적은편이고... 친절하진 않아요.....", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJCU_rM2VWphzjmhv8OkwUvKGT2eC1cneyJCOmYQoIqIYEllA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "장승은", "rating": 5, "content": "동네 골목에 있는 숨은 카페 발견. 커피 맛도 좋아여.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL_S0KAv67PdcvCnfGcM-aqG4phqi51_X2WRsauH-oiUvssNQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "Adella K", "rating": 3, "content": "브런치메뉴가 더 많았으면 좋겠어요..  커피는 맛있어요..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUrRfqPUzh9wmKO7ho7DiIdWz8Wz0VZdR6Yh9gIGMl4olRrjQUN=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ_azbCCFnezURO-lTjxqlF44/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ_azbCCFnezURO-lTjxqlF44/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ_azbCCFnezURO-lTjxqlF44/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ_azbCCFnezURO-lTjxqlF44/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E61000006C9AD25515BC5F4045C5EEF1F8AB4240
