4	37.643937699999995	126.7873856	2026-02-16 19:12:04.189698	2026-03-17 21:06:33.984757	019c65ef-8ddd-7e55-a08c-fccc7a929312	CAFE	ChIJYxHj9cmafDUR6MltBjr3w5U	21906910	스타벅스 백석역DT점	[{"author": "David Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "여기 스벅은 진짜 붐비더라구요. 자리가 없을정도로 손님이 많고 드라이브스루 까지 있어서 일하는 사람들이 정말 힘들텐데도 웃으면서 응대하는걸 보고 저들은 진정한 프로다 라는 느낌을 받았습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUJV1ARGZ45TUVGBQr0OVVNgcLjrjxsU7pwU55ljybgV-p018l_=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Jay Lee", "rating": 4, "content": "근처에 예식장과 교회가 있어 그런지 주말에는 사람이 많아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ0Fu2HPQhO-mcPcyQ1Rjs1BQPkXtoi7em0mAy5_MFpY8-Tow=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Stella", "rating": 3, "content": "1층만 있는 DT점은 처음 봤어요.\\n분위기 있고, 대화하기 좋아요. ^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUBekUhD3-jXfJNf83yoxk2zIjehY07ub7BwwTpdXGYgWc6wlwMXQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "야감히", "rating": 5, "content": "전주 또는 강릉서 버스로 오갈 때 사실방 옆에 있어서 편했어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWQvqsfKwKHU_m624Z0KhIVaRkM33qHAf85tLpZIIvprJB7bLAo=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "김수한", "rating": 3, "content": "매장은 1층만 있음\\n- 주차장은 있음(주차하기 힘듦)\\n: 건물 밖(20m 내외 정도)에 유료 주차함\\n(1시간 3000원 지불 했음)\\n- 화장실은 1층(깨끗함)\\n- 코로나 19\\n: 사회적거리 두기로 의자가 많이 없음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVzDYOJxvmqgqZNwX1gXfUvHa456yCAmL8mAl00FS3QPiRkoUGE=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "보타쿠", "rating": 5, "content": "서방은 어디나 친절하고 좋아요 여기는 넓어서 더 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW33KV_2Rvy6smQ6Qosk5taYYSrdSsaDQaj5l2JLbYvGF-qETZIFw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "만드는가게사랑을", "rating": 5, "content": "오랜만에 가보니 여유로운 느낌이 좋았어요:)", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVQU48yACE3o_ue1V_tbgzxwuh0GJejvK4brJdGua6dK_kGgRcE=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "MH K", "rating": 4, "content": "1층이라 공간이 넓지는 않지만 좌석이 많은 편, 직원이 많아서 신속함, 위치와 분위기가 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXl5FzXl-h4oiNOTbkc_awNRyYakjxqeUB1118jXSR3Xj_lvR_21A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJYxHj9cmafDUR6MltBjr3w5U/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJYxHj9cmafDUR6MltBjr3w5U/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJYxHj9cmafDUR6MltBjr3w5U/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJYxHj9cmafDUR6MltBjr3w5U/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJYxHj9cmafDUR6MltBjr3w5U/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJYxHj9cmafDUR6MltBjr3w5U/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJYxHj9cmafDUR6MltBjr3w5U/photos/6.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJYxHj9cmafDUR6MltBjr3w5U/photos/7.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000D855928664B25F40AA14F18C6CD24240
