4.8	37.207744	127.0427198	2026-02-16 19:12:08.446272	2026-03-17 14:57:54.737176	019c65ef-9e7e-77b9-8147-533957ad7a7f	CAFE	ChIJ4dcqVQZEezURU9KmKiy1QlA	1882267297	소소	[{"author": "김태정", "rating": 5, "content": "병점동 커피전문점 중 최고!!!\\n사장님 엄청 친절하시며 커피 직접 볶고 음료도 직접 다 만들어 맛도 좋음~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV26NDIfB12OVvcvazDyaClxNjQ7dT3EqW_q2AVemDEiKBtBwhf=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Aiden Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기 좋고 사장님이 친절함 커피맛도 괜찮음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLpCDNwTxpZJalW8tzXBs3VWnh-AgeTyH5EtRj63cEgxD-D4ydi=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "이승희", "rating": 4, "content": "커피가 맛난집 가성비 괜찮아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJqU7ZdcBbCaKAYASxj9YeUTwwXdoBZVKbVR2r1r_hc7jjKyQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "이윤아", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUN9edVxWLqzcXLhywLrm1ROa9fXgqeSob4BFJMtzkGrEH38JM=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "해피", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIJ4jZiSopfMfusaaqr2hHK7lgtVKVvUQ6UcmEst-IwjZPaGg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[]	[]	0101000020E610000011F9D3EBBBC25F4059F8FA5A979A4240
4.1	37.207234299999996	127.0341035	2026-02-16 19:12:07.094858	2026-03-17 21:17:55.685761	019c65ef-9936-7543-bf8b-5f7ff99b8e76	CAFE	ChIJD-Sxe1JDezURG0pr92mYqUo	1257832353	투썸플레이스 병점역점	[{"author": "곰지키기", "rating": 4, "content": "병점역과 가까워서 이용하기 편리합니다. 케이크는 투썸이죠. 떠먹는 케이크도 달달하고 고소하니 맛있었습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWwWqq7GS-4yFr2TVkHHic_-KIFIorf7KbJKbsxHSv6m3bOxTrEYw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "황인정", "rating": 4, "content": "투썸 케이크는 항상 너무 좋아하는 케이크입니다. 생일때마다 쿠폰 선물도 하지만 제 생일에 받고 싶은 케이크이기도하지요~ 가격이 좀 높지만 어쩌다 먹는 맛 만족합니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWag-TNC_ixYg0qFYFLaAtJ-eI3-6zGIkhSCE_DbHW9HlyfKEpQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "리뷰 (이름정책준수)", "rating": 5, "content": "요즘 추세인가 까페치고 상당히 조용했다. 병점역 특유의 사정인지는 모르겠으나 그점이 마음에 듬. 매뉴얼대로의 대응과 체인점의 커피 그걸로 만점은 아니어도 선방한 거라 봅", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX7u_r6gY5ENJZoQk4fhInVBPEGbtC1AuNBT6fCh0siEYLIUr9A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "amy imverse", "rating": 2, "content": "인터넷 클로즈 시간이랑 달라요ㅠ\\n거진 1시간30분 이나 빨리 닫더라구요\\nㅠ그럼 말을해줘야지..주문후에 알았네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ8enT76aCNYmpJRTKhUv6pM4S0nNduaf1ExtVtIPWb-WAqFA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "COCO ABC", "rating": 4, "content": "사람이 엄청 북적댈줄 알았는데 생각보다 없어서 좋네요. 투썸 매장치고 큰편은 아니라고하네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKa5-WsULAExXkTTxgilO6anohWSt5G0qNhZ5kpUZXkahR-=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Soojeong Lim", "rating": 5, "content": "매장 넓고 깨끗하고 친절하고\\n케익도 커피도 맛있어요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVvzQ3GCrYWJ53nT0dWqGEtokF3PBvhUvhrUoVuJBLK_n6rDn9c=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "홍부영", "rating": 5, "content": "커피 한잔하고 조가케익 6천원대\\n케익 3만원대 사가지고 왔네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLJgTLzbkqtf7npe5PGwA1J9YL4vfwPhBoJxi05Zl7gcer8PA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "OrangeBlatt", "rating": 4, "content": "我希望工作人员可以更友好一点。这咖啡厅很大所以很舒服。", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVW-9E3su44YLOAFKzDJrCSxUUdyxKcH0lAdTQ1Ceaozdow3sXQLw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJD-Sxe1JDezURG0pr92mYqUo/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJD-Sxe1JDezURG0pr92mYqUo/photos/1.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000774B72C02EC25F40028E4EA7869A4240
