4.3	37.5894748	127.01955219999999	2026-02-16 19:12:08.448144	2026-03-17 21:08:46.674894	019c65ef-9e80-7ee9-b9a6-d359f33f315f	CAFE	ChIJq0idbLi8fDUR_3lsJAhF4fo	1178899525	카페구월	[{"author": "김지현", "rating": 4, "content": "카페 넓직하니 아주 좋네요\\n들어서자마자. 와플냄새가 아주 고소합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX9Un28S7JBOGPq7WHy3DGt7R2vWcX3NFKrrMJYkdDKHW1AqaVRGw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "윤나현", "rating": 5, "content": "한건물이 통째로 카페인데 좌석간 간격도 너무가깝지않고\\n1층엔 매대 2층 3층이 좌석이어서 방해나 눈치안받고 좋음\\n(4층은 있었나 기억이안남) 화장실도 층별로있고\\n콘센트는 좌석마다 있진않지만 벽쪽 좌석에 있어서 사용할수있음\\n층마다 5G wifi 있음\\n가격도 합리적인 편 분위기도 조용하고 편안해서 자주 애용합니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVn8BFjtaJzwlmTVRF3sNMtWEP6MzZ6278o-ksci2CD5n_8VBIl=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "이지우", "rating": 5, "content": "일단 매장이 넓어서 좋아요. 음료도 맛있어요!!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJKDutDew0DF_nqURqf8AlvdU8Vx0F5uJjugwRp5BEAzELTkw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "정현희", "rating": 2, "content": "1층만 카페 분위기고 테이블은 2개밖에없고  2~3층은\\n학생들 공부하는 도서관인쥴 ㅠ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIobaAuf7bKKs5qN6SIl9BMSB-Tij_qhO3M39PSFAGYB6hF4g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "박가은 (JUNE)", "rating": 4, "content": "음료도 맛있고 디저트도 맛있었습니다❤️😊 카페에 공부하시는 대학생 분들이 많은 것 같았습니다 ㅎㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUntRxPNYxt7xbR-DNzInE91V2gb0g-KREqnU8rc5AhJHSeKRLi=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Kyo yi Koo", "rating": 5, "content": "커피도 맛있고\\n추억의 허니브레드 강추입니다ㅎㅎ\\n분위기도좋아요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLnUk7WbitP0HGjyBN79ED1bqoq8JPmHiTOjFNK1w0LACokCw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "영이안", "rating": 5, "content": "혼자 커피마시거나 작업하기 좋은\\n3층 건물임.\\n허니브레드가 맛있음!\\n혼자 작업하는 분들이 많은편이라,\\n여러명이가서 수다떨기는 좀 어려움", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKGt1BuIiCpFYK8k0aM3qyWt6_yYe-_dYSFqckcuF70qhpWag=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "조땡 Joe TThang", "rating": 5, "content": "비엔나 커피를 잘한다고해서 마셨는데\\n맛 좋네요 :)\\n분위기도 좋았습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUNZ5ef5-SI5YcToPjNZuV8SWhR0ro_nBmTA_awiZJN0ti9xUXP=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq0idbLi8fDUR_3lsJAhF4fo/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq0idbLi8fDUR_3lsJAhF4fo/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq0idbLi8fDUR_3lsJAhF4fo/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq0idbLi8fDUR_3lsJAhF4fo/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq0idbLi8fDUR_3lsJAhF4fo/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq0idbLi8fDUR_3lsJAhF4fo/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq0idbLi8fDUR_3lsJAhF4fo/photos/6.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E610000026E4DE5740C15F4077E805E973CB4240
