lishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWF6uxsn12Dc6Ugg7RDs27Anld3eTwLNK3JtEXr7FHoWXy73Dts=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "김범수", "rating": 5, "content": "부평에서 커피가 제일 맛있음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWDqhOguN9hRyJjdeXzTHIAIkGfsURmREiWY4lM5tHX-mndYvDL=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000006E241AEE6DAE5F40B82BAA3418BF4240
4.6	37.463368599999995	127.1270866	2026-02-16 19:12:10.488181	2026-03-17 21:09:24.692305	019c65ef-a678-7e0b-82ba-6d4abf2e23e5	CAFE	ChIJ5X0nXqqofDUR1CVfyDfDzGw	24975299	글래머커피	[{"author": "김은주", "rating": 5, "content": "카페라떼 맛집입니다~ 썸머라떼도 기분이 안좋을때 먹으면 달달하니 기분이 좋아집니다. 여기 사장님은 정말 친절하십니다^^ 그래서 단골이죠~~~ 카페라떼 꼭 드셔보세요!!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLb_KTSdlphXF4-PYACI2ObkSUwDtplF5sbLM6yI2xpDMyASQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "이지율", "rating": 5, "content": "핫도그가 입안에서 춤을 추는 느낌입니다\\n꼭 한번 가보세요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcOTIl_Pb2vrMX5wzG5KCa9o3JygnpxVBpNyUzY1f-EE5G_yL0=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Hyokee Min", "rating": 5, "content": "아메리카노. 부드러우면서도 엣지가 있어요. 쥔장이 항상 밝게 웃어줘요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUU7By-BX4tC2T74wo7-xKoL1J83hfyg8tixid5HVooPZFMJ2IT=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Yangsu Park", "rating": 5, "content": "맛남 친철 저렴", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJan7V5pYkQOiUPgNz5oOVEKl4dQKkUuNNtTGCZxARPieY1tA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Steed Bae", "rating": 5, "content": "라운지 짱", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWLvQKpxJlc8Bcp8A4P7blpbAGHgGNN-c_eu3ps2o59LLtUFE7J=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Matt Horne", "rating": 5, "content": "The best patbingsu I had during my time in Korea (and I tried a lot of patbingsu).  The roasted almonds and pecans together with the milky shaved ice were incredible.  It's an intimate cafe overlooking the park and street which is really nice for sitting and hanging out with a friend.  Highly recommend.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU6TcoV7FA6xxWaKskEzaCP_yckxplmeL95bqULmoML9Apf1XHTkw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Hyunwoo Shim", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW846WpNNMJPczX4nF2sQ9IXVyPyz7jOkOxDC2QTSM3Utk7i2_k=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "김성경", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK4SrLMSL958ni1xTKbfqnt3rQhQeZzOPunb9Q8KikMJ22n-w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ5X0nXqqofDUR1CVfyDfDzGw/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ5X0nXqqofDUR1CVfyDfDzGw/photos/1.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000A1B0D52F22C85F40247F8BA94FBB4240
4.4	37.4672109	127.12717319999999	2026-02-16 19:12:10.488494	2026-03-17 21:09:28.873584	019c65ef-a678-7e0b-82bc-18d2a3488ca1	CAFE	ChIJL14ua1WvfDURrhKrqs292ZQ	584023367	별이빛나다	[{"author": "김빙구쓰", "rating": 4, "content": "프랜차이즈가 아닌 개인 카페에서만 느낄 수 있는 따뜻함, 안락함. 카페는 이제 커피맛이 특출나거나 특별히 다른게 아니라면 분위기 아니겠나. 아늑하기도 하고 안아주는 느낌이 든다.\\n셀프바가 있긴하지만 그래도 문쪽 벽에 있어서 발이 잘 안 떨어졌다. 테이블 배치가 촘촘해서 사적인 얘기를 하기가 조심스러웠다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocICoBuJTxEIMK5RNNECtW6LyGr-BZe9rIcbMP_g64eUiHnirg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "A Han", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님 너무 친절하시고 커피도 맛있어서 애용하고 있어요♡♡", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIZLypB0n-OU27kD0mspeCisCq8kMC807Nm0em279wxYjn9QQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Sehun Jang", "rating": 4, "content": "여름에 더위식히기 좋은 식당입니다 냉장고인줄 알았어요 사장님도 친절하십니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUUWm2HXuhdhuqFCufXy5ISrxMCRMpsvSJmRjOPNDwz9Bk-LANo=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "YongGo", "rating": 4, "content": "아메리카노 2. 무난한", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLMaLlvopVcZWyvkterk0naSbKVU5_Lf9nKUIi4zDN6mIq5lA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Evet Is Awesome", "rating": 5, "content": "My favorite café in this area", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVllj7p1IgpgP3r6aMFp0Ei6qGinNgsRgl523KthsHOwtgOaK52=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Soojung Park", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ6jH8tihL_eZR9X_hcG852RVeTBlhltOceH73umrNtj3A3zQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "이나영", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIJV1Ylc-0Z9JVCnMKUNG0E_LUsKHPRHKfDW1vlHywV5pb8oQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "W.H. S", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVySxO2N6j3STyey3XNkd59pU-wCjXXikGVqLXxZHhDyrFjwYFQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJL14ua1WvfDURrhKrqs292ZQ/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJL14ua1WvfDURrhKrqs292ZQ/photos/1.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}]	0101000020E61000005EBB0F9B23C85F40D8EA1791CDBB4240
