4.6	37.5138215	126.6639584	2026-02-16 19:12:43.500907	2026-03-17 21:26:58.64019	019c65f0-276c-79f4-89ac-96c18c21890d	CAFE	ChIJeed9n3B_ezURw3ZfixjoxVo	957177842	컴포즈커피 율도점	[{"author": "David Lee (Rainmaker)", "rating": 4, "content": "커피한잔 하기좋은곳\\n친절하고 깨끗합니다 아주좋다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUDyY6-viMmhkslBZt1cDgvRT0rxmpJ32A14xLvGL6IDeND-5g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "황미녀", "rating": 5, "content": "처음 간 카펜데 넘 좋았어요.\\n공간도 적당하게 넓고  대화하기도 좋구요.\\n저렴한 가격에 가성비 좋은 다양한 차..\\n또 갈거에요~~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKwUwc2R1eehm2X5Nk7qGYhaabDQV1JOIxSUYceQD-lY0P8Mg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "조예은", "rating": 5, "content": "가성비 최고죠 말해모해요ㅎㅎ\\n친절하시고 모든 자리에 콘센트가있어요 혼자있기에도 좋고 단체석이있어서 모임하기도 좋습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ5-aMPNcB-VGo-uVYZqhKI9DatIdt8IHsPm35FQn4WiTx1YA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "TV 당 (당뇨걸린헐크)", "rating": 5, "content": "생각보다 가게가 엄청 넓어서 이야기 하기 딱 좋은", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWnGmW73Kouuzt9D5mvYDETPtJl_0moE2M_doi-0cXv0i3v-54T=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "신현규", "rating": 5, "content": "에이드, 쥬스는 달지 않아서 좋아요.\\n제 입맛엔 최고 자주 이용할 것 같아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV4r94swQarsSy6HO0qXmv500ZdvvYaQ-Nw6jD7_1ejKQhTG9gc7A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "김진용", "rating": 2, "content": "그저그런 커피전문점\\n동내건달들이  진을치고있어  그닥 추천은 않하고싶다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKbwLm8ymBRdIWK0xF5JR62w1sUDbE73J3WY6vq2pLV0kgfnA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "냥슈", "rating": 5, "content": "친절하시고 음료 와플 맛집", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null