4.7	37.4805443	126.8013963	2026-02-16 19:12:25.992858	2026-03-17 21:28:39.123627	019c65ef-e308-7167-92af-0eb34342784e	CAFE	ChIJfWYM5mRjezUR7QScVJfgRDM	724127751	카페 소사	[{"author": "yygraphikos photo", "rating": 3, "content": "특별하지는 않지만 적당한 느낌의 동네 카페.\\n직접 굽는 구움과자류와 커피 한잔하기 좋음.\\n\\n더 자세한 리뷰는 블로그에서.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKGXXEsaFD-L8fAhMieniwQ58h_gw-kEoIxYrqaCqd4i4em=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Toy", "rating": 5, "content": "저희집 바로앞에 동네카페 카페소사입니다.\\n케이크나 마들렌맛집이라 자주찾는데 디카페인도 맛닜네요 ㅎㅎ 분위기 좋고 깔끔!! 친절한 사장님이 운영하셔서 서비스도 만족해요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXWFF4cvo6GplPLlh7YgHpNkskbBzGQ2P-BhXIh5gYSO2BUN8Y-=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "김현우", "rating": 5, "content": "빵 사이즈가 다 큰데도 엄청 싸고 맛있습니다.\\n주변에 삭막했는데 카페가 가까워져서 좋습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJbhmJjZUMFuGrvQCfPN0qIRcicv9ReQ40j5nfEwOMqKGjD-g=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "문상훈", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기 깔끔하고 음료와 빵 디저트전부 맛있습니다.\\n적극추천!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKDJPzo_o4jls52HILkxQx5woNme81JK67dst5D7RrcUPNdeA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "문종현", "rating": 5, "content": "카페너무이쁘고 빵도 너무 맛있었습니다.!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLvOKQHJGjmKQBVZtxxUqvq2mXb3544IscnkuyHrfrZvOXYHw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Risk Yourlife", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUiP51kBeLLPUcB_b-RfkdaCHRJJsCWNevtAvrXEmPg48uFWxQO=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "김정현", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLUMvXBsGQNyIrZkKcEoA4sK-0cD1LQbYISKzpOgQA9pg30bTIS=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "손민재tv", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKefES1MS1J8rGkGb2oALkxgkroW6LcYNuCZglpmHyHHJeIJA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJfWYM5mRjezUR7QScVJfgRDM/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJfWYM5mRjezUR7QScVJfgRDM/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJfWYM5mRjezUR7QScVJfgRDM/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJfWYM5mRjezUR7QScVJfgRDM/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJfWYM5mRjezUR7QScVJfgRDM/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJfWYM5mRjezUR7QScVJfgRDM/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJfWYM5mRjezUR7QScVJfgRDM/photos/6.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000AAE8B4134AB35F40BD63C27982BD4240
