4.7	37.075446	127.0554521	2026-02-16 19:12:29.4342	2026-03-17 21:24:26.13741	019c65ef-f07a-7c76-ba51-3dc1986c5dbd	CAFE	ChIJ20B4-6o5ezUR_feoe7akkkc	1215666103	세라프커피 SERAPH COFFEE	[{"author": "이지혜", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기가 아늑하고 사장님이 넘 친절하세요!\\n직접로스팅하는 커피라 커피맛이 남다릅니다\\n가성비도 좋고 겨울 한정 메뉴 수제붕어빵도 굿이에요\\n또가고싶은 카페 추천!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJt4Yl4Twb64WwF_D1JsSueyCVDZow4XqeV6bZHjwjBxJj_uA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "DORE MI", "rating": 5, "content": "수제디저트맛집 대왕붕어빵 최고\\n직접만든 초콜릿도 서비스로주시고\\n스페셜티커피라떼 1리터😋넘맛있음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVu25PdeIF32etIkETWsN9Kf-nArX4fA4pUZLOB99abFbdW1m3SmQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "민은희", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기좋고 원두에진심인\\n사장님 진짜 커피너무맛있는데\\n케이크 딸기천국…❤️ 갓성비", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKkl3B4qtpAjaH5qy-VLLfJVRCXh4KjiXiCrvoKqghrG0YS-Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Mary", "rating": 5, "content": "커피맛집 디저트맛집 아늑한 분위기속에 진한맛의 비스크치즈케이크 달콤쌉쌀한 에스프레소 딸기라떼 직접로스팅한 원두로 내린 정성가득 아이스아메리카노까지 굿굿", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLi-3lalB3UCBW3Z-Rii0xxL7X6lJDVO7bmYe1Ef0CXKi1xzg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "전서영", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님 친절하시구 커피도 넘 맛나요\\n다음에 디저트도 먹으러 다녀오고싶어요 :)", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIixSSeDhhA4WqA8hXJgcNzzNqk2m5DgDWCdfyu4MlHRtdVqQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "투유TOYOU", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님이 커피에 진심이세요, 덕분에 이렇게 맛있는 커피를 알게됐네요. 시그니처 커피도 의미가 있어 새롭고 케이크도 직접 만드신다니 다음에 꼭 먹으러 가고싶어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjULgOOF-v5LrQjEaU-73FYirRXtBtsS0n3NhV7XegJc2xH0YyHN=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "임지수", "rating": 5, "content": "바스크 치즈 케이크가 엄청 꾸덕하니 맛있고 딸기말차라떼가 매우 맛있었어용", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIFMHpTFVwc0CNsSNNiGCcxz0YudLzKR8eu98IsNHX71flzww=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "이준호", "rating": 4, "content": "공짜러 먹은 커피\\n맛은 있음 바닐라라떼 1인 으로\\n비교적 나은듯함 가려서 먹는 커피 1인으로 저에게 개췐 공유는 제맴 님입맛은 님입맛인걸로 제입맛은 좋아요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLKJGFhc9Y132NitjicEeaJRONDXw29KETp9MZSOaG54sz7Eg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ20B4-6o5ezUR_feoe7akkkc/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ20B4-6o5ezUR_feoe7akkkc/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ20B4-6o5ezUR_feoe7akkkc/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ20B4-6o5ezUR_feoe7akkkc/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ20B4-6o5ezUR_feoe7akkkc/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ20B4-6o5ezUR_feoe7akkkc/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ20B4-6o5ezUR_feoe7akkkc/photos/6.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ20B4-6o5ezUR_feoe7akkkc/photos/7.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [13, 0], "closeTime": [9, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000A6FFF6868CC35F40984EEB36A88942