4.5	37.3783008	127.1122664	2026-02-16 19:12:30.932401	2026-03-17 21:21:03.653532	019c65ef-f654-7d85-b553-3bf849743ba0	CAFE	ChIJO-mRBj1ZezUR0pjJ2HkvBr4	577942947	크레마노 분당	[{"author": "A.K Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "가까이 있었는데 오늘 처음으로 가봄. 분위기가 넘 좋고 커피도 맛있고 창가 분위기도 넘 이쁜 카페. 식사후에 이곳에서", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLKO2QdP8Rr9yS6xK6mkuEmkif1LAf4AhgX5PeZdcjdXLip25Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Emma C", "rating": 5, "content": "수내역 숨겨진 커피맛집. 에스프레소에 진심이신 사장님이 만들어주시는 커피에요. 에스프레소 메뉴도 정말 다양해서 골라먹는 재미가있답니다. 곁드려 먹을수있는 구움과자류들도 저렴해서 완전 좋아요! 다른 카페에서는 너무 비싸게 받는데 ㅠㅠ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI1AVNLS5NjY_AMyMknBqkRP5tW8vkCo58I1w-A9VKeSIM0ig=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "냥우힣", "rating": 5, "content": "+기간한정으로 두쫀쿠 판매중이세요+\\n친절하신 사장님과 맛있는 커피\\n느낌좋은 에스프레소바!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ5DxNJF42qc2sJnkZ7dchHtqc7RcaY5TD1ORqlv1oKvdANVw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Hyunkyung Han", "rating": 5, "content": "분당에서 처음 도전한  에스프레소바\\n느낌있고 유럽분위기? 나고 ㅎㅎ 동네에서 가기 좋은것 같아요\\n탄천과 가까운것도 장점!!\\n커피 맛이 정말 좋았어요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI2UV6Zx8Uh_hpxTmd0e3slXjKQ0--BIlOUI1m38PhJ3kfbiOc=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "수락폴", "rating": 4, "content": "워낙 조용하고 존재감 없어서 지나치기 쉽지만, 내부에 들어서면 전문적인 아우라가 느껴짐. 에스프레소 외에도 모든 음료들이 맛있고, 깊이 있다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWtAUjO_fh2oBqO6yIJ3Lz7xeDzzkXTok8yg_w9uiHd-jC2DCVz=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "미미(Olivia Ko)", "rating": 5, "content": "에스프레소 맛집\\n진한 커피 마시고 싶을 때 찾는 곳이에요\\n질 좋은 크림 가득한 콘파나 맛있어요\\n추천합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUoqxsGq04reinRpQiOzKewTJKCv7emylv2_POFnuwoljC6aRjZ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "봄에서가을", "rating": 5, "content": "커피 넘 맛나요\\n카페도 분위기 너무 예뻐요\\n음악도 굿굿\\n어딜 앉아도 좋을꺼 같아요\\n자주오고 싶어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUfQRQryFsyspCNCbBcxOuRuXo5O3gJjndOH82fESg_mDPxfkU=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "킹나비", "rating": 4, "content": "커피가 맛있어요.. 의자가 좀 불편하지만..   커피는 굿!!!!  서비스 좋구요..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJVxvBfpoXb688Y_UR3MtHneV4yu2hfeeZxgUPJWAn5CdLgYA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJO-mRBj1ZezUR0pjJ2HkvBr4/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJO-mRBj1ZezUR0pjJ2HkvBr4/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJO-mRBj1ZezUR0pjJ2HkvBr4/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJO-mRBj1ZezUR0pjJ2HkvBr4/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJO-mRBj1ZezUR0pjJ2HkvBr4/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJO-mRBj1ZezUR0pjJ2HkvBr4/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJO-mRBj1ZezUR0pjJ2HkvBr4/photos/6.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJO-mRBj1ZezUR0pjJ2HkvBr4/photos/7.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [17, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [17, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [17, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [17, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [17, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [17, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000231C695F2FC75F407B061E296CB04240
