-br100"}, {"author": "이태신", "rating": 4, "content": "The atmosphere of the restaurant is bright and warm, and the kindness of the staff is good the recommended\\nmenu is sweet taro milk tea with chewy tapioca pearls\\nThere's nothing to look around, but Irecommend it because the atmosphere and drinks in the restaurant are delicious us", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLF8VuPDUrkSwonYnnaE3bLXiFD5wIOlvNsbBVcXe5SFUPqSw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "권유빈", "rating": 5, "content": "It is usually a place where many people come to eat dessert af meal. I also frequently visit and chat with my friends. It is relativ expensive, but it is also delicious. I recommend coming when y eat sweets occasionally.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIN8qaIcAJOOTi7rScamJ40s0nQy3hl8CO08LnBSP2r8NUGuA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ2caV53i9fDURUxTf8jsdEAs/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ2caV53i9fDURUxTf8jsdEAs/photos/1.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000001BFF4F0F9BC15F4081BFA959B1D14240
