4.8	37.5525385	126.9680193	2026-02-16 19:12:44.948495	2026-03-17 21:35:08.782847	019c65f0-2d14-73db-9223-49e17022d132	CAFE	ChIJn8J0mWWifDURpjybGaLDKsk	1038423658	카페지오 CAFE GIO	[{"author": "Mij P", "rating": 5, "content": "카페 인테리어가 아름답고 음식이 다 맛있어요. 가방도 직접 만들어서 파시는데 예뻐요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW0L1Y8W9V4Ufk7qY8lOgozWAPP3HmOQ5BQ2MTOCUUtJwJ1vv4=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "흐켱", "rating": 5, "content": "주변 카페중 가장 맛있는 커피맛. 직접 제조하는 샌드위치는 식사로도 훌륭한편. 주변에 오게된다면 꼭 들러보길", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJxBS9TrNECjUgF7qZFrEVOj9wzHdgyczDmBPDEc7jYqdl8uw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "김미화", "rating": 5, "content": "서부역 건너편 골목안쪽에 위치한 카페다\\n작지만 커피맛도 훌륭하고 싸고 직접구운 쿠기도 맛나고 소품들도 이뻤던곳", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjURZhoeBsyDRY2Mn5ItUkAkvZTxIHWcmiaG8h9A9MT7saidn4NoEA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "동아", "rating": 4, "content": "커피가 맛있고 의자도 편하고, 화장실도 깨끗해요. 조용히 대화 나누기 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV1hktD_4I_ShaF5SDIyOZAn3HGJzkDYgHIrrp9T8PWDCIUkN9i=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "양병남", "rating": 3, "content": "비치된 도서가 낡고 오래 되었으며 커피맛도 중급", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVxu4vMPTsRBC8KM3-a6e1OtKS0O6ESpAKqsP2TDaWuZ8E8xRxUTw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Sheung Gyun Yi", "rating": 5, "content": "2022년 10월25일 인생 라떼 찾았슴~^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIrP5fCXWWs_8FBR7n1JKw3GJHiR6x5A3YreMSmMvZ4ZN0NZA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Buseung Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님 마들렌 개꿀맛입니다 좋아용~~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL1CToIhJBYpqWPURBNtOPGjgxvEdI_6k_TkkEs2xmPlk45Uw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "김성민", "rating": 5, "content": "맛있는 동네카페", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWSpxTzx5D8N3eGEaUhw0BAFt57jLDGNvn7c8ivt8pLVV3kbpfi=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJn8J0mWWifDURpjybGaLDKsk/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJn8J0mWWifDURpjybGaLDKsk/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJn8J0mWWifDURpjybGaLDKsk/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJn8J0mWWifDURpjybGaLDKsk/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJn8J0mWWifDURpjybGaLDKsk/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJn8J0mWWifDURpjybGaLDKsk/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJn8J0mWWifDURpjybGaLDKsk/photos/6.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJn8J0mWWifDURpjybGaLDKsk/photos/7.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E610000065D93807F4BD5F40F4A3E194B9C64240
4.2	37.4829982	127.1234595	2026-02-16 19:12:44.948701	2026-03-17 20:49:21.248636	019c65f0-2d14-73db-9224-6fc95eb49218	CAFE	ChIJ3Rb6sfalfDURXATOhzOE7Js	2135614712	파스쿠찌 문정르피에드점	[{"author": "Sangmin Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "르피에드 문정 1층에 위치한 파스쿠찌.\\n매장이 엄청 넓고, 깔끔합니다. 음식은 여느 파스쿠찌와 같이 괜찮은 편입니다. 브런치 먹기에도 괜찮습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXFHpcfo66Qm0zpQUaOjbuu9LXFDjwPfsxDdKEn-0io5dLYBwQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Victor Kim", "rating": 1, "content": "음식은 체인점이라 똑같겠지만\\n키오스크에 품절이 많을수는 있지..\\n주문했는데 그것도 품절이라고 결제취소하고 다시 결제하라고 하고\\n음료 된다고 했다가 안된다고 했다가\\n안된다고 했다고 또 된다고 했다가..\\n재고를 제대로 확인하고 키오스크도 관리하고 해야지\\n사과도 하는둥 마는둥\\n답답함", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVUWN8iFgsOOWhZ3n9X5E-rv369qht8B4p8JuSp-dAQkg41uTFw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "쑨도리친구", "rating": 4, "content": "넓고 캐적한 공간이지만 소리가 울리고 정신없는 듯", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKc2BrrqhqGg7_GhmatnYxjDsV5FRwQotgKkuqijtde-TY-Qw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "나윤관", "rating": 5, "content": "새건물에 잘 만들어졌어요 :)", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXO9F1fsu2YeCDFSmMAzyaJ7M3NXMo0x0IxfW6YQEOD23dYUzo=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "최태영", "rating": 4, "content": "석천호수변에 위치 한 곳으로 점심과 함께 커피를 마셨는데 석천호수를 바라보며 식사를 하니까 풍경이 좋아보였슴", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWqXTM3IFhsjKLHGlAjb1MJ9fcvyqnPtev0cCiFGwfE-IUr4hLwJw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "kate", "rating": 4, "content": "신규 매장이라 쾌적해요.\\n혼자 오는분들이 많습니다.\\n은근 좌석 잡기 어려워요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXvbO4yfVBSC9l52MYMcY5lTROwxSWv0cxUZSHdU9iu9kAjU6fc=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "남지선", "rating": 4, "content": "넓고 조용히 이야기 하기 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVJTTm05iikxu9gnpROAhXsRnFSaChy_fZtLvuBIC2rovLMfvTfkQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "winner IM", "rating": 4, "content": "자리가 편안한 장소다\\n자주 찾고싶은곳", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWz925D8T-rPrzDMrmgV54gWtcm1eZGRr4GSaXRQ-54Xagm87B2=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ3Rb6sfalfDURXATOhzOE7Js/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ3Rb6sfalfDURXATOhzOE7Js/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ3Rb6sfalfDURXATOhzOE7Js/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ3Rb6sfalfDURXATOhzOE7Js/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ3Rb6sfalfDURXATOhzOE7Js/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000005AB8ACC2E6C75F40708390E2D2BD4240
