4	37.482450899999996	126.9294091	2026-02-16 19:12:46.467488	2026-03-17 21:34:42.573435	019c65f0-3303-7485-a9ea-9fa9496ee961	CAFE	ChIJAVmJoFCffDURa22qiKsjeZo	1530501554	디저트39 신림역점	[{"author": "김하나", "rating": 5, "content": "케익이 넘 맛있고..다회용컵을 사용하셔서 집에 가져왔어요..생각보다 컵도 예쁘고 분위기도 좋고 커피도 맛나요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKNjmI2PLQD2dxpBrFZJm7QRLR9ywzHdor7CSc7cKMYoFtctg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "afjioqwjfw", "rating": 1, "content": "인간적으로 키오스크에서 오믈렛 사진은 다시 찍어라. 엄지손가락 크기더라.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLAuxvLjgxcFsM01jbj9tokX2xhd938em-4dxgIOX--iCBFXw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "lowpanpan", "rating": 5, "content": "位於新林店的Dessert39\\n打包了三款甜點\\n1️⃣ 커스타드 슈크림크레이프 (卡士達奶油千層蛋糕)\\n價格：₩7500\\n奶油部份比我想像之中還要好吃\\n甜度適中，口感柔軟濕潤，\\n薄餅皮做得很薄，與奶油幾乎融為一體\\n做到入口即化💯👍🏻\\n雖然價格有點貴，但很好吃，\\n可以嚐出來奶油的品質很好，不會膩\\n2️⃣오리지 널도쿄롤（原味東京卷 )\\n價格：₩5600\\n因為太軟很難拿在手上 哈哈\\n最後還是放下來用叉子挖著吃\\n奶油的牛奶味十分濃郁，幾乎完全不甜\\n蛋糕部份口感很軟，很濕潤，和奶油很搭\\n3️⃣ 커스터드 크로칸 슈 （卡士達奶油泡芙棒）\\n價格：₩4900\\n在店裡是熱的又脆\\n但打包回家時間久就冷了不脆\\n建議買完立即吃掉\\n餡料顏色比一般卡士達奶油更黃\\n鹹鹹甜甜的味道\\n好像奶黃流沙包的味道 哈哈\\n\\n總括而言，\\n很推薦dessert39的甜點\\n比很多私人烘焙賣的甜點更好吃！", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXG58zruhYVCyJfQY9T-zwCfmwHTkQBTJ_V4qRamBC1bO1bREWcsA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "김희재", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLmyPON_8gqGDiEZmIcK2f5VKcmqk_Ky8V4D7jz5uTyEKgfHA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJAVmJoFCffDURa22qiKsjeZo/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJAVmJoFCffDURa22qiKsjeZo/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJAVmJoFCffDURa22qiKsjeZo/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJAVmJoFCffDURa22qiKsjeZo/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [3, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [3, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [3, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [3, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [3, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [3, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [3, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000B5464E707BBB5F407FB67AF3C0BD4240
