4.8	37.504564099999996	127.043701	2026-02-16 19:12:51.431743	2026-03-17 21:42:08.723884	019c65f0-4667-7f54-89d0-3707f43890b9	CAFE	ChIJ94bLb--lfDUR7UeUcLeyAQA	1992321980	카페 봄	[{"author": "김도일", "rating": 5, "content": "BTS늦덕인 내가 올해 처음 까페투어를했다 데뷔8주년!!!사장님의 BTS사랑 새삼 느끼고 왔음 커피 맛있음 깨끗함", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXYYBO5Ks36CXsm7QQ6cKJDpVPAvijLOOyh3K8KzeDdr4A-ZfvtvQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "robinhood sinchon (신촌로빈훗)", "rating": 5, "content": "아이유 생일 이벤트를 진행했던 카페 중에 제일 좋았어요.\\n\\n감사합니다~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWkwBvL3_rC5mnN_Yif2TN4I-Y0PdVfKJ_dWOkm27nkmZRfutnaLA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Carpe diem (메쉬윙키)", "rating": 5, "content": "우리 애들 생일카페 짱! 데코도 좋고 주인분도 너무 친절하시네요~~ 알고보니 아이돌 생일카페 전문으로 유명했다는 ^^  WIZ*ONE ♥ IZ*ONE", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWdOjjmi0e-Dgvw9F_b6_5jVJiG6_pgwsxALpWzw1XCBhfXKQlEeQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Carrie Park", "rating": 4, "content": "짐토버 생일카페 투어차 갔는데 넓고 나눔도 많고 해서 즐겁게 있었습니당 ㅎㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIk22sCmcpwk9zSaHqLFJg8JIvBrKu_JKR5vtktC1Tr8cx_Kg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "비밀친구`_ᴡɪᴢᴏɴᴇ", "rating": 5, "content": "아이즈원팬이라서 진주에서 서울 와서 카페 왔는데 분위기도 좋고\\n컵홀더&사진 엄청 많이 주셨어요 이정도로 많이 주는 카페는 처음이에요\\n아 그리고 카페 음식들도 저렴하고 맛있습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWgyuuCqE7wHIYd0FnwPn6gXxJyzn6B9u1lnYq0oAr0IMr8yb-d=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "에반게리온미래에의포효", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님이 친절하게 잘 대해주셔서 잘있다가 왔네요\\n카페 이쁘게 잘 꾸미셨어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLWDStgGlmfPVMQoS1GLJGR3Tu8tYHiHboMDXYXlneCgm3PNGQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Ian Kinsler", "rating": 5, "content": "오늘은 10/06일 몬스터x 주헌(joo honey)생일이었다 팬들이 아이돌을 먼발치 (이까페)에서 챙겨주기도 하고 아이돌이 직접 오기도 하는 까페, 음악 계속틀고 ㅋ 일반 까페는 아닌듯", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU5qgYiJOm6YJrn6sVUGuiDPRYc9lYx29P-FhPtRUIz-zTE9Cf3=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "이은영", "rating": 5, "content": "여기는 묻지도따지지도 말고 와야할곳\\n사장님 내외분도 엄청 친절하신 곳\\n사랑방같은 장소💜", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKw5ix0b3wpVjVIlDBUhcL7sRAjL4YXYiV79MAyaHvCrqJk=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ94bLb--lfDUR7UeUcLeyAQA/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ94bLb--lfDUR7UeUcLeyAQA/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ94bLb--lfDUR7UeUcLeyAQA/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ94bLb--lfDUR7UeUcLeyAQA/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E61000005C7347FFCBC25F402A1E728E95C04240
