4	37.4244315	126.912454	2026-02-16 19:12:51.432849	2026-03-17 21:37:39.410593	019c65f0-4668-76c6-8b98-b936bb6f1959	CAFE	ChIJFywBSP1gezURG1FLw19y7A8	1133575899	카페테라스	[{"author": "SUNGHWAN CHOI", "rating": 5, "content": "레몬에이드에 꽃잎이 세 개, 이쁘고 맛있고 인테리어도 좋네요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXJkoaAeub7fQ2BCMMfXIorhHrbQ5EmZndnluPw14IvY3LBqjc=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "김병철", "rating": 4, "content": "삼막로에 많은 카페중에 분위기도 좋고, 커피도 맛 있는 집입니다. 주차장이 별도로 있습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWNJ42IsUxiAFQldk889LpLGyKFhNBpujeygiSDfzDQe7XeMlED=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "김소연", "rating": 5, "content": "넓고 인테리어도 너무 예쁘고 음료도 맛있어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXGqBrQNFrfs3nwrosNEX2OQMyXwD0rppe-rVlzR5qguRZKpiA0Lw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "jy park", "rating": 4, "content": "이름처럼 막 분위기 있는 곳은 아니어서 좀 실망...커피맛도 보통이었어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU5ljyzF9R8HvXMUURzGqtM1ZcWvc6pPR9CfhFWF311UHrtq2IHBw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "평강공주", "rating": 1, "content": "커피집이 너무 맛이없어요.아이스크림은 커피잖에 성의없이 나오고 같은거 안시키면 안좋아라하고~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXrk0PXiOlZGaBrM4PkW0E4I1CkTP-ukrMvLN18U8pL1MGmblPs=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "푸른하늘", "rating": 5, "content": "음식이 전체적으로 다 맛있다. 날이 좋으면 야외에서 경치를 즐기기에도 좋다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIc7iCtCuqp-xNa9vG0JcS3ghmkeCB6Pie9arh3bi9SJIJV3w=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "권자경", "rating": 3, "content": "넓은 실내. 인테리어도 맘에 들고 군데군데 써 있는 말들이 뭔가를 생각하게 하네요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIH0-I5EgsQ8awT01XJ9X5ykTyKs4M8YhiWWerQBFkNaXFn5A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Younho Gyung", "rating": 4, "content": "삼막먹거리촌 가운데 넓은 주차 공간 쾌적한 실내와 테라스 공간이 있습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV4PQwQCtkJAg1QrxGM6GKb9pqkzUsGVs2GnGuTsTFcCD8NYrU9=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJFywBSP1gezURG1FLw19y7A8/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJFywBSP1gezURG1FLw19y7A8/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJFywBSP1gezURG1FLw19y7A8/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJFywBSP1gezURG1FLw19y7A8/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJFywBSP1gezURG1FLw19y7A8/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000AE4676A565BA5F4034F279C553B64240
