4.4	37.369409	126.811196	2026-02-16 19:13:22.599089	2026-03-17 21:49:21.231709	019c65f0-c027-7a59-bb5d-a45131a58e5a	CAFE	ChIJveiaFZFlezUR15NjLK1dygw	1395640713	투썸플레이스 시흥능곡점	[{"author": "Ariella Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "매장이 넓고 좌석이 많아요.\\n화장실은 같은 건물내 화장실에 휴지는 없지만\\n깔끔해서 쓸만합니다.\\n\\n음료가 다른곳보다는 비싼 느낌이지만 자리값이다 생각하면 괜찮고요.\\n능곡동에선 여기 베이글이 가장 맛있습니다.\\n\\n아무생각없이 들려서 편하게 있다가기 좋은 곳 입니다~^-^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVx96n2eLRjYV5CvyFkwxs5ml2gACGnJwdqwbKesAOHEhI-Stzm=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "FULL Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "일요일 주말 심심할땐   투썸이지", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXscyOzzqbLz0mqxguwqsxc-Qn13TklzuDbJX3Ol-PptvFe1CWFHg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "이성상", "rating": 5, "content": "깨끗하고 창가쪽 좋아요~ ㅋㅋ 2층!!!\\n\\n화장실도 깨끗하고!!!!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLJn34JkuAellTQt4IREY65ZDIc8JgLP1jPl5dPnTu1meR3=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "파란하늘", "rating": 5, "content": "자리넓고 직원분들 친절합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXWUegk6EglzRD35YL1wDhAITkzbsiBc7GLL0G1QqCr02a0d4pN=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "허인순", "rating": 5, "content": "직원분들이 너무친절하시고 점장님도   친절하셨어요\\n맛도 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVgOWNfO3jLul9KyD-qLQld2JVG214UffkzkNI-LjMNpoxDT7rc=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "이윤지", "rating": 4, "content": "좋아요 그런데 홀관리 조금만 더", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU3P_CufwjPPcXh7c_tmnriFmoOLnlYiMimi7OL0pJJwyf20N4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "이춘옥", "rating": 3, "content": "넘 시끄럽고 친절도 떨어짐 플라스틱컵은 좀지저분함", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIi0TtB9yJUV5zQgkGRBG0YzQNIULpWk19FlzrYtuDGoIz3Ng=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Shiny K", "rating": 4, "content": "넓은 좌석 일반 투썸 수준의 음료 및 디저트", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjViSpB7WEqpcvLnsUZE8yqDsNK79JdQIdY8hLMkBm7LeQW94d0=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJveiaFZFlezUR15NjLK1dygw/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJveiaFZFlezUR15NjLK1dygw/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJveiaFZFlezUR15NjLK1dygw/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJveiaFZFlezUR15NjLK1dygw/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJveiaFZFlezUR15NjLK1dygw/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJveiaFZFlezUR15NjLK1dygw/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E610000058A9A0A2EAB35F408DEC4ACB48AF4240
