4.7	37.5886711	127.0043635	2026-02-16 19:15:24.484618	2026-02-16 19:15:24.484618	019c65f2-9c44-78da-bb95-93aa0a6fd742	CAFE	ChIJ-z9Uq7-9fDURnFL4nYHcaOY	24975334	혜화문아래	[]	[]	[{"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000F372D87D47C05F40D84C199359CB4240
4.2	37.4978383	126.99916529999999	2026-02-16 19:13:25.979661	2026-03-17 21:50:54.141957	019c65f0-cd5b-7868-8327-4164bec0a504	CAFE	ChIJ_9xEbb6hfDURPNC6Ra-3A48	1180498194	먼셀커피 서래마을점	[{"author": "YJ L", "rating": 4, "content": "공간이 널찍하고 예뻤어요.\\n베이커리류도 종류가 많고 다 맛있었습니다.\\n가든(?)같이 생긴 공간에 있는 새장이 인상적이었습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXeTHkvGcAnW3hgUpm3311rUGD8rYKag6Yt3_5LHTkcOkeB9SysJQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "JH Choi", "rating": 3, "content": "후기가 나쁘지않아 방문했으나 생각보다 내입맛은 아니었던걸로...\\n인테리어가 반반이라 특색있다 정도?", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXM9_vZ9l2t04Sz4R_cO4itwAnGYPN1N0AY2W_Zg7Mi4xxJuH9TRw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Andrew Kim", "rating": 3, "content": "지하공간이 숨은 보석. 그러나 조금 황량한 느낌도\\n1층과 컨셉이 다르고 1층은 2가지 컨셉.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVzp5i3HEAJit0YWS-_VqBiC7DtlG80T9uWfqhBnEJtWI7RTSad=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "문지영", "rating": 3, "content": "자동문 뿌실뻔했어요 , 자동문버튼 누르고 닫히는건 저절로 닫히니 억지로 안닫으셔도됩니다.  문 밀고 있으면 시선강탈..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXHfSYNmudSt2waTDz9j9jCQWmmZCXzTBugwU-uGX1moMhzrA8m=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "YH Kim", "rating": 3, "content": "음료가 그렇게 맛있다기보다는 매장이 넓다는 점이 가장 장점임. 1층에 뭔가 숲처럼 꾸며놓은 공간이 있고 진짜 새 두마리가 새장에 사는데 새 지저귀는 소리가 종종 들림.\\n지하는 안내려가봤지만 단체 또는 공부하는 사람들을 위한 공간이라고 되어있음.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIub39y4z8yfpuAB8FyZYWBtyWkZ8R77gCOLXy5gPBi3KlBQA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "hoon ku Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "요새는 잘 없는 편히 커피한잔 가능한 곳", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ3uoqokEDKV8JkkPR7iCbNCsTwN1mWGML0KOq8zE4CHdVJ-w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "앨리노아", "rating": 5, "content": "발렛 4천원에 맡기고 지하에 넒은 곳에서 편이 이야기 했어요.\\n지하 흡연실 앞 자리는 냄새 오져요~~~ 피하시길", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU04IlDdoXUhrJfsBjHjKvifWGUruu6RPGYM9sRUkVGastwkJt3bw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Lisianthus Kwon", "rating": 4, "content": "예쁜 인테리어가 인상적인 카페입니다. 시그니처음료는 빠르게 품절되어 또 못마셨네요. 다음에 더 빠르게 들러야겠어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUzPLa91N-XA4LfdcIeHBxsMRPhIpubZ_bdKzoYpV-2tmwM9nLm=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ_9xEbb6hfDURPNC6Ra-3A48/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ_9xEbb6hfDURPNC6Ra-3A48/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ_9xEbb6hfDURPNC6Ra-3A48/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ_9xEbb6hfDURPNC6Ra-3A48/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E610000012B30353F2BF5F401E99582AB9BF4240
4.4	37.6435716	127.0311842	2026-02-16 19:13:25.979816	2026-03-17 21:50:55.278108	019c65f0-cd5b-7868-8328-d96957c6d3c6	CAFE	ChIJbc1aiQm9fDURSPy-zT2zEyk	1567589438	더쌍화커피 쌍문동점	[{"author": "Ride “Snowman” The Wind", "rating": 4, "content": "한방차를 다양한 디저트류와 함께 즐길수있는 공간입니다. 한방을 매개로 다양한 메뉴들이 많네요. 가성비있는 구성에 맛도 좋고 만족스럽게 즐길수있는 곳입니다. 커피가 너무 식상해질때 리프레시하기에 정말 좋은곳이네요. 사장님도 매우 친절하시고 주차공간도 나쁘지않네요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX6yyBa_OmukwBfrVyhTmlZit4pZ0Fq0gkc9lfsyA1jd_rYGXkFUA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Sang Jun Ahn (Alex)", "rating": 4, "content": "전통적인 쌍화차를 만날수있는 카페.\\n주인장님께서 친절한 설명을 듣고 마시면 더 좋다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW-H_vYiy2FzfxhgeLIz--mqhaJrT4cX6xYCIX0-Yu3aP95Vpj7=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "LUCKY TV", "rating": 5, "content": "가루쌍화차와 차원이 다름. 5천원에 이정도 쌍화차와 피칸과 대추 약간, 새끼 장뇌삼까지. 훌륭한 구성.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXc5-tcD0wbIdFS_4PhSv9grkjOmryx6A5BaBcpvVXeBnkWY14p=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "박정순", "rating": 5, "content": "샬롬! 한국에 전통 찻집으로 추천해요 차로 힐링 할수 있어요 ☆", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWWFiRxfl-dURZTokZt6Cou4Zmii09Synx9yuB59YNKCxQWoN4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "김수연", "rating": 5, "content": "어르신들의 성지입니다. 전통음료 좋습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV_nr9Kdwu2E8l5SjLBcnIR-tSb0JQNS-82_6Uyyef_Bnj19pJ1=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "바람의천사", "rating": 5, "content": "정말 좋아요~~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUHOg5wuj47_PFwQEcWoQGDmebpDMcpbFrjVxrNHTu7RCGJp2Bl5Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Hsin Nung Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "In love with the traditional Korean tea set 🍵 The cinnamon and ginger teas were flavorful and comforting, and the owner was so warm and kind 🥹", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUEmChFZJL1t4Zi9Ixh25zFMFJfiAeIVQ8S0A3xy9jC4jjs_tg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "Ruben Acuna", "rating": 5, "content": "Wonderful little coffee shop with unique drinks and dessert. No english.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI7ks745ODWhjvWti8nr1oc4QIy7UADGiZ6kdt9rAZbzmSn=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJbc1aiQm9fDURSPy-zT2zEyk/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJbc1aiQm9fDURSPy-zT2zEyk/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJbc1aiQm9fDURSPy-zT2zEyk/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJbc1aiQm9fDURSPy-zT2zEyk/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [22, 30]}]	0101000020E6100000B9C903ECFEC15F403451DF8D60D24240
4.6	37.6496135	127.0377396	2026-02-16 19:13:25.980528	2026-03-17 21:50:42.726286	019c65f0-cd5c-7e50-9a2d-c8132c518019	CAFE	ChIJ75tFc6u-fDURbBW5-XzvZNw	102061915	카페알로	[{"author": "JY ahn", "rating": 5, "content": "쌍문동 자주가는 최애 카페입니다. 원두도 사장님이 항상 신경써주셔서 그런지 상태 좋고 커피맛은 당연히 최고입니다. 수제 샌드위치는 전부다 굳굳입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJQDBF7KsZ9tslyusdRFeQHptb9viOzexHJqDK3MgvCe00jEw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "변재문", "rating": 2, "content": "창북중 앞 친절하신 사장님이 계신 커피숖입니다..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK3TTz9qSZ2PX32xe_nphgYpms2sZj04jrJ8k2B7EoII5pmqg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "totoro", "rating": 5, "content": "깔끔하고,햇빛도 잘 들어와서 좋아요.\\n쥔장이 친절해요.\\n커피도 괜찮아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXrd5pKAS8kXmRuDlAojHb9QdhlIt1E1oLI4DHNU3ORfX9x4EpR=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "김선우", "rating": 5, "content": "맛있고 분위기도 좋아요..케익도 맛있었어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKvevdTTLyDdy7CPfTfmLvgEMcnPPch09QgirjK9F-07I8ASg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "유연택 (tommythink)", "rating": 5, "content": "아이스 아메리카노 + 샌드위치 조합은 행복입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWH8hXMUaoSRsQ0aoJqtVSXpx90d4RVa3eLlHo3Lr-Ss6CE7WBH=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "양미숙", "rating": 4, "content": "기쁨나눔 청년대안공간 까페알로  자립준비청년 만남을 이어갑니다!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLcih9hjoUv_UQMSjClm6HEdUvaF9TdAg3oD6z9O6rOS-dnMQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "wbin", "rating": 5, "content": "라떼가 아주 맛있고 무엇보다 너무 친절하세요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKBio_jMawxTdtKUlFaV6OtAFqFSev2EIlP3VdX9_XrWkh5UfU=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Kevin Roche", "rating": 5, "content": "음료는 평범. 샌드위치가 정말 맛있음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVxHMTNiSJD8gCJbvInJTpNqjuBZC7GU9Y8p5mRfhvoM21cuQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ75tFc6u-fDURbBW5-XzvZNw/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ75tFc6u-fDURbBW5-XzvZNw/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ75tFc6u-fDURbBW5-XzvZNw/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ75tFc6u-fDURbBW5-XzvZNw/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ75tFc6u-fDURbBW5-XzvZNw/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000E7F05A536AC25F4022C5008926D34240
4.6	37.546315299999996	127.3269983	2026-02-16 19:13:25.981715	2026-03-17 14:57:54.737176	019c65f0-cd5d-7067-9038-d87aedb53206	CAFE	ChIJL6pBgNZLYzURPkCIbKnxdyI	2068926811	Cafe In	[{"author": "박병권", "rating": 5, "content": "라이딩할때마다 꼭 방문하는 카페예요\\n작지만 맛있는커피 친절한 사장님덕에 편안해요\\n외국인들도 많이 찾아옵니다^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV1mbNrhWs68AKpIc8O-d4GHqdmB8qhTksATqP7diFwQOPiSpnOCw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "NAK HYUN LIM", "rating": 4, "content": "사장님이  아주 친절 합니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX_z7FVc_2jReqRLyp6OSMs5V5raagRbN0BTmArTy1FL22yNKD_=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "WH Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "서울에서 자전거타고 양수역가는길에 양수역한 100미터전에 오름편에 위치한 조그마한 카페입니다  자전거 거치대도 있고 아기자기하고 이쁘게 꾸며놨어요  양수역앞 북적대고 사람많은것이 싫으시다면 이 카페 강추합니다  그리고 항상 나오는던지 모르겠지만 음료를 시켰더니 가래떡을 조금 썰어주시네요  자전거타는 사람들에게는 칼로리도 보충할수 있고 좋네요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLVF-6kywb01i3CRLGfdR5RhwUijVsQFVpwK6EAVzkYyH7Xix0=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "향긋한바람", "rating": 5, "content": "양수리역에서 가까운 곳애 위치한 카페입니다.\\n자전거로 운동하는 사림들이 주 고객이지만 바로 옆에 있는 두머리 부엌에서 친환경 식사를 하고 한적한 곳에서 차 한잔 마시기 좋은 곳입니다.\\n특히 비오는 날은 운동하는 사람도 없고 한적한 도로에 내리는 비를 보며 시간을 보내기 좋습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUSSvRbLHhPer5D1-mVUXOd6I-tgbn2YZklA0gTUH9uZdH1lbn6=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Lucy Park", "rating": 4, "content": "애매한 위치에 있음. 사장님 친절. 커피맛은 특별하진 않은데 가격은 좀 비싸게 느껴짐.\\n아직도 뜨거운커피와 아이스커피 가격이 차이가 나는곳임", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKH0kB43xlfZoWj0qELn1d8dP8c9ngsWkBtV9nykBgFuCzMJ_Y=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "이성수", "rating": 4, "content": "서울에서 자전거도로 양수역 도착 200m 전 오른쪽에 홀로 있는 카페\\n일단 조용합니다.\\n아메리카노 리필 가능.\\n사장님 친절합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUjQvOHAjxX3stS9BEC3xtxU9JlUxvZZgvG_LO400e3stDX-teC=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "김임섭", "rating": 4, "content": "야평교 건너 양수역 직전 자전거길에서 만나는 커피점.\\n테이블 다섯개 아담한 커피점.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLfwUkfcQ7JPykuTXBbFTRBH_CFWd11uzu_HQDFoAvs28doyQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "홍성순", "rating": 5, "content": "커피맛도  까페도 깔끔하고\\n그래서  갈때마다 들리는\\n곳입니다 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL2ILwS1u6Sjm4dw70HwiypXb29gAWxKjUNN_k3QoAAhGGBKw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}]	[]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [17, 0]}]	0101000020E61000003F16478AEDD45F40F766E5A8EDC54240
