4.2	37.5003465	126.9084386	2026-02-16 19:13:42.580422	2026-03-17 21:53:07.27533	019c65f1-0e34-79a5-b5a4-9d6895190d16	CAFE	ChIJr4Lu9_OffDUREju8_TGGw6g	1993056337	스타벅스 신풍역점	[{"author": "이지맨Easyman", "rating": 5, "content": "단체로 방문하기에도 개인 공부나 작업 하기에도 좋은 매장이에요! 근처서 식사 마치고 오기도 좋고, 지하철역 입구 바로 앞인 것도 장점인 매장입니다!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWnhsGS7d5kCxvfGRrZmJlXHtggXjQm0P02AekxVKGtL99hl3ZG=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Jung Woo Shim", "rating": 5, "content": "타 매장에 비하면 아담한 편\\n규모가 작아서 인지\\n항상 붐벼서 자리를 잡기가 다소 불편", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL5pLpcJIgYLaqY2fAQ_LYw6k-SH28-X5CPrqs_1am2_4myPw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "오송근", "rating": 5, "content": "넘 맛있게 잘먹었습니다 ㅎㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW1YMtVhN2E8IR2NlsuOTTkhETJ8-80BU2qpTQbW62WnfX2HvsY=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "홍홍", "rating": 4, "content": "신풍역 바로 옆 새로 생긴 스타벅스⭐️\\n위치 좋고~새로 생겨서 실내 인테리어 깔끔하고\\n직원들 친절하고, 커피 맛 좋습니다 👍", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKtoh7rIk_WUMJB6FDdXfRN53CEkUaJiMDKunb_1YDCBLQWZg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "주아쥬블리", "rating": 4, "content": "직원들 친절하고 자리도 편하고 이용객 20대에서80대까지 다양 카공족들30프로 분포", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX_erofHD9WHKR3JjK5XQp05OIvo2cx1CX6-U6_rEvgQM55Ol3b=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "덕도리 (duckdori)", "rating": 5, "content": "저녁에 가면 자리없어요. 그래도 스타벅스니까 전반적으로 만족해요 깔끔하고", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXSxfw0hkVTVrHZ9LpYxByAU58ymqh_sRVC42Lj1bSxBkQTK82I=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "앉으나서나", "rating": 5, "content": "결혼식장,수녀원옆에 있어서 사람이많네유", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW6zTG3WaEWRPE2b8eDSUug8GCobJwBqrJ1jYOshztoETrBiyiNMg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "천지선", "rating": 4, "content": "새로 생겨서 깔끔합니다. 생각보다 내부가 안쪽으로 넓은데 자리가 좀 좁아서 아쉽습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVRtddmZsPwvN1GhzkQ3qeFDmyHb0Fl8zokEBzP6lyYqDj7RYpnZg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJr4Lu9_OffDUREju8_TGGw6g/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJr4Lu9_OffDUREju8_TGGw6g/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJr4Lu9_OffDUREju8_TGGw6g/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJr4Lu9_OffDUREju8_TGGw6g/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJr4Lu9_OffDUREju8_TGGw6g/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000235BA7DB23BA5F408315A75A0BC04240
