4.3	37.505672	127.0274505	2026-02-16 19:13:45.081405	2026-03-17 21:56:08.574629	019c65f1-17f9-7777-bcb4-a5a8a39a0040	CAFE	ChIJm0MWHmujfDURalu_Irx4Keo	1002422159	투썸플레이스 신논현점	[{"author": "wonny", "rating": 5, "content": "매장은 넓어서 좋아요\\n각 구역마다\\n테이블세팅이나 분위기가 달라서 좋던데요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLiXOZKMYHAfFjHhtQNyogrbsJX54zwlbXUl9UPftPY5VyxKA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "여행자", "rating": 4, "content": "매장은 넓고 좋은데  저녁늦게가서 직원들이 많이 지쳐보이고 질문에도 반응이 없었다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVcWGH5o24nrlBGHMGj8pW_WCuSImS1yI1Mk4tw4DGaCbEcx_Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "언제나고고고", "rating": 5, "content": "위치가 한가한곳이라 그런지 여유있어서 좋습니다. 세트메뉴로 먹으니 저렴해요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU80isdvQPZNqivUGYeDLPRjkRze_R1NmSa_s8oNmOQjCs9_CJF=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "김Great KIM", "rating": 5, "content": "매우넓은공간이 맘에 드네요\\n야외에도 자리가 있습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXDH4sLQywzwn7cM8FNXOhW79OHGtiMZN_Xw1LqHfMW2zgpPGZOzQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "Sunny", "rating": 3, "content": "다 좋은데 매번 방문할때마다 느끼지만 너무 불친절해요~ 돈주고 사먹는데도 구걸하는 느낌이에요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXxIB__UmVs-w65GW7dlsMCwQV3hS48oVYGnNWhx8tXJfdXonX8=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "5 jin", "rating": 3, "content": "케이크야 뭐 본사에서 공급받으니까 맛있는데\\n직원 불친절하고.. 그저그럼", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIlD4OlDpP2f4akYAq0QCLGBYR0IoZfgOi96_L15Fq82LDcYQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "나꼬", "rating": 4, "content": "분리된 공간이 다구 있고, 스터디를 하는 사람들과 미팅을 하는 사람들이 각자 나누어 일을 보기에 좋은 장소였습니다. 커피와 빵은... 체인이라.. 크게 이야기 할껀 없네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVaKTrYe9glGUUAzgRVM3gbwX9B52_7MWo2OSXGuZKmBKt_VNs=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Dudu Kim", "rating": 3, "content": "들어가는 입구에서 넘어질뻔했어요ㅠ 보니까 넘어짐주의 표시판이 밑에 조맣게 설치돼 있더라구요. 좀더 잘보이게 해놔야될것 같아요!! 손에 음료라도 들고있었으면 어쩔뻔했나요ㅡㅡ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ1fRIEFvQOz5LO9FWTad7CTqc6ZIjDxHD_T2aMzfvZ7kVzrQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJm0MWHmujfDURalu_Irx4Keo/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJm0MWHmujfDURalu_Irx4Keo/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJm0MWHmujfDURalu_Irx4Keo/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJm0MWHmujfDURalu_Irx4Keo/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJm0MWHmujfDURalu_Irx4Keo/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJm0MWHmujfDURalu_Irx4Keo/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E610000091F0BDBFC1C15F405F402FDCB9C04240
