3.9	37.522276399999996	126.92464179999999	2026-02-16 19:13:51.576224	2026-03-17 22:02:10.187364	019c65f1-3158-7830-9f5d-d35c465ae758	CAFE	ChIJeQH6nz2ffDUR9D-yaT4l0NA	1699590524	커피빈 여의도교보증권점	[{"author": "김응조", "rating": 4, "content": "여의도역 4번출구의 교보증권빌딩 1층에 있는 커피빈 체인점입니다.\\n\\n이곳은 특이하게 1층 실내보다 야외 테이블이 더 많고, 야외 테이블이 있는곳이 나무로 가려져있어 프라이빗하고, 바람길이라 더운여름에도 바람이 불어 사람들이 야외 테이블을 많이 찾는것 같습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWkkrab4TFxtRubhNWutSq2MBgHsMmHGetus55RmteAOO8QhEI=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "한국인", "rating": 3, "content": "여기갈바엔 2층 커피빈 감\\n같은 건물에 커피빈 2개나 잇음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXJee3-zebJOrV2L6lB1niy5gKpCbgaXcjzB_9DfbFX9LMgrkI=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "YECHAN JO", "rating": 5, "content": "사무실 점심 시간대와 겹친다면 복잡하고 시끄럽겠지만 그외 시간대는 자리도 넓고 꽤적해서 좋습니다.\\n커피도 좋습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLNgc6xADhbklcCH5cPMTEbIpI3f4j84-cjgylvRGhhN4keYOs2=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Jae-Hyung Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "위에 커피빈 여의도교보증권카페점이 있는데 거기가 더 아늑해서 증권점에서 주문하고 카페점으로 올라가서 먹어도 됨\\n단 트레이 리턴은 다시 증권점으로", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVcXwe7UPN_rm_oDqfAi86kOTEye67McZpbEVEVvYptj3xEiGrAAw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "나윤관", "rating": 5, "content": "역과 연결 되고 2층 공간도 넉넉함!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXO9F1fsu2YeCDFSmMAzyaJ7M3NXMo0x0IxfW6YQEOD23dYUzo=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Happy Smile", "rating": 4, "content": "내부는 자그마한데 비해 야외 테라스석이 넓어서 날씨도 좋고 덥지도 춥지도 않은날 브런치를 즐기기 좋습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIEasQSLBjL0rkhD_23y88EQ9N0AB30w6BTsD8xy7szcL9WyQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Tae kyun Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "야외 좌석도 있고 저녁시간에는 그리 붐비지 않는 커피빈.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ8ffxlKcb-4xcYpiYORbGoGLYyi9WHhlJsAgwK1ptpneqFHQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "park seonghwan", "rating": 5, "content": "커피빈 여의도교보증권카페점입니다. 커피와 차 푸드를 판매합니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIgjQzrGk8q8b4GOPGAxMRXRjrubVBkza6cRiNPvGuSj2eG2w=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJeQH6nz2ffDUR9D-yaT4l0NA/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJeQH6nz2ffDUR9D-yaT4l0NA/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJeQH6nz2ffDUR9D-yaT4l0NA/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJeQH6nz2ffDUR9D-yaT4l0NA/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJeQH6nz2ffDUR9D-yaT4l0NA/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJeQH6nz2ffDUR9D-yaT4l0NA/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [6, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [6, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [6, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [6, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [6, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000EEE0CC542DBB5F407EBCFCF3D9C24240
