4.8	37.4858659	126.81193499999999	2026-02-16 19:13:52.940079	2026-02-16 19:13:52.940079	019c65f1-36ac-7be0-8bc3-bb026c34de88	CAFE	ChIJQ0PwWnxjezURNO50fT7Y5Ww	1331529238	컴포즈커피 부천역곡점	[{"author": "TAMOOK 탐욱 (NA)", "rating": 5, "content": "친절하고 빨리 나와요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV1oDIhPB7GwrAUUnhE2SSAkQ3IVv3ZnS3bxUQXXBksoWVEAUiq=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "YONG CHUL JO", "rating": 4, "content": "친절하고  커피 맛도  좋음..부드러운 맛..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJnx6A2GTOQs_Y3vj4VKYdKKVh781DCjthM7wqJxinxTfLQTw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "김용진", "rating": 5, "content": "커피 맛있고 분위기 편했어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWtEjPoba3lDRM7FusJ0E7fHJKtKAqF_ZntOHKf0g-k5WM8vaeb=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "김동현", "rating": 5, "content": "The store was very clean and quiet, and it was good to spend a cozy time alone, and the coffee taste was great, so I felt very satisfied while I was in the store", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLx0NAgzwvq3ss-HgbMPanR2m6IIkyvWtXBTTohaGrGvH3C3A=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "김일호", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXFmV0reuNn-97oe33xlOCpYChFujqjU2ytTNIJ6uRxUszgq2fOrg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "권태진", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUExe6bqjYvuP1xJr9N9xLFSJhQEdtbQj2qOEE-bFLsgnTP2a-o=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "choi arah", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIhd2CnK