4.7	37.487797199999996	126.81489339999999	2026-02-16 19:13:52.940218	2026-03-17 22:10:16.644503	019c65f1-36ac-7be0-8bc4-b4c29496f571	CAFE	ChIJrTKqtpJjezURnEY-9j5KwUs	1147441206	모퉁이돌마을카페	[{"author": "yan", "rating": 5, "content": "주택을 개조한 카페로 색다른 분위기를 느낄 수 있어요.\\n2층에는 읽을 수 있는 책들이 있고 통창으로 보이는 풍경이 인상적이었습니다.\\n가까이 있다면 종종 방문하고 싶은 곳이에요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXt1CsQxo0yQh-gK1baMUUXB_U3jQDgBhlbt643oE8n8wknDEp-=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "STEVEN J", "rating": 4, "content": "커피맛이 3점 정도 입니다\\n분위기는 좋아요 가정집같은 알락하고 따뜻합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXrM6eEkwsxXMyxVBGbqWATsGftkcg00ni0pz4-9cS1cJvj12yZag=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "김선이", "rating": 4, "content": "동네 한가운데 있는 까페라서 아시는 분들만 오시는듯\\n그런데 마당에는 애견과 함께 갈수있어\\n넘 좋은듯 합니다\\n분위기도 야외와 실내가 함께이고\\n요즘같은 가을날씨는 더욱더 좋은듯....", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIplF61qcjsbsbv0i4XgnL1OmGctjYIhM8L4NZtugB7OsmxwA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "ARONG “비밀의 정원” CHOI", "rating": 5, "content": "차가 맛있어요.\\n공간이 넓어서 모임하기 좋습니다\\n종종 들르고 싶은 곳~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV3nBRfu8-dxAYp91UzPE825dXRHcKNbYU0p3Q1w8y07AEeY90G=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "박미래", "rating": 4, "content": "동네 편안한 카페 입니다. 주차공간이 없어서 아쉬웠으나 오며 가며 들릴수 있는 공간 입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK1_s5xJjZIQc1_mSTmXbgM3eYPK-BYO39iwrgCwIJ_POtfHg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "INAE LEE (LIA)", "rating": 5, "content": "Always the best place for gathering", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXWuK9NSJ2gUJmlaUBx0twK5lWqLywrY_aH40ysbEOO_w1EXUwt=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "Félix Mazeroski Matos Moreta", "rating": 5, "content": "Un lugar placentero, rico y delicioso...", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUVtOyUemvQE_1hqhjaJ419Cd5GzDbvt2ukQI6McPywEy06G-k=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "정원일", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVbmkLV8DceK1uo_5sNUEZreyHC0IYv3MCy2hc50rWuTGTtemw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJrTKqtpJjezURnEY-9j5KwUs/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJrTKqtpJjezURnEY-9j5KwUs/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJrTKqtpJjezURnEY-9j5KwUs/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E61000007AAEA53627B45F40498A7E2370BE4240
5	37.601013099999996	126.91518669999999	2026-02-16 19:13:54.48153	2026-03-17 22:11:30.315528	019c65f1-3cb1-7992-b737-af79b1f5ca99	CAFE	ChIJGwuIEJmZfDURJ8aAdM0PGLc	166576448	스위츠마인	[{"author": "임정숙", "rating": 5, "content": "당근케잌과 망고케잌의 달콤하고 부드러운 맛이 환상적이다. 그러나 자리가 좁은 것이 약간 아쉽지만 포장해 가는것도 나쁘지않다~~😊", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKCVEKE-nNIg_DrOn3wxAM3Jyjih6wVPhEbQwJ9Cf1EipIHjg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Mj S", "rating": 5, "content": "딸기생크림케이크, 레몬오렌지생크림케이크\\n\\n둘다 너무 촉촉하고 적당히 달고 맛있었다!\\n\\n근처를 지나간다면 꼭꼭 또 사 먹자! 미래의 나야!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJW48ujhVL8njspNd9YEXtrz8xdnxi-CO1KE-sNn0shdA47lg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Amy Do", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님 너무 친절하세요♡♡\\n가족 생일때마다 매번 홀케이크 주문하는데\\n먹을때마다 감동 줄줄 입니다ㅜㅜ\\n은평구 케이크 맛집 인정 👍", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWRwzKCDXFPfcxLGf1XZpEv9pRF57lD7RV23LtwauDXSTgwct9Y=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Catherine HWANG", "rating": 5, "content": "동네에서 보기드문 퀄리티의 케익전문점 이네요~^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr559mx5N0QtP6T6Y7OU50JW2Oi2FYSyLKZAYfbvKaDCG7FA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "lillililli", "rating": 5, "content": "케잌 재료 아끼지 않고 쓰시는 거 같은데 퀄 생각하면 가격이 꽤 괜찮다 싶은 편입니다. 음료 케잌 모두 훌륭한 편입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIYof7ayJAwtz4s7U8WlECVJaugcIknFUCUOPimwzOOzKNVDpo=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "yh Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "최고! 딸기생크림케이크에 바닐라빈이 아낌없이 들어가서 너무 맛있었어요 빵도 너무 부드럽고 폭신하구 맛있었어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWeIF8_GBZNhD7MLfHCZyVQZ4WtB0vLn0pQjOFci8ckn5wCjfvV=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "연두", "rating": 5, "content": "급하게 예약 했는데도 너무 잘 해주셔서 동생 생일 잘 보냈습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIkTF8GxEjFcbde1l4zxhTEtI_hgTQRn_6DqzyGFqi46Tz99g=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "민홍준", "rating": 4, "content": "사장님도 엄청 친절하시구 케이쿠맛이 일품입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXtik-exI4lbH7dMHF4-7KhOoORlpXtY8wB7cnqAUz9rIdmF1E=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJGwuIEJmZfDURJ8aAdM0PGLc/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJGwuIEJmZfDURJ8aAdM0PGLc/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJGwuIEJmZfDURJ8aAdM0PGLc/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJGwuIEJmZfDURJ8aAdM0PGLc/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJGwuIEJmZfDURJ8aAdM0PGLc/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [13, 0], "closeTime": [9, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [13, 0], "closeTime": [9, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [17, 0], "closeTime": [9, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [13, 0], "closeTime": [9, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [13, 0], "closeTime": [9, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000FC8E3C6B92BA5F40D97B4CFFEDCC4240
