4.1	37.1451822	127.0677812	2026-02-16 19:14:04.624149	2026-03-17 14:57:54.737176	019c65f1-6450-707d-a4ce-849989be5e95	CAFE	ChIJ6zxgpxBHezURsgARfZxxE2s	635985501	앤드커피	[{"author": "KWANG IL KIM", "rating": 4, "content": "오전 10시경 방문 혼자 앉아서 와이파이로 줌강의를 들을 수 있어서 좋았다. 라떼를 주문 컵을 데웠는지, 추운날씨에 따쁫하게 마심", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVezjLRlBLzabesHkjcIBMuLKxZKt5oDXyHphU90B5fJGOzj2p8NQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "윤영김", "rating": 3, "content": "음료를 파는 카페로는 2점이고 공부하기 좋은 카페로는 5점 역과 아주 가깝지만 사람들이 많이 오진 않아서 조용한 분위기에서 공부 가능 다만 음료는 가격대비 맛이 정말 별로다 수다떠는 곳과 공부하는 곳이 분리되어 더 좋다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX8vzVxa8ONWJ7C-apOf53OwndBBOjOU3i051SqyMgzgx2AC8hu=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "손수호", "rating": 5, "content": "친절해요. 고마워요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXtw2xkg5BQQXV9ERA77mczVjqgVcCzBKVGfl-dRy5LEJMxrlY=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "블루라이트", "rating": 4, "content": "무난하지만 친절함", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJLLcClkX4Y-4XwvILYOhn5KGlEZsTw8okPVxiGfS2CTlO7qQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "손수호", "rating": 5, "content": "좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKhogdZFjJfPNq640G7QROM9aLVqz7sB1jK7Xyua30JmbJLzQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Lucas", "rating": 4, "content": "The cafe was close to Osan station, and it was a quiet and cozy place. When I drink coffee here, they always give me a biscuit, which was not bad, but I don't eat them often. It was also convenient because the toilet was inside the cafe. Anyway, it was near the station, so it was the good place to drink a coffee and catch the train.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXNGB12Wx5AZaad82FY3JRZ9p2nfs1SDVnb9jloRcHP6qnrkLnL=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "평산", "rating": 3, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUHJOx3itu5pHDGYT9RwqxpbXKr4lIEf9kKl7tPTirn-efrQ80E=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "김진엽", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXVLBJic595t7cKCGJlrBz_fVpUrb-WBMh4NPi14QJFAaxYG1qkIA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[]	[]	0101000020E61000002752F58656C45F400D7B905495924240
