4	37.5176241	127.60120119999999	2026-02-16 19:14:15.862018	2026-03-17 22:20:31.310904	019c65f1-9036-79ed-953c-75b738877012	CAFE	ChIJk6L9-1Q_YzURufxNczNPTcw	2063068079	용문산 빵공장	[{"author": "남자스페셜한삶을", "rating": 2, "content": "빵은 맛이없네요\\n안에 크림이 텅 비었어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK3BG7ylALvk4Xvifgg2FzOrY8OEHB36HbkU6Ec0jH8idxVAg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "이경호", "rating": 4, "content": "커피와 빵이 맛있어요.\\n단 직원 서비스는 별로임", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKYdfULbkEpoCP7lb_nmGBm1UGRaaAT8hbTgn0KNZKg_fr9QQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "Lee sh", "rating": 4, "content": "빵은 먹기좋게 컷팅 되어서 나왔습니다.\\n요즘 빵은 상향평준화 되어서 어디서든 맛볼수 있는 빵 입니다.\\n평일이라서 별관은 조용했어요.\\n직원이 친절합니다.\\n루프탑은 좀 관리가 안되는거 같았습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI0w73NJxluuyEZkQ4JEd5jlR1wO1M1vrOOPOcde9sE4bB-bg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "ROSE JANG", "rating": 5, "content": "용문산 갈때마다 들르는 빵집\\n추천합니다. 일찍 가야  맛있는 빵 살 수 있어요\\n늦게 갔더니  빵이 다 팔려서  많이 못샀어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVLXHDpOTm7jJKG4by8PvvDPKooYzVeqk9NcjkEvmaE2Gz_ki4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "박종호", "rating": 4, "content": "양평에 올때 마다 시간을 가지고 늘 방문", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIN4bopsHGkpkCO2WCZY5716ClCn7C66GMmaTosFrjXX2rVtg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Seungsik Min", "rating": 4, "content": "빵, 커피가 맛있네요.\\n소금빵이 담백해서 내입에 맞는듯\\n마약빵등이 맛있는듯", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWo7dXe14T8uF_yfqHUnjXXhNMh78QGfsA-CPddt1CrHgUGjLbA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "언제나 졸리", "rating": 5, "content": "캠핑장 다녀오는길에 들린곳^^\\n첫눈까지 내려서 분위기 깡패^^\\n커피와 빵이 완전 맛있어서 좋아 좋아!!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU21waW2FAjk1z3-56BPZFfThzd1vb_uicjV5d-wdowvqW27pY=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "손원진", "rating": 5, "content": "빵들도 다양하고 커피도 맛나네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIzgfatDMcPzZJOLmo5hMTj8pK1P8ubkXi9FbTMC21RnrvwuQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJk6L9-1Q_YzURufxNczNPTcw/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJk6L9-1Q_YzURufxNczNPTcw/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJk6L9-1Q_YzURufxNczNPTcw/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJk6L9-1Q_YzURufxNczNPTcw/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJk6L9-1Q_YzURufxNczNPTcw/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJk6L9-1Q_YzURufxNczNPTcw/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000381499147AE65F408B8FAA8141C24240
