4.4	37.4936541	126.4908502	2026-02-16 19:14:17.21969	2026-03-17 22:13:14.669554	019c65f1-9583-7389-8b0e-b54297c43432	CAFE	ChIJ4apab76FezURSssvG9jxBys	1023118493	커피빈 영종도운서역점	[{"author": "Taco Kimchi", "rating": 4, "content": "커피는 그저 그랬고, 추억의 생크림케잌을 샀는데 며칠지난느낌을 잊을수 없었음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVTJ6be3C3p3VvgFr7kwvvn8XgBkgt9xWVZKxGENOntq_kCODPVQg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Totu Wai", "rating": 4, "content": "운서역 근처  1층 에서\\n편하게 시간보낼수 있는곳입니다.\\n와이파이 및 의자 테이블 많음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXtvJ-t1JABxMm25uWVD16WBQqrkhuu_jFp1UPOgOmjfEEpGdRbyQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Kyan Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "밤11시까지 운영해서 여행 전날 들린 호텔에서 나와 커피 마시러 들렸습니다. 간단한 케이크나 쿠키류와 음료 가능하고 디카페인 메뉴 있네요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU3uWrh_gEP-nnef9XJGKFCoenBMtgMO35eBGqn6VD7bkm5sgjmsA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "hj jun", "rating": 4, "content": "케이크가 특히 맛있었어요 !!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWpgeaeGWYRZoiqu0vYdNIzcTfOBACrncX5DEbwIBt0HOKvRbZHdw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "쪼쪼티비", "rating": 3, "content": "가격이 근처 카페보다 너무비쌈ㆍㆍ안갈듯 다시", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXRpprLf-S6rhWkSD6zrhvlkknUnw3VXWmDDn9Q8-fOEvyPor05-Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "sungweun shin", "rating": 5, "content": "봄 여릉은 굿. 겨울은 보통\\n\\n날 조은면 아이들 놀기 편함", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIS-W7k2PwQpyWizOELSUJYQdAIvrawAl862g4-lPS0qjwhuA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "양영재", "rating": 1, "content": "따뜻한커피를 주문했는데 컵의 절반까지만 들어있네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKTbANGpPYDcYJjfJdaqMjRoqjephMz0Yq5bin6MvyNO04FEQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "SM MOON", "rating": 4, "content": "직원들은 친절하나, 커피맛이 찐하거나 연하거나(재탕)느낌??", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVW0L6fd3c83il_WUE9OzipBC-Pt7cfX0LfBGP0PB20eDc_OIei=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ4apab76FezURSssvG9jxBys/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ4apab76FezURSssvG9jxBys/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ4apab76FezURSssvG9jxBys/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ4apab76FezURSssvG9jxBys/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ4apab76FezURSssvG9jxBys/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ4apab76FezURSssvG9jxBys/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E61000000B0FF5166A9F5F40A684BB0E30BF4240
