5	37.5664206	126.9839401	2026-02-16 19:14:37.098157	2026-03-17 22:15:07.671048	019c65f1-e32a-71f9-9232-8acc62ee2184	CAFE	ChIJxYNrDwCjfDURpKsqoosjJlE	2145995437	더오오	[{"author": "Julio J", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV2MAqEsLc30o-xa_YdFtd1a4wzo96M6TAW8KbFYB3gqIOBC5s=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJxYNrDwCjfDURpKsqoosjJlE/photos/0.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [16, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [16, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [16, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [16, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [16, 0]}]	0101000020E610000045AEE5DFF8BE5F40EE63607880C84240
4.6	37.5590426	126.94416229999999	2026-02-16 19:14:20.829748	2026-03-17 22:15:17.578941	019c65f1-a39d-7115-b8a2-efd5a95750d2	CAFE	ChIJVVVVVZqYfDUR5O10E3YXrVM	10371912	벨라프라하	[{"author": "영뽀이", "rating": 5, "content": "커피가 너무 맛있고 사장님이 친절합니다.\\n화장실이 매우 깨끗하게 관리됩니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLjrSUkqgJ9eLwqHlPkWXE21lF0kbBkTThCuYgvq0Qtxd7kHg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Mj S", "rating": 4, "content": "말렌카, 카페라떼\\n\\n코로나로 해외 여행을 못가는 시기에 체코 디저트가 먹고 싶어서 갔다.\\n\\n처음 먹어본 말렌카는 꿀로 푹 절여진 따뜻하고 굉장히 단 핫케이크였다. 말렌카를 먹는다면 꼭 안 단 음료를 같이 시키길 추천한다.\\n\\n신촌 기차역 앞 골목의 골목에 있고 올라가보진 않았지만 카페는 2층인 것 같다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJW48ujhVL8njspNd9YEXtrz8xdnxi-CO1KE-sNn0shdA47lg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Kyutae Jo", "rating": 4, "content": "이대 앞의 체코 디저트 카페... 달달한 체코 디저트도 맛있고 체코 풍으로 꾸민 분위기도 좋다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJprfisILNOPnsyACf7WA1SvXNybmAbtJW2CYNo3s-JJUOz=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "불꽃커트", "rating": 3, "content": "분위기 있는곳.데이트하기에 좋은 장소. 커피맛은 보오통!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWTS7UI0P4CiXuHiT8EcKQ6YyMhdh6sYtgrQ8vJeN9nE1ZwJxzJ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Mii Re", "rating": 4, "content": "분위기 좋고 맛있음!\\n음료는 4~5000원정도였고 신기하고 먹어보고 싶은 것들이 많았음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJyFUr-UEozlBtcLjEJzgtLSzjY9dWhWmtdQFVjj_Nm4hw1hQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Matthew Lee", "rating": 4, "content": "커피 맛에 좋아요~!\\n사장님도 친절하시고!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVq1xTyITaZb4w9MhWtObWLHp1QbYWsaUNWXk0qeIo2d92gEJ4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "곽국장", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님이 짱친절하세요^^ 이대 숨은 맛카페^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWvs7K8On0oDMnFed_ljMTni9v-ysFiGDRKfpuCizXtolc0KHCn=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Mj", "rating": 5, "content": "제대로 된 말렌카를 처음 먹어보는 거 같아요!\\n가격도 맛도 너무 좋았어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV3KEGDdAksTknXiom5rcwsYY-m4PLiZRd85_vd1HpsQeP4TbQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJVVVVVZqYfDUR5O10E3YXrVM/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJVVVVVZqYfDUR5O10E3YXrVM/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJVVVVVZqYfDUR5O10E3YXrVM/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJVVVVVZqYfDUR5O10E3YXrVM/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJVVVVVZqYfDUR5O10E3YXrVM/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJVVVVVZqYfDUR5O10E3YXrVM/photos/6.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJVVVVVZqYfDUR5O10E3YXrVM/photos/7.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000006E27B6276DBC5F4010093AB58EC74240
4.9	37.5575563	126.94596349999999	2026-02-16 19:14:20.830417	2026-03-17 22:16:59.071907	019c65f1-a39e-756d-a4c3-21dc7a53ca9d	CAFE	ChIJ_x_givaZfDURQkJ9shg-p-o	1712804513	카페드리옹 이대점	[{"author": "이쪽저쪽", "rating": 5, "content": "카공족들에게도 너무 좋을 듯 하고, 디저트류가 다양해서 차분한 분위기 즐기기 좋습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX76QLp0IE_M0ExUs63aVoxEmwEpBgBYjmI8eTEtZFiGGMAQa8=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "min Anna", "rating": 5, "content": "가게 위치가 특히 넓고 경치도 좋습니다. 치즈 케이크가 제일 좋아요, 오시면 드셔보세요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX1pQLnyHKClAhXDqJYuT0DcODj2E2YYCC1zruMRlzVuV-sjfU=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Bumsang Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "<카페드리옹>에서 차 한잔의 여유를... 메뉴와 가격은 사진 참조~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU0T3Dd0oozZU0VqTCxb3GIMN5w_a38cuVwOWoWAjM26eTIKZWA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "Seoul Promenade", "rating": 5, "content": "좌석이 많고 개방감 드는 공간. 창밖으로 나무가 많이 보이고 혼자 앉을 자리도 꽤 많아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW_7SeMrsr6RyMnj4MFye5kz-rcjQop-bO68kCFf9Jyh1JFF0k=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "iamblingbin", "rating": 5, "content": "밀푀유가 저엉말 맛잇고 레몬케익도 저엉말 맛있는 곳이에요. 이대상권에 생겨서 너무 감사한 디저트까페!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocISNYSea-YnK6bbfejAJkBtwnUYAWVZoWC6ORVDnVsfsE1B9w=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "_ Law", "rating": 5, "content": "매장이 넓고 깔끔해요. 맛있게 먹었어요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIYio_M0nW3swEW2k-m75oUpmcs67rVX3jmCq_lG6a83cZe5g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "엘프신창", "rating": 5, "content": "차분한 분위기에 깔끔한 음식 시간나면 오고 싶은곳", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW0LiNETz2_vKsLWQuzlttJOdToLSm6SWVSCH-xB2U7Gj4HtZQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "MISS JANUARY", "rating": 4, "content": "กาแฟ ชาเขียว ชา โกโก้ เค้ก อร่อยมากจริงๆ\\nบรรยากาศร้านดี wifi แรง .. เจอ พนง เกือบจะเหวี่ยงแต่เก็บสีหน้าทัน ฮาาา ถ้ามาแถวนี้รอบหน้า จะกลับมาอีกแน่นอน", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV2YoAhSn4FJ5YM16j_JdXsm2iG_TXRATYQZj-RpzhBqrwBnVwZ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ_x_givaZfDURQkJ9shg-p-o/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ_x_givaZfDURQkJ9shg-p-o/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ_x_givaZfDURQkJ9shg-p-o/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ_x_givaZfDURQkJ9shg-p-o/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ_x_givaZfDURQkJ9shg-p-o/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ_x_givaZfDURQkJ9shg-p-o/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000006BED7DAA8ABC5F40E2163D015EC74240
4.3	37.6493065	126.8767166	2026-02-16 19:14:22.87232	2026-03-17 22:17:16.734564	019c65f1-ab98-7e4b-86b1-139f7b289418	CAFE	ChIJc8kE-16XfDURk87ZdOAlxdg	11651393	스타벅스 원흥역점	[{"author": "traces of life", "rating": 4, "content": "#2024.9~저녁에는 스벅매장쪽이 너무 어두워서  영업 안하는것처럼 보여서 그부분이 아쉬워요\\n\\n1층구성~길게 넓은형식으로 되어 있어요\\n동선이 편해요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXXcAn3CgnJIGVh-ICz2Gsfa0krZMieAE7-CjbsUPrfcez4YYpuyw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "금강견강소복괴산불", "rating": 4, "content": "천장고가 높아서 인근 주민이나 근로자들 수다떨기 좋은 카페. 무난하네요. 경치가 좋진않으니 멀리서 찾을만한건 아닌것 같고", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVGi4ktdAh6NIVtQnHhPfAjaSPR2H0Q1rL-T_B5mKZo0NxyyyJ5Fw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "용호두웅", "rating": 4, "content": "위치좋고 메뉴도 좋네요\\n단 오더받는 직원들이 좀\\n부족합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI6qtTp2neeomE3u_FTSBvGcy6Yx_BSkw8pOAW--3bEDZgxeg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "eunju shin", "rating": 5, "content": "생각보다 다양한 텀블러가 준비되어 있네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLlNDloGHEYYS5Q7gu-qIqlkHwQ8WxNa1NZtF1Uu32S50KqpA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "HARRY PARK", "rating": 5, "content": "동료와 함께 따뜻한 아메리카노 마시고 갑니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVKp1lPSl3MvYhpygmZsYToIjym8bWA2ZEhOuoNsZQzZUr5VzM=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "woowi choi", "rating": 5, "content": "넓고 깨끗한 편입니다 화장실은 외부에 있지만 그래도 깔끔하게 관리돼요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV5tz9r6RQEx0HFmazw0NMrknTgBPskGM2SulhhxxmNiCjYwzjJ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "이민우", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기도 괜찮고 딱히 단점이 없네요!\\n좋아요 ㅎㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJhH2uX6Ts1Vvtos-RFM6Olvx6sh_EprMUnmAP6sa-l-QbYOQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "강나래", "rating": 5, "content": "주차하고 어디로 나가야 가까운지 몰라서 무작정 나갔더니 완전 반대편 방향으로 나가서 한참 찾았지만 장소는 약간 자그만 하지만 대략 조용한 분위기에 주변사람들 담소도 조곤조곤, 공부하시는 분도 많았어요. 화장실도 깨끗해서 조용히 공부하면서 커피마시기에 딱 좋아서 거리가 조금 있지만 종종 이용예정입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI1bhA5WwDGACnfhsglkvMrruua-IZo4L8OOAy_u2huy3k9mA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJc8kE-16XfDURk87ZdOAlxdg/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJc8kE-16XfDURk87ZdOAlxdg/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJc8kE-16XfDURk87ZdOAlxdg/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJc8kE-16XfDURk87ZdOAlxdg/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJc8kE-16XfDURk87ZdOAlxdg/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJc8kE-16XfDURk87ZdOAlxdg/photos/5.png"}]	[]	0101000020E61000000F37F11F1CB85F40454AB3791CD34240
