4.3	37.3915067	127.1254333	2026-02-16 19:14:24.193957	2026-03-17 22:20:33.807187	019c65f1-b0c1-72ba-befe-da5b532f906e	CAFE	ChIJS-6YGABYezURqtcfOxEsj1Q	24268061	커피에반하다 분당이매점	[{"author": "HEESU LIM", "rating": 5, "content": "처음 생겼을때 부터쭉 다니는데 맛있어요!\\n진흥상가 매장앞이라 가기도 편해요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWbIcleEMI2ljs_jj0DvnRsQDXu8bpfxUOU1wPJif4-R4RY8ec=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "정훈", "rating": 5, "content": "쿠팡이츠 기사입니다.\\n배달중 미끄러짐 사고로 총4개2만원상당의  제품을 폐기처분하고 새로 돈도 받지않고 제 몸을 걱정해주셔서 감동이었습니다.\\n\\n꼭 그 빚 같으러 가겠습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJbsgLL75sUJI3MwJHonMQv1tvrwUQ-mPe05E46wckC9ImdAg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "이채린", "rating": 5, "content": "친절한 사장님과 맛있는 음료들,쿠키까지 일석이조 입니다 완전 좋고 그냥 좋은 곳이랍니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLydDfOw2UN9HqBT-od4raetS2CsF660so9FNTB9jqZdlhQSQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Jeff Lim", "rating": 4, "content": "꿀팁 ; 카페라떼 는 기본 1.5샷인데 진하게 드실거면 '2샷' 달라고 하세요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXovPEWwPjHA-QkBEBhXrzob6nqbJlTY42kPtUTJuE3ogMsHww=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "이혜진", "rating": 5, "content": "아담하고   착한커피  맛에  퀄리티는   5천원  커피보다  맛있었요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUrSgF_Ub9Y_9pbdqXfLHDi41bJIM2iYZzeGQC-db0XKspFgmKbog=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "이현학 (비범한학이)", "rating": 5, "content": "근처 탄천으로 들고가서 음료를 먹으면 기분이 좋다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIek-97cwcXHbt6SiENdySOWhai3BH9TNXhQF1jJYl8zSIIUw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Miran Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "친절하고 좋아요..아이 하원 픽업할때 잘 가요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJIPvoPixBRRaqqFSawfgBb9dAELWFzmaL9NtPB0Bt3nsi1AA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "에어굿", "rating": 5, "content": "커피맛 좋고 친절하고 빠르네요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLYospOEL922teWEhNkKvXDnc_wyWFj1LNRXnk1bsgvKOyLtg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJS-6YGABYezURqtcfOxEsj1Q/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJS-6YGABYezURqtcfOxEsj1Q/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJS-6YGABYezURqtcfOxEsj1Q/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJS-6YGABYezURqtcfOxEsj1Q/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000001455641907C85F401B553CE41CB24240
