4.3	37.4036808	127.1266349	2026-02-16 19:14:25.289837	2026-03-17 14:57:54.737176	019c65f1-b509-7d1b-9257-29c3a677ac83	CAFE	ChIJDYtAzwmofDURfEI9sSAVFgY	22135105	트리아농	[{"author": "Kyung Kim", "rating": 3, "content": "피자와 떡볶이 퀘사디아 샌드위치 포장해왔는데 피자가 커팅이 안되어있네요. 좋게 보면 홈메이드요리 느낌인데 요리할 줄 아는 사람이 보면 내가 만든 게 나을수도 있다는 느낌이에요. 그래도 맛 괜찮은 편이었어요. 나쁘진 않은데 굳이 찾아가서 먹을 정도는 아닌 것 같음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVcqb7aH5Yu-A822tMgo14EkR1sxAHFFE7LHK9jAoOEvtf7UQWWqg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "EunJung Hoe", "rating": 5, "content": "이런 보석같은 카페가 아파트 상가에 숨어있어요. 샌드위치도 맛있구 케사디아도 맛있어요. 가격대비도 넘 훌륭.... 진저라떼, 단팥죽 맛있네요. 요 메뉴는 계절 상품인듯 해요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJGUgNwjFn_YTLW3p_ZRP8xsa7HinDmQFTyc-X02Wd8Dx_-Hw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "최영선", "rating": 5, "content": "아파트 단지내 가볍게 차한잔 할수있는 공간.\\n커피와 음료수,간단한 식사 대화를 할수있는 장소입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVOnuLIzicwGHXPKwFqioG6ectUJ0VfKMu2NJZSwmm6ThCNnk3W=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "하지혜", "rating": 5, "content": "집밥을 먹는 듯했어요 속도 편하고 분위기도 따뜻하고 좋았습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXi4JdGQ3yDz_871AszilbkHTjYVfx3LOAwBGzGzESUJbNvfvc=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "문현주", "rating": 4, "content": "오래전에 가봤는데  편안한 분위기 좋았어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVZudvuehwqcdxVoj3dP5aLILzDTWpzmE3LjxPXhrEMThz5AlnVzw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "김동원", "rating": 3, "content": "좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL1c_2NpcAJORUSOuymZ-cmr9bXK8IdlEJdbb3bh5LkPMR4LQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "JE B", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUFeEBpb6LQkzy6H80oaBQQ9mHmr1rhGLudP1FMUiGTphfShTyV=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "김영준", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUluDJ9nv5nStv9siWGZpb3wdhAcXBDGvHHh4DyTPpfKip3OQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}]	0101000020E6100000108244C91AC85F40F502FDCFABB34240
