4.7	37.5946942	126.9163554	2026-02-16 19:14:37.095783	2026-03-17 22:23:30.976614	019c65f1-e327-7604-be55-d97f6440ed22	CAFE	ChIJ2Yu330uYfDURSaginxwejxY	156500845	월하점	[{"author": "아기공룡둘째", "rating": 4, "content": "동네 새로 생긴 카페입니다. 근래 마셔 본 커피 중에 제일 맛있었습니다. 그리고 아직 홍보와 맛이 알려지지 않아 손님이 많지 않아 조용해서 너무 좋아요. 그리고 사장님도 친절하시고 간단한 빵과 쿠키도 있네요. 아직은 커피만 마셨지만 나중에 다른 메뉴도 먹어보고 싶네요.\\n커피는 정말 맛있어요. 다음에는 에스프레소로 마셔보고 싶네요.\\n아나 당분간은 자주 방문할 듯 합니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXzye_peBiGxuDxz93kRhCYRXhRIBL6f2_XhJ0NuUOLADf4QLa9Eg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "언제나맑음", "rating": 4, "content": "커피 맛있다.\\n가게 이름에 맞는 인테리어.\\n\\n입구 손잡이도 반달\\n내부 조명도 달이다.\\n\\n커피원두 선택 가능", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXFYPX2XMPGZJhyjCO63Ridso-idtulxn4oqq1FL3nTn-wCxR4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "소식", "rating": 5, "content": "디저트 상타치!\\n소금빵 한입 깨물면 버터궁물 흐름 주의!!\\n음료도 맛있어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUFThfgydBIwcxYunQIf4Nzc73IE5qE0y2aeg6p8R03iZhOhKs=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "이승률", "rating": 5, "content": "의자가 불편한 것만 단점이고\\n특별한 커피와 빵,그리고 느낌", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIOfdz5UwHaaAhaREKiNxeIY9oGC7s7Rymbb7Hx-9IsZciD5g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "Jung Sook Oh", "rating": 5, "content": "산미  깊은  에스프레소  굿!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXYuBEV27hZwgUG8ljIq3A01RJQObD1ARBTnjozKrBGfzH1EvrX8w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "lime light", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLpNbnVBYcHT3jV4ycLRTV-S5E4Au5C7MIS1j4cwLN_l9DZTak=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "이계영", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXcCWTV7h9eWfpSALOkcX0ysG4BEpCJf24UMVI2eMEBPouPKYIr=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "양순화", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJaZGEW14c9dafpfZ5RzJPbHdV7jx3XyKENxQ06MdfjfUJghA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ2Yu330uYfDURSaginxwejxY/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ2Yu330uYfDURSaginxwejxY/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ2Yu330uYfDURSaginxwejxY/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000D5A01E91A5BA5F40790F86F01ECC4240
