4.3	37.3967342	126.6376916	2026-02-16 19:14:31.866475	2026-03-17 22:24:06.283226	019c65f1-ceba-7296-b5b8-b99402c20525	CAFE	ChIJX5jqJQB3ezURhCCe3vicPxY	1227723274	라운지25	[{"author": "김효진", "rating": 5, "content": "넓고쾌적한공간입니다\\n24시간언제든지방문할수있어요\\n무인이아니라유인카페라더욱더안전하고\\n정겨운곳입니다.\\n\\n센트럴파크공원에 왔다가 산책길에잠시들르기좋은곳입니다.\\n\\n리뷰이벤트로미니버터쿠키를주시는데\\n제가진동벨을안가져와서\\n음식이나온줄도모르고자리에앉아있는데\\n친절하게도직접손수자리까지가져다주셔서\\n세심한배려에너무감동이었답니다^^♡\\n\\n아날로그를좋아하는저는 이런부분이너무따뜻하게느껴지거든요~~~\\n^^♡\\n어제새해대청소후어깨가너무아파서 쉬려고러 책한권들고나왔는데\\n너무추워서가려던곳대신이곳에오게되었는데\\n너무기분좋게티타임하고갑니다\\n\\n구글회원님들도\\n새해에는말처럼활기차고밝은기운듬뿍받아\\n가는한해되시기를바라면서 냅킨에인증샷남겨봅니다.\\n기념하기에 냅킨 이만한 좋은그리기\\n종이도 없는 듯 합니다.\\n\\n카페에서공부하거나 책보거나 단체로카페이용하고싶을때\\n넓고쾌적한라운지25추천해봅니다^^♡", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJVb7ICS5XOMqyCciIfQGbcvM0GlqvZ1dh3kOqierohfuNfEUW0=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "남극펭에빼어날수", "rating": 4, "content": "카페가 넓어서 쾌적함", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWh2RVdor7l2CleiFqGOvTHWfn0keuJ6nkYtIMcGtCDlp_ktJqY=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Yoonseung Choi", "rating": 4, "content": "The place looked the same as advertised - hip and chic. But everything else was sort of unchic unfortunately. The drinks are overpriced.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV9RUjMb_PFrkf4zzKxq_v7prSdNAw8EaZUYhvFVgtBJGIONBLr=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX5jqJQB3ezURhCCe3vicPxY/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX5jqJQB3ezURhCCe3vicPxY/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX5jqJQB3ezURhCCe3vicPxY/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX5jqJQB3ezURhCCe3vicPxY/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri":