4.3	37.454880599999996	126.7020228	2026-02-16 19:14:33.840463	2026-03-17 22:24:43.610205	019c65f1-d670-7328-aa0c-84ae01be824b	CAFE	ChIJ3fWJnGN7ezURACKxTyfhaa4	583751693	폴바셋 연세와병원점	[{"author": "Anderson PARK", "rating": 4, "content": "기본이상을  하는 커피\\n심하게  달지안은 케익과 제과류\\n깔끔한 매장과  분위기\\n주차는 애매\\n인천  시청주변  커피숍", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWvz-RUY0J6ysfICIi4mP0LS_qADdT3hdJoh_cKCr1RjcN2f2h41Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "스티브라이프_Steve's Life", "rating": 2, "content": "선거일. 덥다. 통창으로 열기가 그득한데 냉방을 하지 않는다. 옆자리 손님들도 덥다고 인상쓴다. 더운거다. 끈적 거린다. 이정현 팬이다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXnrKwF3F4m9ss_NFYqKkn-mGAttXsTNJfMUPn9NLvf3JA37OQi=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "heungsik park", "rating": 5, "content": "커피도 좋지만 특히 아이스크림이 맛있는 집 ^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLTlzSt8ex_Fo4-28MgqpRbHMpu0Cn-RT2-rizZzkbbDBsrn_QD=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "u s", "rating": 5, "content": "사람이 많지 않고 여유로워서 좋았음\\n시그니처인 아이스크림라떼도 맛있었음\\n인테리어도 고급져서 좋음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ9qYmL-LOvmq6jKNuNzHe7KYd_sypCFdmK13Ysl0FhtNwXpYBn=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "뜨락", "rating": 5, "content": "점심때 사람이 넘 많아요^^\\n커피가 맛있어요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIgmuWWVMT6bTqqBVW02wL1xI_59H3sUBcNjj4Z0CbBv5GjTA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Pro Hong", "rating": 3, "content": "커피 맛을 몰라서 개인적으로 맛이 있는지는 몰겠음. 분위기는 좋은 편이나 가성비는 떨어짐", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXmXeTjUL32uhvft8oiQWpMU8DCIEm8R9DyDWMvrsJfpSPvCbW3pQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Jooyoung Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "폴바셋 커피 맛있어요.\\n여기가 아쉬운건 주차를 스스로 해결해야하는거죠.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUrU0Hx6FBUz7xGtmcRc650MDkVFBr7TGYa8gQwMfwsVMld372r0w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "김써니", "rating": 3, "content": "음료에 비해 비싸단느낌...", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWNRXppjHUD7kSrhsxtNn0JZEz8CFMHlS-tfZHvsvxceYZyP_FA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ3fWJnGN7ezURACKxTyfhaa4/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ3fWJnGN7ezURACKxTyfhaa4/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ3fWJnGN7ezURACKxTyfhaa4/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ3fWJnGN7ezURACKxTyfhaa4/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ3fWJnGN7ezURACKxTyfhaa4/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000F7C209F1EDAC5F40DC4A0A8739BA4240
