4.2	37.4935046	127.0292214	2026-02-16 19:14:42.187146	2026-03-17 22:27:41.871506	019c65f1-f70b-7eb9-86de-b2a4444ac982	CAFE	ChIJmY7ln1qhfDURIkjZHz0HC7Q	1662040802	스타벅스 서초우성사거리점	[{"author": "Minjae Huh", "rating": 5, "content": "사람많은곳에서 좀 떨어져서 조금은 조용하고 친절하심", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKSHCM43GCWanuoLD9frCtwG8TiYKzn2bnGx5PB0tnJqWyezA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Y Sangho", "rating": 4, "content": "예전 외환은행자리에 새로문을연 스타벅스 서초우성사거리점이에요. 1층에 넓게 자리잡고있어서 들리기 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVnsFSAqNoS6uyymlXoUAj9eYwOzCt0KGFugJNsltJ2EI9raB4I=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Kidult DaN키덜트 댄", "rating": 4, "content": "강남역 주변 스타벅스중에 조용한편. 1층짜리 지점이지만 안쪽으로 넓음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV4Fr3FyWb7rZa0DvTaA99G_CFJrfslKFtx5ayIR3Z_ks1djKG-=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Henry Good", "rating": 4, "content": "스타벅스 커피점이에요.\\n코로나 바이러스로 인해 매장내 좌석을 줄여놓았어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWgu13V8jMa0o5_M82GtQEMRLj9FcUwsPshzbRW_KELbeVIF8lr=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "함소영", "rating": 5, "content": "강남역이라 위치가 좋아요! 내부에 소파좌석이 많구요. 교보타워쪽보다는 연령대가 높네요. 그만큼 다른 지점보다 조용한 듯 해요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWTos-NIGpskWK0Oxb2MwtePxRTgYQV3Df0eUXSS0rlTGU_MPegRQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Kyobin Koo", "rating": 5, "content": "강남역 주변 스타벅스 중 가장 최근에 만들어진 곳.\\n깔끔한 레이아웃과 비교적 덜 붐비는 위치.\\n(구. 외환은행  강남중앙지점)\\n다만 콘센트가 부족해서 노트북이용자들에게는 다소 불편.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXccKfM9Bcada9ApUwTO-vZO15I2qbQGoB3xKpC8-URL_IhaQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Jianna Park", "rating": 5, "content": "점심시간에는 항상 앉을 자리가 없다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ5ywYV_XMYE6CIv4qPuf6R7T_TOovwyBsFDPNUEm4CaIcA7w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Seunghoon Lee", "rating": 3, "content": "적당히 넓은 스타벅스. 다만 화장실은 외부에 있음.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLjz-1ae38gkjRJ7Hfee119-WRn4DiOZ_-awDHPLfQANbPLOA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJmY7ln1qhfDURIkjZHz0HC7Q/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJmY7ln1qhfDURIkjZHz0HC7Q/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJmY7ln1qhfDURIkjZHz0HC7Q/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJmY7ln1qhfDURIkjZHz0HC7Q/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJmY7ln1qhfDURIkjZHz0HC7Q/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJmY7ln1qhfDURIkjZHz0HC7Q/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJmY7ln1qhfDURIkjZHz0HC7Q/photos/6.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000F9556FC3DEC15F4079B6A2282BBF4240
4.7	37.514407	127.1023208	2026-02-16 19:14:42.188257	2026-03-17 21:52:34.422264	019c65f1-f70c-70af-ad50-81a1da585b3b	CAFE	ChIJWTx8IIKlfDURHvRPFQ8unn0	563684118	커피볶는아침	[{"author": "BS Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "잠실지역 몇 안되는 자체 로스팅 핸드드립 카페입니다. 원두 종류가 다양하고 분위기 힙해요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUSnnYmZ_xqk4KoQF8xEkLqrnG17jl93YZ0lzPLzqjP54dNh7tx=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Y.-C. Jhi", "rating": 4, "content": "수십종의 다양한 원두를 선택할 수 있습니다. 원두 별로 배전도나 분쇄도, 드립시간 등을 맞추기 어려울텐데 하는 걱정이 들 정도로 원두 종류가 많습니다. 맛은 썩 나쁘지는 않지만 최상급은 아닙니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXJHsF8SF6Y7KAIzsVwBGEl-X_NcwrUaeYL_sO8tGm-TQzGeZJn1w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "킹나비", "rating": 3, "content": "네이버 평점이 좋아서 방문했으나.. 예상보다 커피맛이 별루였어요.. 매장내에서 마시는대도 커피를 머그잔이 아닌 일회용잔에 주는건 좀 안닌듯해요..  다소 시끄러워요..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJVxvBfpoXb688Y_UR3MtHneV4yu2hfeeZxgUPJWAn5CdLgYA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "이주영", "rating": 5, "content": "너무 좋아용 일단 커피가 너무 맛있어용 진짜 최고\\n커피 좋아하시는 분들은 정말 핫 하실꺼에요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJEPuqWerFqmq_RcWDx9cNmeoHYtEQx5D-_I0GGXtFsTBOxEg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Kim Soyoung", "rating": 5, "content": "신선한 원두, 다양한 종류의 원두를 골라서  커피음료 주문할수 있어서 좋아요.\\n예를 들면, \\"하나는 과테말라 안티구아로 라떼주시고, 다른 하나는 예가체프 모모라로 카푸치노해주세요\\"이런 식으로 주문이 가능해요. 원두 종류가 보통 50 여가지가 있습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKxmquHrsdDyf5GzSPzBNz_jNYNnWi7iNfdUAAjzX41yGZB1A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "연기상", "rating": 5, "content": "커피맛나요\\n여러종류의 커피를 맛볼수 있어서 좋아요\\n직원분도 친절하십니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU2SkjTx9DzBumb1uWdMJxcXMuAsgcgBXg34OgAn-_gY4Hva3JAFA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "박재한", "rating": 5, "content": "직접 원드를 로스팅하는 곳\\n원두 종류도 많았으며 자체 브랜딩한 제품도 있음\\n신선하고 향도 좋았어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJsH0W4I1_YBbPbYTLhB_UlD-LJ_I42OOkoN1dYLeR9JIT53g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "JH H", "rating": 5, "content": "커피의 근본.. 원두 추천이 매우 탁월하고 직원분들이 친절하심", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLwu690RE3UefGeD-SqYLEVUBHWu34eGs8aSXsyB0Tg7sS_bg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWTx8IIKlfDURHvRPFQ8unn0/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWTx8IIKlfDURHvRPFQ8unn0/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWTx8IIKlfDURHvRPFQ8unn0/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWTx8IIKlfDURHvRPFQ8unn0/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWTx8IIKlfDURHvRPFQ8unn0/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000D66C8A6C8CC65F40AFEAAC16D8C14240
