5	37.5324793	126.72353079999999	2026-02-16 19:14:43.761279	2026-03-17 22:28:02.092353	019c65f1-fd31-7baf-a3c4-e35a2e940b57	CAFE	ChIJESY0kY59ezURn4G24mxnFvc	135006261	리필앤빈 작전동점	[{"author": "chris", "rating": 5, "content": "If you ever find yourself near Jakjeon Market in Incheon and just desperately need an hour or two of peace, you have to try Refill & Bean.\\nI actually stumbled upon this place almost by accident, and I've already been back twice. What makes it so special isn't a trendy atmosphere or a huge crowd—in fact, it's the exact opposite. Every time I've visited, the cafe has been wonderfully, blessedly quiet. It's the perfect escape from the usual buzz and noise you find around a traditional market.\\nFor anyone who needs a proper workspace outside the house, this spot is a genuine lifesaver. The Wi-Fi is strong and dependable—no frustrating dropouts while you're trying to focus. And critically, the coffee is good. It's smooth, well-made, and hits the spot, whether you need a quick shot of espresso or a relaxing Americano. They don't compromise on quality, even if they aren't busy.\\nI almost feel guilty sharing this gem because the lack of customers is precisely what creates the relaxing atmosphere. But if you value good coffee, a comfortable chair, and silence while you work or read, please stop by. You'll be supporting a great local business, and you'll instantly understand why it's become my personal favorite spot for a few hours of focused work.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL2LXqGGyHdDYl-L7hQyx-clBeigLfPs9n2KrBY2yEDhQTYaRI=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJESY0kY59ezURn4G24mxnFvc/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJESY0kY59ezURn4G24mxnFvc/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJESY0kY59ezURn4G24mxnFvc/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 10]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 10]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 10]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 10]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [23, 10]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [23, 10]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 10]}]	0101000020E610000084E920544EAE5F4003A61D4828C44240
4.8	37.5343437	127.0669987	2026-02-16 19:14:43.761522	2026-03-17 22:28:35.799523	019c65f1-fd31-7baf-a3c5-83a4375379d9	CAFE	ChIJA-uxEgClfDURTn3HbjaY6ns	1539283965	블랙스미스	[{"author": "크앙크앙", "rating": 5, "content": "대부분이 맛있습니다!! 동네 작은 카페입니다. 한강공원이 가까워 주말에는 웨이팅이 종종 발생합니다. 주차할 곳은 없습니다. 매장내에 테이블이 매우 작습니다. 동네주민인데 여기 주인아조씨가 빨리 돈 많이 버셔서 옆이 가게까지 넓히셨으면 좋겠습니다.\\n테이크아웃이나 가게 앞 캠핑의자 이용을 추천합니다. 밤에는 캠핑의자 옆에 불도 켜주심미다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW2EfuEe95bNXLZRwWpYbdJeMZGzwzRW9vRVL-Yo5dDvDeE9rqkHQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "­박영선 | 자연과학대학 수학과 | 부교수 | 한양대(서울)", "rating": 5, "content": "커피 맛집~ 사장님 썹스 맛집~♡", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVtWN7dtH4c3XaGVjuH4Sk3-hWs_VMwINx6Z-yiLysQXgEP0PI=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "U jung", "rating": 5, "content": "에너지 넘치는 사장님이 만든 맛있는 커피를 마실 수 있는곳", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVwU6htRZurOoRUY0P5xm4gZAuH81grXsfGeqcNfmFAEInIVjvJ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "최sj", "rating": 5, "content": "여기는 진짜 커피가 완벽합니다..  누가와서 먹어도 취향과 입맛 사장님이 다 맞춰서 만들어주시기까지해요\\n이 가격이 맞나싶어요\\n사장님..  가격 올리셔두돼요!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocILhkdSrjGXDr0IpRL7rQEGFjZh81mOAAD3JE1Y-XYfcBTh3g=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Cohle Rustin", "rating": 5, "content": "성수동 수많은 커피집보다 이 집 커피가 훨씬 잘합니다. 투자자분들이 이런 분 언넝 발견해서 성수동에 분점을 내야해요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUqEcj0mpC2am97QRljY5_-OEDds22GupsfT97nOpQ4-tD2pgHc=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "단팥빵(JasBo fun life)", "rating": 4, "content": "이 가게 시스니쳐인 블랙스미스 드셔보시길 강추합니다 ! 한 잔의 에스프레소로 두 가지 맛을 느끼면서", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXI7QllX_9R86NW-V7DKiBWlueuPmlRI-bEVHfpnwNjvUo7S_oT=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Jungmin Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "여기꺼 한번마시면 다른데꺼 못마심..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIJ-RYnmdbC9B9NEcK95yT0PrtoN1JngNK-IJb3wWkASNoC0g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "미련곰", "rating": 5, "content": "처음먹어보는 맛있는 라떼", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIfJG5tMNDK1IjEc0uji7xd4tNzPU94UKZ7les481Na9Xs6Og=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJA-uxEgClfDURTn3HbjaY6ns/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJA-uxEgClfDURTn3HbjaY6ns/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJA-uxEgClfDURTn3HbjaY6ns/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJA-uxEgClfDURTn3HbjaY6ns/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000F857EAB449C45F406D29D65F65C44240
