ublishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLGBQBEyqV4morf44B7qACGkgZZ65GNK-TzGdtrWztjPgOrcw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "Nex M", "rating": 4, "content": "분위기 조용하고 요즘처럼 더운날씨에 시원해서 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWnr7MHXeFroQQ2ShBnBCWH_DGYLsMRM30AzvAWleNQUUlymHwA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJj54C8aV9ezUReA-ibBZbSAI/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJj54C8aV9ezUReA-ibBZbSAI/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJj54C8aV9ezUReA-ibBZbSAI/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJj54C8aV9ezUReA-ibBZbSAI/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJj54C8aV9ezUReA-ibBZbSAI/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [11, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E610000061F8889892AE5F40A50AEB6B02C44240
4.7	37.5288316	126.7243649	2026-02-16 19:14:43.763862	2026-03-17 23:56:11.534914	019c65f1-fd33-7307-a363-245e8076e3f7	CAFE	ChIJWZaL-K19ezURunXsM4OHbps	2124783000	후루	[{"author": "외국인", "rating": 5, "content": "원두알못인데 질문하면 친절히 설명과 추천해주십니다. 간 원두 내를 맡게 해주시는데 그 향을 즐기다보면 마음이 편안해짐.\\n\\n푸딩 개 맛있습니다.\\n\\n커스타드 푸딩 시럽 쌉쌀해서 달달한 푸딩을 덜 물리게 해주고, 말차 푸딩도 말차의 쌉싸름한 좋은 맛이 잘 느껴졌습니다.\\n\\n가게에서 수다떨다 시간이 되어 밖으로 나오면 현실로 돌아온듯한 느낌이 듬. 약간 마법같은 곳이라 생각 됩니다. 다음에 또 오고싶은 곳!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVz1VtlYEZq3dHO6hRykyZwsxPnHJTuJHe0Bdqo_1tfiuzMja6t=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Hangkook Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "오랜만에 갔더니 메뉴가 몇개 늘었네요 집사람과 딸이 이곳 커피를 좋아해서 가끔 포장해갑니다 매장이 작지만 무언가 특별한 맛의 노하우가 있다고합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJyapZ3MtQZQnCAN1DjX-CeFnuZyL3HYbkEFSGmk5COX_WW=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "hyeonsun hwang", "rating": 5, "content": "작전동 커피 1티어 입니다! 오랜만에 왔는데 첫 오픈 그 즈음 보다 맛이 더 깊어지고 자리를 잡으신 것 같아 너무 좋습니다! 40분 걸어와서 먹어도 아깝지 않은 맛이에욥!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL3bCdqDsodRwHekT0mRJR0P_IIJTF-IW17As2zZYFFs1HZxg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "지해인", "rating": 5, "content": "커피가 정말 맛있고 사장님도 친절하셔요\\n전 필터커피 이런 거 잘 모르는데 설명도 친절하게 해주세요!!\\n디저트도 맛남", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUwDgtSTpTYn8YC6SDXSVHyW_tbffgWtRUkhaVx3GNPFcQhzER9=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "쟈우니", "rating": 3, "content": "스페셜티 커피 드립으로 즐기기 좋음 다만 브루잉 가격이 비싼감은 있음 아메리카노는 산미 있는 원두로 한가지 인듯함 자리가 협소하여 못 앉을수 있음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUdr8k-IsoZIyQlt1pHlaL1VoCTnNdvffQ2L8vqACt-7Kpwvivw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "hyunju lee", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWFWNpDYK-LWQUwSjEsYJW594HX5VVtySaG4HJtWXS2wHYliyS5=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWZaL-K19ezURunXsM4OHbps/photos/1.png"}]	[]	0101000020E6100000B3F798FE5BAE5F40B18BFDC0B0C34240
3.8	37.5367094	127.20950409999999	2026-02-16 19:15:20.233303	2026-02-16 19:15:20.233303	019c65f2-8ba9-7693-86c2-390b5d0d09f7	CAFE	ChIJUQ24bOKxfDUR9wFA10fpQ2Y	914575131	시오스 카페	[]	[]	[{"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E61000002F78E28368CD5F40573AC4E4B2C44240
4.2	37.5282954	127.06779909999999	2026-02-16 19:14:43.763692	2026-03-17 22:31:38.745444	019c65f1-fd33-7307-a362-76b60759f463	CAFE	ChIJX7vqu4WlfDURq0XbPYkGcPQ	644560377	스타벅스 뚝섬한강공원점	[{"author": "김경실", "rating": 4, "content": "분위기 전망 좋고 깔끔하며 직원분들 친절하시구요 커피 케이크 맛있어요 커피와 디저트 먹으며 탁트인 한강 뷰 지는 노을에 윤슬이 찰랑이고 멋지고 예뻐요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWYNXetD_KV_E3EzyiG8Tw-iheICvFbkK1Ob696kkKpm_q3LLLVDA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "노기태 (Kitae Noh)", "rating": 4, "content": "주말에는 사람이 많아 자리를 먼저 잡고 주문을 해야함.\\n테이크 아웃 주문은 빠르게 처리됨.\\n기프티콘 사용 가능", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVyc_WJuSsMmfU_79vHRPOE7aT3JCZlXuonl4aZbqK_sk4JuXci4A=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Simon Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "한강뷰가 좋았지만 사람들이 많아요.\\n어느정도 감안하고 가세요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX5v9yQYisoKeCBIyjpukyBiU_m7dZvWodncXfdUtQgR91awxM=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "튜텩 튜브", "rating": 5, "content": "오전에 떠오르는 해를 보며 커피마시기 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUQ3JYazF8T1EmZcQW3O5_wvq8OcxDDbKcDEkYjtQ3_IwGy1zwr=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "Richard A Francisco", "rating": 5, "content": "I've been to many Starbucks branches in Seoul but this is hands down my favourite. Having a cup of delicious coffee while sitting in front of the water is just very relaxing. This branch has many seats facing the water and it also has a section inside that's a little bit more private if you need that.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVKB3RUhFLtt7ImosmwoSu6nunMGPyPyAxwHXozmwk8SfivDzjhcQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "スタバカ（SUTABAKA）", "rating": 5, "content": "トゥクソム漢江公園にある水上のスターバックス。\\nそのロケーションは最高です。\\n地下鉄7号線も運行している清潭大橋や対岸には蚕室のスタジアムやロッテワールドタワーも見えます。清潭大橋は夜になるとライトアップもされるため、明るい時間と暗い時間で大きく雰囲気が異なりますが、どちらも素敵な雰囲気を楽しめるスターバックスです。特にカップルにおすすめです。\\n公園には細長い円筒型の複合展望コンプレックスがあったり、音楽噴水や水辺広場、バラ庭園、自然学習場などがあり、老若男女どなたでも楽しめる公園となっています。朝はウォーキングやランニングをしている市民の方が多いです。\\n駅からも近く、観光客にも是非訪れてほしいスターバックスです。聖水エリアを訪れた際には素敵な夜景と共にスターバックスのドリンクで素敵なひと時をお過ごしください。", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXTLxe8-oIJCozHCmO296_ESRZAnIpw8r8e3-GbE92pYKYMTFRQBQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "美鈴Misuzu", "rating": 5, "content": "席はゆったり配置されていて４〜５人でも座れるボックス席も多数有る。\\n漢江側の席は二人席が窓際には多い。\\nトイレは店内には無くて、水上施設共同のトイレ（秘密番号無しトイレットペーパー有り）\\nセブンイレブンとチキン屋が有る。\\nこの店舗には酒も購入できるので夜は漢江越しに夜景を観ながらお酒を飲む事も可能。\\n赤ちゃん用の椅子も二つ有ったので子ども連れの家族も利用出来る。車椅子でもこのスタバなら利用可能だと思う（漢江に掛かる橋は傾斜が有るので介助は必要）\\n朝、昼、夕方、夜と時間帯で異なる表情を楽しめると思う。\\n駅から５分くらいの位置なので利用し易い", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU4G6pXqSRGwMveIcPVFVwk3d8TbFaTrpMf1KXx2z3HmpS7Xbto=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "J Park", "rating": 3, "content": "I stopped by the newly opened Starbucks floating on the Han River at 뚝섬공원, and it turned out to be unlike any other Starbucks I’ve visited. With its wide windows overlooking the water and framing a stunning view of Gangnam, the space feels more like a library café than a coffee shop. The drinks and food are the same as anywhere else, but the atmosphere is on a completely different level. Sitting there with a cup of coffee or tea while the river breeze drifts in makes you want to linger far longer than planned. If you’re looking for the familiar comfort of Starbucks in a refreshingly unique setting, this place is worth the stop.\\n\\nOf course, the same old downside remains—I wish Starbucks would invest more in the fundamentals: better coffee and better food. I stopped drinking their coffee a long time ago, and I still can’t bring myself to eat their sandwiches, hot or cold. So why do I go? For me, it’s all about the atmosphere and the freedom to stay as long as I want without feeling pressured to leave. While Starbucks recently introduced a policy discouraging people from treating the café as a private office (and I’m definitely not one of those), I still appreciate that they don’t overwhelm customers with too many restrictions.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK80-TKU9WI9lX5IolhZhhklx30RPLGu6bednHi9liF2DStaXQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX7vqu4WlfDURq0XbPYkGcPQ/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX7vqu4WlfDURq0XbPYkGcPQ/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX7vqu4WlfDURq0XbPYkGcPQ/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX7vqu4WlfDURq0XbPYkGcPQ/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX7vqu4WlfDURq0XbPYkGcPQ/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX7vqu4WlfDURq0XbPYkGcPQ/photos/5.png"}]	[]	0101000020E6100000AF4C09D256C45F4049D0042F9FC34240
