4.2	37.530831899999995	126.723681	2026-02-16 19:14:45.180183	2026-03-17 22:33:39.12162	019c65f2-02bc-71f8-b0c5-70de6b615057	CAFE	ChIJ85H3Y459ezURaFItrY6pg3A	670891326	이디야 인천작전역점	[{"author": "shin seung seob", "rating": 5, "content": "지인만남의 장소로 2층 너무좋아\\n적극적으로 추천합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJoGqXCpP3oN0bAWNj0KDRcefLkIymgMNOZ2JVldYT4HiLOo-TH=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Sophia Yoon", "rating": 5, "content": "평일 오전타임 여자알바생님 짱 친절하세요, 그분때문에 더 자주갑니당", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLWYnJQldcVvNgytx3XjLUf_O_ss48uZYFs18dPyhq6IG_xpg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "제법멋진남자", "rating": 4, "content": "화장실 하난 깨끗\\n다른건 뭐 그냥 어디서든 볼수있는 커피숍.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWLLjAaJopl7F1FCVZETjNCAPkc5AJXcAfAn48xwJ9gvt5lTXDC=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "하나의한국 (하나의한국)", "rating": 3, "content": "매장이 다른곳에 비해 상대적으로 작고 입구가 좁아 선뜻 들어가기가 쉽지 않았다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUDskWvpoek3_VvPLhGceu40Id-jOI9SNOrRFnh4S8T3QNsmI988g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "미니백 (미니백)", "rating": 5, "content": "커피 마시러 감\\n주차는 바로 앞 공영 주차장에요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUfVvwM8icEyNMvycjfhvlljefF59Q4EE1tnzjM7jcwFZI7xnSO=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "이동규", "rating": 5, "content": "사람도 잘 없고, 2층이 넓어서 공부하러 가기에 좋은 곳!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW7iV-9JuXGcVjTuyHS711d4NfYNHNSWSmYlwHNmQUpEDO0kVy0=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Silver Boy Woong Ah", "rating": 4, "content": "주차장..     공영주차장...     가깝고  ...\\n주변에  웬만한    코피숍  없다 ...", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUzKwhaLsko6TwrWkpC1OOG2RyO7ovxCa3c-xnfAK2YL7HJeV4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "김진철", "rating": 5, "content": "2층은 넓고, 커피 한 잔 하면서 독서하기 좋았음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLn18dopXn9Dpw5KDxjK9nFSktZ9pf3K3I_iX6XWlTD13fExw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ85H3Y459ezURaFItrY6pg3A/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ85H3Y459ezURaFItrY6pg3A/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ85H3Y459ezURaFItrY6pg3A/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ85H3Y459ezURaFItrY6pg3A/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [0, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [0, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E610000024EF1CCA50AE5F403616B94CF2C34240
