3.7	37.571080599999995	127.0001466	2026-02-16 19:14:49.045161	2026-03-17 22:30:05.308798	019c65f2-11d5-7629-9faa-ee0748916437	CAFE	ChIJ69UAIiGjfDURNKRCrodnnro	19615597	투썸플레이스 종로5가역점	[{"author": "노시경 TRAVEL", "rating": 3, "content": "종로5가에 위치한 카페로 조용히 쉬어가거나 대화 나누기에 좋습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUvrrUBRwLhQz_MDE3jLFDFuBVVszXQHzsdUgKYOfP1TBe4URsrSA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Ptricia", "rating": 3, "content": "냄새가 좀 나요(1층에서 2층 올라가는 쪽)\\n입구쪽은 냄새가 안나는데 안쪽은 화장실 냄새 비슷한 냄새가 나서 ㅜㅜ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJwigu-ceE3a5948flphLHgk0kTLo94JP9K1drQ7jKOE1AOCw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Jihun Park", "rating": 5, "content": "종로5가 보령약국에 볼일이 있어 왔다가 들렸어요. 뱅쇼를 먹어봤는데 괜찮더라구요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWxAC2Hg3oQ1HafOaP4axuhxyOsTIvzNJBV2rksUTvd8CHZ1Jy18g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Yong-Cheol Yi", "rating": 2, "content": "아주 오랜전에 왔던 곳. 빽빽한 자리, 세련되지 않은 공간, 불편하고 작은 2층 화장실... 역시 투썸도 종5가에 위치하면 어쩔 수 없는 건가.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXEej20jMaEVzqUr-b-LNlEoSbR7-b87Z9YZycw6vY3fenf4YA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "죠블랙", "rating": 5, "content": "오후8시  만석입니다 달달한거먹고 싶어서 스트로베리초코릿ㆍ뉴욕치즈ㆍ트리플초코릿무스 ㆍ ㆍㆍ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRBee8zq2wT2Ye2AZawjrU4TitoAIC4PQyKkEms6681ahnrQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "육아조무사TV", "rating": 5, "content": "키오스크로 주문합니다. 화장실은 2층에 있으나 매장은 1층에만 있습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjURbj96sS70BqWT10zYIWW_cjtHXRogbx1u0xlgc72nXn7eCG6sXA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "Ji young On", "rating": 5, "content": "종로5가에서 넓고 시원하고 맛난음료를 즐길수 있는곳입니다. 붐비는 시간에 자리가 없어요~~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX0bLR1HJyuINuztG6HzYoNWRSx-gqPE8rKQyU7uk6KLuXVbr6P=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "원송연", "rating": 5, "content": "매장내부는 쾌적하네요 ㅎㅎ 새로나온 티도 한잔했습니다. 멘솔맛의 그러한 맛이네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUkr8vRfczksUr_yXZXsC65UVRySkdl3SMWhfc-smdy6hrVEmZ-Mw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ69UAIiGjfDURNKRCrodnnro/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ69UAIiGjfDURNKRCrodnnro/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ69UAIiGjfDURNKRCrodnnro/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ69UAIiGjfDURNKRCrodnnro/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ69UAIiGjfDURNKRCrodnnro/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ69UAIiGjfDURNKRCrodnnro/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ69UAIiGjfDURNKRCrodnnro/photos/6.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ69UAIiGjfDURNKRCrodnnro/photos/7.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000288DE26602C05F40A5304A2B19C94240
