4.6	37.3513928	126.7418342	2026-02-16 19:14:52.008928	2026-03-17 22:32:02.173511	019c65f2-1d68-7675-bbc4-cd9ad1787fd6	CAFE	ChIJZ-pjVlpxezURoG3F66k2Gkk	1935370277	에스프레소플래닛	[{"author": "sangroot", "rating": 5, "content": "커피 맛있고 블루베리차 향도 좋고 향긋하네요 분위기도 나름 나쁘지않고", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWLqiRBuW4h8J8OxzEWkS8K3bWTxxxlPLyV8BR_g5fogK8K-dW2=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Anna (Ra)", "rating": 4, "content": "커피스미스와 비슷한 느낌.\\n창 너머 뷰가 좀 아쉽지만 디저트에 만족.\\n정왕동커피가 있다!\\n소문에 의하면 카페인이 매우 강하다고 하니 두근거리고 싶다면 추천.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWBO3eUxX49E1VLrESKctK4dEh14bEl37z3w2SYwWGrqJ6V1yoT=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Youngbin Kim", "rating": 3, "content": "커피는 2가지 원두 중 선택 가능하다.\\n커피맛 자체는 나쁘지 않지만 진한편은 아님.\\n빵이랑 케이크도 먹어봤는데, 빵은 보통이고 케이크는 맛있었다.\\n(더티브레드?랑 자몽 쇼트케이크 먹음)", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJJSEX_doUnsoFIEFqn6rO9RmMIqFuxKnrGf_HzV06JG3t-=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "두뇌풀가동", "rating": 5, "content": "아메리카노 주문시 2가지의 블랜드를 선택할 수 있습니다\\n디저트류도 맛있어요\\n어두운 정왕역의 한줄기 빛같은 카페", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLngOz71PkzsbamosHqN0OOk64IsQpb1vi3U_tXED44wZmccHU=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "이ᄒᄉ", "rating": 5, "content": "맛있는커피~\\n원두종류도 다양하고\\n인생라떼 맛나요~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ47GP6zHDmm8HwFP1RWQstvJnlnWHzjndhie9BpT-FmK3Mfg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "임실", "rating": 5, "content": "분의기 좋고 차도 맛있어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL-NW2-BO1cOTPENg0daPADSlIfLDKCIF4YxVELOrdWD5Ar1Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "kkusn126725", "rating": 4, "content": "수박쥬스랑 자몽케잌 맛있었어요.담엔 커피마셔야지", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXz3k9VC_nGXx_ONMZUZnp2PSDEr4UmbmRx6LYtbTan0A-EDws=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "hyunju Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "맛있음 주차장협소 다소공부방인듯  대학생들이 많이자리잡고있음  주인장 친절함 재방문의사있음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIUFqqPx8Zu7cwV5BNGs2RspEkezJg7y418SJUwFHHCtxJPeITu=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZ-pjVlpxezURoG3F66k2Gkk/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZ-pjVlpxezURoG3F66k2Gkk/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZ-pjVlpxezURoG3F66k2Gkk/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZ-pjVlpxezURoG3F66k2Gkk/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E61000007A0327367AAF5F4062067470FAAC4240
