4.1	37.5785556	127.03378479999999	2026-02-16 19:14:53.619686	2026-03-17 22:33:45.955733	019c65f2-23b3-71e4-9967-c4229983f68e	CAFE	ChIJQ3KZoK68fDUR3I-4qZvJij0	104266652	투썸플레이스 제기동역점	[{"author": "Jin", "rating": 3, "content": "의자가 대체적으로 낡았어요.\\n푸드 종류도 주말이라 그런건지 많이 없고..\\n블라인드도 다 내려놔서 영업을 하는건지 의아했습니다.\\n직원분들은 친절합니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXpq6IETZrXakoYPKVgJTAOVwaXEPspwUw_3DYdFNxMMQCxhVY=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "2 min (‪DHN 민‬)", "rating": 1, "content": "케이크를 시켜도 접시를 주지 않음\\n그렇다고 쟁반이 깨끗하진 않음\\n포크 없으면 숟가락 주고 먹으라함\\n\\n웃긴건 아무도 케이크를 먹고 있지 않았다는 사실\\n\\nEven if I order cake, they won't give me a plate.\\nBut the tray is not clean.\\nIf you don't have a fork, give me a spoon and eat it.\\n\\nThe funny thing is that no one was eating cake.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKq8J4s9ZQQYgdqXeT4GjNJzS6g5HF-45U3HwZdAw2uaXHLDNcD=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "세염미", "rating": 5, "content": "디저트류 다양해서 좋고, 직원분들이 친절하다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVkYLjeYv6-CGj844pWon-4R0MABMaPhk7mkw8VYnLvsRyc9nvD=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "유리미니", "rating": 2, "content": "두번째방문  처음보다는 못하다\\n몬  냄새도  나는 뜻  나만그런가  분위기  등\\n,", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUBMWv-Znso_4wm7P1FaidttABDhQ6IodkPYY3e-v39TD4ZDYWmPw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "JB KIM (ZIRVING)", "rating": 3, "content": "평범한 투썸입니다 1층이고 좌석 간격은 보통 공부하기에는 그렇게 좋지 않은 것 같습니다 알바분들 친절하세요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXzAesIvgDG6sVx4bPfUlF9-eMdH0zZXPeCOtER9fAFp3wU7rcI=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "bonbon shizue", "rating": 5, "content": "화장실 깨끗하고 자리도 많고 좋아요!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUyIRiLfMtxxWnfBoW1Em9A_3BidHoi8MWTUv0ui-eMHYZnPFsvZg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "박가은 (JUNE)", "rating": 4, "content": "가게도 깔끔하게 이쁘고 직원분들도 친절하셨습니다!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUntRxPNYxt7xbR-DNzInE91V2gb0g-KREqnU8rc5AhJHSeKRLi=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "kh Lee", "rating": 4, "content": "투썸 치고는 가게가 작은 편이다.깨끗한 느낌을 준다.답답한 느낌도 약간은 있다.안쪽 1인용 테이블 중 충전 불가 자리가 하나있다.키오스크 주문 가능하다.화장실 아주 깨끗하다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIrjMIzDr1PXtiI09URS6SDtoc9AupiVBeKRiJD67Z79v5rLQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJQ3KZoK68fDUR3I-4qZvJij0/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJQ3KZoK68fDUR3I-4qZvJij0/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJQ3KZoK68fDUR3I-4qZvJij0/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJQ3KZoK68fDUR3I-4qZvJij0/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}]	0101000020E610000085C6B88729C25F407675221C0ECA4240
