4.2	37.4654275	126.6564684	2026-02-16 19:14:55.427024	2026-03-17 22:35:27.657205	019c65f2-2ac3-71af-975d-808117215e35	CAFE	ChIJsSrKnx55ezURgxf5fIEB6Tw	1630196483	메가엠지씨커피제물포남부역	[{"author": "이효정", "rating": 5, "content": "The drinks are good, the other side dishes are good, and I think the price is good\\n\\n음료도 맛있고 다른 사이드 메뉴도 맛있고 가격이 괜찮은것 같아용", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL9wtRXMupAUwrEWvJlvLn1oBkEKE8a9Uv62AOGqX7DK_RSdA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "요호", "rating": 2, "content": "테이크아웃을 전문으로 할텐데 알바생인지.. 손이 정말 느리십니다ㅎㅎ\\n출근길에 시키려면 집에서 출발할때 시키세요~버스에서 시켰다가 20분기다렸네요^-^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ6XeOuc-Dler9HImQqDjOdnw7kwBE6Xev8EIv34al7n1EKmVU=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "박용심", "rating": 5, "content": "아이스아메리카노 자주먹는데 진짜맛있어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLJPMT-6zhBYE0boOdbv8y9zR4M_wIKezWequOmC1_nvizZ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "센스쟁이비우다", "rating": 4, "content": "한가하고 빠름", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXzrtxzRwQGpQRWTDw_akYR1ifnrMisGh_FQTuIc1BoaGxYWGaQyQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Byeong-Yeop Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "메갈커피조아", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI20d-zsar4dXjyiaFa9sRbe_YkplhBYFuqTxq9jLP4maepsss=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "한동윤", "rating": 5, "content": "커피맛집", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKp1zEtqmvMSj23XX-9nAa4Mke5_NfbZGcTYmW-H2nqjRbFuQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "30622이윤정", "rating": 5, "content": "The name of this cafe is Mega Coffee. All the menus in this cafe are delicious. but I like strawberry latte the most. The song also has a good song that fits the cafe. and I think I pay a lot of attention to hygiene.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL8mkr6P5gXEBSmlOa2-A9xu2Q0nY6TKTAcbB5bdCQOr_xSMA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "장민영", "rating": 5, "content": "It's close to home, the price is cheap, the atmosphere is good, and the taste is cool and delicious. The service is friendly and good.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKjSKdBvKWnF4uI67n_ugAW6mjmK2ZZlDV2xCOsye59tfqx7A=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJsSrKnx55ezURgxf5fIEB6Tw/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJsSrKnx55ezURgxf5fIEB6Tw/photos/1.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000E036099403AA5F405B94D92093BB4240
