4.3	37.556691099999995	126.86189789999999	2026-02-16 19:15:03.556863	2026-03-17 22:38:06.020365	019c65f2-4a84-760a-8719-745065812909	CAFE	ChIJZdBp3CydfDUR_8-U6yROp4g	169109254	폴바셋 증미역점	[{"author": "jin kim", "rating": 5, "content": "내부 공간이 넓어서 시각적으로 시원하다.\\n하지만 공간이 울려서 좀 씨끄러운 감이 있다.\\n\\n주문은 정문 키오스크를 이용하면 된다.\\n\\n음료등은 모두 좋았다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVmz9tBR6kywSfxhpo300nuRai-fZtCIO34du7uAhqcXUEFtG7L=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "John Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "핏자와 커피샵이 결합된 형태로\\n\\n커피샵 고유의 향보다는 핏자의 향이 더 강하게 풍기므로\\n\\n카페인지 핏자집인지 그 경계 또한 모호함..\\n\\n나름 호로 작용하는 사람도 분명 있을터이지만 나에게는 불호로 다가왔다.\\n\\n그럼에도 차맛은 좋았다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVqqcVUs1zCVQ42QCeaEIXcMPcb295tInXvAV-hPTsuS61ZqfBw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "우디르", "rating": 5, "content": "커피가 아주 향긋하고 맛있어요. 좋은 원두를 쓰는듯. 물건을 분실했는데 감사히도 친절한 직원분이 찾아서 잘 전달해주셨어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ8jwScS4_lhcfvW4oPX7BcFjGd-1QP6hsw-DOJFTxIiPdrHg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "애플맹고", "rating": 4, "content": "일반적인 커피가게 입니다.\\n커피가격은 비싼 편이나 산맛이 나는것이 특징 입니다. 주차 1시간 무료 됩니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU3zYuTW_G2BvvWbpzgH4FvjGEy2avHO3IpCufiBjVtt4dRPjmw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "쏭쏭", "rating": 5, "content": "커피마시거나 간단한 식사하기 좋음\\n지하주차장있어서 주차편리함", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUfauXvQ1OG6hw6Zbb2MVNZsTpG5_CQtHra045tGyapfFif4vRg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "냠냠이", "rating": 3, "content": "넖어서  좋아요..근데  사람이  많아지면  너무 시끄러워  스터디하기엔   별루에요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIwg5gbIBr-Ng-v3OgZaCrI9IK29Wb6qMVmTBWAuhaBY-UwXQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "정제이와이", "rating": 4, "content": "역시 손님이 별로 없는 시간에 갔더니 라떼 맛이 좋았습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUolU2QTpsCSG-etM0C_IGEXaILhPkTQBFVkPl5evKOitiblSQO=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "한인옥", "rating": 4, "content": "사람이 너무많고~시끄러워 나이든사람에게는 별로인것 같아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKLeueiaOYClELCuQ_QW3f9xRPGS6bskQ_exCtlpDZ82OIJEWfT=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZdBp3CydfDUR_8-U6yROp4g/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZdBp3CydfDUR_8-U6yROp4g/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZdBp3CydfDUR_8-U6yROp4g/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZdBp3CydfDUR_8-U6yROp4g/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZdBp3CydfDUR_8-U6yROp4g/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E61000006D3FCF5529B75F40B43C6AA741C74240
