4.2	37.499551499999995	127.11162499999999	2026-03-17 20:29:57.046583	2026-03-17 20:29:57.046583	019cfb8f-4736-7070-b3c4-1289ea185dfa	CAFE	ChIJj6uyb-ulfDURMfo2PiMgTSE	286436268	메가MGC커피 송파역점	[{"author": "Redstone68", "rating": 4, "content": "좋다고 하긴 어려워도 나쁘지 않은 아이스아메리카노를 저렴하게 즐길 수 있음. 외부에 키오스크 있어서 반려동물과 함께라도 ㅇㅋ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWyIQ2N7sxnf413Q8oRP9KYcgBkgOO3jC3fyRTPSqUwfQ7lsv79=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "유나경", "rating": 4, "content": "헬리오 상가 1층이라 위치좋고, 차마시면 1시간 무료주차도 가능해요~.\\n위치가좋아서  지나가다 차한잔하기 좋아요^^.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLRe0bH9ZrtuDmuxrnbaOfLYJLE2VAANIURt2NnkL63mhQFtQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Willy J", "rating": 5, "content": "작지만 편하고 좋네요~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVlNWH-2D9CdwxXCU8AI_RBADNxQug7nPVKwuq6_qsYesw4w71v=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "HK J", "rating": 1, "content": "수박주스를 시켰는데 급한 일이 있어서 그냥 4000원 낭비 했어요 여기 오지 마세요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocId-Ef4hzo-xGHdqKCt4uFM1rUE33y82P4QUgP0Bu3_pfUewA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "김인철", "rating": 2, "content": "음료 주문하고 받는데 20분도 더 걸렸어요. 매장에 직원이 3명 있었는데 별로 호흡이 맞는 것 같지도 않고", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLT5_PPazysTSZNkMJg8QcNDR9f7k-scMOfggF7zrEIVyW77w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "개솜군", "rating": 4, "content": "매장밖으로 테이크아웃 가능합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUVLFcwlkKfwCFPFzAe9K1qxyJnz4ZTYytjz5VEIT_m1g2Aw-h7=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "김신애", "rating": 5, "content": "매장이 크지 않음. 감자빵 맛있음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocItL-85uDeKQ0vo_9g3Mo-ws0853-XCQ0q3zncHMlA58XgZxQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "kd “스윗가이” w", "rating": 5, "content": "아주 시원합니다~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVkWaisMsttUx6xQEK9WLfqaIWZYnU9emDZKZ2f51ZC2NpKXiue5w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJj6uyb-ulfDURMfo2PiMgTSE/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJj6uyb-ulfDURMfo2PiMgTSE/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJj6uyb-ulfDURMfo2PiMgTSE/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000009F1A2FDD24C75F407895B54DF1BF4240
4.3	37.4553959	127.150122	2026-02-16 19:12:22.724046	2026-03-17 20:30:04.665184	019c65ef-d644-781c-83a7-a0a912bc945c	CAFE	ChIJrTCiAcuofDURNOSTiznxahQ	551600361	메가엠지씨커피산성역점	[{"author": "Phillip Jai", "rating": 4, "content": "잠깐 들려서 커피 한잔 하고  컴퓨터 조회좀 하고 나와서 사진이 와이파이 사진만 있군요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUTrlzoTyq5A2fxixI7t3GCK_iRtGIl6pbhrQtmyw_cYvKss3FbTg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Moonhee Kang", "rating": 5, "content": "커피가 싸서 놀랐고 맛과 향이 좋아 또 한번 놀랐습니다. 매장에서 마시다가 친구가 와서 나가야했는데 친절하게 테이크아웃컵에 담아주셨습니다.\\n남한산성 산행 전에 커피한잔하며 일행기다리실때 이용하기 편합니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL1bk61seT8nesKlO3ubv5Mo7hndNgWQRQczgfJdo2aLUzV4g=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Sjsj dkdj", "rating": 5, "content": "이번 가을 시즌음료 밤프라페 진짜 맛있네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLi_HVvoj3INgu5rUaQSBAaXzGBfLgwcv7OOH1RnIxpo4AMtg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "longforn", "rating": 4, "content": "성남폴리텍 근처 산성역 2번출구 10미터내에 있어 출근길에 들려 마시면서 출근합니다.\\n10번먹으면 아메리카노 1잔 주는것도 좋네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUG_D186aIo9p9L3lqW_2HKRV752DMk85G6MglENPKqFoCFLG555A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "이혜진", "rating": 5, "content": "알바생들 친절해요 평일 한 3시쯤 하시는분", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXA7HSWnpXX1q8hHETA7p3YmTFOBml4Z0qHIQDR80E2i52DhYZfzg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Joseph Han", "rating": 3, "content": "사장님 넘 친절. 커피는 저렴해서 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVlVvGhtjh8Pfx5lDWWDbXaWSniIL7p2HPzI0Y-9XyfEr5L3P4A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "김영휘", "rating": 5, "content": "간단히 커피 한잔 하기 좋습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIM8hmcdx-71NkvVwzs71rFiwYc6XN40ll3MhM7yv4VU4YYrg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "정훈진", "rating": 5, "content": "친절하고 편리해요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJBHoMsFPZ_3pZaAL0rUENJ-i9LzQmDN-9228UzZMNwZEpqNQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJrTCiAcuofDURNOSTiznxahQ/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJrTCiAcuofDURNOSTiznxahQ/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJrTCiAcuofDURNOSTiznxahQ/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000003F1A4E999BC95F40C29DB0694ABA4240
