lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXYQkb94DTzdNk0yXNiRprCFXUZpdXcQi-1uAub1xjjkxM1PoHy=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "ddrl", "rating": 3, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW5OPbwiY5byz-TtuEFQh6muk0CZt6roU2Xkp9XJo23Dye-mj_s=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJAYB71I55ezURPYwsxhzF8uo/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJAYB71I55ezURPYwsxhzF8uo/photos/1.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000007B5D2B4682AB5F408DB27E3331BB4240
3.9	37.4622597	126.7086126	2026-02-16 19:10:37.9817	2026-03-17 20:31:14.397297	019c65ee-3d1d-73a8-b194-0a6db04853ff	CAFE	ChIJ7-AhUPB7ezURBetH4-djRAg	742149480	투썸플레이스 인천간석점	[{"author": "Chang Hyuk Yoo", "rating": 5, "content": "주변에 카페가 많지 않은 곳에 맛좋은 투썸이 생겨서 좋네요 ^^\\n매장도 넓어서 시원시원하고 좋고, 오픈한지 얼마 되지 않아서 그런지 깨끗해요 ^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLsKzHaWKo7kOs5lNIU1lxbtm4ulV4vOvYFr72tSjSqNORBuJOx=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Jihun Park", "rating": 4, "content": "분위기도 괜찮고 멍하니 시간 때우고 싶을 때 카페는 좋은 곳이죠. 넓어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWxAC2Hg3oQ1HafOaP4axuhxyOsTIvzNJBV2rksUTvd8CHZ1Jy18g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "SOONSHIM CHO", "rating": 5, "content": "10~12명이 들어갈 수 있는 공간이 있어서 이용하기에 좋았습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVIVvIGsvonocnesdbwwBtfQjZUnSQN-2QyAqRf-yukoIsbvL0=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "진(별빛부는 언덕)", "rating": 5, "content": "간석동에 드디어 브렌드 커피점 들어옴 까페베네 나간이후임\\n대형매장이라서 넓고 시원함", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVuGABqUrx_d_x4ZGoFC8aPubWtGST3AJ4JCwAg1wOrLVI3xuyR5w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Ryan Jeong", "rating": 5, "content": "맛있고 친절합니다. 주말에는 1시까지 주중에는 11시까지 영업해요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUJtRq_9DsYEFrlks6RO2XI5lOjkAkK3PiLRp4L8DiM2YPcHsOA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "박문선", "rating": 5, "content": "넓고 인테리어 좋아요. 커피도 맛있어요. 오전 10시 이전 아메리카노 3천원. 텀블러 할인 300원?", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLw8N7ZC80F1PzL88Lr7WaKx25PD5MrE7FycMlAxen1t4-ZdQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "김커리온", "rating": 5, "content": "커피가 아주맛이 좋더라구요\\n어떤곳은 별로였는데 이곳 직원분은 친절하게 응대해주시고 잘마시고 왔습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV0qo4XjhUf4ysmd7xoAzFbuxVIb5W3W4KTQRLpDYLSv2BzIY4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "이병용", "rating": 3, "content": "친구와 가볍게 커피 한잔했다. 넓고 쾌적한 여유로운 곳. 이런곳에서 커피를 마신다. 세상이 참 많이 변했다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUZOEYXtx3rQ3KgmSPShiQQGgXFL9or2fxi3gEMGVEV-l7MSXfT=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ7-AhUPB7ezURBetH4-djRAg/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ7-AhUPB7ezURBetH4-djRAg/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ7-AhUPB7ezURBetH4-djRAg/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ7-AhUPB7ezURBetH4-djRAg/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ7-AhUPB7ezURBetH4-djRAg/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ7-AhUPB7ezURBetH4-djRAg/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E610000025A2A9E859AD5F401FE16A532BBB4240
4.1	37.5689904	126.98360559999999	2026-03-17 20:52:22.288083	2026-03-17 20:52:22.288083	019cfba3-ce10-76a8-a5e1-7e3f7e3ad558	CAFE	ChIJ51xO1e6ifDURXBnVh-SAmYA	141454443	프롬하츠커피 청계종각점	[{"author": "JAEKYUN KIM", "rating": 3, "content": "팥빙수 먹어보았는데 그럭저럭 괜찮은편이에요. 청계천 바로 앞에 있어서 위치가 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW6crMDajf9pOBBx2asX-I_dyU9vzyiep4j9whh_B2lYzWG6x7B=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "서지빈", "rating": 5, "content": "퇴근 후 친구 만나서 간단한 저녁 겸 해서 들렸어요~! 2층 좌석에서 청계천이 바로 보여서 분위기도 좋고, 수다 떨기에도 조용하고 좋았습니다~! 다음에도 방문의사 있어요:)", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJTwp3hb5K3SHufF4WtPDxt0rHv6QbX9oT87PM80renQirNeg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "김영진", "rating": 5, "content": "청계천 산책하러 나갔다가 우연히 매장에 들어갔습니니다.\\n남자 직원분이 아주 친절하고 근래들어 먹어본 라떼중 최고였습니다:) 종각역에서도 가깝고 앞으로 자주 자주 갈것같요~!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXvacd4KZqX6vsCWObVuCOXYO5qPH3qayYF8ejyQ0NZ4A3yO83p=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Beomseok Chae", "rating": 5, "content": "눈이 갑자기 많이와서 들어왔는데 커피맛도 좋고 가게도 눈 풍경이 정말 멋져요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJkmDOAe_0Lla6g_9sjOkEjEjbCkb9werNTWxZm4nohYo8KfQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "tommy yoo", "rating": 4, "content": "원두도 훌륭하고 청계천변에 있어서 좋더라구요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWb_qV1xT3w1PBY680HjXljYFENiEO5k5cbydxyNWEsDG-9cufdCw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "김진성", "rating": 4, "content": "아보카토를 먹어본결과 맛이 조았어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV0nR0PcCEjUD4yEsrbX9IY2qsT6m85s18WTDmoN84630xeTlLW=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "우쭈쭈뽕뽕", "rating": 3, "content": "1층은 개방감도 있고 괜찮습니다. 2층은 자리가 좁아서 그런지 시끄러운 편입니다.\\n커피는 보통이지만 크로와플이 맛납니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXZy97rHJJ2PFXSgt2Gx0qOUWChbxPwMNbn02eSHjRzWIGU70JHUA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Yeonsoo Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "메뉴가 다양하고 청계천뷰가 보이는 예쁜 카페. 에이드는 진짜 과일즙을 짜서 만든다고 해요. 그래서 인지 진짜 깊은 맛이 나고 질리지않는 맛. 좋아여ㅋㅋ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIAJ0jJV21dco-lkCzepWlDzY_rEMa5l_O-t2sGeJRVe9kzig=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ51xO1e6ifDURXBnVh-SAmYA/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ51xO1e6ifDURXBnVh-SAmYA/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ51xO1e6ifDURXBnVh-SAmYA/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ51xO1e6ifDURXBnVh-SAmYA/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ51xO1e6ifDURXBnVh-SAmYA/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ51xO1e6ifDURXBnVh-SAmYA/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ51xO1e6ifDURXBnVh-SAmYA/photos/6.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ51xO1e6ifDURXBnVh-SAmYA/photos/7.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ51xO1e6ifDURXBnVh-SAmYA/photos/8.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [20, 30]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 0],