4.5	37.6011654	127.14072209999999	2026-02-16 19:10:39.24026	2026-03-17 20:33:21.00653	019c65ee-4208-7753-b0d5-cab1101a4ced	CAFE	ChIJp8SvIwCxfDURGiRiSwxO2fU	932934864	카페 몽슈슈	[{"author": "MI YOUNG Go", "rating": 4, "content": "잘 보이지 않는 위치라 카페가 있는 줄 몰랐어요. 음료도 다 진하고 맛있고,  연세 지긋하신 사장님도 너무 친절하셨어요. 깔끔하니 이쁜 매장에 테라스 자리도 예뻤습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUfcRU_NX5L0cNpOry4sOtXbenzNxlW3NR1eJ6q9M3y2UVKY41Jig=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "한주영", "rating": 5, "content": "CYC 다양한 고급 케익이 있는 카페. 케이크를 사러 방문했고, 전반적으로 이쁘고 맛도 좋음.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXsF5WQGmCD_GdISVh48Mt3KdN4jN9-azWk9WpW7Z-POd41TedW8Q=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJp8SvIwCxfDURGiRiSwxO2fU/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJp8SvIwCxfDURGiRiSwxO2fU/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJp8SvIwCxfDURGiRiSwxO2fU/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJp8SvIwCxfDURGiRiSwxO2fU/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJp8SvIwCxfDURGiRiSwxO2fU/photos/4.png"}]	[]	0101000020E6100000C354449701C95F404E3EE2FCF2CC4240
