4.6	37.418148599999995	126.91217049999999	2026-02-16 19:10:43.006527	2026-03-17 20:37:38.039234	019c65ee-50be-720c-950d-6690e273f683	CAFE	ChIJ1YE0awBhezURz7ioUOpdgls	528277842	더빈마켓	[{"author": "배명환", "rating": 5, "content": "2가지맛의 커피를 선택할수있음.\\n인근커피숍에없는 선택.\\n그리고 아이가 복숭아아이스티와 소금빵을 좋아함.그외에도 직접만드는 빵이 맛있음\\n조용하고 대화하기좋은데 경우에 따라서 그렇지 않을수있음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLSFf2gqjJ5IBHfsLY17MFlbpO9NDw-j1C1_8zY-IOZkAzA2w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Eddie Park", "rating": 5, "content": "맛있는 커피와 더 맛있는 빵을 같이 먹을수 있는 곳이네요.\\n자주 들릴듯 합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKCWc4AqUsJTl3OUI7tiTFnqVKsuuhwGqcLDotSAiMYkHxSMA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Camila Cerda", "rating": 5, "content": "Beautiful cafe , delicious food! A cozy place in Anyang.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXI4r5VIkss5CR3X6GmNb3X0NKYP_zueGGge1akDRPOrisuUC2M=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "J.H SHIN", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUPYYdqEmJHNc2KTyk9BPefDaqiMF1EiBAD05mZYkxpAh2J72Cn=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "김문형", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWiOdQvqbyIHRt75Edeb-XUcCfBUUB2FxepPVugtnm83rUJLYM=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ1YE0awBhezURz7ioUOpdgls/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ1YE0awBhezURz7ioUOpdgls/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ1YE0awBhezURz7ioUOpdgls/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northea