4.8	37.493662199999996	127.01930569999999	2026-02-16 19:10:45.959723	2026-03-17 20:39:14.48966	019c65ee-5c47-7f80-8ab9-12600ecdfe23	CAFE	ChIJ1epNrBihfDURZTRt8nABAgc	217485329	피그커피 교대점	[{"author": "정은정", "rating": 5, "content": "교대 최애 커피숍 소금빵 구음과자 맛집이에요\\n커피도 고소해서 분위기도 좋아서 자주가요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLkmMvyyMLJiC3YQ8Sr07V0WsXmArCFod6eDHrcxQ1MAyQ1MA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "H.Y Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "고소한 맛 커피에도 산미가 조금 있긴한데 전반적으로 좁은 공간임에도 불구하고 분위기가 좋고 커피와디저트가 괜찮아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWzBJr12N9LNnBpS21a0MO6PYqFv_Qp4dywBZ06MYyzRXbNa1QVig=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "201", "rating": 4, "content": "서울교대 근처의 주택가에 있는 한적한 커피숍이다. 조용하게 커피를 마시기에 좋은 곳이다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW43cEMZdSYq7Ze8WDTmgXOvl9Gfy0rznkgdTNWCH8F9NRLO7Y=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "yongjae kwon", "rating": 5, "content": "아이스라떼 엄청 맛있음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUe9L8Uq_s4uAZze7kOfbJ4xDfNdXZe36ny7kRAfAUPSVygjJY=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ1epNrBihfDURZTRt8nABAgc/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ1epNrBihfDURZTRt8nABAgc/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ1epNrBihfDURZTRt8nABAgc/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ1epNrBihfDURZTRt8nABAgc/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ1epNrBihfDURZTRt8nABAgc/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ1epNrBihfDURZ