4.8	37.6016753	127.0167846	2026-03-17 20:39:14.551342	2026-03-17 20:39:14.551342	019cfb97-c8f7-7c94-9eaa-c659330c1ae0	CAFE	ChIJFRXBE-u8fDURUO8HZkE_bPA	737247316	오감공간	[{"author": "Oh Myoung Sik", "rating": 4, "content": "아메리카노는 구수하게 누구나 마시게 편한 스타일이고 라떼는 맛있었어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWvCn-BOq7S2J-CwPK8-Nj_I-PmfMvOU_HVZX7NQP98svDZMjzDQA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Dome_in_O 360", "rating": 5, "content": "동네커피&핸드드립&여유\\n오감이네요~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLfda681-xaDmbRFkuGoX1PmkNR80b5mPCbkOjbDggF-gtkyA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "오즈 (OZ)", "rating": 4, "content": "색다른 인테리어와 싱글블랜드의 드립커피의 향기가 잘 어울리어 맘에드는 그런 카페라는~! *.*", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXQ54ICooNSEWQnzsaRTlmh-xQJBD1k975XwaOGeSeTAMv3fLU7=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "정아", "rating": 5, "content": "반려동물 동반 가능합니다. 오트라떼가 있습니다. 라떼 맛있게 잘 먹었습니다😊", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU3d5Bhdi080oP-DrPqmY0ngskvK71kzGIHo7OAMH8gt0R7KoUQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "야가바바", "rating": 4, "content": "편한 분위기여서 좋은 점도 있지만, 그 분위기가 사람에 따라서는 산만하고 떠들썩하게 여겨질수도 있을듯.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcClgjYd6R2GQqIbmOGu_JE_SNKMI0D-wwLTdhHZOgnd_2PuCU3w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "wind U", "rating": 5, "content": "커피 맛있어용 조아요~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIpSpis3X1mXjR33y03OQG2IjYgZDc711CZBZyVXmRDmAdfw2Y=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "FrameStory ON", "rating": 5, "content": "조용하고 커피 맛있어요..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWTt7OQQESKqcSC7OcHDdAUbFEFOPCvVH8fmHeXKeYqUXgqpf_yPg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Chino YAM", "rating": 5, "content": "핸드드립 커피가 맛있는 곳", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW9TM7fAFOOKPFIruv1asdysOL5qD4263tKFb1d4mYFxJjS0Ek=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJFRXBE-u8fDURUO8HZkE_bPA/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJFRXBE-u8fDURUO8HZkE_bPA/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJFRXBE-u8fDURUO8HZkE_bPA/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [6, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [6, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000E404B7FF12C15F40CE273CB203CD4240
