4.8	37.5013693	127.1391396	2026-03-17 20:41:47.466289	2026-03-17 20:41:47.466289	019cfb9a-1e4a-7028-9404-10199136b19e	CAFE	ChIJQbmG95yvfDURy40lluKf0aM	359130693	카페미리	[{"author": "taeyoung Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "빵은 버터가 많이 들어가 부드러웠고, 음료는 평범 했다 . 가끔 들릴러 같다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLAc0BlxkM3ZrSDbz_ghXnj1j85YLEp8hsj9JT7Lx42F9C-Vw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "주민경", "rating": 5, "content": "조용하고 예쁜 카페", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJvTP4TxNI7gpKrFX20dEHeI34VFGYxMcVuZVttnTC9l7o9pA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "전우권", "rating": 5, "content": "맛있는 커피와 디저트가 있는 곳입니다. 정말 좋아요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU2bcFBwbArxJ9zfNG6SRmlFKgbBRa9432bwT_q8f4qMZdZrNxO=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "송진용", "rating": 5, "content": "커피 맛있고 빵도 굿이네요  같이 한번드셔보세요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWlX_s0xzXGz55RnetwtlAfDslN_agY049_dsdO77nwvy3OTnFm=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Sun Hee Jung", "rating": 5, "content": "조용하고 맛있는커피 친절해요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL5T7c8Pne8SqppTZ_sX9MwWE61hEPeoQnPs1VTDtGIpMt4Fw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Yurok Cho", "rating": 5, "content": "숨은보석!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWS_XoFDbvgfi_YBiCSCFAJ-2eupS50ESWT2h9rIwJGxlUsgNXhcQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJQbmG95yvfDURy40lluKf0aM/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJQbmG95yvfDURy40lluKf0aM/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJQbmG95yvfDURy40lluKf0aM/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}]	0101000020E610000006E5C7A9E7C85F40F55B85DE2CC04240
4.2	37.4844951	126.9011683	2026-03-17 20:41:47.466517	2026-03-17 20:41:47.466517	019cfb9a-1e4a-7028-9405-8f2a3173436a	CAFE	ChIJLZFIcW2ffDUR0YliKc7yztU	13500050	할리스커피 구로디지털단지역점	[{"author": "김난희 (난희)", "rating": 4, "content": "구로디지털단지역 2번 출구 바로 앞에 있는 카페, 평일 주말 가리지 않고 항상 사람이 많아요.\\n\\n근처 다른 카페에 비해서 좌석 간격은 좀 좁아서, 테이블 사이로 지나다니려면 조금 조심하는게 좋습니다!\\n\\n화장실은 매장 안에 있어서 깨끗하고 편해서 좋았어요.\\n\\n오렌지 자몽 싱싱 주스는 맛있게 먹어서 추천드릴게요!🍊", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVlhrvoVGHTRF9p1SXULc20KlJ2O7I5xdx4S_y8dBgMngTX6bLG=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "duksu jin (국제뷰티아티스트TV)", "rating": 4, "content": "주차가 편해서 좋습니다.\\n가게앞에서 흡연도 가능하구요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXqhlRDWPAgZReLD7DP0WAIPAhAgY_jxFGNfGyQmJ7UcX1dbHEUfg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "스테고마그마", "rating": 4, "content": "번화가에 있어서 사람이 많네요.\\n키오스크가 있어서 편하게 계산할수 있구요.\\n음료도 다양해서 커피가 아니어도 다른음료 선택할수 있네요.\\n매장직원도 친절하시구요.\\n좋은시간 보냈어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJTeFjMVNt-paedcCbf_jimwf-qNkzldQcTdrrcny3QPfmCSA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Julio CHO", "rating": 3, "content": "걷는 중에 역을 보지 못해 여기와서 에그마요 샌드위치 시켜, 야외 1층 있어 나가서 먹었음 (화장실 이용하려고 들아가봄) 할리스 중 무난한 듯. 울동네엔 할리스가 없어서...", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKzHYnAM2KbVP_cMOZuU4H8nOXhE-K5KVkQ9LlPTvefO_cvse8=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "장규리", "rating": 5, "content": "항상 친절 하세요 ~ 💙저번엔 커피 마시다가 립스틱을 테이블에 놓구 왔는데 챙겨 났다가 주셔서 너무 감사 했습니다 ~ 커피는 당연히 맛나구여 👍", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWsc785GP5lxgHzMrgc7zNJtF06zw7tYb_9s955iB7GaO5nFZspLg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "s flyhero", "rating": 2, "content": "구로디지털에 있는 다른곳이 좁고 산만해서 이쪽으로 왓는데 여긴 좀더 클뿐..\\n매장이 깔끔치 못한 느낌.\\n할리스 예전엔 고급진 느낌이엇던거같은데.....\\n쿠폰쓰러왓지.. 내돈주곤  안올듯", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKALLbpXqzCpqz6epzT0uuuWraq7J0sBtxI25MKbpNTnBVZ6A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "MARCO K", "rating": 4, "content": "프리미엄이라 하지만 400원을 더 투영 할 이유가 없다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVpjZAu1xAr36h-ogd5bszpuZC8nJSKRo5qQm90OmgV_8R5CEX4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "공산북괴절멸", "rating": 3, "content": "매장이 좀 더 넓었으면 한다.윗층 투썸이 상대적으로 넓다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX627NoF5OCzufC6A4Hi-P0kd6eL8OiCygaOejG-MX87ByJC51U=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJLZFIcW2ffDUR0YliKc7yztU/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJLZFIcW2ffDUR0YliKc7yztU/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJLZFIcW2ffDUR0YliKc7yztU/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJLZFIcW2ffDUR0YliKc7yztU/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJLZFIcW2ffDUR0YliKc7yztU/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJLZFIcW2ffDUR0YliKc7yztU/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000482CCEBDACB95F403FC978EF03BE4240
4.3	37.5002199	127.10494829999999	2026-03-17 20:41:47.466784	2026-03-17 20:41:47.466784	019cfb9a-1e4a-7028-9406-3c5a33c2e49b	CAFE	ChIJZeVELeOlfDURCc2oL-cVPLA	1539671071	투썸플레이스 송파헬리오시티점	[{"author": "곽민석", "rating": 5, "content": "이번에 나온 신상 두초생 케이크먹었는데\\n너무 맛있었어요.\\n티 멤버쉽 30프로 할인되어서\\n저렴하게 먹을수 있는것도 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL60MFaYCaflau5Pk-DEAbZUSJ5EEtnm-z6nMBfzwKAWbAyJw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Dillisus", "rating": 5, "content": "< 첫방문입니다. >\\n투썸플레이스 만의 매력이 느껴지는 곳이었는데\\n다른 카페와는 다르게 손님들이 책 읽으며\\n공부하기에 최적화되도록 환경을 개선한 노력이\\n보이는 카페인 것은 분명했습니다.🤣", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXSBkiky5gAr6aBGBu4DpBSfwBh5VTOD_bpO_l5i6YDKH8P2qM=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "이준혁", "rating": 5, "content": "새건물에 새로 들어온거라 그런지 인테리어도 예쁘게 잘 되어있고 역시 투썸이라 케잌이 맛있네용ㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW0MSU9aLedJaYl639ZZE7US_R6uECD8JrjX6Q0ZkrftUq1Z90=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "MJ Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "공간이 꽤 넓고, 코드있는 자리 및 다인석, 1인석 등 다양한 자리가 있어서 일하거나 수다떨면서 시간보내기 좋습니다. 디카페인 커피도 있고 다양한 음식과 아이템도 살 수 있어 구경하기도 좋습니다. 다만 화장실은 밖으로 나가야 하고 칸이 적어서 새 건물이지만 편하진 않았습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWrOklR9vMbCsKds-ZT8otHPJY4k_s7kVOQJId8pjiZMRohAyE=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "이소영", "rating": 3, "content": "커피주문을 했는데 사람이 많기도 했지만 너무 시끄럽고 음료제조하는 직원이 너무 정신없어 보임\\n이것했다 저기했다 왔다갔다\\n다른사람 음료도 하나 안나오고 다시만들고,\\n음료도 너무 오래 걸리고,\\n빙수갈고 있다가 놓고 다른일하고 다시올리고 ~~\\n내가  뜨거운커피를 주문했는데 아이스로 나와서 새로 만들어줌\\n매장에 비해 직원3명은 너무 부족한것 같아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWRlDW1xf8B_rfiT2z6v0YkdIt7PXyu0AprnhD-8sl2gUsbQ7N-ug=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Janice Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "2024.04.08\\n매장 깨끗해요\\n키오스크 주문가능해요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVc5YFDoAxraVyzSv-7CKQ9XH9k8dt_7xenhFj-iItXpeI29cPz=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "정창호", "rating": 5, "content": "넓고 쾌적한 공간. 꽤 다양한 메뉴를 구매할 수 있음.  공부를 하기위한 공간도 따로 마련되어 있음.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVPcrX_15d89RCTWOq21I0DwTW3j-_Ulc42MCCMtRpWNE-yuZpt=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "애국화가윤에스더PDTV (윤에스더PD)", "rating": 5, "content": "연습후 ㆍㆍ넓고 깨끗하고 좋음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXk1J39cVsIjJvA3YFWqPwnt890yW2TVgrbCl-co8m3AzN4ymi8=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZeVELeOlfDURCc2oL-cVPLA/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZeVELeOlfDURCc2oL-cVPLA/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZeVELeOlfDURCc2oL-cVPLA/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZeVELeOlfDURCc2oL-cVPLA/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E610000054111379B7C65F4079A7A73407C04240
4.8	37.505345399999996	127.1057948	2026-03-17 20:41:47.467021	2026-03-17 20:41:47.467021	019cfb9a-1e4b-701b-867b-3345e3ef8ca1	CAFE	ChIJdwueJH6lfDUR0kS0_eQZ7Mk	1837804724	카페르띠 RTi	[{"author": "Oddsbitsandpieces", "rating": 5, "content": "쿠키 꼭 레인지에 돌려드세요 쑥마카다미아, 로투스 스모어 꿀맛이에요ㅜ_ㅜ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJpm9rpLnuap_KnY0-ebjiSMmvQa7rEVGJjKlC7jm89APZsvbg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "jang ramul", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVlqid7xa8mSK_8Ni5djgjffcPOhYz0B7mG71wWxWYw2r4jpGlV=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "JAMES CHOI", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKJtF9ye3H8pDDYMiDwWgd--MbVSMwWeSVglISkO9f7GLoP8w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "장복환", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIWji9PsxrnaaqiOgg0IFTDy1Yocm9BxutmPFvD1ULFqfkuvw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "최용환", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJlfQP57Z0foVh4g8_Icns-BSIbfpt0YzESFbekiNQycq0TMtI=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJdwueJH6lfDUR0kS0_eQZ7Mk/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJdwueJH6lfDUR0kS0_eQZ7Mk/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJdwueJH6lfDUR0kS0_eQZ7Mk/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJdwueJH6lfDUR0kS0_eQZ7Mk/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 