4.2	37.6116151	126.9176004	2026-02-16 19:10:54.691811	2026-03-17 20:42:13.167981	019c65ee-7e63-70f2-9a0b-f2e01179bf13	CAFE	ChIJh4hAkFmZfDURQ98Pyqt1xzI	1348174119	컴포즈커피 구산역점	[{"author": "yunmi cho", "rating": 5, "content": "집근처에 있어서 퇴근하거나 지날때 자주 이용합니다\\n요즘 아아 잘 마셔서 자주기는데 1500원에 맛있게 잘 마시고 있어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXDnKjj6lFWkrZACajaII5GYnM5Dh-UILsyPKIDIYwW5LIKJXF8Kw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "새봄", "rating": 1, "content": "제가 가는 낮시간마자 계신 알바분.. 매번 살 대마다 얼음 적게인데 정량만큼 주시나요..ㅠㅠ 주문 요청사항 간과하지 말아주세요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXlbT64stdI2ik4vI6EUpizfaeAp_Baaul0QaUwUl19fPuQ6Ig=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Jhon Harper", "rating": 5, "content": "아메리카노도 싼데 바닐라 라떼도 싸고 맛있네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVMvLfvYGB-iXTRuGki-2NE0gh1nm1SZMCYZysz5QyYUzlpPJc=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Elizabeth JH Choe", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX9GXQdvSbv71kF7BKF6BUSHCbrMoQVpIr-KfF2H15Oy63rVe8I=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "레드러브", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXceX11iayFNluh3pTlbfKfdu6LorinIqkVv2ydLeyGRNEm2pbZCA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJh4hAkFmZfDURQ98Pyqt1xzI/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJh4hAkFmZfDURQ98Pyqt1xzI/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJh4hAkFmZfDURQ98Pyqt1xzI/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": 