4.9	37.541743	126.73904499999999	2026-02-16 19:15:10.181624	2026-03-17 20:45:17.137369	019c65f2-6465-745a-93cb-2256d3449b00	CAFE	ChIJITeYKPWDfDURn4PUzfuNYwc	262070800	세라젬 웰카페 계양직영점	[{"author": "Arirang's & RainBow", "rating": 5, "content": "음료도 맛있고 세라젬 체험도 가능한곳~\\n직원분들 모두 친절하세요~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXlNx7IJgLPr5FV7O2h7R0AcDrAIxgJX25ZsgK1oahocoZ5wQsE=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "오충렬", "rating": 5, "content": "허리 와 목이 아플때\\n세라젬 웰카페에 들러서\\n체험하면 통증 완화되고\\n편안하고 건강에 도움이 됩니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKlHvIWD72bocKHejbg0qBuMcl5enkdOzfpyeNSk3frxVuDkqBQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "안희준", "rating": 5, "content": "세라젬 안마기 체험을 할수있는곳 입니다.\\n음료나 커피를 주문하면 안마기 체험을 할수\\n있습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIYr55ZdKD2hpzpCRelXpTCXahn-_uPZS7QDkCeV9dMOFPvqg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "jaeyong lee", "rating": 4, "content": "직원들이 친절하고 기기 체험 효과가 좋아 자칫 구매할 수 있음~😅😅😅", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW6_y3CsZ8VOwqj8Qvq55AVfsBysAUXkvHsQWZG7XgXveGrjxk=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "장철현", "rating": 5, "content": "시원한곳에서 안마도 시원하게받고 커피도마시고\\n좋습니다^^*", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXuKC0BdqVMlYbryfo0rJiwanogBCHVb54aisH_FWalWYui-vuz=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Seungjae Jung", "rating": 5, "content": "친절한 직원분들\\n상가내 무료주차 가능(음료 계산시 정산)", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUhUF2W8T-Z9TZ6rNS59jduKel5cSn0qamzrXo2iPf0wyG9lyAV=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "엄성호", "rating": 5, "content": "파우제좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL5A3JEr-RDmAbvqGz_v0dj_KFLuIvsf_KZCu90QMp4_yjABg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "최진경", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKKu-gAKrt9syTLBpVe_pIF2VtbebhPbJH6LGUOgt8WACMMuA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJITeYKPWDfDURn4PUzfuNYwc/photos/0.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}]	0101000020E61000006D5166834CAF5F4020EBA9D557C54240
4.8	37.543061699999996	126.7274552	2026-02-16 19:10:50.52929	2026-03-17 20:45:18.35304	019c65ee-6e21-71c9-8f55-d7c940788c34	CAFE	ChIJE7GPmXCCfDURLXbNwyyJGvQ	640856958	코페아신드롬	[{"author": "Ho Cha (Klavis)", "rating": 5, "content": "커피가 무엇인지 알고 싶으면 꼭 방문 해야 하는 곳.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV9HKj9AyuHiuEWnoe9Y9BZIL20vauLJDQ8LUdDQhefMPi-elAozw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Jay-Q LEE", "rating": 5, "content": "이곳에 커피는 한국에서 유명하다는 조무래기들이 평가할 수 있는게 아니다! 집단으로 커피시장을 장악하고 있는 커피 사기꾼들아! 여기는 얼씬도 거리지말고, 한국 시스템에 억지로 합류시키려고 하지도 말고! 그냥 관심 좀 꺼줘라!\\n이곳에 커피는 품격자체가 천박한 한국커피시장의 그것과 비교할 수 없다! 감동 그 자체이니까! 이제 한국에서도 일본의 장인정신에 기반한 정말 좋은 커피를 마실 수 있어서 이곳 사장님께 감사할 뿐이다! 행복하다~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI6oxhQGpzgzoBvb1wK63sObyCGj9mHD9CrG0R32ttstYcD2Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "박진석", "rating": 5, "content": "심플하고 커피맛좋은 커피공방", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU388f7fSVA-bx8a3ertTqxOCdTekWfJ7sEJmxIw2wwXlbzADfc=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "소진섭 (voiceman)", "rating": 5, "content": "진정 커피를 좋아하는 마니아 라면\\n꼭 마셔봐야 하는 인생커피", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWHLuzWiI03I0emiCNZkacFcHrVgcTsEbM3GLmRszQ2POfnNJfFDA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "박정민", "rating": 5, "content": "커피도 맛있고 친절하시고 잘 알려 주십니다~!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK-gVthMy6jJiEK2Ua99RgW6n_TVPjSFk10CzygQ0B-IeyJ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "GeNiuS Park", "rating": 5, "content": "커피맛 최고!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXkmAG6Ma9aOJ_0VIUnTMN5LQEn-Y5J9WqqJRmKjbZTNvA_36M=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "양송이", "rating": 5, "content": "원두 괜찮음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWvNc8Vc32MuML1Det5-ZyIuhaQaDELjou0J5RbpaQHg7XnjA_B=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "순두", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWtczH8kc3FFo1Bd7zLw0INfxKgaq8tH2I94aL7Lc9guMxYZ8aK0g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJE7GPmXCCfDURLXbNwyyJGvQ/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJE7GPmXCCfDURLXbNwyyJGvQ/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJE7GPmXCCfDURLXbNwyyJGvQ/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJE7GPmXCCfDURLXbNwyyJGvQ/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [7, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [7, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [7, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [7, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [7, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [7, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [7, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000875341A08EAE5F40E69AB80B83C54240
4.6	37.3106237	126.8272915	2026-02-16 19:10:51.916934	2026-03-17 20:46:44.615885	019c65ee-738c-7515-bcb0-15526d696822	CAFE	ChIJ55Zh5CZvezURk5kQ3odS_1A	1458676036	포터블	[{"author": "damnstew", "rating": 5, "content": "연희에나 있을 것 같은 카페가 안산에 있는건 축복이지요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX9xd0IbhsGB9rGaRAgKWakcq-kVNvKk6W8YEInefbQ8by1NtvH=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Bora Hwang", "rating": 2, "content": "커피도 맛있고 디저트도 맛있는데 진짜 너무너무 추워요.\\n춥다고 말씀드렸든데 대응을 적극적으로 안해주십니다...\\n너무너무 추워요... 분위기 좋은데서 책좀 읽으려고 멀리서 와봤는데요.... 디저트랑 커피 남기고 15분 버티다가 나왔어요....\\n글고 포터블커피 옆에 크림커피라고 써주시면 좋을 것 같아요. 메뉴판 잘못 읽은 제 잘못도 있지만 아아인줄 알고 시켰다가 크림커피라 아아 추가 주문했어요. 근데 잘못 주문한 포터블커피도 진짜 맛있어요.\\n근데 진짜진짜진짜 추워요!!!!! .....", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKwYRQDv1bFj_FgqUGBQmCpTZxrdi_BQOiDuLJis2IRWpX6mg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Choi KY", "rating": 5, "content": "• 9/10\\n안산에서 이렇게 멋지게 운영되는 카페가 있을까..\\n디저트는 사장님이 직접 만드신다고 하여, 당일 판매 수량이 한정적인 부분이 어떻게보면 아쉽기도하면서 신뢰가 가는 부분..\\n\\n분위기로 만점주고 커피는 기대하지 않았으나, 필터까지 완벽하여 5점..\\n\\n혼자서 멍때리기며 마시기에 참 좋은 카페..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVZBduUZyTPXTbpwzmY2f5Dwqk0hbJL15OWV0ICS9IsSUTLpRA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "김채영", "rating": 5, "content": "제 최애 카페입니다!! 음료 디저트 메뉴 하나 빠짐없이 다 맛있어요ㅠㅠㅠ푸딩이랑 포터블 라떼는 꼭 드세요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJPqtDQOiZ4vCsQB4OOFpiYoK55b2Z_pdoFfn9o85FMIXIyQg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "뉴트리아;", "rating": 5, "content": "명명백백한 디저트의 왕", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWAXQSKRiUYCX5VrO1b-FrO99_cQX6XAGm3XVNjS5Tsq4bRY77XpQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "베어링", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXUQWhOycFInqVh2bDx0X2zLWkdHaUBM-ynZsT5gKbg-J5SSwLH=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "김민호", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIdaSHCYSviAMNf3mo05s74Bdv9NKh-OL3EL_8wKut7_d4r=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Jake", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL-k1e9vuFZUcBkQbo7g2VtRHIEDlj1aDES7bSetWRyf-PyIg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ55Zh5CZvezURk5kQ3odS_1A/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ55Zh5CZvezURk5kQ3odS_1A/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ55Zh5CZvezURk5kQ3odS_1A/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ55Zh5CZvezURk5kQ3odS_1A/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ55Zh5CZvezURk5kQ3odS_1A/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ55Zh5CZvezURk5kQ3odS_1A/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ55Zh5CZvezURk5kQ3odS_1A/photos/6.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [9, 30]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [9, 30]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}]	0101000020E610000090300C58F2B45F40676E7484C2A74240
