4.8	37.3678034	127.1567094	2026-03-17 20:45:23.423207	2026-03-17 20:45:23.423207	019cfb9d-69df-79c5-979b-85023ef71578	CAFE	ChIJ5cnoXS1XezUR3MmaKItFZzg	270511582	어웨이크(AWAKE)	[{"author": "MIN", "rating": 5, "content": "친구들과 급히 반려동물 동반 카페를 검색해 처음 갔습니다. 저희는 오늘 햇빛이 좋아 외부에 앉았는데 조용하고 은은하게 들리는 음악도 참 좋았습니다.\\n\\n차도 맛있고 소품 하나하나 정성을 들이시고 손님을 위한 배려가 눈에 보입니다. 사장님도 친근하고 좋으시네요. 혼자서라도 조용히 있고 싶을때 가끔 올것 같습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVr09uI3QBBgkMbdIubuxiYmAgq-0I9Aqn4riJjoHjpYGOVEbKJRw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Agent JK", "rating": 5, "content": "신현동 cafe AWAKE 커피랑 크로플?이 맛있었어요\\n다음 방문할땐 에그타르트 먹으러 가볼게요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLhcgUSXIw4f3erOIs3zueQwTqlVP-orOE1R-SV8Yn3k0-tHw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "이정희", "rating": 4, "content": "브런치와 커피.분식도 즐길수있는 곳\\n수제버거도 먹을만함", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKLm2UxA04yLSqk8t2t49kC_nlvgjdY9-1kjdRPIIFjpfbaug=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "김가연", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKuFqcyCPb23ddgoE7-8Y3omFF3vHsy3EJAg5xficSB2gy6yw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ5cnoXS1XezUR3MmaKItFZzg/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ5cnoXS1XezUR3MmaKItFZzg/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ5cnoXS1XezUR3MmaKItFZzg/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ5cnoXS1XezUR3MmaKItFZzg/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ5cnoXS1XezUR3MmaKItFZzg/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://mo