3.7	37.5415233	126.727835	2026-02-16 19:10:50.528023	2026-03-17 20:45:39.380486	019c65ee-6e20-7e0a-90b5-8e83b7a8120e	CAFE	ChIJyYLLVHeCfDURZmm5Mii7JP0	1367079155	브라운띠어리	[{"author": "Ny Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "계산역 2번출구에서 쭉내려와서 우측으로 꺽으면 얼마안가서 우측에 있는 건물! 2층에 있는데 간판 처음에 잘 안보여서 헷갈릴수도 있다 실내분위기 좋았다 고급진 느낌! 커피가 맛있다 원두도 다양하고 같이 먹은 크로와상도 맛있다 또 오고 싶다 화장실은 깜짝놀랐다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVFnulW5LDF0NPgGgvB6zxftkOz9hdpDwZ2vQmlamsXLVP2fA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "TEN", "rating": 5, "content": "밤이 되면 분위기가 더 좋아지는 카페입니다...!!\\n동네 카페는 거의 다 가봤는데 세 손가락 안에 들 것 같습니다\\n음료와 디저트도 정성이 들어가있고 식기나 인테리어 등 하나하나 신경을 쓰신 느낌이 팍팍 들어 좋았습니다...!!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWZFyUl3JZUCNIdH7bZIhqaP1SbdYfR1nFfOV68JHMgRDplmnYF=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "김은지", "rating": 5, "content": "와... 감동.. 들어가는 입구보고..  헛 잘못왓나 햇다가... 막상 들어가서 분위기에 한번 놀라고 커피맛에 두번 놀랫는데... 디저트 맛에 기절할뻔...\\n이가격할만한.. 그런집...", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXQeKt8gYOsH2pzU1hXhgjDYo8MrDVvuiC-zgyJK0hWyX_vpTXo=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "이동규", "rating": 4, "content": "콜드부르가 없는게 슬프지만... 좋았어요.\\n다만 2층 올라올때 문이 너무 어두워서 영업 안하시는줄 알았어요.\\n\\n응대도 괜찮으시고, 커피 마실줄 몰라서 맛은 모르겠지만 분위기 있고 좋아요.\\n\\n남자 두분계셨는데, 사장으로 보이신 분은 친절한 반면 직원으로 보이신 분은 너무 딱딱함 + 유들리하지가 않아서 좀 그랬어요..ㅠㅠ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW7iV-9JuXGcVjTuyHS711d4NfYNHNSWSmYlwHNmQUpEDO0kVy0=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "마루에띠", "rating": 4, "content": "카페위치가 잘 나타나있지않치만 핫플인듯 안으로 들어가면 사람이 많아요~분위기좋고 커피가 맛있어요\\n다만  화장실은...ㅠ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL1GHpknkZBQ7CUc3HnywC9OIfkuZ-jOtzW0kBq1Yl8ZNVmEw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "고구미", "rating": 1, "content": "인스타 감성에 취하신 사장님. 너무 재수없어서 다시는 재방문 의사 없습니다. 매출 잘 나오신다고 자랑하시던데 번창하세요🙏🙏🙏", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIJ2WPdIIqWhRAHEoaDRzI2nTXdozqjmxvHJSmMNGOz5hPepA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "elelelel lee", "rating": 1, "content": "전형적인 인스타 짤 방식의 응대. 메뉴판 숙지 하셔야 합니다 살면서 첨들어봄.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVJ-GCNwXtVXlAadciCLxMYpSH46GPI-hYoY_deS35JWo8oamNy=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "mylotte마이롯", "rating": 5, "content": "브라우니..너무맛있어요....", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUzOkUTKplPYp3VDBOEZ5_mTQEXb0t21XvqJzpn_C8mRSwAVF4f7A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJyYLLVHeCfDURZmm5Mii7JP0/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJyYLLVHeCfDURZmm5Mii7JP0/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJyYLLVHeCfDURZmm5Mii7JP0/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJyYLLVHeCfDURZmm5Mii7JP0/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [11, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [11, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [11, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [11, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [11, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [11, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000967840D994AE5F40D1C2AFA250C54240
5	37.4897396	126.8765303	2026-02-16 19:10:57.822904	2026-03-17 20:45:41.232906	019c65ee-8a9e-76a2-8787-6a228f2900a8	CAFE	ChIJdaC4HAWefDUROL-GEyvAzdA	1000640945	방다방로스터스	[{"author": "周炫성경애TV", "rating": 5, "content": "구로1동주민들 맛있는커피전문점 생겨 매우 좋아해요\\n브랜드유명한카페가도 디카페인커피가 없는 커피숍 많은데 메뉴도 다양하고 가격도 좋고 출퇴근시 동네지인들 모임과 가족모임하면서 구매해서 갑니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXFSQI-yCfze4iMZrtVvdLJLqPM6YOMFx63WqPDGjfLfzDY4fnb=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "신갑부", "rating": 5, "content": "훌륭한 커피맛만 놓고 본다면 위치는 참 아쉽다. 나만의 카페로 가둬두기보다는 이 맛을 많은 사람들이 나눴으면 하는 마음이다.\\n자리는 테이블 두개뿐이라 조용히 얘기하기엔 한계가 있다. 드립스페셜과 게이샤를 마셔보고 주저없이 원두도 구입함.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX-vVeF3sdCT0K9oIPIIFA438BcpA-Dj77_eodOrKJHPE-GaOXu=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJdaC4HAWefDUROL-GEyvAzdA/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJdaC4HAWefDUROL-GEyvAzdA/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJdaC4HAWefDUROL-GEyvAzdA/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJdaC4HAWefDUROL-GEyvAzdA/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJdaC4HAWefDUROL-GEyvAzdA/photos/4.png"}]	[]	0101000020E6100000FF1C8B1219B85F402FC786C9AFBE4240
4.5	37.5456217	126.7306567	2026-02-16 19:10:50.528275	2026-03-17 20:45:50.632693	019c65ee-6e20-7e0a-90b6-16a8e7ebe1aa	CAFE	ChIJTS5EKGWCfDUR18Tc4fI4Q9A	183978059	오늘같은날에	[{"author": "sunghyun woo", "rating": 5, "content": "케잌 맛집이에요. 너무 맛있었어요!\\n딸기우유케잌 강추강추\\n가게 분위기도 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUYrwbxwFHFCKOu3fsYms0dS8XDtCFXX4vWNzhgX9kGYloZNRC85w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "원동찬", "rating": 5, "content": "근처에서 맛있다고해서 여친데려왔는데..\\n내가다먹음..\\n앉아있으면서 케익 포장하러가시는분들 있었는데\\n다 단골인것같았음\\n딸기케익진짜 미쳤음..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL-9BiTEh1sNel0TGDkWxfBwZFxZ5z8NbbGsgsI02uUspH6XQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Yem 2", "rating": 4, "content": "동네 치곤 디저트 가격이 쎈 편이지만\\n커피랑 분위기가 괜찮아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKVJ-BbvTSL4RzN90dvkmjnTAusqDfAaWVvFH36wUfhep8uPA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "예니", "rating": 4, "content": "평일 낮에 방문하면 세상 조용한 힐링을 느낄수있는 카페", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUVupfxfp1CR4xmG0uuEr5TyVL0btprJxjWfSkt24mpetRq02px=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "고지혜", "rating": 5, "content": "여긴 무조건 가야함! 사장님도 연예인급으로 예쁘시고, 공간도 사장님닮아 아기자기 예쁘게 꾸며졌어요. 계양도서관 맞은편 핫플이에요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVitiQTIdV1VTOyFMKMtUi1DLaU3oLRDm0d53NRulTxbhDvgUHnAg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Sungtae Lim", "rating": 5, "content": "시그니처는 투데이비엔나랑 투데이 쉐이크가 있어요.\\n\\n커피는 아메리카노 기준 3,500원이라 저렴한 편이고\\n\\n여기 디저트는 꼭 드셔야해요.\\n\\n수제로 만드시는데\\n\\n베이커리 맛집 뺨치게 맛있거든요.\\n\\n​케이크들 비주얼도 장난 아니에요.\\n\\n이런 예쁜 홀케이크 생일에 선물받으면 넘 기쁠 거 같아요.\\n인테리어도 예쁘고 음료나 디저트도 퀄리티 좋아요.\\n\\n도서관에 갔다가 머리아플 때 나와가지고\\n\\n당충전하고 가면 넘 좋을 거 같아요.\\n\\n도서관 앞에 있는 카페 세 개 중에 젤 좋아하는 곳!!\\n\\n추천해용!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUeVgbihvKjgS5J2EOqdgrXcts4BhGkuyz1DLAA5siopjmsrYTfQg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "마루에띠", "rating": 5, "content": "우리동네 카페중 전체적인 음료와 커피가 굉장히 퀄리티있는곳이에요~디저트도 넘 맛있고 음료가 맛도 좋은데 이쁘기까지해서 너무 좋아요~^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL1GHpknkZBQ7CUc3HnywC9OIfkuZ-jOtzW0kBq1Yl8ZNVmEw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "완두동부병아리", "rating": 5, "content": "반지하인데 햇볕 잘 들어와서 어둡지 않고 밝아요. 특히 사장님이 친절해요. 케익 티 커피 먹었는데 좋네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXhEtWkxKI-40E0W0oTtwX7OgchphZQVrfR2cAuGtKxcGkOVxr6=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJTS5EKGWCfDUR18Tc4fI4Q9A/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJTS5EKGWCfDUR18Tc4fI4Q9A/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJTS5EKGWCfDUR18Tc4fI4Q9A/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJTS5EKGWCfDUR18Tc4fI4Q9A/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJTS5EKGWCfDUR18Tc4fI4Q9A/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJTS5EKGWCfDUR18Tc4fI4Q9A/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}]	0101000020E61000009CC65114C3AE5F4074BE8EEED6C54240
4.8	37.347270699999996	126.94753929999999	2026-02-16 19:10:57.823048	2026-03-17 20:46:13.283269	019c65ee-8a9f-7864-8e70-9919e7ac9a97	CAFE	ChIJAfNhwJ5nezURG_5j8cEOLi0	1853032968	네세네	[{"author": "박용한 (하나여지)", "rating": 5, "content": "맛있어요 작지만 알찬 빵이 종류도 많고 맛있고 많이 알리고 싶습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXTFB7gHia6_OnbskLwrIecASEwxYDD78ZcsWNQIwfxPBg16F7W1Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "HJ Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "정말 맛있네요! 직접 가본 건 아니고 아시는 분이 주셔서 먹어봤는데, 여기 디저트 맛집 인정입니다!!! 너무 맛있어서 직접 가보려고요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU2GHRf6rMuVZYqWc72a7xG3uUnukbOkJAWkUMzfgb1JTj39VVr=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "JongHwan OH", "rating": 4, "content": "단맛의 컨트롤을 잘 하시는 것 같습니다.\\n강렬한 단맛을 싫어하시는 분들은 매우 좋을 것 같습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWnJ0TpyLvxiAhk0XV-Qko4YomUKG7JxS15CarmBS0WXeVe9xM=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "moon Red (저고리)", "rating": 5, "content": "주차공간 없음. 식탁 몇개없는 작은 카페.\\n디저트는 진짜 맛있다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX3cOHGyClCzZaNLcpvLC4Bs47p5sbk00_Gm4K1Mr2xwZoH6-Fvwg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "박영섭", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLrwYHigqsHrBo6djq5Hb5DGuGe6d9w-vi1-cvCFhS_UhI6_Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "Moonsun Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXbi8EKcnxc_nUSmNbQA8CNcWEnHNrlLFvQabiKzamvG9d-7iCaCA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "늘처음처럼", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVrqXaCfm0x8D0GNMryVnGR5gxo7AqlAePUHHuqScmcPr-flbXV=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "Wonil Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXGXm3Wv9j2ilbTAWPGtI9MhAIxzaCUkVIGFTG4e-sQaJgToUYAAg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJAfNhwJ5nezURG_5j8cEOLi0/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJAfNhwJ5nezURG_5j8cEOLi0/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJAfNhwJ5nezURG_5j8cEOLi0/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJAfNhwJ5nezURG_5j8cEOLi0/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJAfNhwJ5nezURG_5j8cEOLi0/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJAfNhwJ5nezURG_5j8cEOLi0/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJAfNhwJ5nezURG_5j8cEOLi0/photos/6.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}]	0101000020E61000002E4BE07BA4BC5F40F4ADC55D73AC4240
4.6	37.5634983	126.9837446	2026-03-17 20:49:07.056714	2026-03-17 20:49:07.056714	019cfba0-d370-72eb-8508-7829bb199aab	CAFE	ChIJX7hgM_CifDURUA_5T_TDnKs	26420764	배롱나무 카페	[{"author": "연Lotus", "rating": 4, "content": "시내 한복판에 이런곳이 있는게 신기합니다.  오랜만에 방문했는데 야외테라스는 막았네요.  12~3월까지 막는다고 하네요.  가격도 저렴하고  조용해서 명동에서  가무와 함께 선호하는  장소입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVcDXNbhbiotIKi6H8894XI1cB749QA_1533KeBfKhh-dFyzYf2=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "YJ YANG", "rating": 5, "content": "찾아가기 어렵지만 한적하고 여유롭게 커피한잔 할 수 있는 아주 훌륭한 곳!\\n가격도 싼데 커피맛도 훌륭!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVzKIp-WfreAATBdM_CQBgrrc9RhnrBK0897eTQjvNAInNsNdWUMg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "Min Jun", "rating": 4, "content": "커피는 조금 별로지만 저렴하고 혼잡하지 않아서 좋아요. 12층 옥상에 야외자리도 있어서 경치도 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXydYKBenCirBoHxbiG1L4hA2-0vNLb7gsU4uJL59iThoVOuxb-=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "사막의오아시스", "rating": 5, "content": "명동 유네스코 빌딩 옥상에 있는 카페...\\n아는 사람만 아는... 여유있는 카페인데, 여름에 옥상 야외 식탁은 낭만도 있음.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUp1scYKQHw8qmicWFcKTrbOiO4AMNRXKCKcGT5BzCt1KPc4zm_=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "YUNTAE KIM", "rating": 4, "content": "여긴 히든 플레이스라서 별로 소개하고 싶지 않음. ㅎㅎ..  봄.가을에 좋아요.  겨울엔 밖에 못 나갑니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX0WkpdLmhaLkpXYnMMgY2h7JMhBm-9rc4VmcXe1UPLlrCP3-1D=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "김민영 (미녀잉)", "rating": 5, "content": "빨리 가을이 와 다시 와서 밖에 앉아 선선한 바름을 봤으면 하는 곳이었어여🙃 밤에 와도 예쁠 거 같아여", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXw37JaaiLeOapZD4rd5EEfFFmxAuhV4R33aupmcN7UUIeWhCQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Byung-jun Yang", "rating": 5, "content": "아는 사람만 간다는 카페 좋았습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK-E2kjuyQ2itjxH3AjFjwxj7jbN-_EdWAEKWvnpda311n2ug=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "오프로", "rating": 5, "content": "옥상정원에서 커피를 친구와 한잔 했습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLXr_LBdUM6uSdFq3dana4GmwUCIOByzMRD5_lIlkFjoqN0aF0=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX7hgM_CifDURUA_5T_TDnKs/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX7hgM_CifDURUA_5T_TDnKs/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX7hgM_CifDURUA_5T_TDnKs/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}]	0101000020E61000007627E9ABF5BE5F4001ED58B620C84240
4.6	37.5652925	126.673593	2026-02-16 19:10:50.528739	2026-03-17 20:46:16.879173	019c65ee-6e20-7e0a-90b8-e57b7dc72a88	CAFE	ChIJ66isdaKBfDURdO_nD6y3DXo	911164965	디저트39 검암경서점	[{"author": "울산고래", "rating": 4, "content": "녹차 도쿄롤을 사와서 먹어 봤습니다!\\n카페 빵이라 조금 비싸긴 하지만 오늘 하루 고생한 나에게 한 번쯤 맛있는 걸 투자하고 싶다 하시면 드시는 거 추천 드려요!\\n안에 있는 아이스크림(?), 치즈(?)가 달지 않고 담백해서 마음에 들었습니다 ㅎㅎ\\n나중에 다른 메뉴도 사러 가보려구요😆", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXAwgzDM8dJ3j9gVvVnZzLqLEsu4UB3TqbqfpVTDwBRCo3VfPbR=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "밀크초파", "rating": 5, "content": "맛있고 컵도 이쁘고 케익도 맛있어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWQ3DXtAVxnVA5DWMOSrT5WJg_WUcyk0oiqWoIN3i5NF21secJU=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Crogs", "rating": 4, "content": "옥수수빵 맛집", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU6ruRTWZWDdKxsLlHcCxgod7XXeFljRgwXiFLtj0vDnlTNCgRH=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "MJ YOON", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJN-8s3FQ4BOFY-MX5OwwbeRjTlOf0QQfqMc6xcNkH1wDwKEyeg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "soon", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX0gcY8QiwfivBTPOLPGba0rQr5S3VXcJItKZIlhF3_i_gvcLmW=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Jayden", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ9AJ3jQeVJ4R6RdCuOgf6Y05avBWSyDJguSVCQ8LTUulDm7w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "송선희", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUMJGtc0CU3nwPXD-_aFxPVi6FRAEhS8dYdMaHI-_1JjcBAsv2K=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "하치야치나미", "rating": 3, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI7UeRJ_pCR-xEBrCjny07OqxweWRqWOFZRlIl7TdpYnenz81w=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ66isdaKBfDURdO_nD6y3DXo/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ66isdaKBfDURdO_nD6y3DXo/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ66isdaKBfDURdO_nD6y3DXo/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000002174D0251CAB5F40481630815BC84240
