4	37.4956178	126.8734441	2026-02-16 19:10:57.822381	2026-03-17 20:49:04.838822	019c65ee-8a9e-76a2-8783-cc0c00ce75ef	CAFE	ChIJH_CfdsKffDUR9AVB9T8t8z4	1988799836	컴포즈커피 구일역점	[{"author": "SANGDON LIM", "rating": 4, "content": "가성비 최고 좋은 커피집..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVpw9Gi8PB45nIaa3r43TpQUR3ixEH7La-oie-nANZVC68k5cgKAQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJH_CfdsKffDUR9AVB9T8t8z4/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJH_CfdsKffDUR9AVB9T8t8z4/photos/1.png"}]	[]	0101000020E610000096181582E6B75F406128716770BF4240
5	37.5363432	127.0886927	2026-02-16 19:10:56.551864	2026-03-17 20:49:07.046122	019c65ee-85a7-7da2-bebe-716c83577ed0	CAFE	ChIJ77R2Pm6lfDURDDgRdP1lI8I	1001473965	노티드 구의역	[{"author": "이혜옥", "rating": 5, "content": "김여사와 자매님들 데이트! 노티드 오랜만~ 도넛이랑 커피랑 너무 맛있네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIcSTQiyCFYo4fSupaN6xzIgeDp1P6Y4PF1Yr3dpb6NvPk_=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Sohee Sun", "rating": 5, "content": "도넛 종류가 다양해서 좋아요 저는 우유크림이 제일 맛있었고 커피도 괜찮네요\\n귀여운 굿즈가 많아서 구경할 재미가 있어요\\n매장이 청결하게 잘 유지되는 것 같네요!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLEZkm6ufU2O7ikaQ5uYmOMtxLwItVD6K8OuPN8pProjrOhkA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "김하영", "rating": 5, "content": "구의역 근처라 접근성도 좋고 매장 분위기가 예쁘고 따뜻해서 좋네요 ㅎㅎ 직원분들도 친절하시고.\\n도넛은 노티드가 제일 맛있는 거 같아요! 지점마다 맛 차이도 없고 수준 너무 높고 좋아요 ^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ_vnC_JN6PaCYq2eEHkkkghIoaafualSsiBg-4xubJrbGLlw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "배소저", "rating": 5, "content": "매장도 깔끔하고 직원분들도 친절하셨어요\\n노티드 도넛 좋아하는데 항상 도넛을 먹음직스럽게 만들고 맛도 있어서 신제품 혹은 콜라보 제품 나오면 항상 가서 먹어보거나 포장해서 먹네요~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ3e8GEcZY1cyNkJy-hqfpkue6CMtG_zwFZL0l8l1tc5chmAg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "호박", "rating": 5, "content": "매장도 깨끗하고 도넛도 넘 맛있어요>_<", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL6iIEvcoTfKyTyP1-m_O73CC6_X4pMUkvxvqfsw0gAdF5vCA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "KSY", "rating": 5, "content": "신메뉴 라이스 도넛 추천해용~ 쌀도넛은 처음인데 쫄깃하면서 부드러운 크림이 너무 잘어울려요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKM7_zqx2_FoPA5JKHvEsRYiX3BR-vUsaGxfM-xSiodn9NR7mE=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "hapapa ia", "rating": 5, "content": "매장도 너무너무 이쁘고 다양한 도넛들도 있고\\n소금빵도 안에 버터 동굴도 완전 완벽해요 ㅜㅠ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJZbzV2OKpH0n_3vJQ7-YEZglZUDMB3yqai9bKX5XrA428_sD8=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "김혜정", "rating": 5, "content": "노티드 너무 좋아요 ㅎㅎ빵이 폭신하면서 부드럽고 크림이 그득한데 안느끼해서 맛있습니다 시즌마다 새로운 메뉴가 다양하게 나와서 새로운 맛나올때마다 꼭 가요 ㅎㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIf2yHQ5jJ43eoikYTmfkn8q9YeuZUrrPrY-Sw-9QXULT3zpg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ77R2Pm6lfDURDDgRdP1lI8I/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ77R2Pm6lfDURDDgRdP1lI8I/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ77R2Pm6lfDURDDgRdP1lI8I/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ77R2Pm6lfDURDDgRdP1lI8I/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ77R2Pm6lfDURDDgRdP1lI8I/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ77R2Pm6lfDURDDgRdP1lI8I/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ77R2Pm6lfDURDDgRdP1lI8I/photos/6.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E610000036792524ADC55F404BB7DBE4A6C44240
4.8	37.5435969	126.9734246	2026-02-16 19:11:04.954388	2026-03-17 20:49:57.710625	019c65ee-a67a-7815-b141-dc0e50747879	CAFE	ChIJHx3sFgCjfDURpv-rTpfpVIw	350196267	틸데	[{"author": "HANA LEE", "rating": 4, "content": "2층 위치. 올라가기 전까지는 이런 분위기와 느낌의 공간인지 알지 못했음. 평일 늦은 시간까지도 테이블이 꽉 찰 정도였고, 2-4인 모임하기 괜찮음. 1인 1메뉴 주문 필요/빙수는 2인 메뉴임. 실타래 빙수는 귀엽게 나오고 보들보들 맛있음. 연유 뿌리지 않으면 너무 달지 않아 좋음. 바스크케잌도 괜찮음. 다만, 디저트 가격이 밥값만큼은 생각해야함. 커피&와인 이라 마지막 주문 밤 10시까지, 10시 반 이후까지 오픈.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX0NW7e0ZIfOHlaoV2ozdBLhNNb-rfoIeVtghywDKpxnpMN-KxE=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "알구스", "rating": 5, "content": "빙수가 먹고싶어 방문한 가게\\n말차와 밀크티맛이 있고 우리는 말차맛으로!\\n진하고 맛있었다. 토핑도 다양하고\\n\\n다른 빵메뉴나 음료 메뉴도 맛있어보이는 게 많아서 다음에는 다른 걸 먹으러 한 번 와봐야겠다.\\n\\n저녁에는 와인도 판매하는 듯! 가볍게 커피든 술이든 한 잔 하러 오기 좋을법한 곳이었다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWz3sJDAWOAy09fpul1oWXJorjSW_FtlkxEEUtzeAud45zso8o0Yg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "marie Marie", "rating": 5, "content": "Super gemütliches Café/Bar! Sehr leckerer Matcha 🤩", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLrgZieqcdClvGQETetVliREqQ8sKBSQ3AOlGRih7qgfT3Ahw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Hye Jeong Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "very trendy and cozy cafe\\n\\nI ordered matcha cream latte which was really good.\\n\\nThey do cafe until 7pm and bar after that.\\nThey had a projector to show some cute videos and music.\\n\\nI think it is a cool place to come with friends or a partner.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXr4rP8hry9M74cqC16nJNZOZJUyvVPHey1-8Lr1AIo-VDsamE=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Jack Fitzhenry", "rating": 5, "content": "Great wine and atmosphere too", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKGwePUWCt-fMlSvl1AD5N76J8gjjYw98KXEwXkZ8ZDeRS2fg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Cherry", "rating": 5, "content": "ฉันมาเกาหลีหลายครั้งแล้ว และก็ได้ลองมัทฉะมาหลายร้านมาก แต่บอกตรง ๆ ว่าไม่มีที่ไหนเทียบร้านนี้ได้เลย นี่คือมัทฉะที่ดีที่สุดที่ฉันเคยดื่มในเกาหลี รสชาติกลมกล่อม เข้มข้น และสมดุลมาก\\n\\nบรรยากาศของร้านก็ดีมาก มู้ดของร้านสวย อบอุ่น และผ่อนคลาย เป็นร้านที่อยากนั่งชิล ๆ แล้วค่อย ๆ ดื่มมัทฉะ\\n\\nสำหรับฉัน ที่นี่คือร้านมัทฉะอันดับ 1 ในเกาหลีเลย ไว้ครั้งหน้าถ้ามาเกาหลี ฉันจะกลับมาอีกแน่นอนค่ะ 🍵✨\\n\\nI’ve been to Korea many times and have tried matcha at so many places but honestly nothing compares to this one. This is by far the best matcha I’ve had in Korea. The flavor is rich, smooth  and perfectly balanced.\\n\\nThe atmosphere of the shop is also amazing — the mood is beautiful, cozy, and very relaxing. It’s the kind of place where you just want to sit and enjoy your drink.\\n\\nDefinitely my number one matcha spot in Korea. I will absolutely come back agian.🥰", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIcV00PVcPorU2cfrit0aJPRtUbcVIdzDBOWCo0-_tqCnnrfw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJHx3sFgCjfDURpv-rTpfpVIw/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJHx3sFgCjfDURpv-rTpfpVIw/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJHx3sFgCjfDURpv-rTpfpVIw/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [11, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [11, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [11, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [11, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [11, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [11, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000CD87B1964CBE5F407