4.2	37.500901	126.86624049999999	2026-02-16 19:10:57.82182	2026-03-17 20:49:09.038512	019c65ee-8a9d-74b6-91ca-2cade2330125	CAFE	ChIJ78TLMqedfDURyolDeOM8yx8	2041426645	투썸플레이스 동양미래대점	[{"author": "Aaron So", "rating": 5, "content": "커피 맛 나쁘지 않다.\\n커피 분위기 좋다.\\n비즈니스 미팅하기도 좋다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVxsHWBogiN3lRx1yj2le2udh6pz2rMNC-8nPLZVneWtvYZHvT-=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "sj p", "rating": 1, "content": "두 시간 이용 제한 안내 방송으로도 모자랐는지 점주 같은 직원이 두 시간 넘으면 나가라고 고래고래 소리 치면서 매장 돌아다니는데, 시끄럽고 불쾌했음. 콘서트 있는 날이라 그런 건지 원래 그런 건진 모름.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVAP2-a4CnswwuEDBu-hdhgYB0D_qzS1XnWrc6VJyjnPQYxMyc=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "SANGDON LIM", "rating": 4, "content": "동양미래대학교 옆이라 젊음과 활기가 넘치는 카페입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVpw9Gi8PB45nIaa3r43TpQUR3ixEH7La-oie-nANZVC68k5cgKAQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "김태웅", "rating": 4, "content": "실내 인테리어나 깔끔하고 2층도있어서 편해요\\n알바님들 친절하고 이렇게 친절한데 처음봤어요.\\n바쁘신가운데 대답도 잘해주시고요.\\n다만 시끄럽게 떠드시는분들이 있어서 1층은 조끔시끄러웠습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVXNzIaYozu-qjZWKz0m6VEy3kMLkIJ3tYZ_4ek5xByvjHh_F2E=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "한나", "rating": 4, "content": "아메리카노가 맛있지요~~\\n케이크도 초코생크이 젤 맛있어요^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWjtoJrsJVYJre-fd7b6HJt83u-vq2o8ZjQaB-__SxymvaKJB1b=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "유승민", "rating": 5, "content": "타 투썸에 비해서 층고도 높고 1,2층 있어서 엄청 넓습니다!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKlOsAh-2kzQz8Be_tE2R0b9kCnBUXzmJqo-isKFowdBuoiPw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Leonard Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "오픈한지 얼마안되서 깨끗하고 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUw5K6nnpTMwqgm95Pu2_SC4LKEgcnLbXYb_1kPg7WKVBWZpCiM=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "송은경", "rating": 4, "content": "카페 2층 엄청추움", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVaTeLfL-TTYOJhuhgV2UMT4hM4ZgiN432XtE6vUzt-QHUWw5aQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ78TLMqedfDURyolDeOM8yx8/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ78TLMqedfDURyolDeOM8yx8/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ78TLMqedfDURyolDeOM8yx8/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ78TLMqedfDURyolDeOM8yx8/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ78TLMqedfDURyolDeOM8yx8/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ78TLMqedfDURyolDeOM8yx8/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ78TLMqedfDURyolDeOM8yx8/photos/6.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E61000001F7EFE7B70B75F4050C422861DC04240
4.5	37.3622224	126.9415293	2026-02-16 19:11:01.216816	2026-03-17 20:49:10.33448	019c65ee-97e0-70ec-8eb7-0690832a62ea	CAFE	ChIJ0a4A0QpnezURBlnq4Y9g3n8	1314725041	이디야 금정신환사거리점	[{"author": "gs shin (momo98)", "rating": 1, "content": "다른 곳에서  드세요!\\n본사 레시피데로 하시는지 궁금합니다 진짜,,,,,이데아는  끝인가 봅니다\\n납득이 않가는  맛입니다\\n커피전문점인데  개인적으로 대충  만드는 느낌이  납니다\\n뭘  마시고 화가나기는 처음 입니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKWAhDuomkG8558uO7bhGuFYWq2Nb9N4mdZ4xEiQSEvVEcrzg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Youngseok Jang", "rating": 5, "content": "아직은 유명하지 않아 조용한 카페.\\n분위기 좋고 커피가 빨리나와서 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXUypWeS6wsPmigO2HYcC20nceJ6mt7ofkIzI5mzBlVtuEIZQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Oliver Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "신환사거리에 있어요.^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWLtqQK1hojpGZirXpXA6nllkgDKF6ajKxwj1Lf5RrP7shveEF4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "귀한비", "rating": 5, "content": "금정역 에 있는 이디아 매장보단 전 이곳 매장이 더 감각적인 멋이 있어  좋왔어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUV9XyDIJDXf8iyBo6ZAO7lRkE-Axq31kg-h70X8BNUmC7z4KoD=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "조창현", "rating": 5, "content": "한번 테이크 아웃을 해보았어요\\n인테리어 잘되었요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLi0nS6nGTLKzJ7AZo7KgLvLCnt9kk6igg4tY9n68MDBp0sAA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "박호성", "rating": 5, "content": "친절하고 깨끗함 주차자리없음 그밖엔 일반적인 이디야", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXx8VcqXjsoQjQVTeVfF4p-A3FWCGwrHmmWD_uBPnGnVHPJ7TU0=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "김법린", "rating": 5, "content": "군포교구 533구역 모임 끝나고 바로 귀가", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWlFxbZxqi_mvo5uLmy4QiB8LblhKUbCYLsO3pfrdEb0cXPOqs=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "빈정화", "rating": 5, "content": "갈때마다 항상 친절하세요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ-Dsv-KTyC0O191eDtXgoesNsy5Mlr408Z8CmvfVhT3C5iWw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ0a4A0QpnezURBlnq4Y9g3n8/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ0a4A0QpnezURBlnq4Y9g3n8/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ0a4A0QpnezURBlnq4Y9g3n8/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ0a4A0QpnezURBlnq4Y9g3n8/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ0a4A0QpnezURBlnq4Y9g3n8/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ0a4A0QpnezURBlnq4Y9g3n8/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E610000073EE1B0442BC5F4077F0B84D5DAE4240
