"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUVoUm2F4-RCHDt2Xom3iVWhw2E7CsIlYrdP2OyGjKXmaS7FBs=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Jiyeon Bae", "rating": 5, "content": "커피 맛있고 채식메뉴 있음.\\n공간은 작지만 책 보면서 머물고 싶은 곳.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWvLLXyj2uPMqXMtsysl9hrIFufarDuSIVSRtmzK3eQ8v3WHJs6=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJaW2GWNWZfDUR56iR0AqltbM/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJaW2GWNWZfDUR56iR0AqltbM/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJaW2GWNWZfDUR56iR0AqltbM/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJaW2GWNWZfDUR56iR0AqltbM/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000ABA289C10DBC5F409CB2E43B42C64240
4.5	37.6202209	126.8217658	2026-02-16 19:11:20.11185	2026-03-17 20:55:10.265006	019c65ee-e1af-7324-a796-4e7d6b3d6fc2	CAFE	ChIJwajIGvmafDURrT_BZ-uQDPU	1195110374	아도르	[{"author": "신미경", "rating": 4, "content": "넓은 공간~~\\n컵 뚜껑에 귀여운 캐릭터를 그려 주셔 즐거움을 주셨어요\\n커피도 맛났어요~~^^\\n이번엔 딸기라떼 ~~\\n상큼달큼 ~넘 달지 않게 맛난~~^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWA-4vHAKR3XRRUfbCxxMAhWjkN6R8JqH0FKcPMYOshfc1I4an5=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "Willy J", "rating": 5, "content": "편하고,\\n친절하시고,\\n넓고,\\n안락하다.\\n주인분께서 음악하시는 분인듯ㅎㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVlNWH-2D9CdwxXCU8AI_RBADNxQug7nPVKwuq6_qsYesw4w71v=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "김대회", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님 친절함. 서비스도 정말 좋음.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK-bNqeOkpspN974NJp_iuqUjN6ea7MGONPZmkmTxv2j0Dtew=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "J호랑", "rating": 5, "content": "교회1층 커피집\\n내부가 생각보다 넓음\\n커피맛 좋음\\n조용하게 쉬었다 가기 좋음\\n\\n- 주차는 건물앞 3대정도?\\n- 화장실 남여 따로 1칸씩\\n- 디저트 메뉴 있음\\n- 작업 하는사람들 많은편", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK3ewRzQqkpMYsiFQWFmhjN5cxpHKcmCZhV34KD4Guvsj1CPA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "최정규", "rating": 4, "content": "테이블이 붙어있지 않고 어느 정도 공간도 확보되어 있어서 답답하지 않고 좋습니다. 커피도 무난하고 직원분들도 친절하네요..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ9BqxOvJWVrF7jb-jMhfyjXd63CCr6PlLy3Uupp6CqaW8S=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "이재혜 (에스더 재혜)", "rating": 5, "content": "공간 이 여유롭고 조용하여 커피마시기 에 아주좋은 장소입니다 아도르 케이크도 아주 맛있어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL6-9VuqHzRMO-ndC6JG4_8uM5cD8ae0RhYzgU_AJbfc-ieDg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "양태현", "rating": 5, "content": "친구 추천으로 라떼먹었어요\\n라떼 잘 안먹는데 맛있네요\\n실내 인테리어도 좋습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWrb3FQcNaYN7XKmFd5aseUxL_LKHyBzJE8_yXYoVuu_UUf_5IstA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "윤은숙", "rating": 5, "content": "커피맛있어요\\n치즈케잌도 맛있고요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLHtMJjV7-eJy93g2d5AZjunJmIDW19cbmOx-QhZIuRQ-kNOw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJwajIGvmafDURrT_BZ-uQDPU/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJwajIGvmafDURrT_BZ-uQDPU/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJwajIGvmafDURrT_BZ-uQDPU/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJwajIGvmafDURrT_BZ-uQDPU/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E610000029FE94CF97B45F40D9E5006663CF4240
4.1	37.6457611	127.0491744	2026-02-16 19:11:15.3192	2026-03-17 20:54:06.996697	019c65ee-cef7-76b9-91cd-d364496aa555	CAFE	ChIJX35Cwm25fDURp5TwCyZg42U	1560924093	카페녹천	[{"author": "Jiyoung Yoo", "rating": 5, "content": "커피한잔의 여유, 퇴근시간 즈음에는\\n조용하고 좋았어요. 맛있는 커피는 덤!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWhmYpKycdiVUCbTglyDcdTZi1_fA6Gm5suLwPh0G0e6F9Krhil=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "잭잭", "rating": 5, "content": "음료도 맛있고 빵도 식감이 좋아서\\n자주 이용하는 카페녹천", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVk8SCEEhJFqcn0a0YBqG6N5LP6BTmt78dDfheDjBx_fgXo-3k=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "김진호", "rating": 5, "content": "커피 빵 다 너무 맛있어요 매장 분위기도 좋고 커피맛이 진짜 좋음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIWVeWt6zpOq5zNSpJiZqAdtjAsasa6y5UI_R7qX8povraA9A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "엄룡이", "rating": 1, "content": "아저씨가 매우 불친절함. 짜증나서 그냥 들고나왔음. 아침부터 기분잡치네.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUy4nNH7S_qj7KavrCK2D1Z7NDvvU6LYMo7goyhvVV5B9_j2moD=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "두더지", "rating": 5, "content": "빵도 맛있으며 자주 생각나는 카페입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLAT3IrdoiPmgT6KzNPG0aMgjNRnF7-vL_PINe8qTAmWZVNZQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "운소요", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWCV_nvG-IKjFgp5ESKwKQEc17wICy5GMtsbvrIR8kANGnHG_Y=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "karaaa", "rating": 3, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWC42NE7OtnVJjxY4kxR6xaKhgSf_58RTKgbiLj_ikEYWz50C4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "윤해경", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK541Nlam9J5CHY4ZpUPLgl1Vhl1NNSnEXYF1rIcKBlfBXZhA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX35Cwm25fDURp5TwCyZg42U/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX35Cwm25fDURp5TwCyZg42U/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX35Cwm25fDURp5TwCyZg42U/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX35Cwm25fDURp5TwCyZg42U/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX35Cwm25fDURp5TwCyZg42U/photos/4.png"}]	[]	0101000020E61000003AF361AC25C35F40B6C3BA4CA8D24240
4.7	37.5482574	126.9397899	2026-02-16 19:11:15.31941	2026-03-17 20:54:09.041934	019c65ee-cef7-76b9-91cf-91759de63db8	CAFE	ChIJQQY2OMGZfDURYOVuuIYB5N0	130687423	나이스워크투데이	[{"author": "Libby Yu", "rating": 5, "content": "넓지만 아늑한 느낌이 있는 작업공간 겸 카페인 나이스워크투데이 입니다. 새로 생긴 건물에 위치해서 깨끗하고, 화장실도 청결해요.\\n\\n필터 커피 원두 셀렉션도 좋고, 낮에는 경의선숲길 방향 통창이 전부 열려있어서 뻥뚫린 뷰 보면서 작업할 수 있는 멋진 공간이었습니다.\\n\\n문열어놓고 에어컨 바람 쐬는 호사를 이곳에서 누리네요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLB9iKvwPqBY6b8cku2kX7JEArF3CecJj8dmGRBs54iAz6-_FVd=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Oli", "rating": 5, "content": "사람들이 멋져요, 특히 보라색 스웨터 입은 사람들요! 🟣그리고 일하기 좋고, 테이크아웃 커피가 맛있어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJAmVn-Z1AAr-rKz69TQQCKjhUjyeHO_LzsfrQJCcGt2Aw2Vg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Winnie Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "손님 90% 가 노트북 펼쳐놓고 있는 카공까페입니다\\n통창문에 높은 천고로 내부 쾌적,\\n원두 선택가능,\\n라떼와 구움과자 매우 훌륭한맛", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVhzhQW1FdGmnelxvHGisYunF8vZ9RefAjqUXXjvMNXNPknGlhi9g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Sam Nam", "rating": 4, "content": "음악선곡좋음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUdLJZQ-pra_Pjyfotp7ygUCwoguM7n5EIPU5Ye5b5RogSL_yJa6Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Kyuwon Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "Lovely coffee shop, laptop-friendly, with beautiful park view and ample natural lights.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXaWeGyhSV_BgmNibtSj5KWDhWCdRw70TGYXCHmFpBp26yk57qx=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Jy Lee", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLhDojeOliBo39RHpEW9KXU1tVOFEUzr3ID92A1HQ1SXy32UQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJQQY2OMGZfDURYOVuuIYB5N0/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJQQY2OMGZfDURYOVuuIYB5N0/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJQQY2OMGZfDURYOVuuIYB5N0/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJQQY2OMGZfDURYOVuuIYB5N0/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJQQY2OMGZfDURYOVuuIYB5N0/photos/4.png"}]	[]	0101000020E61000001C67898425BC5F401E65694C2DC64240
4.5	37.5148586	127.11095399999999	2026-02-16 19:12:00.779837	2026-03-17 20:54:24.401134	019c65ef-808b-7159-9724-fc7802c0a2d3	CAFE	ChIJK3j43PGlfDURcMdYVcAir98	1197446070	포모르	[{"author": "임예람", "rating": 3, "content": "☕️ 메뉴\\n• 아인슈패너 6.5\\n• 아인슈패너 크림이 비주얼과 다르게 그냥 생크림 느낌이라 아쉬웠어용. 라떼 맛도 쏘쏘..ㅎ\\n• 퀄리티도 아쉽고가격도 6,500원이라서 가성비도 많이 아쉽네용🥲\\n\\n🌹 외관 및 내관\\n• 오후 3시 방문, 웨이팅 ❌\\n• 콘센트 있어서 카공이나 노트북 가능 💻\\n• 넓고 자리 많음, 우디한 인테리어, 채광 좋고 동화 속 집 느낌🪵\\n• 이야기하기 좋은 분위기", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXj4s_jzWeaL3YuYy3pnRHa5HyyfAl_uIufaIczcHvclYL5_ArJ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Angela An", "rating": 4, "content": "(24년 8월) 복잡한 도심 한복판에 동화책 속 집처럼 등장한  예쁜카페!  분위기 좋고 음료도 맛도 좋네요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXUNbwSmKUmH2cbMYIltWjwpsxMcZRBXMtPuDkpoYOYEaGzqhgG=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "수민", "rating": 5, "content": "카페 분위기도 좋고 라떼도 맛있어요! 소금빵은 바삭한 크랙소금빵이에오", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWngzqz7Vg0_CzKkDMTSTknb1Sgz4LWEQOWiIqujLlHgcNxY9kGYA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "LYN L", "rating": 5, "content": "총 2번 방문한 포모르!\\n한번은 평일 낮에, 넘 좋아서 또 한번은 주말 낮에 다녀왔다.\\n또 방문했던 이유는, 차분한 공간과 그 다양함이 마음에 들었기 때문! 추천하는 시간대는 평일 낮이다. 사람이 많이 없고 혼자 생각에 잠기기 좋은 적절한 소음과 음악이 흘러나온다. 반면 주말에는 사람이 꽤 붐비니 참고하면 좋을 듯 하다!\\n\\n소금빵이 그리 빨리 팔려나간다는데,\\n세번째 방문 때엔 소금빵 꼭 먹어보고 싶다!! :)", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU5LiMe4DG7hL2jkuEhWxMdRqJT0XGH3vusml5pRX5WFxEQlp4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Seon A Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "집과 거리가 꽤 멀어 자주가지는 못하지만\\n여행 다녀온 것 같은 포모르의 벽돌느낌은 아주 좋습니다. 특히 소금빵이 일품이지요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKN3IWh9MwDm7vfzJKvDNjLXaw-3uV5gXXW9cAuXz776BowbQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Hana", "rating": 4, "content": "분위기와 커피, 디저트 다 좋고 괜찮았어요. 앉았던 테이블의 높이가 낮아서 그건 좀 불편했습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWDqZWAQ97xEddy92PED-1rYPGeNIKP_HtsIYJtI2FCkLVoT6g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Park June", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기 좋음\\n상당히 친절함\\n가정집을 리모델링해서 분위기 차분함\\n디자인이 밖이랑 안이랑 잘 조화스러움", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWvlydqyWO_axO2Ucaxukeq3w59ZZf9wQAwZGXaQACmZ4OETLxA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Byungkyu Ahn", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기 좋네요 크로플도 겉바속촉 느낌으로 괜찮았고 아인슈페너 크림도 쫀득한듯 부드럽고 밀도 있었습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUulbVLkdWiwQrOjVmARSg2oTAcfDqv3VaOobdMLS4uAtKc5czv8Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJK3j43PGlfDURcMdYVcAir98/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJK3j43PGlfDURcMdYVcAir98/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJK3j43PGlfDURcMdYVcAir98/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJK3j43PGlfDURcMdYVcAir98/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJK3j43PGlfDURcMdYVcAir98/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJK3j43PGlfDURcMdYVcAir98/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJK3j43PGlfDURcMdYVcAir98/photos/6.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}, 