4.7	37.5470706	126.94000009999999	2026-02-16 19:11:15.319533	2026-03-17 20:54:27.810293	019c65ee-cef7-76b9-91d0-62d07cede148	CAFE	ChIJq51O2WaZfDURsyjXX0vxYWU	355492892	포에	[{"author": "고김", "rating": 5, "content": "대흥역 인근에 위치한 레트로 감성의 카페입니다.\\n\\n커플 두분이 운영하시는 아담한 카페로 굉장히 편안한 느낌이 들어 장시간 머물러 있기 좋습니다.\\n\\n산미있는 커피 좋아하시는 분들이라면 강력 추천드리고 텔린느라는 초콜릿 무스 같은 디저트가 정말 맛있습니다.\\n\\n사장님 두분도 너무 친절하고 전체적으로 메뉴들이 과하지 않아 부담이 적습니다~ 자주 올 것 같아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUst5WSGJH_JU23uFe52sNLEGuQ4vVuL8Jm3Q5va1x8UdX2ED1Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "JH Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기도 좋고\\n샌드위치 맛있어요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK3rqJNT5PppL2bc1A_JMSqA6oqCKaPcCPvqkwV4lNfg-tAGw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "Esthee Wong", "rating": 4, "content": "Cute place with nice tall windows with good light. Not modern but quite cozy with nice smell of coffee. Espresso price is higher than most places I have tried but they do serve you n they are smiling. The nutty espresso was actually better than I thought so I did not feel so disappointed with the price.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWpjEVXW7HHBQBB-DflVS7hksq7gh1d-sFNN8KPVRtQIRchhwzoDQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq51O2WaZfDURsyjXX0vxYWU/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq51O2WaZfDURsyjXX0vxYWU/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq51O2WaZfDURsyjXX0vxYWU/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq51O2WaZfDURsyjXX0vxYWU/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq51O2WaZfDURsyjXX0