4.3	37.673865299999996	126.7779166	2026-03-17 20:56:41.076926	2026-03-17 20:56:41.076926	019cfba7-c0f4-79ca-a7e1-a914763e33e9	CAFE	ChIJ6zV7i_yPfDUR7k2aBsxacGA	18950060	카페로드 Cafe Road	[{"author": "石原亮", "rating": 5, "content": "고전적인 분위기를 자아내는 인테리어와 다양한 원두를 골라서 커피를 마실 수 있다는 점 그리고 늦은 밤시간으로 볼 수 있는 자정까지 운영하는 게 좋은 카페입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUn_HL8MBsZWoSywk-_zCxo9HGpf6socxVHc-Wetkn4BIC_17g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "조윤관 (어흥)", "rating": 3, "content": "빈티지스타일의 카페\\n마카롱 맛있슴", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWxI7k7FDqXzF-Tu7sK5S8vxQyhRMQ7OM7GlG_pVo2VbKwLQ-BtVA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Saskia", "rating": 4, "content": "맛이 전체적으로 진함 케익 맛있음! 공부하러 많이들 감", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVxQz4UyPojSzbxrbR2QdezGQIaOL8Q_x-wxkuiuwZ4tt-H4xbm=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "김주이", "rating": 4, "content": "커피잔을.파시는지 곳것에.전시되어 잇고 공간이.군데군데 많앗어요.  고체연료로 식지않게 홍차를 마실수 잇엇어요ㅡ 더워도 따뜻한 음료를...ㅋㅋ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLlbABe76_FZSQHCD2Fan9wukgGYprozttIMQQ5F2DpUJTGMw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Jinsook Myung", "rating": 4, "content": "단골 카페인데요~\\n커피 맛 대비 가성비 좋습니다.\\n좀 올드한 분위기와 테이블과 의자들이 낡았다는 건 고려할 사항이죠~ㅋ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWVvd3qi_YRqMRRen9qkzBKmhEEpEtpVRUj8y31FOv1Kt7HGCMr=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "자알살아보세", "rating": 1, "content": "동네인데 테이크아웃 커피 했는데 가격이 너무 비싸네요\\n거의 메이커 커피수준\\n쉽게 마실수 있으면 좋은데\\n원두가 아무리 비싸도 아아가 4000원은 심각하게 비싼것 같아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUDloL7zMwaty8jCy8iYmWHl6w1PhVTXY9q26UtTbBNLv2hZ8Om4Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "한봄", "rating": 5, "content": "커피를 직접볶아요 커피맛을 중요시 생각하시면 꼭 와보시길 추천합니다~^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK5WNFMhfGfRm4Cj-ocTK-HxLyoKuBYyjKrb54syqjkQtbN6Q=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "김인빈", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기 아주 편한하고 좋아요\\n커피 맛도 좋구요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU7egneGT_micd1eBG17RaMeHzsb1227-mtCbB61ylkCET_KChd=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ6zV7i_yPfDUR7k2aBsxacGA/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ6zV7i_yPfDUR7k2aBsxacGA/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ6zV7i_yPfDUR7k2aBsxacGA/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ6zV7i_yPfDUR7k2aBsxacGA/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ6zV7i_yPfDUR7k2aBsxacGA/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000FE00B562C9B15F4061B4D83741D64240
