4.8	37.6723502	126.7476377	2026-02-16 19:11:11.648531	2026-03-17 20:56:45.878969	019c65ee-c0a0-7a4b-9fef-b8129daa2106	CAFE	ChIJdS0sNwCFfDURD57TVbo1rhg	785480048	남표카페	[{"author": "이윤정", "rating": 4, "content": "케잌과 피낭시에 맛있어요\\n글루텐프리라 맘놓고 먹어요\\n특히 당근케잌좋아해요\\n근데 매장내 좌석은 조금 애매해서 좋다고는 말못하지만\\n테이크아웃으로는 굿입니다\\n그리고 사장님너무 친절하시고 기분좋게 해주세요\\n항상감사합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKMmhfy0BM9bFavV1duATukwzY0mp8sPkLs9ZRe93Dr_PubHQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Leandro", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님이 친절하고 분위기가 좋은 카페에요!!\\n그리고 미숫가루라떼 추천드려요 ㅎㅎㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV6wIQVJnvQoEnt5UKNA-66WKshUk2XBK_U9_Lhqyr5EjNBNOYK=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Kim안토니오", "rating": 5, "content": "딜리셔스 굿~친절 굿 맛 굿 그냥 굿", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVeQljHCGKMSRhxlEOMv4jvWjazC1-8NQgfTPa5pGuS6wkz0xI=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Işıl Doyduk", "rating": 5, "content": "Çay içtik, çilekli ve çikolatalı pasta yedik. Hoş ve huzur dolu bir ortam var. Müziklerde harikaydı. Sahibi çok kibardı. Biz çok sevdik umarım bir gün yine geliriz🥰🙏❤️", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXuLkiF_eGktcIlpDOH0HqOyDucJD71Z4pu0WfHHowe_daD60E=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJdS0sNwCFfDURD57TVbo1rhg/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJdS0sNwCFfDURD57TVbo1rhg/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJdS0sNwCFfDURD57TVbo1rhg/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJdS0sNwCFfDURD57TVbo1rhg/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "