3.5	37.5028643	127.1071949	2026-03-17 21:01:45.542834	2026-03-17 21:01:45.542834	019cfbac-6646-78f3-b21c-5ff8eefcdcae	CAFE	ChIJy-NFZQClfDUR_D1n3Y39ASA	948046751	와요커피 송파점	[{"author": "jang ramul", "rating": 3, "content": "커피가 별로 맛있진 않은데... 저렴하고 애견동반 가능, 강아지 간식도 있는 나름의 메리트가 있다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVlqid7xa8mSK_8Ni5djgjffcPOhYz0B7mG71wWxWYw2r4jpGlV=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Jiyeong Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "땅콩크림 추가 필수! 존맛탱\\n반려견과 올 수 있는 점이 매우 독특한 커피숍이에요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUYrEJ_dWzXgEEC0OYyJMBymCLzvtVvVuBqA5O-z_WIUTYi21Jm1g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJy-NFZQClfDUR_D1n3Y39ASA/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJy-NFZQClfDUR_D1n3Y39ASA/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJy-NFZQClfDUR_D1n3Y39ASA/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 30]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 30]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 30]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 30]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 30]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 30]}]	0101000020E61000001273FF47DCC65F40B8697DDB5DC04240
4.2	37.502230999999995	127.11034989999999	2026-03-17 21:01:45.54298	2026-03-17 21:01:45.54298	019cfbac-6646-78f3-b21d-adaf866303d9	CAFE	ChIJ21JH0pulfDURRsn7NEnMvII	26900350	스타벅스 송파사거리점	[{"author": "Haejin cho", "rating": 4, "content": "3층 건물을 모두 사용하여 공간이 넓고 좌석이 많은 장점이 있었다. 갑자기 더워지는 날씨에 에어컨 조절을 잘해주셔서 너무 춥지도 덥지도 않았다. 3층은 안 올라가봤는데 2층은 공부하기 참 좋은 분위기!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocItSV8uhO5Mu0xen8joq3IsSfkdBfNdtHpL_AZFD_aeS0iAbQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "채별", "rating": 5, "content": "3층으로 된 스타벅스\\n조용하고 좋았어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIHvS7ZGpqkSe8KV8kr5bIv8v_bKg49dmYCZt3IElyLqTpjYQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "MK Kim (Flo.)", "rating": 4, "content": "3층까지 자리 넉넉하고\\n창가 탁 트여있어 좋음\\n조용한 분위기 잘 쉬다 감", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWyaIK9SZ7e0eN2y8tZd3EOxFX4ne-mQeLugIQkwkUHfQFcoSE0=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Jason J.", "rating": 4, "content": "3층 구성의 매장이에요\\n인근에 지하철 역이 있어서 접근이 용이하지만 가락시장역이나 석촌역 바로 옆에 붙은 매장은 아닙니다.\\n그래서 유동인구가 살짝 덜 한 느낌이네요!\\n\\n현재 3층은 당분간 스타벅스측에서 사용중이라 이용할 수 없는 것처럼 보입니다. 교육용으로 사용한다고 하네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV8qZHs9VPWFyAzpoAgxCD5u8PuJarY_8QBaufzsMcB6hP1gng=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "jjih k", "rating": 4, "content": "조용하고 좋아요. 평일 낮에도 자리가 없을 만큼 인기가 많네요! 2층까지 있어 더 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWOYBXVwfay0Wa7k-h4S_p0aC3puHJS-pocwMzAIrGqppRpSbE=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "SK Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "3층까지 있으며 쾌적하다 단 화장실이 3층에 있다 오랜시간 머물려면 3층으로 자리를 잡으세요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUpdfZA9y3shRKaS79ieSZQahwkLFVLe_WtXhRKLWi1vEEi3-gJ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "가나다", "rating": 5, "content": "송파사거리 늦은시간 달리는 자동차 창밖으로 보이는 풍경에 복잡한 마음이 이 도심 속 같아요...\\n화이트초코 라떼가 위로해줘요~달콤하고 부드러운 맛이 네온싸인 불빛 같아요 ㅋ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJNJqCsSWE2ENYk4q5wDNkNwDfkRVYRGJVq5YRG2kc40mejFw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Sangmi Baek", "rating": 5, "content": "방문해서 먹기..사이렌오더로 주문해서 도착 후 얼마 안되 자리잡기. 항상 들리던 곳이라 좋아요. 사람도 많지 않고ㅎㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJmkep-K1gCVwffzTZ2-DYvzkPONlj-RHo3Twvwd7qJvnU3RUBC=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ21JH0pulfDURRsn7NEnMvII/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ21JH0pulfDURRsn7NEnMvII/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ21JH0pulfDURRsn7NEnMvII/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ21JH0pulfDURRsn7NEnMvII/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ21JH0pulfDURRsn7NEnMvII/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ21JH0pulfDURRsn7NEnMvII/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ21JH0pulfDURRsn7NEnMvII/photos/6.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ21JH0pulfDURRsn7NEnMvII/photos/7.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ21JH0pulfDURRsn7NEnMvII/photos/8.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000007AE706F90FC75F40C804FC1A49C04240
4.2	37.509478	127.1052976	2026-03-17 21:01:45.543217	2026-03-17 21:01:45.543217	019cfbac-6647-7218-a0e1-bd09bfc03ec4	CAFE	ChIJOcMukp-lfDURIVZG-E8RPMw	22547048	스타벅스 석촌호수점	[{"author": "박철근", "rating": 1, "content": "석촌 호수를 바라보며 부부가 3시간을\\n행복한 물멍을 했습니다. 3층, 2층강추", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU9uFp4w7RxXXCfOBDO-I5qUhImiLu9EUvLt_SpAsiMEHT8DVs=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "모아스토리", "rating": 5, "content": "석촌호수 전망의 스타벅스. 입구에 경사로가 있어서 휠체어, 유모차 타거나 몸이 불편해도 편하게 이용할 수 있어요. 3층까지 공간이 있습니다\\nStarbucks with a view of Seokchon Lake. There is a ramp at the entrance, so you can use it comfortably even if you are in a wheelchair, a stroller, or feel uncomfortable. There is space up to the 3rd floor 🍹", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWLpxEl40GkZUJKv9pjz5B3nTOeGPauHN5YerNt5lj3lxE_mT-o=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "렛츠 (Lets)", "rating": 4, "content": "나무들에 가려서 석촌호수는 잘 안보이지만, 그래도 공원 근처에 있다는 느낌은 들기에 분위기는 괜찮습니다. (길따라 1층 야외 테라스 카페들이 꽤 많아요.)\\n\\n속칭 '관장라떼'라는 별명이 붙은 \\"돌체라떼\\"와 \\"딸기라떼\\"를 주문 하였는데, 프랜차이즈라 맛은 다른 지점들과 동일 합니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX3e-EY-GhmPiqIXGwTxDnn185ZNB1hGNKOQZ3t2XWNnq7jmcw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Chung Ms.", "rating": 4, "content": "전망이 좋아요. 사람이 많아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL41evbKXmfFwT6I3iwaLCyG7fjGuY2W7EoP4krfZXIi6_Bxg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "전원호", "rating": 4, "content": "3층까지 있어서 조용히 작업하기에 좋습니다. 특히 3층이 아늑하고 좋네요~ 바깥쪽으로는 석촌호수 뷰가 마음의 안정을 줘서 좋습니다. 콘센트가 별로 없는것은 아쉽습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIvLNwNyWm3cTzPiAtx5g6wmXVHpSuEPNqXc9WfVgz0lVp73w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Chi Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "뷰맛집 왜 사람이 많은지 알았다는 ㅎ\\n평소에 일층에서 테이크아웃만 했는데\\n2층 3층 올라가보니 왜 사람이 많은지 알겠네요\\n통창뷰가 너무 좋다는 ㅎ 재방문 의사 있어요♥️\\n\\n석촌호수 송리단길 카페추천 스타벅스☕️", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXD3XHKd6qqSNTs6syIBnPJngVyzKDogbRP2__V73wQ9pWneiXU=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Myungsoo Park", "rating": 5, "content": "창가 쪽은 확실히 뷰가 좋네요. 디저트도 맛있고..그러나 화장실과 쓰레기통이 제때 제때 치워지지 않아 보기 불편했습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV-3bZHdY9qXZaHPec7VD1aL7G27Yo7lVuLb_kilKII3FMOBkWjug=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Munhee Lee", "rating": 4, "content": "3층 짜리 단독 건물로 실내가 넓고 쾌적합니다.\\n석촌호수 공원을 걷다가 가볍게 들르기에 너무 좋아요.석촌호수 서호 석촌동쪽 길가에 있어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWJYH5LVJSxnpC3RyIPZKKVboEZyCfWycmV9xo6k20SAst5HZ2NUw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOcMukp-lfDURIVZG-E8RPMw/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOcMukp-lfDURIVZG-E8RPMw/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOcMukp-lfDURIVZG-E8RPMw/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOcMukp-lfDURIVZG-E8RPMw/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOcMukp-lfDURIVZG-E8RPMw/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOcMukp-lfDURIVZG-E8RPMw/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOcMukp-lfDURIVZG-E8RPMw/photos/6.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOcMukp-lfDURIVZG-E8RPMw/photos/7.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOcMukp-lfDURIVZG-E8RPMw/photos/8.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E61000003A162532BDC65F4008043A9336C14240
4.7	37.54772	127.10262279999999	2026-03-17 21:01:45.543441	2026-03-17 21:01:45.543441	019cfbac-6647-7218-a0e2-2cef85227dec	CAFE	ChIJi5tDPDWlfDURmpi8FlpCU10	1878695105	리트커피	[{"author": "eunha", "rating": 5, "content": "조용한 주택가 골목의 작고 예쁜 카페입니다. 한적함과 여유를 느낄 수 있는 분위기에요. 비치된 도서와 음악이 보고 듣기에 좋아요. 주차는 어려울 것 같네요. 등산다녀오다가 광나루역 방향으로 갈 때 들르기 좋습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUmIEF2fiGfF4nD_-QMm8mdzRrJf9IX6p1UHEAcuQ6iMkfdy0gG=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Smin", "rating": 3, "content": "붉은 벽돌 너~~~~~무 예뻐요~~  커피잔도 귀엽구요~\\n아메리카노는 다소 평범했어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ4emRuhpgVzZpsOQBN5wAgGWDxpEEoRBHegr9Ufh2mHYQL9g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Y Jung", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기 좋고 아담한 카페. 인테리어가 깔끔하고 아메리카노도 진해서 맛있는 편이다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLyho_uGUOFMyoWetbWJ1oXPLsqRgKoBZ4RAa5EmatvollKcw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "윤정장", "rating": 5, "content": "커피 넘 맛나요~~^^ 특히 울꼬맹이가 요기 아이스코코아 스벅보다 맛나다며... ㅍㅎㅎㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLb4mNSpM9HBLgw4xqyng6YqOZPvYU2sH751p2oeUjunGSSTQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "송영주", "rating": 5, "content": "마을의 작고 아담한데 분위기도 있는 카페.\\n빨간 벽돌 포토스팟이 시그니쳐!\\n\\n커피맛이 좋은데 심지어 사장님이 특별히 친절하고 좋음.\\n\\n벚꽃필 때, 가을낙엽질때 짱좋음.\\n\\nnow is the time to visit!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK3DLKJjT4gG4EAC_p_f7RygWUhLWliqB0GTXfwhJfj9xy_2Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "Sanha Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "커피도 맛있고~~ 사장님도 너무 친절하신데 코지한 분위기까지 너무 좋아요~~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIYm95hMeXHyK61EujIP8KKfH3r5B2rOlRb7KWof03GFUPOzA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "젼이스져니", "rating": 4, "content": "가격도 싸고 맛도 있고 작은 가게지만 외부 테라스도 있고 화장실도 있고 인테리어도 예뻐요 동네 자체가 조용해서 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWU1GZgDkBOpXkUiAoq7jqp2j_lteCsQbKPWSAUE7Lzg2b1zB9b=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "정연진", "rating": 5, "content": "커피도 맛나고 사장님도 좋으시고 압으로 자주 애용할듯요♡", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXa18misw1GjXqjPG2ReePHnA01iI6dsJl2AF06MtSe21P40x0=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJi5tDPDWlfDURmpi8FlpCU10/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJi5tDPDWlfDURmpi8FlpCU10/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJi5tDPDWlfDURmpi8FlpCU10/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJi5tDPDWlfDURmpi8FlpCU10/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJi5tDPDWlfDURmpi8FlpCU10/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJi5tDPDWlfDURmpi8FlpCU10/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [16, 30]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [16, 30]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [16, 30]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [16, 30]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [16, 30]}]	0101000020E6100000BB74385F91C65F40BCAE5FB01BC64240
