4.8	37.6173249	127.0821666	2026-02-16 19:11:47.321756	2026-03-17 21:04:10.557255	019c65ef-4bf9-71ca-8a29-c55f760e3488	CAFE	ChIJWRC7vsy7fDURBTYYYhtdyfE	348171606	만랩커피 묵동점	[{"author": "반포소공녀", "rating": 5, "content": "세가지 원두중 골라먹을 수 있는 프렌차이즈 커피집 만랩커피..내공 만렙을 줘도 될것같습니다.^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVIaiqxOQuRWi40SZmi75ERPa0i63rlosLCDckmji8qdNxgT1I=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "이재연", "rating": 5, "content": "커피가 맛있었어요.여직원분이 엄청 친절해요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXVbRYf3l-18v5-2HgUJ-anO0CC_9eNRdRz3bCnkvvcmXsv2jPw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Piero Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "넘 친절하시고 커피도 맛있어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWjbTFuSt_VlbRzvgY_i888z87PdsVJTxP5053B8CFp9mVQAeru=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Coconut Coffee", "rating": 5, "content": "가성비 좋은 커피에 매장 깔끔하고 친절하십니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVg_EnjO43h_jc32J_NRC6Z-ZuGMF7qWD2j-pRbQyW0eGEX42o=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "박정훈", "rating": 5, "content": "저가 커피중 퀄이 좋아요~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXYS5qNFpvj7xzz3_GCKlV42krdGtxX-TTldhY1yBefEnPspGfB=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "정진아", "rating": 5, "content": "음료도 항상 맛있고 양도 많아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIM2_HlgOCboqfZ0Ob__OumQxB_dNQeKbZIaTBBSZsXc7HKXg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "강대호", "rating": 5, "content": "초코스무디", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJVbX7WF7EBLZkgMcTruhfskJyo49EMKwlIxgvBj9GD1Oz4Uw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "박선애", "rating": 5, "content": "완전친절하심", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWqV5UqbgNy-C5bfX_0SKtc4ZUIgw5UZV0TtVyBLafprB5osFxn=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWRC7vsy7fDURBTYYYhtdyfE/photos/0.png"}]	[]	0101000020E6100000B4F4B23742C55F40D440988004CF4240
4.1	37.652864799999996	126.7767027	2026-02-16 19:11:38.158458	2026-03-17 21:04:11.354425	019c65ef-282e-7b93-a1b6-587a749055a9	CAFE	ChIJq1Cm_UuFfDUR2pIu8CfIJlI	17884706	스타벅스 마두역점	[{"author": "Limes", "rating": 5, "content": "3호선 마두역 앞에 있어요. 1층에는 창가측 좌석을 비롯해 회의 테이블 및 좌석, 일반 좌석 등이 있고 2층에는 꽤 많은 좌석들이 있어요. 직원들이 친절해요.\\n\\n오늘은 새로 나온 용과음료 시음~~🫐 색깔은 진한 진달래색 음료로 너무 예쁜데 맛은 약간 불량식품 맛~~~ㅎㅎ\\n\\n화장실은 매장 내 1층에 있는데 깨끗해요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUifZSpu5BK-MwuGW_9uGVMmFvtSvXYOktuHI0y4znedzxFUG9noA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Jung Woo Shim", "rating": 5, "content": "1층은 공간이 적어\\n주로 2층으로 올라갑니다\\n추워서 2층 안쪽을 찾아 이동하기도\\n밖  뷰늘 보면서 혼자서 고독을 씹기도\\n아님 2층에서 수다와 공부하거나\\n선택하세요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL5pLpcJIgYLaqY2fAQ_LYw6k-SH28-X5CPrqs_1am2_4myPw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "KYOUNGSUN YOON", "rating": 5, "content": "1층에서 주문할 수 있습니다. 2층에 좌석들이 있어서 여우롭게 앉아 있을 수 있습니다. 일부 좌석에는 콘센트가 있어서 랩탑이나 다른 기기들을 충전할 수 있습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXAfaIGRQ_SE-57YoH9TM25ePQzP1Lx62ODqeFf59HGEtY2tRnhBw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Jooah Lee", "rating": 4, "content": "예전부터 굉장히 자주간 마두역 스타벅스.\\n최근엔 잘못갔지만 최소 5년전부터 이곳을 자주 방문했다.\\n친절하고 위치도 좋아서 그런지 요즘엔 갈 때마다 더 자리가 없는 것 같다\\n\\n@jooah_lee", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXbM7YjH0Radh1-MRReMjkRx-xOb2f0TndGXIt3QTWq77MwbioYgA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "hyangshin jeon", "rating": 5, "content": "늘 이용하는 매장.\\n사람이 많지만 방역, 거리두기 잘 되어 있고 친절해요~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVzFVbLFz-kZVdGHtTtHg7a1_mEp50HfXGIXZGRZqxLvqQrF1Y=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "김지연", "rating": 4, "content": "디저트 종류도 많고 직원분들이 친절해서 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJUilDHc9r8s7kn2wvsaDVvGkaFoRaNPEWOT8Eg5ssjftym7g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "traces of life", "rating": 4, "content": "마두역점 스타벅스는 다른 점포보단 어수선하지 않고 평온한 분위기\\n직원들도 친절하다\\n단점은 영업시간이 밤10시까지 영업이란점", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXXcAn3CgnJIGVh-ICz2Gsfa0krZMieAE7-CjbsUPrfcez4YYpuyw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Lost", "rating": 3, "content": "괜춘..다른 스벅이랑 비슷해요~ 2층에 올라가면 좌석있는..사람 좀 많아요~공기가 별로 안좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWaILWZu5ViW2TFB9yD41ZeADJnF85GVk92R61EMaNSY1AoluA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq1Cm_UuFfDUR2pIu8CfIJlI/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq1Cm_UuFfDUR2pIu8CfIJlI/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq1Cm_UuFfDUR2pIu8CfIJlI/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq1Cm_UuFfDUR2pIu8CfIJlI/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq1Cm_UuFfDUR2pIu8CfIJlI/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq1Cm_UuFfDUR2pIu8CfIJlI/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq1Cm_UuFfDUR2pIu8CfIJlI/photos/6.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "clo