5	37.4604895	127.15513059999999	2026-03-17 21:04:44.851696	2026-03-17 21:04:44.851696	019cfbaf-22b3-7076-84a7-39f014f33d4d	CAFE	ChIJo-bnfjGvfDURhxK5_gK2Rf4	26808989	커피베이산성점	[{"author": "온광러브", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님 정말 친절하시고 늘 웃으시고 완젼 따봉입니다~~!!! 커피맛도 좋아요^-^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLr-Gnl4jr8gusU9keQWVJQauzY1MKIH7v-1Rc6MARprCEyYA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "최준호", "rating": 5, "content": "친절하시고 분위기도 식음료 맛도 최고에요~^^ 주차도 편합니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKLZhoKfbYqRydo8uJmE8TsqUxqZjuOz8BkhyrkMcbD_eUI_QpL=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "jongjun yoon", "rating": 5, "content": "조용하고 깨끗하고 친절하고 커피맛있고. 짱 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKa3USiwBR4S91E6N-ci8QDo51sSjxfGjCQKyOCfDKlU7IE8Q=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "오세원", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJpYXHx4JCusEm4OfoVFiNpA8qs93xPvfccYRxdUirz5Jsn6g=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "양용석", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLKINaPjUddeNa8aCReDLisuMWUZuyIacCMgjff-l8F0kJ9PQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "신설희", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVZnEFZWMNIJMHW_hPo3SmXWuLc_Z3jmGEBQOggSy6B5Eha2XtORA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "김지호", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKEzEXjGQ1Iig7IWw-Jy1qiIbHl45Gf4eNfCNUeX0WoC-6-Rw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "류일청", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedConten