4.5	37.5800329	127.0882609	2026-03-17 21:07:23.485095	2026-03-17 21:07:23.485095	019cfbb1-8e5d-781f-a055-99c7526abd7f	CAFE	ChIJd0HUUQu7fDURSwBjSnJR4G8	1569146178	메가커피 사가정역점	[{"author": "김성회", "rating": 5, "content": "맛도 좋고 위치도 좋지만\\n사람이 너무 많아서 시끄럽네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJUV7Qdcjyjq1beMlBSe5ArxvkjpU_F3xDdKlvh2Z2RaF-7=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Sujin Choi", "rating": 5, "content": "저렴하고 좋아요.\\n좌석이 꽤있어서 잠시 커피한잔하기 좋은 듯", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJpiOq4xMEcBY_qbGUqhqEipdQ-7fz8qHkhopsWZu1gJbpqMA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "hyunsub jo", "rating": 4, "content": "일단 시간때를 잘 맞춰서 가야함 잘못가면 너무 시끄러움 하지만 조용할때는 조용함", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLkNpNjZGvmFkgwfAGRYZRccquD2F_nzwbF3eylkg7fGzmPqw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "H An", "rating": 5, "content": "다른 지점보다\\n커피맛도 좋고\\n우선 양이많아요~^^\\n따뜻한 라떼 자주마시는데\\n스벅 벤티랑 양이 같아요~\\n오전일찍 가는편인데 점장님이신지?\\n암튼 두분다 친절하세요~\\n덕분에 커피 마시는 시간이 넘 행복합니다~^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWjRfIx5_Q2i-PiJTBhv3OBmGgEFkNh-L6LeYknjd8SdnaNV_9y=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "신명순", "rating": 5, "content": "음료 빨리 제조되고 직원들 친절합니다 제가 시킨 음료 만나요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLG8QOX8JCjSj3NeSmNp90DaUeKzxnlzMDS8NUyQquDxc-cGw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "정의민", "rating": 5, "content": "아이들이 좋아하는 메뉴가 있어서 자주 갑니다 위치도 좋고 지하철역 옆이라 이용하기 좋아요 직원들도 친절합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLEku2GhhWUPLuD0rJCVxn-Ww9dHYNm0se19FR3FU1F1ktr9A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "서봉섭", "rating": 3, "content": "바뿌면 그럴 수도 있지만...얼마 안하는 커피 마시면서 별거 다 따진다 할 수 있지만...알바들 친절은 기대도할 수 없습니다...사장님은 매우 친절하십니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ9BlA5QrCqzSvvZ6d4eKITRImX82u61QRsQdjEx0TAn9SSdg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Bassist Ji-soo Yoon", "rating": 5, "content": "잘 관리된 기기와 어리숙한 신입직원이라도 친절한 곳.\\n가성비가 훌륭하며 맛은 꾸준하며 일관된 편", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1m3Pb-sA3IIW5zHR-BGZKslckruNhy4NpudXgFVqKjr9A1b39=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJd0HUUQu7fDURSwBjSnJR4G8/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJd0HUUQu7fDURSwBjSnJR4G8/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJd0HUUQu7fDURSwBjSnJR4G8/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJd0HUUQu7fDURSwBjSnJR4G8/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}]	0101000020E6100000FEC00B11A6C55F40510DA0843ECA4240
