양은 당연히 많음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK_F7PHBLOJEXYXTo7Gov4CIkRdyDqQWjWDyr2F6oZrdLm4vw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "이홍근", "rating": 3, "content": "유동인구가 많아 무엇이던 원하지 마십시요 그냥 니알아서 하세요 입니다 ㅎㅎㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIbn23pUlVHANAAkQSLNm3-znoH9m-rlQWvED6qrUqYt0hR0Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJpWaRcGmhfDUR4WKfeOeaMGo/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJpWaRcGmhfDUR4WKfeOeaMGo/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJpWaRcGmhfDUR4WKfeOeaMGo/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJpWaRcGmhfDUR4WKfeOeaMGo/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJpWaRcGmhfDUR4WKfeOeaMGo/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}]	0101000020E610000084775ECFFCC05F40C16ED8B628BF4240
