4.4	37.6492769	127.0622837	2026-03-17 21:12:14.663987	2026-03-17 21:12:14.663987	019cfbb5-ffc7-793d-ad97-159eb7d46a18	CAFE	ChIJqxWCzTu5fDURMfpxN6hsihI	1742354677	컴포즈커피 상계백병원점	[{"author": "최상희", "rating": 5, "content": "상계백병원근처 사거리 대로변에 위치. 가격대비 착한가격에  커피맛도 좋고, 부담이 없어서 좋습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVsLEMB6r-IbtbZ0nEzkic8iYiXbwHyuQIOmpN03BTbDHwnR_t0xQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "조항득", "rating": 3, "content": "깨끗하고 다양한 음료디져트 먹을수있는곳", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUeK8Sm5jro0o2RAcwtgsxTvn1lUYmVK7GfRffID1EGo8Z_-E_XXg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "윤부숙", "rating": 5, "content": "음료메뉴도 다양하고 특히 커피는\\n가성비 좋으며 친절해서 좋은데 앉아서\\n먹는곳이 없어서 아쉬워요^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLP9SYXXgf2RSFI5KKOF3Om0poA2ehPgBiuoDs3T4LyAt2VKg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Leo", "rating": 4, "content": "빠르게 나와서 좋아요~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVKoSiOkscgQ6S1zns0QQmd42pB8tMp17s933CLT0Qucic4H1mwWw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "i밋슈", "rating": 4, "content": "빠름", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUS3f9oq4i32R1BNTmKOOmwe3T_vwBcGzQNxZ2H1TLgNEN6X6qy=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "이정연", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLT-7skG5-k-gk6w8gy2o5NWLqgHsZdb-2YJ3GPf29PdQZc0w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "장일영", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI5iwlCzCjLdvQGjEEqtVpSBgMiP4cPcp5q-NQsR6QjAU6uPA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "김대현", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocImrVH-sHnaUkP5hzOZNolRUHRKcfdMPnjhHrgzKL289k_JnQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJqxWCzTu5fDURMfpxN6hsihI/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJqxWCzTu5fDURMfpxN6hsihI/photos/1.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}]	0101000020E6100000BAA4C574FCC35F402DC665811BD34240
4.6	37.5415001	126.98709579999999	2026-03-17 21:12:14.664165	2026-03-17 21:12:14.664165	019cfbb5-ffc8-7881-8dc6-2afb6342a011	CAFE	ChIJZQmvaE-ifDUR2g1bnXRrg1o	15533960	르 카페 Le Cafe	[{"author": "올리브", "rating": 3, "content": "커피는 맛있었어요.  테이블 간격이 너무 붙어있고 알바생이 불친절해요 화장실은 외부에 있습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUG2F2C8uMPdE4cYgpSbN8lY_pt10fPUOu3ZTpjsliQQsDaBflZoA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "cottony S", "rating": 5, "content": "Nice cafe owner and good vibes\\nLove to be here\\n해방촌 오시면 꼭 오삼", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIWnC9rPZm82z3w6fuysL7II1AaH_Z9V9-mfLyzJ3AY96qFsA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "박징주", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기 너무 좋아요🥰❤️ 아담하고, 편안하고, 따뜻하고,,,커피도 넘넘 맛있어요:)", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWuJjOlldi0BMBi1nI2ZzbNgyJh_mqThGzsOreOVarUJSm2ZKvi=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "신날치 Shinnalchi", "rating": 4, "content": "아담하지만 눈치안보이고 혼자만의 시간을 즐길 수 있는 카페", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWnTmQq1fB0b0Zj8bLnIbzWbYNrpSKqaqsvqqt8YZDSXSHki4zC_w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Byungkyu SHIN", "rating": 5, "content": "낮에 여는 카페가 드문 곳에서 여는 곳. 조용한 낡은 카페 느낌의 커피숍.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWQuYukcUvy3VnQOiyGRvPbcnEA9MUQi3R3SFJ1ln4Y9rGCpum5wA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "망고빈 Mangovin", "rating": 5, "content": "왠지\\n장인이 만든 커피를\\n맛볼수 있다는\\n특별함이 있는 카페예요.\\n\\n실내에 테이블이 두, 세개? 있어 협소해서 오래 머물분위기는 아닌데,, 그렇다고 눈치보이는 곳으누아니고 자유롭게 책읽어도 될거 같아요.\\n\\n가장좋아하는 자리는 테라스로. 해방촌 지나가는\\n사람들\\n구경하는 재미가\\n엄청 쏠쏠해요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWgrjt3QDxGjoPpUwQHcpyy6kmJkbHyVZ6p5UPIRjCTUsRNkF3pqw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Yeon L", "rating": 5, "content": "인근 식사 후 우연히 방문한 카페에서 불안한 마음으로 에스프레소를 시켰는데 ( 커피집 이곳 저곳 방문해 보면 에스프레소 기계 수입 함에도 불구하고 에스프레소 메뉴에 잔이 한개 밖에 없다며 종이잔에 주시겠다는 황당한 상황을 여러번 겪다보니 카페에서 이 메뉴 시킬때는 저도 모르게 초조 합니다 ㅠㅠ )……. 맛있는 추출에 더하여 설탕과 물까지 정석으로 기분 좋은 커피 한잔 즐기고, 자가 로스팅 원두까지 구매하게 되었습니다.\\n\\n에스프레소 안심하고 드셔도 되는 몇 안되는 장소예요!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWOuSSDwYzpYEZB0xA9a0yuOfv5dlcAS7cgAtWqsCulhJCQxTW3=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "김지민", "rating": 5, "content": "해방촌에서 오랫동안 자리잡고 있는 카페. 혼자가서도 부담없이 조용히 있다 올수있는 편한 카페.\\n특히 플랫화이트랑 롱블랙강추!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIummEB5TAKg1lMJtpVg9lIleNNTzpZjJFFC-tbu1bDWlYaLA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZQmvaE-ifDUR2g1bnXRrg1o/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZQmvaE-ifDUR2g1bnXRrg1o/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZQmvaE-ifDUR2g1bnXRrg1o/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZQmvaE-ifDUR2g1bnXRrg1o/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZQmvaE-ifDUR2g1bnXRrg1o/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZQmvaE-ifDUR2g1bnXRrg1o/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZQmvaE-ifDUR2g1bnXRrg1o/photos/6.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZQmvaE-ifDUR2g1bnXRrg1o/photos/7.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZQmvaE-ifDUR2g1bnXRrg1o/photos/8.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazon