oogleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJrUkKLgGImhjrRrJ24csVoTiRwsSApucPchqmg9APo7J4WIw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "sejin song", "rating": 4, "content": "아늑하고 따뜻한 분위기~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVEZcifatxg48p-BENasZ0accaVYRm8N3RTsbIa6kcEDZkUOpvNcg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOYBj4E58ezURys7dW_ALBxA/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOYBj4E58ezURys7dW_ALBxA/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOYBj4E58ezURys7dW_ALBxA/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOYBj4E58ezURys7dW_ALBxA/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOYBj4E58ezURys7dW_ALBxA/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOYBj4E58ezURys7dW_ALBxA/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}]	0101000020E610000044AD1F5157AE5F4057EDF54949BF4240
4.3	37.493923699999996	126.72413209999999	2026-02-16 19:12:12.91956	2026-03-17 21:15:34.33849	019c65ef-aff7-769b-a212-5a2cfe857f4c	CAFE	ChIJRyjCGE98ezURmuvb8WhRXQs	1146977726	그날의온도	[{"author": "정하남", "rating": 4, "content": "부평 평리단길카페 거리에 있는 분위기 좋은 카페임 시그니처 메뉴 중 옥수수크림커피랑 액설런트라떼를 먹어봤는데 옥수수 향이 많이 나 옥수수크림커피 메뉴를 정말 맛있게 먹었음 인테리어가 예뻐 데이트 중인 커플이나 지인 모임 손님들이 많은 듯하며 주차가 가능하다고 함 직원분들이 조금 무뚝뚝하시긴 하지만 카페 내부 분위기가 좋아 한 번쯤 방문해보기에 괜찮을 듯함", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWGm6GghlI05KdZMt26G2ZSzY3DI7waivhgUDqtReJ3puXpjwn6=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Iris", "rating": 5, "content": "부평역 지나가다가 우연히 들어가게 된 커피집 이예요!\\n은은하게 나오는 음악소리도 너무 좋고,, 커피도 너무 맛있어요☕️\\n처음 먹어보는 파블로바도 너무 맛있게 먹었습니다🍫🍌\\n다음에 또 올게요🥰🥰", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIW0XrfIYnyNQJPtVBxXrHuncq-6MYgItGXmfPhw4cwuZQoTHI=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "민민", "rating": 4, "content": "내부가 독특하여 개성이 강했고 커피의 맛 또한 좋았습니다만.. 너무 음악이 시끄러워 대화 소리가 묻혀버렸고 그 때문에 테라스 쪽으로 자리를 옮기게 되더군요 그것만 빼면 꽤나 예쁘고 맛 좋은 카페였습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXuXNAAqWXizfaP0T9hCq7JfVOqk_T_MoXoib21qUZIbCtPpND7=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "유영민", "rating": 3, "content": "커피는 맛있어요. 아아\\n크로플은 생각보다 아쉬움. 빵이 시제품(?)느낌입니다.\\n질기고 딱딱합니다. 월욜 낮이라 재고인지 몰라도..\\n카페 분위기는 좋습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV-HRYsh1jbF8NYgs2RAl_-SxXn-g3AUSAunRlatBqkdWWY99mX=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "coo loves", "rating": 5, "content": "커피도 크로플도 다 맛있어요~~ 분위기도 좋고~~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIZF1qbfhOobgL5JHKLPEWVPkpKb94nnWKcS5o8txXku3q1jA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "김나니", "rating": 3, "content": "분위기 좋음.\\n크로플이 와플 식감에 가까움.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXbgwSbMCepdziL5WXBr0qwE6juUCtwcN9szpEK3XnTrURtncB_=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Lloyd Yi", "rating": 3, "content": "누가 여기 크로플 맛있다고 함ㅡㅡ\\n화나네 진짜", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXZsyJoZ43NaMRL7usyP4FDaXNP-BohHrZ3wTaJlncU6l-8pmC9=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "ㅅㅅ", "rating": 5, "content": "커피맛은 좋았는데 금이 간 잔 때ㅣ문에 별하나뼙니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJQzFXIWAIsCveCrYbZr1BYGFwh7_DOuqBb7h03oLRZeuyUzA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRyjCGE98ezURmuvb8WhRXQs/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRyjCGE98ezURmuvb8WhRXQs/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRyjCGE98ezURmuvb8WhRXQs/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRyjCGE98ezURmuvb8WhRXQs/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRyjCGE98ezURmuvb8WhRXQs/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRyjCGE98ezURmuvb8WhRXQs/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRyjCGE98ezURmuvb8WhRXQs/photos/6.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000F6DE292E5