4.1	37.5963467	127.08631559999999	2026-03-17 21:15:57.110141	2026-03-17 21:15:57.110141	019cfbb9-64b6-7ceb-9175-a0d5b03d9e38	CAFE	ChIJ-zVf9b67fDURSGz3B8mxac8	1195814116	메가커피 상봉역점	[{"author": "룬룬", "rating": 5, "content": "내부에 앉을 자리도 많고, 음료도 맛있습니다!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWoi8caiCFI2XNCBYdnqfLlpDF4srptrZ6N0oEAeNEwIpabJV0=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "오대교", "rating": 4, "content": "중랑구 상봉역 근처에 있는 커피집.\\n커피가 맛있다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVE5diHcY__rZUTQgJZ23hLPHxmgx88X0Ni9Gd6TV307-VUyWPVEw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "kh Lee", "rating": 3, "content": "화장실 가는 길이 별로다.\\n어둡다고 뒤쪽 유리문에 써놨는데\\n등을 달면 되지 않을까요?\\n충천 가능한 자리가 적다.\\n다른 메가와 달랐다.\\n나머지는 다른 메가 점포와 별차이 없었다.\\n손ㄴ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIrjMIzDr1PXtiI09URS6SDtoc9AupiVBeKRiJD67Z79v5rLQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Harry Yoon", "rating": 5, "content": "집 근처여서 자주 방문하는 곳입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXOGQ32XgtUa19P59Olbd1hPAHwKY788loNECLSUne6lez5osos=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "유동훈", "rating": 5, "content": "가성비 좋고 자리가 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX5DPvkQxBywcyqzmZP5AYPk3KgvIH3cwJtEVoPaxvzVnA6SYHH=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "유니킴", "rating": 5, "content": "위치좋고(전철 3개노선이 교차하는 상봉역 도로 건너),\\n가성비좋고(아이스아메리카노 큰거2,000원),\\n전기콘센트가 많아서 노트북들고가 공부하기좋고(다른사람도 공부하는사람들이 있어서 편함),\\n손흥민 컵홀더...", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXqhs1E7WqklOmB-SkaDqXAhxQjqkhfSBnm5bm-u7vLpVp5mSQRUw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "CHANG YEON LEE (charlee)", "rating": 3, "content": "상봉역 횡단보도 바로 앞이라서 약속장소로 딱 좋음. 커피도 끝판왕. 거의 피쳐로 마실만한 용량. 잠이 확깸.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWNHH-xmxTddQ11ex3YZX24rQunZcIgUihbD9rrICs-maC2Qjyh=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "HyunJu Kang", "rating": 5, "content": "가성비 굿!  싸고 양도 메가급! 지인들과 편안하게 담소 나눌 수 있어서 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWtbK1wVlyXhCVgJFl1prwiNLfLx_Cf0H8X4YOs1_2DG7m3PoGh=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ-zVf9b67fDURSGz3B8mxac8/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ-zVf9b67fDURSGz3B8mxac8/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ-zVf9b67fDURSGz3B8mxac8/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ-zVf9b67fDURSGz3B8mxac8/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000009DC8DD3186C55F40ECC9B21655CC4240
