4.9	37.5921078	127.0715977	2026-03-17 21:15:57.110611	2026-03-17 21:15:57.110611	019cfbb9-64b6-7ceb-917b-262e4b902120	CAFE	ChIJEaUCMwC7fDURtla7SdvKy8I	235894783	카페하인나 상봉점	[{"author": "이재홍", "rating": 4, "content": "동부간선도로 중량교 출구쪽 뚝방에 있어요.\\n차가지고 가면 입구찾기가 좀 어려울수있어요.\\n길도 좁아서 마주오는차 만나면 ㅡㅡ;;;;\\n망고 빙수가 유명해요~~\\n망고 많이 올려져있어서 좋았네요.\\n가끔 들릴만해요~~~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWQLdt5e9DQtWwhN8zNvSU2WbMFqehv2ATK3-db30UmyDBfhXgd=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "Rapgyu", "rating": 5, "content": "기대안하고 갔는데 음식이 맛있다!\\n커피도 빙수도 조각케잌도 안달고 맛있다!\\n가게 앞 조그마한 주차공간이 있고, 생각보다 넓다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVQ4JE5-JH5k2tP356t6i3Cnkc8OsNOZtrpD6fPh2Az_5j_IBmWvQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "조옥희", "rating": 5, "content": "좋은 만남의 장소입니다. 커피도 맛있고 빵도 맛있고요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUZECvizUdIjOYsXW9KJJr37CJvFyjwamv1lxue71YSal4paFz7=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "노원빵셔틀", "rating": 5, "content": "빙수가 맛있는 집", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXZQgZTwPVhO-yorZsHgV9jUsLp0VZuddw5KVy-kk7d32fgk_nP=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "정룡", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKcQnt1nqWXZYYY9bW2ZXNhxx9GnKBN23inqEhLTc79Av_4hw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "걱정말고그냥가자", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVjh0zZth0j7_jYe1IjFlnmG3EOY4xelQfJLILsv9OWYDi_jQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "이형섭", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-Uj