4.5	37.5101935	127.05858239999999	2026-03-17 21:30:19.981831	2026-03-17 21:30:19.981831	019cfbc6-8f4d-71f2-b143-96135263de6e	CAFE	ChIJC3bBJmukfDURKfSMsCsgkkc	114152703	가배도코엑스	[{"author": "김정숙", "rating": 5, "content": "티라미수와 커피, 차가 맛있는 카페 '가배도'는 간판부터 미적인 아름다움이 느껴져요. 분위기 편안하고 좋은데 에어컨이 약한지 실내가 좀 더웠어요.  매장도 넓고 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKCiH0cL2cXdn65e971q9L1gNqIfrg2imGbNsFESJzAoLqL8zvM=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "어흥", "rating": 5, "content": "가베도(咖啡島) coffee island 커피섬이란 뜻이다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI2g6jHGyQCw9Td347s5d98X4CVutji0vgJOZe4hj_6abXWkw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "jj Steve", "rating": 5, "content": "사람 너무 많음. 커피 보통. 티라미스가 맛있음.\\n\\n따아랑 티라미스 시켜먹길 추천!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWWHVz9jIx7o7hv32EsHndnBdXFQUQZY1VFz_XPBHljukZiaHsHnw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "BB", "rating": 4, "content": "말차 쉐이크랑 말차티라미수 주문했어요. 일단은 슬러시 기계에서 돌아가는 쉐이크라서 가격이 좀 비싸게 느껴졌고, 단맛이 강했어요. 단맛이 첨가된 말차 파우더라 조절이 불가능한게 아쉬웠어요. 티라미수도 많이 달아요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUm1sZt3x7g_qBWvyPi0CO1FkdYJZ--4nqPQa4UJanW71b1A_zK=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "정혜연", "rating": 3, "content": "메뉴가 종류가 다양하지 못해 아쉬움. 티라미슈와 커피 잘 어울림. 자리가 편안하고 적당함.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLZNAVojkeWZ62fXk4oteAHB_FT0rU4n2gm3tWsioSyBj-DYQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "上善如水", "rating": 5, "content": "그린이 목마른 도심에서는 #말차라떼 #말차티라미슈", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX27y1OymPMsFTcmfnw7hPyZl4pGQIgaPRklLL3pu8CLMtsNNty=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Seoul drifter", "rating": 4, "content": "좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWWnQZd6XmUzOIK5HVPp_DOZM9u20Rry1Y5D0pew6XMHe7s2Pc=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "_ J", "rating": 4, "content": "분위기 굿", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIRoDOCnTdLaWANxqbfqxYVzItwIW_vBoliy8cdM0GiV9X9hA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJC3bBJmukfDURKfSMsCsgkkc/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJC3bBJmukfDURKfSMsCsgkkc/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJC3bBJmukfDURKfSMsCsgkkc/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJC3bBJmukfDURKfSMsCsgkkc/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJC3bBJmukfDURKfSMsCsgkkc/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJC3bBJmukfDURKfSMsCsgkkc/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJC3bBJmukfDURKfSMsCsgkkc/photos/6.png"}]	[]	0101000020E6100000C10765D0BFC35F40DE9046054EC14240
