3.8	37.5034942	127.04181439999999	2026-02-16 19:12:41.872108	2026-03-17 21:31:59.695358	019c65f0-2110-7605-978b-5f1a2c0ce721	CAFE	ChIJ8wlf6N-lfDUR1OT_RcV-Qc8	510442194	Cafe MUWON	[{"author": "모아스토리", "rating": 5, "content": "서울역에서 잠시 쉬어갈 카페 찾다가 발견한 곳. 서울역 3층 음식점 옆에 길다랗게 자리 잡고 있습니다. 휠체어 타고 간 일행이 있었는데 친절하게 자리 정리해주셨어요. 여유로운 마음이 기분 좋게 만들어준 곳입니다. 우롱차, 아메리카노, 휘낭시에 먹었는데 모두 맛있었어요~ 😋", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWLpxEl40GkZUJKv9pjz5B3nTOeGPauHN5YerNt5lj3lxE_mT-o=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "소남준", "rating": 4, "content": "라떼 괜찮네요. 양갱은 단맛이 적어서 단거 싫어하시면 나쁘지 않습니다. 점심 시간에는 꽤 영업이 잘 되는 것 같습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWvR3muEE1bFSizhVi8N7UVtuvDP7LPm4eTrU1UhrHc5c2q-ExT=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "Weeyoung kim", "rating": 5, "content": "새로생김. 시그니쳐 팥라떼. 텁텁하지 않고 맛있음. 모나카 아이스크림 강추. 약과올라간거 진짜 맛있음! 전통 접시같은것 구경도하구 외국인들한테 선물하거나 같이가도 좋을듯", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocILe1hrA8seZ4vTXSZrWpJOBQZHhzdxwdVjsKw4peKh-rep=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "니캉내캉", "rating": 4, "content": "KTX타기전 잠깐 커피 한잔하기 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUMzTN2KNnpZCjDjCrk9JtN3BaG082J_CkKjAC2ntn3mmBWNz9v=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "youngjun kim", "rating": 5, "content": "백설기앙버터 세상 맛있음..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV0iypZ_oTgQWBL3jvj9ta84T9RmZP-G6U_XlMj2-MNg53joFCx=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Kai Lee", "rating": 4, "content": "센터필드 카페 무원\\n정갈한 한국적인 멋을 살린 프리미엄 한식 디저트 카페. 아늑하고 캐주얼하면서도 힙한 분위기를 갖춤. 매장 곳곳에 예쁜 찻잔과 접시, 다과상 등이 전시되어 있어 눈도 즐겁다. 흔한 서양식 베이커리와 케이크 대신 한국의 전통적인 맛을 현대적으로 재해석한 디저트를 경험 가능.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUR8ob1eGVQZM64DoulO_dv5nYg1PLnRcsQ2xXWbvcDg-ewJqtyZg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Scott Lee", "rating": 4, "content": "The atmosphere is a tasteful blend of traditional Korean decor with modern twist. Everything was very clean and the food and drinks were presented very well.\\n\\nThe food itself was good, the black sesame madeleine was tasty but a bit on the dry side. The iced coffee was served in a very nice ceramic cup and was okay.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXHpW7vGME__Zs4wKjXR04Upnw88bkVVyz-H2288JsHocq9vI3r=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "mk", "rating": 1, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXsMufoNWwLeIpDtJLFJf7ETBQQPB--zSBYOhjvI6QiO5cjZiXr=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ8wlf6N-lfDUR1OT_RcV-Qc8/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ8wlf6N-lfDUR1OT_RcV-Qc8/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ8wlf6N-lfDUR1OT_RcV-Qc8/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ8wlf6N-lfDUR1OT_RcV-Qc8/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ8wlf6N-lfDUR1OT_RcV-Qc8/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ8wlf6N-lfDUR1OT_RcV-Qc8/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ8wlf6N-lfDUR1OT_RcV-Qc8/photos/6.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "cl