4.2	37.2970398	127.07008019999999	2026-02-16 19:12:43.50046	2026-03-17 21:32:19.428518	019c65f0-276c-79f4-89aa-361e61e0abba	CAFE	ChIJefJQgHxbezURQ60cqqj96iQ	971159733	이디야커피 광교상현역점	[{"author": "최선생", "rating": 5, "content": "깔끔한 매장에 어여뿐 바리스타가 있는곳\\n테라스에서 햇살을 즐길수있어 좋다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUw0DYwvSi4Su74aBWn6rbC2FA3H8FRgpM7bqbuQpq_sEEFd_9LQQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "Jin (Ellie lover)", "rating": 5, "content": "머리하얀 멋진 사장님과 매니저님이신거 같은 이쁜 여자분이 쎈스짱!! 깨끗하고 항상 따뜻한 느낌이 드는 곳이에요~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIRFStuLB8SsV5vJ1QKIGMBzD69hSpsns7JSXPrqjh2XJTqAQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "온광러브", "rating": 5, "content": "soso~~인터넷에서 커피할인 쿠폰을 종종 팔아서 갈만함ㅎㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLr-Gnl4jr8gusU9keQWVJQauzY1MKIH7v-1Rc6MARprCEyYA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "최영호", "rating": 5, "content": "이디야 커피, 준수한 그맛! 보통적인 맛", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXkWU-YJblCs58-O3SScjDjFU_EwYphobrUq9_Nk7I_ko_Tf-pg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "배기성", "rating": 4, "content": "조용 한 실내 빠른 서빙 굿", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVgnG_juxr6q89hW6_5PlbEnAZLrYhaaFBfcdkgc0VSlfnTbgNojg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "이지훈", "rating": 4, "content": "주차서비스가 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXDcdwqBeIxMa5ojhmc2D6QzLfHmpyIpUbHOAreqZkCLev9h24ZZg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "프로불편러", "rating": 3, "content": "TL님 여기서 대화해요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVYLsFOXlrkFMG-sVRJh9t3VGyk7HaGEJzK-BGHTC6JmD55Zggr=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "정천호", "rating": 5, "content": "좋음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKiRTPAHlR7_rvas48z9JlqrhUVtBX1-FCuzx1N7Pbf_ABAFQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJefJQgHxbezURQ60cqqj96iQ/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJefJQgHxbezURQ60cqqj96iQ/photos/1.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E610000037C6A9317CC45F40214E716605A64240
4.9	37.5224055	127.024462	2026-02-16 19:12:41.875134	2026-03-17 21:32:23.822238	019c65f0-2113-7aab-b40e-9e16beccf288	CAFE	ChIJe3ovNgCjfDUROGBi4vaFEcU	1114635665	뉴스틸페이퍼커피 신사 가로수길(NewsteelpapeR coffee)	[{"author": "조호정", "rating": 5, "content": "가로수길살짝골목에있고 반지하느낌으로 되어있습니다.커피는전체적으로 맛있고 친절합니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXiKEZOK_GXTDuq2qlUVq5O5MCCS2I6zPDMKooEy5WNgTF_JDAO=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Sum 30", "rating": 5, "content": "인테리어가 정말 멋졌고, 직원분들도 매우 친절하고 멋있었습니다.\\n음료 메뉴도 다양하고, 정성이 느껴졌어요.\\n케이크도 정말 맛있어 보였으니 다음에는 꼭 먹어보고 싶어요.☺️♡\\n가게에서 나오는 음악도 정말 멋졌어요.🎵", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKC0KXS0Kz6OlUZ8K2dXQoWBgh7Ecp9xvdpr-IOF2nvGqplCw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "Yongsuk Sung", "rating": 5, "content": "산미 있는 빈으로 만든 플랫화이트 정말 괜찮았다. 산미를 포함한 Bean의 개성이 우유에 묻히지 않으면서도 우유와 잘 어우러져 좋았다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWpGvRaa37jZUw1WcgFCMawRm9LOueMtJWxOE-ik96B2elYRSMT6g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "띨롱", "rating": 5, "content": "음료 디저트 하나하나 다 맛있고 사장님도 친절하시고 분위기도 좋은 삼위일체 카페 ㅎㅎ 너무 좋아요 초코케이크랑 밀크티 조합 강력추천합니땨 😍💕", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVUIOU40eUP8EQP8QtX6bIp7BayUqlSj8aggvrsCljxdUbeHPk=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Realreview남긴다 Realreviewerman", "rating": 5, "content": "So Great coffee in seoul!!!\\n아주 맛도리입니다👍👍👍👍", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUFQIIji_lfbuX6b3P-YT6NZdlRO5I12c7PeO4zznp8q9Jl2x8=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "으뇽이", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기도 너무 좋고 음악도 완전 제 취향!\\n커피도 맛있어요 또 와야쥥👍👍👍", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW3oYgyW7l_hEkb4wC40b1OJSNVififv_0iN-SWwVISVD6NhRM=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "TY GOD", "rating": 5, "content": "인테리어 힙하고 서비스는 친절하며 커피는 다양한 풍미를 선택할 수 있게되어있음. 디저트도 너무 달지 않고 적절한 중간점을 잘 찾으신 듯\\n\\n입구에서 사람이 너무 없어보여서 움찔했는데 들어가보니 바글바글\\n\\n화장실도 깔끔함 및 향을 좋게 유지하려는 주인분의 의지가 느껴짐(디퓨져가 3개 ㅋㅋㅋㅋ)", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKDv7zlmtivum_WqM16P8Z9ID_OghFECV-uQ4xAIlfsIafGzoY=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "eunj", "rating": 4, "content": "자리가 좀 협소하지만,\\n서비스가 좋고 인테리어도 세련됐습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJgbN0t6lBOFl2EyrALJEMZS9Wqy_NNwMlHmDgtmn3wpE3CDQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJe3ovNgCjfDUROGBi4vaFEcU/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJe3ovNgCjfDUROGBi4vaFEcU/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJe3ovNgCjfDUROGBi4vaFEcU/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJe3ovNgCjfDUROGBi4vaFEcU/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJe3ovNgCjfDUROGBi4vaFEcU/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJe3ovNgCjfDUROGBi4vaFEcU/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJe3ovNgCjfDUROGBi4vaFEcU/photos/6.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJe3ovNgCjfDUROGBi4vaFEcU/photos/7.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJe3ovNgCjfDUROGBi4vaFEcU/photos/8.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJe3ovNgCjfDUROGBi4vaFEcU/photos/9.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": 