4.3	37.5930506	127.0167085	2026-02-16 19:13:13.236059	2026-03-17 21:32:28.41253	019c65f0-9b94-7a17-b860-bdb1bff057ec	CAFE	ChIJ22xvBQC9fDURXO0Y73oxflk	749250219	스타벅스 성신여대입구역점	[{"author": "최기훈", "rating": 4, "content": "성신여대입구역 스타벅스. 제일 나중에 생긴 매장이다.\\n옛날 건물 안에 있어서 입구는 작아보이지만 안에는 꽤 넓다.\\n성신여대 스타벅스보다 제조공간은 넓은데 사람은 적어서 그런건지 음료나오는데 시간이 좀 걸린다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWJI1l_n0xAK2nvlkRVdkvq9p2R3DQXWt_Z_3C_IveP_AVZ3jSX=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "생각보다 소식", "rating": 4, "content": "쾌적하고 역 바로 앞이라 위치도 좋지만 좌석이 큰 매장에 비해 조금 적습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU0jvEmSlTupBrPw4eC7cPmEUPZnzfl4xPL71fHFhApQaYfRxg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Yonghee Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "친절함", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIwZtmpo_3w5-qfgLWthiuWxjLj_RFjWpUZ8KNNV9k8L9qNCQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Yongho Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "I visited the newly opened Starbucks. It was a nice place to grab a drink and a snack. Overall, it was a pleasant experience.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVpAbeDbjJJsrNBB7FGHZL6X_8FkiaPYvn8vBv2SY5fwN8WpnTc=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Mann Ein", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVWYrpV07BzYtCtJjtScye3E32vIf2YX6RK6sIUKc6YOs6aciQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "최경은", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIatVC0b9VsyF5nR3NHkjjs9cISVDZKfnQX7Scc9xr18BdAqw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ22xvBQC9fDURXO0Y