4.4	37.5196204	126.8574106	2026-02-16 19:12:41.875776	2026-03-17 21:32:33.636887	019c65f0-2113-7aab-b410-c50617faf070	CAFE	ChIJo_JsKNCdfDURjiblt9xxD40	684826268	스마일빈	[{"author": "Molly Song", "rating": 4, "content": "젊은 사장님이 친절하세요 .. 샵에 큰 로스터로 매일 볶는 신선한 원두로 커피를 내려 맛있고도 저렴한 커피집이예요 .. 부드러운 맛을 좋아한다면 사이폰으로 추출한 커피를 꼭 드셔보세요♡", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX-rdGm1ad49vHEhIk3CkCgN5fXCLOzfBu17szMoFYC0IlGeq3g2w=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "SONG SONG", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기도 좋고 커피도 맛남", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX_MxmbJHS0fqYClSkurWUgzc1rH5cmAZUDaSDuxUsdrGdaIg5M=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "지니지니", "rating": 5, "content": "커피가 맛있어요. 가격도 저렴하고 집 근처에 있어 이웃들과 모여 이런저런 얘기 나눌 수 있는 사랑방 같은 곳입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUqNFwCJUcK21tKVkX7iZrPXOryqNYd5OhmPgLa94-UrKXM8oih=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Yoon Ki Min", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님이 젠틀하시고 친절하세요. 원두도 직접 볶으셔서 커피 맛이 정날 좋아요 :)", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIigyNsk78pjn7KYsTp-lJDCXwRMTNl4LYlGqOSJlLKe4hGKQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "김소영", "rating": 4, "content": "커피도 맛있고 사장님도 너무 친절하세요\\n조금 춥고 좌석이 너무 붙어있는게 흠이지만요~^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJbvHmvcl9SoTPRZQeUILYmnWNpITCuHhmEDrVJZgBPrA5MdA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "임은숙", "rating": 3, "content": "커피맛이 soso~\\n사장님은 무지 친절하지만 커피는 약간 심심~\\n샷 추가해 드릴께요~~하면\\n네~~~라고 꼭 말해세요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX7418C98hOaH_fuoEUrp7s_BjNQyT9JC4T--aTUa8yOTOCtBpD=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "육나리", "rating": 5, "content": "오늘 처음가봤어요. 은은한 조명의 분위기와 항상 사람이 많아서 궁금했는데..맛있고 사장님이 친절하셔요^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-WJvlH_KyUGsdOW_ints_yCmoYiKyGpxfigRziyeMd25dPQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "youngsim yi", "rating": 5, "content": "빨리열고 늦게 닫아서 좋아요\\n편안한 회의와 업무에도 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKrE7b9kfvAuFLhfD0wUnZvx6syrpew0rInjDW13_xiQqy86g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJo_JsKNCdfDURjiblt9xxD40/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJo_JsKNCdfDURjiblt9xxD40/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJo_JsKNCdfDURjiblt9xxD40/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJo_JsKNCdfDURjiblt9xxD40/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJo_JsKNCdfDURjiblt9xxD40/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJo_JsKNCdfDURjiblt9xxD40/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000998FB5D0DFB65F40CF2AD8EB82C24240
