5	37.475028	127.0363598	2026-03-17 21:34:15.243707	2026-03-17 21:34:15.243707	019cfbca-264b-787a-a575-68a48e83483c	CAFE	ChIJ3dS9cgChfDUR-fAva7T6fg8	1071588001	삼이일공커피공장	[{"author": "YK Baek", "rating": 5, "content": "대표 커피라고 표시되어있는\\n북유럽 라떼 마셨는데\\n정말 부드럽고, 인위적인 단맛이 아닌\\n부드러운 달달 라떼 였어요!\\n4300원 가격도 착하네요\\n\\n여자사장님 같으셨는데 참 친절하세요:)\\n\\n아침에가서 갓구운 무화과 크림치즈 휘낭시에 먹었는데 부드럽고 맛있네요ㅎㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXjk4m1V9HZ8x6KiqoXJtzHK00zvsADORSVdDe0DtGeteSdCyMGaQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "JIN :D", "rating": 5, "content": "커피와 디져트가 특별한곳 분위기도 아늑하고 좋았어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXgy309BtrVGrdF8sdlSwvr0BIDdMxJaa6mQd93Dknrf4T2np-9=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "나윤관", "rating": 5, "content": "음료와 디저트에 정성이 느껴진 곳!!!\\n신선한 메뉴도 많아요^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXO9F1fsu2YeCDFSmMAzyaJ7M3NXMo0x0IxfW6YQEOD23dYUzo=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Janice Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "2024.11.01\\n커피 맛있어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVc5YFDoAxraVyzSv-7CKQ9XH9k8dt_7xenhFj-iItXpeI29cPz=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ3dS9cgChfDUR-fAva7T6fg8/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ3dS9cgChfDUR-fAva7T6fg8/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ3dS9cgChfDUR-fAva7T6fg8/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ3dS9cgChfDUR-fAva7T6fg8/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "