4	37.5033375	127.05057289999999	2026-03-17 21:36:38.204789	2026-03-17 21:36:38.204789	019cfbcc-54bc-769c-8520-288f48cd69f5	CAFE	ChIJVX2JLielfDURT4T9Kb3rR80	17097590	커피빈 선릉로86길점	[{"author": "Songyi Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "매장넓고 시끄럽지않아좋습니다.화장실 깨끗하구요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVC7rNuIony0aWvf0AHesb_V3lDi3V5SHS28qCM4rg1jWMl5DU=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "송은정", "rating": 4, "content": "직원분들 정말 친절하세요. 에스프레소 맛있어요.\\n장소가 조금 협소하고 테이블 간격이 좁아서 손님들 많을 때는 좀 많이 소란스럽긴 해요, 원치않아도 옆 테이블 대화가 강제로 귀에 쏙쏙~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKPiUA3LOs2-aEKLJ4nlKemQ5W3PQlFmC8Xzkk8z-OJKmb2_w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Jaeyong Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "쾌적하고 여유롭습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLuBMT7kylEZA33tFEQNMMv5fHNGLae1SjQwV84P6_JjX4WlQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "파란돈만장", "rating": 4, "content": "진선여고 맞은편 학원,오피스밀집지역에 위치해있어서 미팅장소로 좋은데 장소가협소한것이 단점", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVg-csRzWESFYlUs0U4O886hCd1K0tYY1M6PIXNVLs8Qsh64e0=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "ITA HA", "rating": 3, "content": "일반적인 커피샵인데 서싱할 정도로 메뉴가 다양합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXnn-y89oIDjjXqqV7-C1AtwNQ0cO8XXySQW-HX4G1Bae8HLGnNYw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "Bola Seo", "rating": 4, "content": "직원이 엄청 친절하고 편안한 분위기가 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX2FUcZU9Dx1JcGq9_TKM4sCbpgroLhYAgxAsUnHbde7yGgbF3CqQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "이선경", "rating": 3, "content": "케익은 맛있는데 베이글 외 베이커리류는 언제나 기대이하", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKSvK9CLLEPlXb4nJYjAsb3d_4TbEdbn37nL0wEZxWo2E-o384=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "김상훈", "rating": 5, "content": "깔끔하고 친절합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWD6uvE85d0zomm2A7T0IWP9ptTziXcrglkSQf5JEwc7X6Iw33TxA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJVX2JLielfDURT4T9Kb3rR80/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJVX2JLielfDURT4T9Kb3rR80/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJVX2JLielfDURT4T9Kb3rR80/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E610000016E41D963CC35F40DAACFA5C6DC04240
4.6	37.4965255	126.7628345	2026-03-17 21:36:38.205009	2026-03-17 21:36:38.205009	019cfbcc-54bd-7a1a-b63c-18ae0461c73b	CAFE	ChIJiasnnQJ9ezURn2CNjNwqHNg	705181752	투썸플레이스 부천중동시장점	[{"author": "김슐랭로드", "rating": 4, "content": "■방문 _2024.11.11\\n■메뉴 _윈터 받쇼 R 6500원, 아메리카노디카 R 4800원, 아이스크림 라떼디카니 6900원, P TWG 얼그레이 밀크티 6200원, 떠먹는 로투스 비스코프 6500원\\n\\n매장 넓고 쾌적해요. 컴퓨터하는 사람들이 많아서 목소리 조절하게 됨..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWPeVJcBVEJTh-p1B_zs7MxD0_f-q9_2YCWtv5pqxYdXTv0uM1N=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Seungwoo Shin", "rating": 4, "content": "내부공간은 넗고 쾌적해요. 커피맛은 일반적입니다. 직원들이 친절해요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUhJ0ppYDP62IV1OggNnfRym5jII-_M_JonxsMg6aGvrkXcsCFL=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "산타", "rating": 5, "content": "생긴지 얼마 안된 투썸~.\\n주말 저녁 이용객은 많았지만 조용하네요.\\n커피 맛나게 먹고왔습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWxLF5AmcUwN80IZbVGyydjpFnI2sL2Yx7E6-Tb0PTPocb5gst_Sg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "K타마르", "rating": 5, "content": "작업할 때 집중 잘 돼요. 옆에 다른 대형까페는 음악소리가 넘 큰데 여긴 적당한 듯", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbw3JZoASBMRjkXxIRqy2h-AU2mxxvK9gao3yt5PpklmgR9g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Cheol sung oh", "rating": 4, "content": "쾌적하고 자리가 여유있습니다.건물 뒤 주차 가능합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVJzqtkL83qdh4WXi0e9wlKrV7OuOJQOMBg4kbkCzT_xiSTVukd=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "김소연", "rating": 5, "content": "새로 생긴 곳이라 깨끗하고 공간이 넓은 편입니다. 커피나 음료 맛이 평이하거나 괜찮은 편임^^\\n마음  편히 이용하기  좋은 곳~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUq88lf8CKNUvxaw1IERSlpgt6LxtuohXjneSgss0GlPbvPCTFi=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "고지윤", "rating": 5, "content": "넓고 분위기 아늑해요\\n커피맛도 맛납니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLgQo6F4pQhoWfTSQUwLY-NUllyEK3-21IuaxYqqvxMtAWZmA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "팔팔홍 PalPal Hong", "rating": 5, "content": "최근에 생겨 넓고 쾌적. 주차도 가능", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWv_i8Ask_ixPloWJtLlqmDa4TtUMRrhYEjeriDbeVXN-9fkuQR=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJiasnnQJ9ezURn2CNjNwqHNg/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJiasnnQJ9ezURn2CNjNwqHNg/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJiasnnQJ9ezURn2CNjNwqHNg/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000AC70CB47D2B05F40A510C8258EBF4240
