4.4	37.2179676	126.6078541	2026-03-17 21:40:02.941634	2026-03-17 21:40:02.941634	019cfbcf-747d-73d0-a1d5-f6f9f17c7f42	CAFE	ChIJSfljdKigezUR7JUXMjskSLM	2117072042	커피정원	[{"author": "김민정", "rating": 5, "content": "커피맛도 좋고\\n카페도 이뻤어요\\n날 따뜻하면 정원에서ㅈ커피마셔도 좋을듯 합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX7v72No5WJIusUmoKWbwQjU0uLxvePh-a17A4dzaULUtHMDPxs-w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "정석희", "rating": 5, "content": "내부와 정원이 정말 잘  꾸며져 있습니다\\n감탄이 나올정도이네요\\n제가 평소에 베이커리 카페를 자주 가는데 여기는 베이커리 카페가 아니라서 빵이 몇가지 없는것이 좀 아쉽습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWJFpEem2dCBxX7QgBDGYtgtNutGi7Xfb3db49hFyKS68cJWdeWfg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Young Ho Seo", "rating": 5, "content": "대부도 해뜨락펜션 겸 커피정원\\n강추합니다.\\n사장님이 직접 만드신 펜션\\n커피도 손수 로스팅 하시고\\n미술을 전공하신 사모님\\n친절과 정을\\n떠나는 날 아침에 주신\\n갓볶은 아메리카노에\\n담아 출발했습니다.\\n건강하세요~~~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKd-f6W4C54EeJaeAJVZjUKmT5q9hgGXtpHAxJmi5-g4N71Hg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "J.K. Cho", "rating": 4, "content": "커피 맛과 질 모두 좋고, 정원 이뻐요.\\n바다전망은 뻘이라 그닥 없답니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXv820u2ZoINSp_mE-PsfYe7XCwRBlnH9rsnx4CtXxo7y_RnV4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "Eunae Hwang", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기도 좋고 조용하고 커피도 맛있었어요♡", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVZfRX2eS3tkLHutF07zMK7Uu35fCtpLo3jL3aGiCFzyfzQz7A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Olivia J", "rating": 5, "content": "정원도 예쁘게 꾸며져 있어 편안한 곳이예요. 커피맛도 당연 좋구요.\\n사장님이 친절하셔서 편하게 쉬고 올 수 있엉ᆢㄷ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW8v6hXxThF4iUUmXwlqG_XfI94zwGBANwVHsnJ2eZ9SZY90MBc=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "김다영", "rating": 5, "content": "친절하고 공간은 너무 예쁘고 커피맛도 좋았어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUHE-aJk5kfUL25seHCxkPxRMaFfBMXMAdjGs39Gwkd9641L_UMbg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Story Luna", "rating": 3, "content": "노키즈존이라 실내는 아이들 출입금지\\n노키즈존이라 써있었으면 안갔을 것\\n넓은데 화장실이 한칸씩이라 한참 기다려야함\\n아아에 얼음이 조금 뿐임\\n초코라떼, 초코인지 안써주셔서 구분이 안감\\n\\n알바생 없이 부부가 운영하셔서 한참 기다려야함\\n\\n커플이 간다면 괜춘할 듯", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXHiK39KVL5hZS36c-LM9z0FO-bnfwd29FutzMEmGDS3fNpAtNM=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJSfljdKigezUR7JUXMjskSLM/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJSfljdKigezUR7JUXMjskSLM/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJSfljdKigezUR7JUXMjskSLM/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJSfljdKigezUR7JUXMjskSLM/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJSfljdKigezUR7JUXMjskSLM/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJSfljdKigezUR7JUXMjskSLM/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJSfljdKigezUR7JUXMjskSLM/photos/6.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJSfljdKigezUR7JUXMjskSLM/photos/7.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000540FE214E7A65F4037CBC