5	37.5219632	127.0258727	2026-03-17 21:41:26.978181	2026-03-17 21:41:26.978181	019cfbd0-bcc2-77cc-b5fc-f3831f06c2e1	CAFE	ChIJEySBSnKjfDURxl5m0-IPUd4	2082454279	루틴잇 ROUTINE:IT	[{"author": "[호주줄리아]Austjulia", "rating": 5, "content": "바나나푸딩이랑 헤이즐넛 라떼 먹었는데\\n어떻게 설탕이랑 버터 없이 이렇게 맛있는 맛을 낼 수 있는지,,, 건강하고 맛있는 카페는 처음이에요!\\n모든 메뉴 다 먹어보고 싶네여ㅜㅜ\\n\\nI had banana pudding 🍌 and hazelnut latte ☕️.\\nI cannot believe how they made these DELICIOUS and HEALTHY dessert and coffee without sugar and butter,,!!!\\nPlease try any of them.. you’d love all of them! 🫶", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUAqntJkD9uhkw1qrJC2uVv1p6H7M8qCjOej3j9JgbB_gowW9u5=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "7878 korea", "rating": 5, "content": "여기 완전 미친 맛..!!\\n노슈가.. 노버터.. 라고해서\\n맛없을줄 알았는데...\\n처음가서 여기 시그니처음료라고 해서\\n일단 그거 두가지부터 시켜봤는데..\\n루틴잇스페너.. 무설탕인데 왜 둘 다 맛있어?\\n양도 넘쳐흐르게 줬는데.. 그게 컨셉인듯..\\n살짝 달짝 지는 달면서도 고소함이 가득한 맛.\\n카페는 크지 않았지만\\n깨끗하고 심플.. 내 취향이었음.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVReSx5j6scA3Pag_wdnFACzLRcDegQeNtWhZ9VTz_XQSrgjdtfFg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Danny Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "정말 맛있습니다. 가격도 너무 합리적이고 일단 퀄리티가 너무 좋네요. 맛도 챙기고 건강도 챙기는 이런곳은 루틴처럼 오고싶어지네요. 그래서 루틴잇인가.. 무튼 한번두번세번다섯번열번오세요 ㅎㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW0a7R0nM2c9GNOozzMuvMCZULAe3Dyrub0uEarmnVGk3X2S_cE=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "NVZ", "rating": 5, "content": "지나가다 들렀는데 맛있어요!!! 쉐이크 추천!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLO6jGohYyePf_YuR9BqTrd-Y7MTxRmRi0Visvgh67iIHR4NA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Fanny M", "rating": 5, "content": "Very kind staff :) the banana pudding is one of the best I tried. Really love this place", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLBQ2WnFwVhhirEiw2ZVMQxrP2hdhnmkmMcBw0WnDe75MOGQaI=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "YESEUL CHANG", "rating": 5, "content": "A lot of healthy pleasure coffees, beverages and bakeries.\\nThere are various types protein shakes it also good\\nManager is sooo handsome 💪\\nThey don’t use sugar and butter (no sugar, no butter)", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLl7Cm2WHxtez5q1uRAWwkV-whnFGqvPypstXwlF0jJOiDxBg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Zolo Enguun", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKMABz_wtc3HGQO8jbg6lAd5ZYbZbQmwZxsRixQuxIJbr3tyA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJEySBSnKjfDURxl5m0-IPUd4/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJEySBSnKjfDURxl5m0-IPUd4/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJEySBSnKjfDURxl5m0-IPUd4/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJEySBSnKjfDURxl5m0-IPUd4/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJEySBSnKjfDURxl5m0-IPUd4/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [8, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [8, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000FD16F8E5A7C15F4096DBACB0CFC24240
