4	37.258601299999995	127.13398199999999	2026-03-17 21:42:57.137122	2026-03-17 21:42:57.137122	019cfbd2-1cf1-7b90-9a91-016aae702c93	CAFE	ChIJ70tGSABRezUR_J4V7Wdtxhg	796918104	카페봄	[{"author": "Tae Soo Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "위치가 다소 외롭지만\\n매장 넓고  친절하고\\n젊은 사장님부부가 매우 친절하고\\n열심히 하심", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKKq1q5R7sRFyH3oAWyCC6mqDb2NpeyKTsacbxryl_MuJLf2g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ70tGSABRezUR_J4V7Wdtxhg/photos/0.png"}]	[]	0101000020E61000002B103D2993C85F40FE19EFD819A14240
5	37.572088699999995	126.9744813	2026-03-17 21:42:08.788924	2026-03-17 21:42:08.788924	019cfbd1-6014-73c3-9b68-dde70fb54b61	CAFE	ChIJoSaEXZOifDURqWIQbIW7GzI	352677691	홍카페	[{"author": "장원경", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님이 직접구운 빵이 신선한 커피와 어우러져 침샘을 자극하고 친절함에 반하는 곳", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWxPc4pUT5t368f2qCGbSCdJcSxIkrC1duvQttjulkTwmecYZ16LA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "이수연", "rating": 5, "content": "맛있는 커피와 수제 빵", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWzI6p03sSSKdo6yTawk3dKXXSs6-67qsdyE0eoSWHvB68oML4D=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "Maria Hammar", "rating": 5, "content": "Great place and great service! We had egg sandwiches, smoothie, milk tea, chocolate cake and biscuits. Everything was top notch and that chocolate cake was to die for!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUUgH8Tb8cXJn-MfppRq3CXdIJjpwxM6vZ40qKI_rgM6UlNP-A=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "임현진", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXznpLQNjrU98OrHKnw-a8Jau3BQbIAljPjJddltDOUPrVrY2z-=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJoSaEXZOifDURqWIQbIW7GzI/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJoSaEXZOifDURqWIQbIW7GzI/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJoSaEXZOifDURqWIQbIW7GzI/photos/2.png"}]	[]	0101000020E61000001184D0E65DBE5F40A074D8333AC94240
4.9	36.9652308	127.0601667	2026-03-17 21:42:08.789038	2026-03-17 21:42:08.789038	019cfbd1-6015-7dcb-90f6-89392fdb5a9a	CAFE	ChIJGVBXewAlezURHnXzW8RBM3A	2009218311	홍사우커피집	[{"author": "Andy kwak", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기는 좀 협소합니다 주차도 좀 아쉬운 감이 있습니다 하지만 라떼가 맛있고 가격이 너무 착하네요. 특히나 테이크아웃을 했을 때 정말로 가격이 친절합니다 2,000원 정도 깎아 줍니다. 근처에서 밥 먹고 잠깐 커피 마시면서 얘기하고 싶으신 분들은 여기 들리시는 걸 추천합니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKlogUFrlD3LJ8RA6J9j4UoZEaH5eFwhx8KgyhokXloB_Rqug=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Bible kim", "rating": 5, "content": "진짜 이동네에서 커피 제일 맛있어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXqN1K_4BXMameRmxqoTJIFPF_coG5PxIpLredDjdQi_hTdxSAo3w=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Olivia Park", "rating": 5, "content": "Discover Hong’s Coffeehouse: A Cozy Gem in Pyeongtaek\\n\\nNestled in the heart of Pyeongtaek, just a short drive from Camp Humphreys, Hong’s Coffeehouse is the perfect retreat for coffee enthusiasts and anyone seeking a cozy atmosphere. Located at 경기 평택시 팽성읍 동서촌로 71-6, this charming spot offers a delightful blend of comfort, quality, and artistry.\\n\\nWarm Ambiance and Welcoming Charm\\n\\nFrom the moment you walk through the door, Hong’s Coffeehouse greets you with its warm and inviting ambiance. The space is designed to make you feel at ease, whether you’re catching up with friends, working on your laptop, or simply enjoying a moment of quiet. The decor strikes a perfect balance between modern elegance and cozy charm, making it feel like your home away from home.\\n\\nCoffee Crafted with Care\\n\\nThe coffee here isn’t just a drink—it’s an experience. Each cup is prepared with attention to detail, and the latte art is nothing short of spectacular. The intricate designs not only make your drink Instagram-worthy but also create a sense of personal connection, as if each cup is crafted just for you. From velvety lattes to bold espressos, the menu caters to all preferences, ensuring every customer leaves satisfied.\\n\\nA Touch of Royalty\\n\\nWhat sets Hong’s Coffeehouse apart is the feeling of understated luxury it exudes. Every detail, from the friendly service to the thoughtful presentation of drinks, makes you feel valued and pampered. It’s a space that invites you to slow down and savor the moment, adding a touch of royalty to your everyday routine.\\n\\nConvenient Parking\\n\\nVisiting Hong’s Coffeehouse is stress-free, thanks to the convenient public sideroad parking area nearby. Whether you’re driving in from Camp Humphreys or exploring Pyeongtaek, parking won’t be an issue, making this charming café all the more accessible.\\n\\nWhy You Should Visit\\n\\nWhether you’re stationed at Camp Humphreys or exploring the Pyeongtaek area, Hong’s Coffeehouse is a must-visit. Its combination of high-quality coffee, inviting atmosphere, and meticulous attention to detail makes it a standout choice for locals and visitors alike.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWan8UD-ZmFqVhxjX3iaY5YzW2gd3wexuvluekOb0D1c8y0_hRKWQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Stefan Pentz", "rating": 5, "content": "Hongsawoo Coffee House ist ein wirklich tolles Café. Sie haben sehr guten Kaffee. Und ich mag die Bagel sehr gerne. Auch die Kuchen kann ich sehr empfehlen.\\nDas Personal ist sehr freundlich und hilfsbereit. Und die angenehme Atmosphäre lädt zum verweilen ein.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJET68HTb4oUyUoWW0nCzKLpA5yzzgIpcsfa9du0o6RE9wRlw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Daniel Chicko (knovah)", "rating": 5, "content": "Absolutely delightful! Hongsawoo Coffee House has quickly become my new favorite spot. The caramel latte is simply divine – rich, smooth, and perfectly balanced. And the coconut? Forget about it! It's the best I've ever had, hands down.\\nBut what truly sets Hongsawoo apart is their generous sizing for iced drinks. I appreciate being able to order a proper \\"large\\" or \\"extra-large\\" iced coffee and at a discount if you order to-go.  You get your money's worth here.\\nThe atmosphere is cozy and inviting, and the staff are friendly, efficient, and speak perfect English if your Hangul is limited. It's clear they take pride in their coffee and their customers. If you're looking for an exceptional coffee experience with generous portions, look no further than Hongsawoo Coffee House. Five stars all the way!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUrqgzae6fD2pc_T1MRKwjPPDES4X7eWKfVZCBnZVBq69NfKpG5oA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Arthur Lacerda", "rating": 5, "content": "The barista gentlemen speaks English and was very friendly. Excellent coffee and welcoming environment.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWxrCyQoMXipJnSBVnq6wVJbdvP6votSPnx_bQvV2BULXfUjs80Ig=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Candace Rain", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXbojp_YxkMMLY7f-S612jMiiEWNPZ-V3ef1P2_lG5yQ_8oq70=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Joy Moraca", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJy5mUFZdpQJbX8Bp2GKoSr43ErVEh0Tecv8urTk8ydAD3sRJhn=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJGVBXewAlezURHnXzW8RBM3A/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJGVBXewAlezURHnXzW8RBM3A/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJGVBXewAlezURHnXzW8RBM3A/photos/2.png"}