5	37.6547664	127.01325569999999	2026-02-16 19:13:15.720625	2026-03-17 21:43:00.231075	019c65f0-a548-7d3c-b02c-15222dde8cf5	CAFE	ChIJqUpfqyC8fDURi5vDsRWCv60	1009937809	클럽포틀락	[{"author": "윤Grace", "rating": 5, "content": "커피맛과 브런치..\\n분위기..어느 한가지도 나무랄데가없는\\n좋은장소", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVcz8N527PJNZF4rlvNevMfFwXWETq9R-8nJNk_Icqk3gHGtG3OUg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "레몬소녀", "rating": 5, "content": "가격은 저렴하고 분위기 좋고 커피맛도 좋아요~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJahI1Rr7ifAt6SLQn0f9pRwHnLncpinG8AIqW9dTomEi44Nw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "정소라", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님부부 완전 짜앙!!! 커피도 브런치도 맛있어요!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLkSrz1JjHnuLiDoL54Nx0Aj5rsi4zuSfZEthVOjtUkmYsQwg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "이준희 (캔디팝스튜디오)", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님 친절하고 분위기도 좋네요^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV0FfoSPiZk-phfFPJoyuPmu3knEoda8hsyFabqsFv1b7_QZ0Hf=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Hosun Choi", "rating": 5, "content": "아늑하고 편안한 카페", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVtq8qydeZGOLFFULHwZYgDaeU9CMD6fcHMOd0o86ORnFEtvdhh=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Joungmin Oh", "rating": 5, "content": "awesome", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL72UpRkC61MbBWtYnEcohUPG9O2i2hQ4xT1eZ0L2nWalWUrw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "혜니", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWmT2dnoedMgJj1zVo65ZhjBAme6_dNFrby0-Y8PftZwnnMRvgI=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJqUpfqyC8fDURi5vDsRWCv60/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJqUpfqyC8fDURi5vDsRWCv60/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJqUpfqyC8fDURi5vDsRWCv60/photos/2.png"}]	[]	0101000020E6100000137F6F2ED9C05F408442A962CFD34240
4	37.6202414	127.0152042	2026-02-16 19:13:15.720818	2026-03-17 21:43:01.738581	019c65f0-a548-7d3c-b02e-d2c419adcb63	CAFE	ChIJG_kzAGa9fDURG4L3j0n54mM	1004103661	커피베이 솔샘역점	[{"author": "민정기", "rating": 3, "content": "크기가 아담하고 횡단보도 바로앞 1층이라서 약속장소로\\n좋은거같아요ㆍ커피맛은 보통정도", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXxHhGaZNlTsxsKJETbBjHdzqljRs-3COeJQL2GP8z0wj4wqjWG=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "신동옥", "rating": 3, "content": "솔샘 공원 경유 북한산 둘레길 모임장소..서빙하는 분이 초보인가 봐요..인간미가 흐르네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUi_8ifxz1xphZmqdFYTHD9qOZqvx0ARmq2epB3huKfA3hhbkA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "박형란", "rating": 4, "content": "조용하고 깨끗해서 좋았어요. 커피맛 대비 가격 비싸요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJzk3isQyso_KCDD5cG-mfhsaSn6c3YQ1tfyI142TGhMnsUVQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "서영한", "rating": 5, "content": "오더 받는 직원이 매우 친절하였고, 커피맛도 풍부해서 좋았습니다!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXU4IL5VG1xoTLnX4-NK7eCyp3j8oBj1Pwiur2gIgYtfDbSP4md=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "이앙꼬", "rating": 5, "content": "편함  해가 하도잘들어서 졸릴정도임ㅋㅋㅋ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIejQuAH0Qg0ngVdiMwPBL7aUIBtn_6fBvo48si9-0CDi0bFA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "박창민", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기도 좋고 커피도 제 취향이었어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIdPv7OqbyPcXpcyHF6S_Rs-JDkyRW2PaZY3Ur8FWsowJQzrg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "강혜진 (깡잉)", "rating": 5, "content": "깔끔하고 저렴한가격 친절한직원.  전기콘센트 사용가능!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIbLzOnfqDpPkBZQQTKPwiFdUuuGNTOh_bZHHtrCtDTBmYtFA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "suzy Su", "rating": 5, "content": "깨끗하고 분위기도 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW7DiICQpfGdoAWkv0bM8S569a2ltdo9O4L8bqm8HZvbHMVNOiK=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJG_kzAGa9fDURG4L3j0n54mM/photos/0.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000C270091BF9C05F400850F81164CF4240
4.5	37.6561993	127.0154692	2026-02-16 19:13:15.720975	2026-03-17 21:43:03.82395	019c65f0-a548-7d3c-b02f-b75786edf473	CAFE	ChIJx014zyK8fDURlJP_zY2je_g	1612110439	하이투피플	[{"author": "이종일", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님들이 저말 친절하시고 다맛있습니다!자주가요❤", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWud_9pn6MD4J3paXSK4nXxtI5-r5IqOgowB6sBQxR0oSRC8GLX=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "이정우", "rating": 3, "content": "근자에 개업한 까페로 분위기가 조용하고 차맛도 괜찮은 집이다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ89NtBOWenerBuizAcwgc-wZPtNUa9KTzI_LjTYgzErzYnxQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "정영진", "rating": 5, "content": "장소는 조금 작을 수 있지만 정말 맛있고 사장님 친절합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXS94WriXji7mxFV_8AAxcWYGDeshAy6IfYpTK_7zC5zPG9Cinrow=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "최규진", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기 좋네요! 커피맛도 굿!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ3eI-KJRPoqKYoGJ2HZKvLPVo9VdbM-GLiKImmOAf7AKrbaw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "d w", "rating": 5, "content": "친절하시구 아늑하고 좋아요~♡", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXbQB98I8HxI4leCyHMHS8OgiD3OjRNLPfLT42uI_VcgGdjP4g=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "서울촌놈", "rating": 4, "content": "바닐라 크림 더치먹음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWeHzL9z9U7U4qY3y7OhUJSWYAS-mHXNPrkFctduu-EHKqJ3ocv=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "장길순", "rating": 5, "content": "동네 조그만 까페", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLl_V-kN7V3qhK6QaTpitFfR9TJO4jaSGJUoGal_Fs6ii6ABQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Jung Ho Shin", "rating": 5, "content": "이쁜장소^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXazKDqdJoLRKXjgKfCXe4IRcrGRlZ_A_sgh5Y7bcMj8XeytcVg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJx014zyK8fDURlJP_zY2je_g/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJx014zyK8fDURlJP_zY2je_g/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJx014zyK8fDURlJP_zY2je_g/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}]	0101000020E610000019068772FDC05F403C94B256FED34240
4.4	37.3192899	127.6099364	2026-02-16 19:13:15.7217	2026-03-17 21:43:04.494723	019c65f0-a549-7087-8d1d-2677187f2586	CAFE	ChIJsdEON6RdYzURqBb_VYUOoM0	1429088335	알바트로스커피로스터스	[{"author": "Jae Gyun Han", "rating": 5, "content": "조용한 분위기에 경치도 좋고. 커피 맛이 좋아요. 아이스크림 메뉴도 있어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLM0QIFYtkkl92G-p-kUxXijQ2Z7J9-4TgxKDnFqC-IRpyPAA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "JS L", "rating": 5, "content": "직접 로스팅하고 커피를 내리는 집. 마침 로스팅하는 시간이라 구수한 커피냄새가 너무나 좋았다. 커피 원두는 두가지였고 하나는 바디감 좋은 커피 그리고 하나는 산미 있는 커피 이렇게 두종류. 산미있는 커피로 마셨다. 상당히 깔끔한 맛의 커피. 뷰 또한 강변뷰이고 잠시 산책하기도 좋았다. 주차장은 카페 바로앞 세칸정도되는 주차장과 그리고 바로옆 여주카페와 같이 넓은 주차장을 쓰는듯하다. (주차장이 넓다 아주좋다)\\n다음에 지나갈일있으면 꼭 다시 들르고 싶다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXfSPueVHMCJxnz1YmilFxXQGIeMuFjF1YYaNl-XRGAzqu_uteBEw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "박지현", "rating": 4, "content": "넓은 주차장, 아늑한 분위기, 탁 트인 전망, 좋은 날씨까지 합해져 너무 좋았다!\\n시그니쳐 커피들도 신기하고 맛있었다.\\n우유니 사막이 좀 더 짭짤한 느낌이 강했고 우유니사막이니가 좀 더 덜았다. 위에 크림이 상상보다 쫀득해서 맛있었다.\\n다만, 크로플은 조금 질겨서 아쉬웠다.\\n재방문 의사 완전있!!!!!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI9cuz6qSxjVKqDz9pBgQFph2vOgK72zHw69QaI81KyU9bu=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "jj j", "rating": 5, "content": "블렌딩 3종이 있고 원두 판매도 하며 싱글 원두은 없었어요. 그렇지만 커피가 신선하고 맛이 좋았습니다. 창밖으로 보이는 경치도 예쁘고요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUO-oLxbo8aWT0WzhKY6s7mGNXsNpo9J5vGF_xCbqyj9MYZnC0=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "이진경", "rating": 5, "content": "여주보 갈때마다 들르는 곳. 맨날 아.아만 먹다 처음으로 시그니처메뉴인 우유니사막이니? 먹어봤는데 크림이 신세계인것....달달하니 고소하고 부드러운 것이...\\n또 먹으로 가고싶은 충동이 느껴집니다. 남친 토스트는 갠적으로 저에겐 잼이 좀 과한건지 새콘달달함이 딱히 취향은 아니었던 것 같아요~ 담엔 다른거 먹어봐야겠어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWnVi9SulXbDTnqu5ebECclgDTYF2zHtQWMqf36gqBq6VA7pdpUOQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "hyerim WON (리무)", "rating": 5, "content": "커피가 아주 맛있음. 고양이 플라이도 아주 귀엽다. 아픈곳 덧나지말고 빨리 나으렴 ㅠㅠㅠ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVlPrCzOXgDny9zAUF_qNmAvBh1xl61YCi8pwBqB71mpA0gO2c=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "lee지애 (뚜비찌)", "rating": 4, "content": "커피맛잇어요\\n여주보근처에 카페끼리옹기종기잇어요\\n커피에대해잘모르지만\\n우유니사막 커퓌  한입먹고\\n맛잇다 라는느낌에  제  스타일이엿답니다\\n디저트도잇는데스콘은 별로엿고\\n초코칩쿠키같은건 괜찮앗답니다\\n메뉴들 다 맛보고싶단생각을해본\\n카페엿어요\\n커피맛이변하지않앗으며 하는바램이잇네요\\n카페내부는답답한느낌이엿어요\\n1층2층이엿는데 아쉬웟어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKavlAd1VCTv__2zRZAOmjeA593GDbAQdnuRFa1UUxITJ8y_w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Kim mj", "rating": 5, "content": "시그니처 ‘해질녘’ 아몬드와 헤이질넛 향~ 달달구리 커피 맛있습니다.\\n잘 저어 마시라는 사장님 안내 멘트도 친절 ^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKXrQckRbNKERhTHHyCzs64xN4uKurM_X5w6PuTIIZduVbNCg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJsdEON6RdYzURqBb_VYUOoM0/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJsdEON6RdYzURqBb_VYUOoM0/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJsdEON6RdYzURqBb_VYUOoM0/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJsdEON6RdYzURqBb_VYUOoM0/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJsdEON6RdYzURqBb_VYUOoM0/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJsdEON6RdYzURqBb_VYUOoM0/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}]	0101000020E6100000F5A8AE3209E75F40B838CF7DDEA84240
