4.5	37.4667701	126.8874178	2026-03-17 21:47:56.387231	2026-03-17 21:47:56.387231	019cfbd6-ade3-7045-af9d-e45f83c89c1e	CAFE	ChIJlZeqnEphezURX4r17_dqSAg	1029503969	카페게이트 독산점	[{"author": "jisoo yang", "rating": 5, "content": "봄 분위기 물씬 나는 카페게이트~\\n커피도 맛나고 인사도 잘 받아주셔서 늘 기분이 좋습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLGpzdQ3iPrVPn8OXQrlX-OatYSsA2LzJ5C4iRtXySvlYbdHw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Sung Hun Ryu", "rating": 5, "content": "항상 휘핑크림 많이 주시고 단골 되었습니다 😊", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVgfEG4b7EWt1Pn1Kploq010pGPNbCx8fOkPl1t9SHQpayXh15A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "박근태", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWnOULapv3PAoGQRTkyXrKtq_byETUwFrIyfLe-gjPlGMP6Hm0P=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Sungsoo Son", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXOyktDA5jZmzA3MJANgo_QcYthF8R-xuaunj7cQv4mQg8kgi-D=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJlZeqnEphezURX4r17_dqSAg/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJlZeqnEphezURX4r17_dqSAg/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJlZeqnEphezURX4r17_dqSAg/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000D9380774CBB85F401520651FBFBB4240
3.8	37.7204354	127.13153349999999	2026-03-17 21:47:56.387341	2026-03-17 21:47:56.387341	019cfbd6-ade3-7045-af9e-14b5e4bf60d5	CAFE	ChIJx34l0X3IfDUROj38XOo_jp4	8238945	꽃과어린왕자	[{"author": "traces of life", "rating": 4, "content": "2026.2~\\n찾아가는것에서는 거리가 산골에 있음\\n분위기는 아기자기하구요.전원적인 느낌입니다\\n커피맛은 평범.베이커리맛은 덜 달아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXXcAn3CgnJIGVh-ICz2Gsfa0krZMieAE7-CjbsUPrfcez4YYpuyw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Youngbok Kwon", "rating": 5, "content": "빙수,발차라떼가 맛있어요 조용하고 분위기 좋은 카페에요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUtR1j2YXH3c7twm-_EzS6bi9hY3COVr5MOwAvYQGz_Zql15zhj=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "내차관리튜닝여기요 (남양주 제이모터스)", "rating": 4, "content": "우연히 길을 지나가다 남자라면 누구나 끌릴수 밖에 없는 전시해놓은 차를 보고 들렸습니다. 방치되다시피한 외제 올드차가 안타깝긴했지만 너무 좋았습니다. 한번쯤들려보세요. 23년간 운영을하셨다고 하네요.^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWEoD1YF4KSaPgBppdEwir-tG8_jmt_ExRR5O5p9PBBQxqVVyJe=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "하트의여왕", "rating": 5, "content": "식사하면 후식으로 음료가 나오네요\\n금연이고요\\n내부보단 외부 분위기가 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVL-CTfbVOPaFjQXgO4b3ZX9sSpKYLV8YBOAO4KO__JN_SPyBsewQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Feyn", "rating": 3, "content": "(방문일시 : 2011년 1월)\\n주인장이 수집한 다양한 자동차들이 볼거리인 양식 레스토랑.\\n\\n운 좋으면 주인장이 모는 람보르기니를 타 볼 수도 있다.\\n\\n가격이 매우 비싸고 음식맛은 보통.\\n\\n음식만으로 치면, 5점 만점에 1점에 무한 수렴할 수 있지만,\\n자동차 박물관에 버금가는 볼거리와 산 속 경관과 분위기 덕분에 플러스 점수를 줄 수 있는 레스토랑.\\n\\n가족끼리 한번 쯤 가볼만하고, 연인에게 독특한 컨셉의 카페를 보여주고 싶은 사람에게도 좋은 장소.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLrVF7yPe9q_BD38Z5HrFIarbeEfgEzLWtuaOOmHhHGXKpva-4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "김경식", "rating": 5, "content": "오래된 카페  정겨운 곳   낭만이 넘치는 곳", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLwuwYpDlMLLbOpB6v0pc6cTYU5W0oTqY2OEXHIN7RlHTDKzA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Kim Seungwook", "rating": 5, "content": "커피, 분위기 아주 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUf0mZJy3qcLDyaYUtwUQPE8EbriUryNetkwPh6PcrUhgjBKrVY1g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "진한규", "rating": 2, "content": "예전엔 정원도 가꾸고 진열되어 있는 차도 많고 좋았었는데 지금은 너무 황폐화 되어 가고 있네요.\\n음식맛도 내세울게 없어요\\n스파게티는 오뚜기 꺼보다 맛이 없어요.\\n빙수도 그닥....", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIeCT1k7b8JktIXU5poKoiP3iE6CUc5ioMpvinprrqUlKpZzw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJx34l0X3IfDUROj38XOo_jp4/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJx34l0X3IfDUROj38XOo_jp4/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJx34l0X3IfDUROj38XOo_jp4/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJx34l0X3IfDUROj38XOo_jp4/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJx34l0X3IfDUROj38XOo_jp4/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJx34l0X3IfDUROj38XOo_jp4/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E610000004357C0B6BC85F40BAF0283A37DC4240
