4.4	37.5043663	126.78087769999999	2026-03-17 21:54:41.207739	2026-03-17 21:54:41.207739	019cfbdc-db37-7119-a1f4-b061edd49e38	CAFE	ChIJd3Vuo0x9ezURRG--6hAONbc	27465046	카페동네 중동점	[{"author": "YEJIN", "rating": 5, "content": "즉석에서 갈아서 딸기듬뿍 제조해주시는데 반해버렸어요. 음료와 빵에 진심이네요♡-♡", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLIK4E_84j9YUZEl-vB0vA1Yzwqvj9xOiASoja1vuLk5W2hrjwd=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "sudam Bak", "rating": 5, "content": "커피부터 라떼, 에이드까지 다 맛있음. 개인적 베스트는 자몽에이드 테이크아웃컵임. 홀 컵은 좀 싱거움.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLIdmZt09WwRKkZTHK5KPdU48Exf3xvue-vqogBe_LMg-Tbpw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "이수현", "rating": 5, "content": "가격도 맛도 좋고 늘 따뜻하고 친절한 직원분들이 좋아요^^저의 단골 힐링 장소에요^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIwQgUHgkSQOORBhciZj0GBBOm1My6QngYTh92KoluVWUK9dQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Darcie", "rating": 5, "content": "딸기가 짱이네요 맛있어용 ㅎㅎ\\n크로플도 맛있어욯ㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUTD_XV7JuOfh0XDrC_3YbmCYZ9OLHnDKxhgp1T5BbgtDDSxC4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "모형쟁이-두손[dooson]", "rating": 2, "content": "작은 동네 커피숍치곤\\n커피 가격이 상당히 스벅스럽다.\\n내부 인테리어도 그렇게 훌륭하지도\\n분위기도 좋지만은 않은데...\\n커피값이 점점 산으로 가는듯...\\n다만 산미를 좋아하는 커피유저에겐\\n한번쯤 가보라고 권유하고싶다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV029fhGQ8e1zdAd3F43ymL1Ow_6SL4iAbNynY9-2FLXkpM4LFZ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "단벌숙녀Danmi", "rating": 5, "content": "인테리어가 바뀐듯합니다. 동네에 이정도 규모의 커피숍이 있다는게 참 놀랍 ㅋㅋㅋ 우리동네는 아니지만 가끔 들르면 좋아요. 음료의 맛은 평이합니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXeO2vOcezUR3vp-Mz8wR8k3w5rCMgiEaTtXPLtsfj9a3l5w4Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "J.S SEOL", "rating": 4, "content": "장소가 넓고 좌석도 많은 편이라 편하게 들릴 수 있어요. 커피는 아메리가 3.8K 정도. 직원이 서빙해줍니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWfENTn07ejo8rlUNPClRARUJ4u__DWWL4_PFJpvGxkBphwYGOtvQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "희나", "rating": 5, "content": "너무 분위기 좋고 좋았어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVDvTkStgUDMccW1G2uN7LjdICj3MyIKfwBQBXta_kmwKugg98_JQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJd3Vuo0x9ezURRG--6hAONbc/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJd3Vuo0x9ezURRG--6hAONbc/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJd3Vuo0x9ezURRG--6hAONbc/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJd3Vuo0x9ezURRG--6hAONbc/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJd3Vuo0x9ezURRG--6hAONbc/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJd3Vuo0x9ezURRG--6hAONbc/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E61000003EEB75E6F9B15F402EDA2D138FC04240
5	37.4282931	126.9933272	2026-03-17 21:54:41.207865	2026-03-17 21:54:41.207865	019cfbdc-db37-7119-a1f5-08945bcdb214	CAFE	ChIJlfnfeABfezURFle2O3xS8Yw	1674774986	브런치빈 과천점	[{"author": "N8CK", "rating": 5, "content": "직원분들은 친절하고 심플하고 깨끗한 공간에서 양도 충분하고 가성비 맛있는 음식을 경함할 수 있네요. 참... 키오스크와 셀프입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXaun0jV_1vXAqlvY0qZe1o9s7yI2UGNP5IbWKnX4o1Qj7Bf3yjQQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJlfnfeABfezURFle2O3xS8Yw/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJlfnfeABfezURFle2O3xS8Yw/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJlfnfeABfezURFle2O3xS8Yw/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJlfnfeABfezURFle2O3xS8Yw/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E61000008B8E3FAC92BF5F401DCDEC4ED2B64240
4.6	37.4099092	127.1358451	2026-02-16 19:13:35.932764	2026-03-17 21:54:43.467079	019c65f0-f43c-77e8-9424-6dc27b19b603	CAFE	ChIJdccWVCupfDURL0lde7s-6Q8	1726369054	롱앤딥커피	[{"author": "Grace Ryu", "rating": 3, "content": "롱앤딥커피 (2025.01)\\n\\n야탑역 인근 주택가 사이에 위치한 커피숍.\\n날이 좋을 때는 혼자 개방형 창가에 앉아 커피를 마시기 좋음.\\n커피도 맛있지만, 사장님께서 인테리어에 신경 쓰신 모습이 곳곳에 보임. 테이블이나 의자, 턴테이블, 화장실까지 모던한 취향이 묻어나있음.\\n특별한 날에는 인근 가게들과 파티를 여시는 것 같기도함.\\n마감시간이 8시라 아쉽지만, 데이트 하기 좋은 곳.\\n\\n직원이 추천한 커피는 아인쑥페너.\\n아인쑥페너 5,800원", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX0IJ52XoIfx2XSG6IYwZpIWDVs877e36hXiFriTbvbYtb-uwvB=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "양설아", "rating": 5, "content": "동네카페인데 분위기 너무 좋아요. 메뉴 만드는 공간 너머로 보이는 초록초록한 풍광과 통창 너머 보이는 나무, 그리고 매장내 인테리어가 너무 예쁘네요. 화사한 공간이에요. 시그니처 디저트로 버터바가\\n있는데 엄청 꾸덕한 스타일보단 좀 단단한 편이고 너무 안 달아서 좋았어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKsbyJEc9F-bZ74p4TZ-aQ6AYpT9YvO1mqAKUie_uJdNMQARQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Hyun Park", "rating": 5, "content": "One of my favorite coffee places in the town. Excellent choices of the pour over coffee - Good African and South American selections. The owner calibrates the espresso machine every morning as per his espresso bean conditions. One of very few coffee stores that you can enjoy REAL COFFEE not coffee flavored drinks like other so called Cafe!\\n처음 오픈 했을때 부터, 항상 커피는 진심이네요. 사장님 추천 커피를 시도해 보시기를 추천 합니다~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWHVOHXseABb1LaYADrLOCOy7iIs1n1GaBh_okdNSHcLx7KnyLJaA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "H J", "rating": 5, "content": "주택가에 어울리지 않을만큼 잘 꾸며놨어요. 커피는 산미있는게 부족하여 좀 아쉬웠어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL4Dbq20g86MWw3kv_ZxW7uWlgGKX8LgTImQOpuQBMqTVsptw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Rak", "rating": 5, "content": "집 근처였다면 자주가고픈 곳이네요.\\n브루잉커피도 맛있게 잘 내려주십니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWX8YhDpdD8Fi_sa9LPuiJP5Dq0dW37wn3plMMdbLKlFl7lmx4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "KS Choi (Gravity15)", "rating": 4, "content": "비싸지만 커피는 맛있다. 음악이 꽤 큰 편", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXozJbcQ9P5qYzjl0-c1vURLg0OFeBPGA0q3IXtYVwah4w6Ki3PJQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "호우소울", "rating": 5, "content": "우연히 들러 마신 드립커피\\n에티오피아 품종은 생각 안남\\n절절한 바디감 산미 좋았음\\n이 집 추천", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWlMKBGYXDi5mYgQeq-82jItGD7PDtSvGOfMQ5v_8i-Tb-k62sS=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Traveller", "rating": 5, "content": "주인장의 밝고 경쾌한 분위기에 플랫화이트 맛집입니다. 고소하고 풍미 있어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK4Gr0wtGJhIoNcD5eAigD-KjaF-PAEJk2fNY18HMxPICWYpQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJdccWVCupfDURL0lde7s-6Q8/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJdccWVCupfDURL0lde7s-6Q8/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJdccWVCupfDURL0lde7s-6Q8/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJdccWVCupfDURL0lde7s-6Q8/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}]	0101000020E61000009974A5AFB1C85F402E