4.2	37.3996242	126.9214916	2026-02-16 19:13:33.199936	2026-03-17 21:58:10.382253	019c65f0-e98f-7122-ad2b-12013d41dab7	CAFE	ChIJKWudAAdhezURhlJV4KNO3P8	1444468980	카페굿웨더	[{"author": "예헷", "rating": 3, "content": "매장은 넓고 테이블도 많다\\n그래도 주말엔 거의 다 찬다\\n인테리어가 자연속에 있는 푸릇푸릇한 인테리어였다\\n안쪽에도 포토존이 있다\\n\\n음료는 시그니처 음료들이 몇개 있다(커피,논커피류)\\n\\n디저트는 케이크,다쿠아즈,쿠키,스콘이 있다\\n\\n분위기나 대화하는 것도 괜찮고 음료랑 디저트 같이 먹으면서 괜찮았다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVzIgHsEZHs4s9ldR_H7_5kct_Hr7lbP0ucg9l_a8QvokBEw0dFrQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "norrse ho", "rating": 5, "content": "내부 공간이 넓고 제주스러운 인테리어여서 아늑하고 좋았어요! 디저트가 왕 많은데 다쿠아즈 맛집인 것 같아요! 황치즈 맛있게 먹었어요! 음료는 쏘쏘합니다!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWkByKswoi3IHUxfogxLR3McDGm-OayY8KdgFpn4s_Y_j-nRWa0=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "PT", "rating": 5, "content": "디저트 다양하고 맛있어요.\\n티라미수바스크치즈케이크 좋아요.\\n크림라떼도 달달하고 부드러워요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXFjheVIE4X9TZLOKR-k6qOCQKp5KVgHio9QsMkdTjFow956lj8=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "홍", "rating": 3, "content": "유자갸또 6,500원\\n핑크티에이드 6,500원\\n\\n핑크티에이드는 와우껌맛이 난다. 리치맛으로 새콤달콤한게 맛있다.\\n갸또는 위에 크림이 청귤?유자?고 가운데는 초콜릿부분이면서 바닥부분은 얼그레이로 3가지의 다양한 맛이 있다. 상큼하면서 무거운 느낌이다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXRkVc9rG5YfxFmNVbxSltrzUrYoyUy2tFowpHPDrguWArzJLl1_A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Ashton", "rating": 4, "content": "제주스러운 인테리어와 아기자기하고 셀프포토 등 이쁜카페다. 커피는 미디엄로스팅이였나 좀 셨음. 사람이 많아 집중할 분위기는 아님", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWoI6SYmqVWCXKWGrJn9v_M4k2pk0tPLwo4KHhMaeMhGtweqsZY5Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "돈터치미", "rating": 5, "content": "비싸지만 케이크가 맛있음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWYzJHhIORbOzOzRJTUDb_LZB2Fd91bMUMZa1hSTy1VDnpeFx8=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "다현", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI0Dv0Im1k1NOlgkITVAggPb4LyWMxbWvF_ko_R83PGaeAthbA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "고종국", "rating": 3, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXWUZ2_5lxiwyJib5Lrvfj5lzDDrYpRBMZC0SQ6vUOnDL1ZJ1Ou=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJKWudAAdhezURhlJV4KNO3P8/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJKWudAAdhezURhlJV4KNO3P8/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJKWudAAdhezURhlJV4KNO3P8/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJKWudAAdhezURhlJV4KNO3P8/photos/3.png"}]	[]	0101000020E61000007A62E7B7F9BA5F4057D8C2E226B34240
4.3	37.550351299999996	127.12784939999999	2026-02-16 19:13:33.198942	2026-03-17 21:58:12.355146	019c65f0-e98e-7388-b310-7081bbb71923	CAFE	ChIJB0rZRpWxfDURqfe0vtJZuEg	1869128016	투썸플레이스 암사역점	[{"author": "YOUNG SUK GIL", "rating": 5, "content": "2월 신상 음료와 디저트 이용\\n달달한 것이 먹고 싶을때 먹음 좋음.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKZZmu4cVUstaRz1ZdAc8m56Q2HZPE4taf9vcGzaI-ZQ3_3iA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "진이츄", "rating": 4, "content": "사람 많아요\\n종이빨대싫어서 잔으로 그냥 마셨는데\\n잔에서 냄새났어요.\\nㅜㅜ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXEKm9GyCkEgQHRkzdclukdaiTybEBL83gGv0Z5JS-AtJW9Vy6b=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "YOUTUBE Seobunam", "rating": 5, "content": "투썸과 스복의 차별화는\\n스벅이 점점 노트북자리를.없애는 인테리어를 하고 있다면.\\n투썸은 좌석마다 전부 콘센트가 있다 .\\n테이블 넓어서 카공족에겐 좋을듯", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjURUhb-49dcEIb_ukpHkcIaAyIW7yeINI5kOMqAM1R4JLWS9n6l=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "김미소", "rating": 4, "content": "자리가 넓고 콘센트도 많아서 좋았다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXQNLZ3Yu2whNgIFtUr8Sl40LlPc79rbJK7gOE9A2ZxaLMcLDiW=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "김선일", "rating": 5, "content": "매장이 넓고 깔끔하며 직원들이 친절함.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVLkiME9lyeD-QskMbyREIj-y26-aXyIcqyid2vIrP4R9-TwDXkow=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "심주희", "rating": 4, "content": "너무 더운 비온날 저녁에 갔었는데 근처 음식점중 제일 시원햇던것같아요^^\\n빙수먹었눈데 망고 치즈케익빙수였나\\n맛잇엇어요 ㅎ 망고시럽을 따로넣을수도잇어서 당조절도되구요^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLtS5kjhx_eD8TaIoyWomevhIMqCi9uUCto9cptIliKdknkhA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "장수정", "rating": 4, "content": "매장이 좀 복잡한 느낌이고  ㅣ인석이 없어서\\n카페공부족들이  자리를 마니 차지하네요\\n암사역 바로옆이라 그런지~~\\n글구 매장이  깔끔한 느낌은 없어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ59u4ufiKDBO0IiaRNDZopec9WxnP_xm_JYmfuNI2OVN1GtA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "심재목", "rating": 5, "content": "생각보다 상당히 넓고 쾌적하여 좋았음.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVTsqyOZl545ik_OkLc1hKfNwvWX_xDVWuFfEHcdI4PMNlJznKQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJB0rZRpWxfDURqfe0vtJZuEg/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJB0rZRpWxfDURqfe0vtJZuEg/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJB0rZRpWxfDURqfe0vtJZuEg/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJB0rZRpWxfDURqfe0vtJZuEg/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E61000000BF43FAF2EC85F40D16751E971C64240
