os/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJT9ExKaylfDURavw1BKk_kLc/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJT9ExKaylfDURavw1BKk_kLc/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJT9ExKaylfDURavw1BKk_kLc/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJT9ExKaylfDURavw1BKk_kLc/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}]	0101000020E61000005C38109285C65F40370076C993C04240
4.6	37.4993507	127.0960114	2026-03-17 21:59:12.566838	2026-03-17 21:59:12.566838	019cfbe0-ff36-7176-9d76-61daf1a860bc	CAFE	ChIJfwEq2HylfDUR582TAtdjf_A	223906209	오아시스	[{"author": "수락폴", "rating": 4, "content": "동네 카페라고 하기에는 내부가 너무 잘 꾸며져 있고, 전문 와인 샵 느낌 등 통일되어 있지 않지만 분위기는 독특하다. 직원분들도 매우 적극적이고 친절하지만, 아쉬운 점은 디저트의 퀄리티가 높지 않았다. 다른 곳에서 구매하여 판매하는 지 잘 모르겠지만, 오래 냉장보관하며 그때그때 꺼내오는 맛이였달까..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWtAUjO_fh2oBqO6yIJ3Lz7xeDzzkXTok8yg_w9uiHd-jC2DCVz=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "Gyu", "rating": 5, "content": "커피도 맛있고, 가격도 합리적이고, 사장님이 멋있으시고 친절하시고 전문적이십니다. 1층은 편안히 식사 또는 대화를 나누기에, 2층은 개인 작업을 하기에 최적화되어 있습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKLFbNsOPBsPCwf4jU9btgjnQtze0fnr_UoIsaPRz7OcsQYWt8P=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Eddie Choi", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님 친절이 맛집, 여느 동네에서 만날 수 있는 친절 그 이상이다. 자리마다 앉아있을때 각기 다르게 보이는 시야들이 모두 흥미롭다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU6yqPoSOvEjxxY_7W5PlReitDRdexRDdyVrvVpM9dNjZ20gAVG=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "조세빈 (Pomonabin)", "rating": 5, "content": "후식으로 시원하게 커피한잔~~\\n매장도 이쁘네요~~ 친절하시네요~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWCStFBDRnhpXegPpQK3e0thFHAEVGdei5mJcllPmECzk3mmMXO=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "지희경", "rating": 5, "content": "카페가 있을 거 같지 않은 뒷골목에 위치했는데, 의외로 들어가니 드립 전문 카페더라고요. 게다가 스페셜티와 와인까지 갖췄고, 커피값이 싸요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVkCK1dsJSw8ltB9ZEiwnW4qoxeuIfic9HPVEtXPINWSTLSnP5q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "오지수", "rating": 5, "content": "깔끔하고, 아늑한 공간, 단단한 테이블, 그리고 환상적인 커피!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUi8BTdJHUM__5lYUSt9frtl2lPdbWwvW8VJSThKuV7YOY6JUga5w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "CookieRun", "rating": 5, "content": "로컬의 향기. 야생초처럼 자연스럽게 자리잡은 곳.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW4A_nVLTiKn9mAnQBFt5yOMYnNphDtPf11Gm3_9TqWZWB6RjPqUQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "koo Koo", "rating": 5, "content": "2층도 있음\\n넓고 쾌적함\\n조용히 대화하기 좋음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL6I_7wv2QJeTDlnJBVuaS_10gPiNGDwAI1OZknNWlYK-3rsw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJfwEq2HylfDUR582TAtdjf_A/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJfwEq2HylfDUR582TAtdjf_A/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJfwEq2HylfDUR582TAtdjf_A/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJfwEq2HylfDUR582TAtdjf_A/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJfwEq2HylfDUR582TAtdjf_A/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJfwEq2HylfDUR582TAtdjf_A/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [23, 30]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [23, 30]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [23, 30]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [23, 30]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [23, 30]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [23, 30]}]	0101000020E6100000C3C2FF0C25C65F400BDE46B9EABF4240
