5	37.5405088	127.0109789	2026-02-16 19:14:00.910447	2026-03-17 22:02:54.723415	019c65f1-55ce-7601-9562-1a34fe8acf98	CAFE	ChIJbVINPgKjfDURjEDtM94rgH8	537845756	옥수티앤티바	[{"author": "greentea Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "티앤티바라니 너무 멋지잖아~~\\n\\n한국의 티를 소개하는 티전문점.\\n\\n한중일 티의 차별화를 꿈꾸는 주인의 열정이 곳곳에 묻어난 공간이며 번갈아가며 작품이 바뀐다고 한다~~\\n\\n또 다시 가고싶당~~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJKUFNhkTxdrHKc6WKNLl_6qIDW25GkyHKQJC5UNnhnIvVs5g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Hye Ok Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "맛있는 차와 그림, 차분한 음악으로 오감을 만족스럽게 해줘요. 힐링 공간이에요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWRA2iVY0cLLCgfJuTc7nMUelX5y9VaFRIFt0CcmsZdIlMdM5av=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Finn Gonschior", "rating": 5, "content": "Incredible selection of quality teas. In addition, they offer a wide variety of tea based cocktail (alcoholic and non-alcoholic) and delicious desserts 🍮\\n\\nHighly recommended!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ21LurvysSEy0mQ5DoI0pH5Z8Ndj6gyJkzmPbROPUKs7Hbmw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJbVINPgKjfDURjEDtM94rgH8/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJbVINPgKjfDURjEDtM94rgH8/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJbVINPgKjfDURjEDtM94rgH8/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJbVINPgKjfDURjEDtM94rgH8/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJbVINPgKjfDURjEDtM94rgH8/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJbVINPgKjfDURjEDtM94rgH8/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "close