4.9	37.7288292	127.0634267	2026-03-17 22:06:08.074303	2026-03-17 22:06:08.074303	019cfbe7-564a-77b7-9e89-715cbd24f28c	CAFE	ChIJX1M1zWrHfDURgu0r7qR6u2s	23718236	카페그라시아	[{"author": "영화심", "rating": 5, "content": "음료종류도 다양하고 음료도 너무이뻐서 보기도좋네요 맛도최고구~~ 빵처럼생긴 떡도 계속사서먹었네요 선물하기좋아서 추가로포장까지 해왔다는 ㅋㅋ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJy32OlNrBnEp2Ri0golpVwIpCevArEJ6OYRTlt7bOdsep-Ig=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "W R", "rating": 5, "content": "자주 이용하는데 커피맛있고 친절합니다 주차공간 넓어서 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXzIfMlnjkYroqLfpsLWJTCZ5vyR1LUWJMWuC3OQVUDbDNfjhVT=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "황성호", "rating": 5, "content": "작지만 편안하고 좋네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ6GypFM_e3hE32Jaf_2tEJsRT2aYAbEQTnal96dRMo8M9EwA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "지희경", "rating": 5, "content": "새로 오픈했다길래 갔어요. 여러가지 음료와 떡케이크를 주문해서 먹었고요. 떡도 맛있고 음료 특히 커피가 진짜 맛있네요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVkCK1dsJSw8ltB9ZEiwnW4qoxeuIfic9HPVEtXPINWSTLSnP5q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "나기린", "rating": 5, "content": "넓은 주차장에  넓고아늑한 까페입니다 의자도 푹신푹신편하고  단체손님도  가능합니다~♡", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXp_hE_OuvuMP3IEl-bkh_c0pgzpuhw2zOOfzt2GCjRmLFN2E_v=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "임호찬", "rating": 5, "content": "자주가는카페입니다~ 주인이너무나친절하고 차도 맜있네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKd6YkPVyc0Erc2rpCN1fZLeZJrMZHcGRHpbWjqmZfT1mxCCw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Yungi Heo", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXKkKQCyDhti8z1nIdiD7_h9PSN9Vc_pU_KMp8M62F6yY22XuPcAA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "가치노을", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU5miQIC--siL5whNx7OPeqsAevz1QKPOUOmOhH9vOX0l0rJ8q5yA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX1M1zWrHfDURgu0r7qR6u2s/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX1M1zWrHfDURgu0r7qR6u2s/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX1M1zWrHfDURgu0r7qR6u2s/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJX1M1zWrHfDURgu0r7qR6u2s/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [19, 30]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [19, 30]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E61000005D8CDC2E0FC45F40572F75464ADD4240
3	37.4934592	127.1172603	2026-03-17 22:06:08.074531	2026-03-17 22:06:08.074531	019cfbe7-564a-77b7-9e8a-ea2584892ab6	CAFE	ChIJCRSOtJOlfDURpi7v8mobukk	906412919	이디야커피 가락몰점	[{"author": "나름의이유", "rating": 5, "content": "여기는 숨겨진 뷰카페맛집이네요. 잠실의 전경이 한눈에 내려다보이는 창가에 앉아 커피를 마실수 있는 장점덕분인지 낮에도 창가에 사람이 가득 차있네요. 거기에 이디야 앱의 업데이트 이후 스탬프를 다 모으지않아도 스탬프 갯수에 따라  800원-~ 3,200원 할인까지 가능한점은 다른 커피앱에서 본적없는 기능입니다. 넘 착한 기능이네요. 커피맛은 매장이 1000개가 넘기에 저렴하게 고급원두를 살수있기에 원두맛은 이디야는 믿고 먹습니다. 아이폰 충전 요청에도 너무 친절히 대응해주시고 멋진뷰를 가진 착한맛집입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXV-ClchxUo8irgKjENza0Lf9eKOwjW1oasNydnRJNngvDV6zzvPw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "J Park", "rating": 3, "content": "《가락몰》\\n이디야\\n자리를 옮겼네요~~\\n그래서 더 깨끗해졌어요^^\\n\\n뷰가 다 했어요!!!!\\n사람들이 많아 시끄럽지만~\\n창문보면서 여유를 즐겼습니다♡", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVkHRDsojvnkZ2TB1sKL8MuLPS_PLCrrE563bPGygvgBSadElYR=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "sharon lee", "rating": 1, "content": "체인점이라 맛은 좋구요 커피도 빨리나와서 좋아요. 하지만 종업원 응대하는 건 아닌 것 같네요. 사람 많아서 그런지 방수 포장안된다고 거짓말하시고 그래도 포장해간다고하니깐 빙수 뚜껑도 안주고 빙수 3개 시켰는데 ㅋㅋㅋ 심지어 하나는 빼고 두개만 주문 받음ㅋㅋ 나갈때 뚜껑도 없고 봉지에도 안넣어주곸ㅋㅋㅋ 두손으로 들고 나감욬ㅋㅋㅋㅋ 저도 서비스직업이고 바쁠때 짜증나는거 안는데 이건 좀 아닌 것 같네요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKtdG0zO0MuTH8KcBCKui6J5FtYq-Lerag0C8r-h8dmVhqG3w=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "남정우진", "rating": 1, "content": "커피 더럽게 맛없는 행주 빤맛이고사장존* 뻔뻔 하고 어이가 없네 다시 는idiot 같은 이디야 안 온다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKKAVBngOl7-8ydWGDqesZtZkiwpscCrtqUHyAOsWlcF3kgRg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "Rim Hur", "rating": 4, "content": "가락몰 3층에 위치해 있습니다.\\n매장은 비교적 큰편 입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWUmULP3lAlNqCm9iaeRX8pRfKYdTEO6qSRWqLBg9OzKIfIfSEhfQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "성준기", "rating": 3, "content": "술먹고 커피먹기 좋다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXxQhGhtOLfs-fz_T3CEp6c73L-O7sWk3NVppfLzcYwJASuacPVmA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Paoyu", "rating": 4, "content": "Pour une pause pendant la visite du marché,\\nEspace agréable,\\nBon service.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLDweC6spNLtr6DmzeUTIaJvhk_y-mU4qFkDN21dvwnpADoNA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "뒷산좋아", "rating": 3, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWNNKvmr9aJpdsK9LKoBuko7x66DfWe4KLwdWf_qeGinHkmpyYBbg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJCRSOtJOlfDURpi7v8mobukk/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJCRSOtJOlfDURpi7v8mobukk/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJCRSOtJOlfDURpi7v8mobukk/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJCRSOtJOlfDURpi7v8mobukk/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJCRSOtJOlfDURpi7v8mobukk/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}]	0101000020E6100000A067583181C75F4085F4CAAB29BF4240
3.8	37.498014999999995	127.11893599999999	2026-03-17 22:06:08.074727	2026-03-17 22:06:08.074727	019cfbe7-564a-77b7-9e8b-572b7737dea3	CAFE	ChIJC5YO7IWlfDUR0-G5P27DfWU	21529164	에스프레소버켓	[{"author": "park라니", "rating": 4, "content": "레트로도 아니고 앤틱도 아니고 조금 난해하고 오래된 인테리어 카페.\\n커피 맛집 같은데 이미 마시고 간거라\\n빙수 주문했는데 ..완전 맛있음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWMdUUmSv9PvH3jeJEl5CZcDxhPgnYeOik0pUQeSqPNqiOAkCoh=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "이채성 (Cust)", "rating": 4, "content": "가게만의 특별난 시그니쳐 커피가 있는 것은 아니지만, 평균적으로 괜찮은 품질의 커피제공. 직접 로스팅한 원두를 사용하시고, 저녁깨에 가면 볼수 있음.\\n유명 가게처럼 시끄럽고 화려하다기보단, 조용하고 안정된 느낌의 장소.\\n디저트류의 품질이 좋은 편이니, 방문하면 한번쯤 시켜볼만함.\\n주차공간이 없어 차는 안 가져오시는 걸 추천.\\nNo signature menu, but common better qualities. Not 'Noisy or fancy' like popular cafe, but comfortable and quiet.\\nAlso, desserts are pretty good. try some if you like sweet.\\nCaution: No parking space.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXNVt_4sMIAVOgQWq9j_tZKXKAMyVdl-sDjjZBBSpgFMMKtOZLy=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "winner IM", "rating": 4, "content": "엔틱한 동네카페\\n편안한분위기가 좋다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWz925D8T-rPrzDMrmgV54gWtcm1eZGRr4GSaXRQ-54Xagm87B2=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "김경희", "rating": 5, "content": "조용히 이야기하기 적당하고 아메리카노도 맛있었어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIJ2RjGBERs_c_fHEkfpD5WSxGE77DbGT4R6H5lAvawrEqLyQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "한처음", "rating": 4, "content": "친절하시고 커피도 맛있습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW1pDv1HzkT4T4vuWZ2iHo0VjFDG0SNeYxENKYEx2MkEGeUXuaw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Uk Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "다 맛있어요~~~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKT8IghvP7qcPiwO26ndx4BoEUDubtRMs-fOJ7CpThbdxoRGA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "김옥희", "rating": 4, "content": "조아여\\n오래되엇네여", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKwQQFYLlkhouQBTdRawOF924PWHaIzHK00cSJNR16Lv3W-kA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "asfadfdhgjh", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIst_N_bqUzqtJsX9qO45Egt2Rr0nbP6j6pkyHkvazFdPdGNVAa=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJC5YO7IWlfDUR0-G5P27DfWU/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJC5YO7IWlfDUR0-G5P27DfWU/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJC5YO7IWlfDUR0-G5P27DfWU/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [11, 30], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 30], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000004A94BDA59CC75F406EF59CF4BEBF4240
4.2	37.1666056	127.09620129999999	2026-03-17 22:06:08.074904	2026-03-17 22:06:08.074904	019cfbe7-564a-77b7-9e8c-4b63be8b8fe1	CAFE	ChIJP98BPzdHezUR3zzfdQQDvRU	46519659	블랙울프 동탄호수공원	[{"author": "Seo", "rating": 5, "content": "빙수맛집이요~~\\n호수공원 산책 후 들러 맛난 빙수와 디저트 먹으러 가는곳입니다\\n망고빙수가 짱\\n망고철이 지나 인절미 빙수도 먹어봤네요\\n분위기도 좋아요~~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJEYWXu0xtfRkdAa6Y0XbflQ5nJq0OXrIdUAPEZkzrquaNHYg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "뒷골목귀공자", "rating": 5, "content": "11자상가, 목동, 호수공원 다 가봤는데 제일 큰것같습니다. 분위기는 11자상가가 좋긴 합니다. 3곳 모두 동일한 메뉴이며. 팥빙수가 맛납니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXJjoZ4wZ_bbjZSxXwmTnZWNPRZGpaygkvhh0BAAsqGCH6DJ1mhxw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Daniel Choi", "rating": 4, "content": "동탄호수공원 근처 밥먹고 빙수먹으러 오는 카페. 팥빙수랑 인절미빙수 주로 먹는데, 팥이 진짜 맛있고 빙수가 쫀득쫀득한 식감임. 인절미도 진짜 맛있습니다. 주차공간이 따로 없는지 길가생이에 대야 되요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJHMpTUlBrWyG8qoCZrQCtAEO_NxOOAw3QfHuF25adFYkHuiwBl=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "바다사랑", "rating": 5, "content": "블랙울프 동탄호수점\\n오랜만에 간 블랙울프\\n오전10시 30분 넘어서 갔는데\\n사람도 없고 한적하니 좋네요.\\n커피랑 아메리칸블랙퍼스트 주문했는데\\n커피잔,스푼,포크,나이프\\n금색으로 고급스러워\\n보이고 앞접시도 칼라가\\n다양하게 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLx370WzaY9mpR7GdCsYC-NhkAtOvnUqwITZl4w9jOwH6jG4lbO=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "이하", "rating": 5, "content": "매장이 쾌적하고  비오는날 너무 좋았어요 근처에 맛집도 많고 팥빙수 조각케잌 완전 맛있어요.\\n사장님도 너무 친절합니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKKHhchjwnjG9r-lo3dFskNJcpIkCIfl7MdFb2JdNMI-T2vlg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "반누리 (유시엘)", "rating": 5, "content": "수플레 팬케익 입에서 살살 녹아요.\\n허니자몽빙수는 상큼하니 입맛 돋구네요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLyZ7CTCCoKkv8Lygyqir7J_kg05V2jkdSzIarSm0UJUTRu_A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "김현주", "rating": 5, "content": "수플레 완전 맛있는 수플레맛집이에요! 한입 먹자마자 입에서 녹아 없어지네요! 한입 먹고 너무 맛있어서 배부른것도 모르고 다 먹었네요. 재방문 의사 있음👍", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUcU6Knf5gNAYokCfyHJI02IhoAG5uIBDLk_tiTwx7C5R-rbl7sAg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "연수김", "rating": 5, "content": "겨울에도 빙수를 먹고싶어지는~~~개인적으로 디저트 별로 안좋아하는데 깔끔한 분위기가 좋았어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVyQrzlt8jimDv_S9fpDE9Z4xyHNYC9eSU9BXArxyO-M2HmwoLs=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJP98BPzdHezUR3zzfdQQDvRU/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJP98BPzdHezUR3zzfdQQDvRU/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJP98BPzdHezUR3zzfdQQDvRU/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJP98BPzdHezUR3zzfdQQDvRU/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJP98BPzdHezUR3zzfdQQDvRU/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000004A557F2928C65F404CAA115553954240
4.5	37.3406339	126.6895103	2026-03-17 22:06:08.0751	2026-03-17 22:06:08.0751	019cfbe7-564b-7168-aeaf-6cd2df0e4093	CAFE	ChIJ8eo-K8B3ezUR-kocnaNRmQA	857776356	카페 251	[{"author": "아수라가즈아", "rating": 5, "content": "맛있는 커피와 뷰가 있는 곳 오이도가면 꼭 가보긔", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJhez3BEj0NjYp6XvWXOQRCGibSrW1oIfziZkYlsqXKsXgt-g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Heemin Jo", "rating": 5, "content": "1층 테라스자리있음. 2층까지 매장넓음. 화장실깨끗. 1층 남자화장실. 2층 여자화장실. 매장내에서 직접굽는 소금빵있음. 그밖에 조각케이크 등 디저트있음. 커피맛 보통. 오미자에이드 많이 안달고좋음.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUcLNhfQRVdeHc26Ri6s2lr7SE6fBjYzRvh6XFdLL0IfVo6f2ND=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "전유성", "rating": 4, "content": "아파트 단지내 있는 카페라서\\n주차.\\n이용하기 좋고\\n분위기좋고\\n커피맛도  괞찬은것 같아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUUBttgNaH5LP8dD1u1BWy5eyKQ4BGVcfJW2DoqlfjMJsapT8rN=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "문영택", "rating": 5, "content": "최고의 서비스와 2층에서 바다를 보면 마시는 특급 경치..ㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV1GBwLaRm7R23-b_uj8DevF1i60_w4P-N6AL9rGCRCiOkEwuE0=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "김혜진", "rating": 4, "content": "조용하게 바다를 보면서 커피 한잔하기에 조와요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUThDSQ3zCDZLkuIzh7g8kKZhOko5kfXs2ZWUOXgd3EWxKFrO07=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "김수미", "rating": 4, "content": "비오는 날 창밖에 바다가 보이니 운치가 있더라구요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXY63KKslC-Gm4Zc5sUbjNjax8AKNeEvCGrwEZnTcU4dAXCq6jc=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "genie lee", "rating": 4, "content": "커피가 진하고 인테리어가 좋습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW2LiDjvrG--HgZhtArHzeeg0dUX2wjECkO17Gb5_fl84gy9wY=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "HYUNHO LEE", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님이 너무 좋으신 분이에요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJTuIPtxnmXLsFDtvrd_0j5PcCNCoW8lMnfIoXMItoRe3yYlw=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ8eo-K8B3ezUR-kocnaNRmQA/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ8eo-K8B3ezUR-kocnaNRmQA/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ8eo-K8B3ezUR-kocnaNRmQA/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ8eo-K8B3ezUR-kocnaNRmQA/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E61000005430CFEF20AC5F40583442E499AB4240
