4.5	37.4990649	127.11124579999999	2026-03-17 22:06:08.077236	2026-03-17 22:06:08.077236	019cfbe7-564d-7a09-a5bb-5924020e3865	CAFE	ChIJA6YtXKGlfDURpAgjva8zh3w	611614901	매머드커피 송파헬리오시티점	[{"author": "유나경", "rating": 4, "content": "매장에서 마시니 머그잔이 크고 예뻐요.\\n키오스크 줄 안서고 메가앱으로 주문할수 있어서 편하고 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLRe0bH9ZrtuDmuxrnbaOfLYJLE2VAANIURt2NnkL63mhQFtQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "JinOk Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "저렴한 가격 적당한 서비스 기대한 만큼의 매장", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLQXdqasJ-jo4VrsItgbLYtgiZVzJavWaPryaHDgebUDN6dK_wt=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "이디야 행복님", "rating": 5, "content": "굿굿굿", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVTZ7dIBNh5gPtam2WNo5Jt6YkEWt4ykf_R1o1vuXBu7iKS4SDB=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Mott Media", "rating": 5, "content": "The manager is the kindest lady. I highly recommend them. The coffee is good.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUfAWqNl8Gu__sbTy4_5hN-fFtixAAMaNy8dbJpWDQRfeDVgg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "jang ramul", "rating": 3, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVlqid7xa8mSK_8Ni5djgjffcPOhYz0B7mG71wWxWYw2r4jpGlV=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "문기홍", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJtQgDEozehzL8uMek4ksTXjgU1ciL9Xj7topzxtzqNLMsA-A=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "김영식", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJFBmk1HUq14Ktc7nvqxTkYKotWJZ9nNCH3xAO5Jy5kfsTQYxc=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "이지현", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUSA8ooMwoLI5t15lVY3lepoI5gmbJdlecu192FDPp-DwB_TXUcng=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJA6YtXKGlfDURpAgjva8zh3w/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJA6YtXKGlfDURpAgjva8zh3w/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJA6YtXKGlfDURpAgjva8zh3w/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJA6YtXKGlfDURpAgjva8zh3w/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E61000004F34B4A61EC75F406F0AD05BE1BF4240
4.6	37.5792858	127.0841466	2026-03-17 22:06:08.077405	2026-03-17 22:06:08.077405	019cfbe7-564d-7a09-a5bc-59956f53514d	CAFE	ChIJu2NhFuK6fDURQkt69bNC2iM	529266542	가비당	[{"author": "0palios", "rating": 5, "content": "커피에 진심인 사장님..\\n친절하시고 항상 매장도 청결하게 유지하시는데다가 원두에 신경 쓰시는 모습이 인상적입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVDFqYC6bpi4KBmQpWD17HQkJRjKgOglhPe6L3fOJfSoqdvWVrzsg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "김종호", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님도 친절하고 커피도 맛있어요. 맥주도 한잔하기 딱 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJCdAhiWit_xyX5RDGFjFSTRZJyIEehLSLuj31Mnu4tT7N8QA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "박효정", "rating": 5, "content": "예쁜 카페~ 커피맛도 좋고 분위기도 굿! 사장님 샌스있고 친절하세요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVARMfUkt01Tro4tYwy80DN01DMk3o7qSS-rtuqkYsZ1fnf7VnO=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "도로로부잉버잉", "rating": 5, "content": "지하의 비밀 공간이 멋진 카페. 가격대비 맛있는 음료와 차가 준비되어 있다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWbNhVDjY-qmf8fVFu3wGjvn4ZK_Z6YvithRYVnBGp44y_EMADqdQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "안이로다", "rating": 4, "content": "조용하고 사장님도 친절하고 지하와1층으로 되어 있어 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXX__OMUzp3D8miDuesSCxlj43GuVVhz0AW1EUxUUKPG_a6vqeBow=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "ilho kim", "rating": 5, "content": "깔끔하고\\n커피가 맛있음\\n사장님도 귀여움", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUKfFxKaa6DiuE4h_MLdxcL73lY1mvZrET__na5KMd0GVLlAO5W=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "찬물", "rating": 4, "content": "커피 맛있고\\n가격도 착하고\\n사장님도 멋짐~\\n동네커피맛집", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU85Zh9fliaF1d4HBNIihbCChVSVy36BG_Wz45AKbCVWEL2zPuo=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "한주연", "rating": 5, "content": "음료메뉴가 다양해요.동네 사랑방같은 느낌?", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWUhR98sfGEUbOggMNf1FC5eQUBMrGSP5L5GxALoxnS8oQmyHMO=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJu2NhFuK6fDURQkt69bNC2iM/photos/0.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [11, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [11, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [11, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [11, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E610000074C46BA862C55F40C3047F0926CA4240
5	37.5411047	127.0144948	2026-02-16 19:14:00.910132	2026-03-17 22:06:31.112494	019c65f1-55ce-7601-9560-91b473416886	CAFE	ChIJRWNDMx2jfDURI0C3HzGs48Q	729418802	엘디저트	[{"author": "shan lee", "rating": 5, "content": "포장 배달 디저트카페로 커피가 고소하고 진하게 맛있으며, 스콘, 소금빵, 스모어쿠키, 브라우니 매일아침 새로만들어 신선하고 맛있음. 사장님 친절하심", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIqHvPR4xzWz6BzegjELh_UkvagcAH8NVZWdwF7VmTkdBq5hQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRWNDMx2jfDURI0C3HzGs48Q/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRWNDMx2jfDURI0C3HzGs48Q/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRWNDMx2jfDURI0C3HzGs48Q/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRWNDMx2jfDURI0C3HzGs48Q/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [17, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [17, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [17, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [17, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [17, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [17, 0]}]	0101000020E610000092FD987BEDC05F401F1B37EB42C54240
5	37.5465376	127.07504039999999	2026-02-16 19:14:05.807874	2026-03-17 22:06:15.441092	019c65f1-68ef-7371-a942-2d0f0de84a2d	CAFE	ChIJmSesh7OlfDURW0FtgbRReoQ	1283573138	브렛 서울	[{"author": "J Persona (myaongjji)", "rating": 5, "content": "친절하시고 외진 곳에 있어서 그런지 주말에 방문했는데 조용한 타이밍이였어서 커피 한 잔 즐기고 나오기 너무 좋았어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWU-M4Icf7dhZx3FbRpqoaUlq_bYYAqGmFhvxj33C2yRu-nBffdBA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "찌현", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVsoxb1qiWzpZB0h7g9dKbvZsoOPTBeCb5PHbM1aw4F9JY5l-zW=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJmSesh7OlfDURW0FtgbRReoQ/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJmSesh7OlfDURW0FtgbRReoQ/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJmSesh7OlfDURW0FtgbRReoQ/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	0101000020E61000003DF83F76CDC45F406504AFF1F4C54240
4.5	37.545217	127.07347349999999	2026-02-16 19:14:05.807973	2026-03-17 22:06:16.474181	019c65f1-68ef-7371-a943-b59b27ddf8c0	CAFE	ChIJ7WmModykfDUR6epgeVITwFg	485950525	환원당	[{"author": "senie", "rating": 4, "content": "매장이 꽤 넓고 들어가는 계단이 신기합니다ㅎㅎ 내부 인테리어가 아늑하고 베이커리류가 엄청 많아요! 2층은 너무 조용해서 1층에서 얘기했는데 만족스런 카페입니다~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIo3q9yVXb4S404J4Wm0pT5g36Zt5e9GXnerWxzIBAgdagr=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "BRIANNA “소피” Sopi", "rating": 3, "content": "주택을 개조한 카페, 디저트 까눌레먹어봤는데 맛있었음, 근처 대학교 학생들이 많이 오는듯, 분위기는 괜찮은데 막깔끔하거나 하진않고, 편한분위기의 카페였음,", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLBWQugc4v3hRkbVwWd7ZOmJGbKpf_g97tmzWHpGl-8rM2AQQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "norrse ho", "rating": 5, "content": "디저트에 진심인곳 ,,, 스콘뿐만 아니라 종류가 엄청 많은데 케이크도 찐또배기에요! 많이 달지 않아서 부담없이 1인 1케이크했어요 ㅋㅋㅋ 어린이대공원에서 놀다가 여기서 당충전하면 딱이에요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWkByKswoi3IHUxfogxLR3McDGm-OayY8KdgFpn4s_Y_j-nRWa0=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "J Persona (myaongjji)", "rating": 5, "content": "주택개조 카페라 자연스럽게 방마다 좌석이 나누어져있고 그래서 공간분리가 장점인 카페. 마카롱도 넘 맛났어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWU-M4Icf7dhZx3FbRpqoaUlq_bYYAqGmFhvxj33C2yRu-nBffdBA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Winnie Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "젤라또 맛있어요\\n루프탑도 있고 1 층 마당쪽에도 외부 테이블 있어요\\n내부는 조금 좁은편이예요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVhzhQW1FdGmnelxvHGisYunF8vZ9RefAjqUXXjvMNXNPknGlhi9g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "kyeongeon kim", "rating": 4, "content": "애견동반 가능한 루프탑카페~루프탑 분위기 갑!\\n음료들은 쏘쏘,,", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVraquAGCMzBquL1RY3A7I93DJZp7Zd5ORVIlxVx2eGVnVwt9Rf=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Park Epimethea", "rating": 3, "content": "베이커리 카페인데 빵류가 다양하진 않았어요\\n에그타르트 맛있었고 커피도 진해서 좋았습니다\\n2층까지는 관리가 안 되는 느낌이 있었지만 주택을 개조한 구석구석 분위기는 아늑했습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV7GkTYmnDCr_4sNRnJjRc_LDR4LD0NaWSw6Rzdjvb7O9Pzs3E=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Peri Kim", "rating": 3, "content": "애견동반카페. 애견은 안고있거나 목줄을 채워서 다녀야 해요. 1층은 빵이 진열되어있어서 애견동반손님은 이용이 불가능해요.\\n음료 종류가 되게 많아요. 쑥크림라떼와 자바칩프라페를 주문했어요. 누텔라크로플도 함께 주문했어요.\\n음료는 진하고 맛있어요. 빵은..... 크로와상 자체는 별로였어요. 너무 질겼고 따뜻하지도 않았어요. 그나마 누텔라가 있어서 괜찮았어요.\\n의자가 불편해서 오래 앉아있긴힘들어요. 벽에 주멀에는 너무 오래 이용하지말라는 문구도 붙어있어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW6_5nsCd-P4clBum8hkRYJH1auIolNOjRh_YamIgJa0arj2mG9=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ7WmModykfDUR6epgeVITwFg/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ7WmModykfDUR6epgeVITwFg/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ7WmModykfDUR6epgeVITwFg/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ7WmModykfDUR6epgeVITwFg/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ7WmModykfDUR6epgeVITwFg/photos/4.png"}]	[]	0101000020E6100000D9E731CAB3C45F40931CB0ABC9C54240
4.9	37.5465109	127.0734483	2026-02-16 19:14:05.808115	2026-03-17 22:06:18.039745	019c65f1-68f0-7345-9fb5-0686ccde62aa	CAFE	ChIJbe5sDgClfDUR_fh-MvAXPOY	825347744	오소리 베이커리	[{"author": "jun hu Park", "rating": 5, "content": "대박입니다. 두존쿠 줄서서 먹어야 하는 이유가 있네요.\\n다른곳이랑은 차원이 다릅니다.\\n무조건 먹어보세요!\\n다른 빵들도 대박입니다.\\n이건 정말 대박입니다.\\n무조건 강추 입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKO-2gBe9qLK0BpvWslsGAF1S53u2t54WzlN4q_foZgLfX66A=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "정예린", "rating": 5, "content": "진짜 너무너무 맛있어용 💗💗 소금빵 엄청 고소하고 단짠단짠 미쳤어요!! 특히 명란소금빵 엄청 짭짤고소하고 밑면은 바삭해서 완전 제스타일이였어요..!! 화이트롤도 엄청 고소하고 담백하고 넘 맛있어서 다음에 무조건 재방문 할 예정이에요💕💕💕", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL_E_8JBAlufNrnWsDgahw8qA5_KmpFf6id8m_JOE4fJ1idQg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Detox", "rating": 5, "content": "오소리 베이커리 두쫀쿠와 소금빵 그리고 여러 종류의 음료 참 감탄사가 절로 나오네요 정말 너무너무 잘먹었습니다. 항상 번창하시고 자주자주 가도록 할께요❤️", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUKJtQD2P1NlII32WuYMbtLkpNtokxXUzT9g1-9530HUOtzGjg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "신동하", "rating": 5, "content": "담소 나눌 수있는 공간과 공부할 수 있는 공간이 나누어져 있어서 좋은 것 같아요. 3층까지 있어서 공간도 넓고 커피도 빵도 맛있어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKc-WpALILoDvjn88zmWAlZuwKwGGXE0puQTSIGNtVIkTR7ioA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "HAVI PARK", "rating": 5, "content": "넓은 공간, 2층과 3층도 있음. 대학교 주변이라 아무래도 주변 학생들이 많은데 소금빵 종류가 다양하고 커피랑 마시면 맛있다. 친절하다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUuy_wiQkVbf1PeYv8yCH5gSTunXT_KlhPuz-xS2SH13rliww_qnQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "에프", "rating": 5, "content": "제가 빵을 좋아해서 소문난 베이커리는\\n다 가봤는데,\\n\\n여기는 말 필요 없습니다.\\n여긴 그냥 가세요.\\n후회 안합니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLlzdhLgq0ukNykh7F2znLIl2gVKEnT0F9nVnIOjYOduG9zRg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "박준혁", "rating": 5, "content": "빵 커피 진짜맛있고\\n데이트하기도좋고 공부하기도좋고\\n1-3층 다 분위기도다르고 정말괜찮은 곳이네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJVLf7A03g4CnWE1ctWvr62_gLatpcDnJQg0VFG668H_dS97Q=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Seohee Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "소금빵아이스크림 진짜 맛있어요! 커피도 맛있어서 자주올거같아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUcv3BnWF85TFkDH7nADiNn7cINQKjLAmEzKtSiZSII3jhCD73W=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJbe5sDgClfDUR_fh-MvAXPOY/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJbe5sDgClfDUR_fh-MvAXPOY/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJbe5sDgClfDUR_fh-MvAXPOY/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJbe5sDgClfDUR_fh-MvAXPOY/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000989C7F60B3C45F402A34B511F4C54240
4.5	37.5484325	127.07262569999999	2026-02-16 19:14:05.808376	2026-03-17 22:06:18.06896	019c65f1-68f0-7345-9fb7-63ab2e5ea0c1	CAFE	ChIJjzJE0dqkfDUR-QEjiA1J3v8	17361029	롬곡	[{"author": "하유진", "rating": 5, "content": "학교 근처 카페인데 메뉴가 다 맛있어요~~ 와플이 엄청 유명하고 가격대비 퀄리티가 엄청나요 음료도 다 맛나요 ㅎㅎ 여름에 빙수도 맛있어요 어린이 대공원 놀러오셨다가 룸곡가서 와플이랑 커피한잔 추천해요 ^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXIvFCVN9yfe2MEt5kzC_m9wS2DXps6d3XIKMDN2yVesTO9IEPqyg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Céleste", "rating": 5, "content": "겉바속촉 느낌의 버터풍미가 엄청난 수제와플!! 2~3명이서 먹을 수 있는 양이지만 맛있어서 혼자 뚝딱(*´ ˘ `*)", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVni93JN0BkHYRct5bRJ6QdHualx3KDQzUu10cxUguvFdLrd2dltg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Namgyu Youn", "rating": 5, "content": "인근 학교인 건국대와 세종대 학생들 사이에서 유명한 와플 맛집 카페. 와플을 길거리 음식으로만 생각했던 편견을 깨준 곳.\\n\\n근처에 어린이대공원이 있어서 가족 단위로 오는 경우가 많으며, 분위기 좋음. 프렌차이즈형 카페와 달리 카페에서 공부하는 카공족이 상대적으로 적음.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUzqtS0mHQ_NKOIAzbaxMKPcMWauZ3oUZ7UlQPTiRSMUofuK-J2=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "Jaewoo Do", "rating": 5, "content": "룸곡이 뭐지 했는데 논물을 뒤짚은 표현인거 같다. 가게 곳곳에 이곳의 정체성을 설명하는 문구가 있었는데 제대로 읽지 못했다. 분위기 있는 커피점인데 대학생들의 공부공간이 되어버린듯하여 후다닥 마시고(그들에게 자리를 내어주고자) 나왔다. 어린이대공원역 근처에 로컬 커피 찾기가 어려운데 이곳, 괜찮다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU86ZFmPHmAawPR4Smu8b5FySrG_4ImsXwz6HodVDL_L8j9G4spfQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "빅또오오르", "rating": 4, "content": "브라우니 빙수는 맛있었고, 밀크티 빙수는 차 맛이 많이 나서 차 싫어하는 사람은 진짜 못 먹을정도... 차 좋아하는 친구는 맛있었대요ㅎㅎ 얼음 색이 갈색이여서 특이했어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXHO2-nSokvUjUsO3APeoWeqJUZzja6UFNBPksMMbBHBQDpyP1J=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "So Ri", "rating": 4, "content": "부드러운 카페라떼가 함께 하는 곳.\\n콜롬비아 AA가 많이 들어간 전형적인 한국식 쓰거븐 커피가 베이스 입니다. 하지만 묘하게 부드러운 라떼와 함께라면 참 좋은 조합인 카페입니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXReZ9EyccWimDY51L9NtEbrsUOeSN2PLE9vVp8NAPYnQ0g34oJ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "J Persona (myaongjji)", "rating": 5, "content": "이름도 인테리어도 감각적인 카페였어요. 세종대 핫플!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWU-M4Icf7dhZx3FbRpqoaUlq_bYYAqGmFhvxj33C2yRu-nBffdBA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "현미위", "rating": 3, "content": "디저트가 맛있네요. 분위기도 커피마시기에  좋은거 같아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJVF8xMD6vZtN28chIs4TZamn3479A0h6IL3wokdY-j1r95XQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJjzJE0dqkfDUR-QEjiA1J3v8/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJjzJE0dqkfDUR-QEjiA1J3v8/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJjzJE0dqkfDUR-QEjiA1J3v8/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJjzJE0dqkfDUR-QEjiA1J3v8/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJjzJE0dqkfDUR-QEjiA1J3v8/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000579643E6A5C45F4021C8410933C64240
3.8	37.3461232	126.688223	2026-02-16 19:14:05.810203	2026-03-17 22:06:22.5458	019c65f1-68f2-798f-a621-dcbc63e335d9	CAFE	ChIJDxcZ6cJ3ezURYwagrtSIPd8	1635112401	불란서다방	[{"author": "류선생", "rating": 4, "content": "과거 물의가 있었던 클릭비 김상혁님이 사장으로 있는 카페입니다. 주말에 방문하면 직접 일하시는걸 볼 수 있습니다. 음료는 맛이 진하고 괜찮았습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVTZrSYTkc_mJUvRoyqbUvcviex8Q0rV3msTS2b8Y4XdZePF32fCg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "신현준", "rating": 4, "content": "커피도 맛나구  호두과자 맛나네영", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW60gb4f5AChwPNmTKv-XkKf3kOqTAViZFvR_T9hKpOrLJEh1qu=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Monte Pulciano", "rating": 3, "content": "페북에서 본거라 대충 들어가봤는데 인스타용 포토존 같은거 있긴한데\\n너무 아재감성 네온글귀들 있구 2층 의자들 얼룩져있고 제대로 관리 되는지 모르겠음..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV1UHVQl4uzbi2f40eK5aAwEJEoan7CATQqxzCXkc6x5JW1qhP8=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "sangroot", "rating": 4, "content": "애들이 좋아라함~!!!  애들있는 가정은 비추~!!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWLqiRBuW4h8J8OxzEWkS8K3bWTxxxlPLyV8BR_g5fogK8K-dW2=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Jin-Youl Yang", "rating": 1, "content": "No Espresso available, Very expensive than its price, a staff is not friendly.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU5GwaD0y9iYchgdODmDUFKXFf2UPer8qsV2J0c7ifrC4h1-lBx=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "SJ Y", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK7l_Kj6M-hyUcFdbNMqxhMhUhle8-LVmyYlbOQqazJNfk5Vw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "이은선", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJGhaSEX_Jz0zeFSHyw-YNMTak139Vg48aCP2Cm8uh5k8S0BQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "김효덕", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocISZtjBxMRH2YdoOq5ge0hwbk897uj_vwCgsJS9Zoe8UvyKZg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJDxcZ6cJ3ezURYwagrtSIPd8/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJDxcZ6cJ3ezURYwagrtSIPd8/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJDxcZ6cJ3ezURYwagrtSIPd8/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJDxcZ6cJ3ezURYwagrtSIPd8/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000B8567BD80BAC5F408531D8C34DAC4240
