기분전환하기 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJBQmqNUIUp_qJBd2HM6QPkcR9NAOGPbKMEjT1GeakbMdu6YoU=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "iamlec", "rating": 5, "content": "동네에서 편안하고 맛있는 커피을 즐길 수 있는 곳", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWl0sanQyX1wRTb8bI3HLwTuCvIw8zUxSChgA0ohvAFS8QM4bxK8g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJpX8APIqffDURJ1Lf9-QoN40/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJpX8APIqffDURJ1Lf9-QoN40/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJpX8APIqffDURJ1Lf9-QoN40/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJpX8APIqffDURJ1Lf9-QoN40/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJpX8APIqffDURJ1Lf9-QoN40/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJpX8APIqffDURJ1Lf9-QoN40/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000350DE59FF4B95F408E870849B0C14240
