4.6	37.4852911	127.0191411	2026-03-17 22:08:24.496044	2026-03-17 22:08:24.496044	019cfbe9-6b30-7347-8081-35c272ef799e	CAFE	ChIJnSEeRnihfDURc7bpreSXz9U	1483021381	스페이스 엘	[{"author": "Woochi Jeon", "rating": 3, "content": "이 근방에 가장 오래하는 카페. 이것만으로도 충분히 가치있다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWpTb5oPNIn20VAmmJWfxKJCUE9KQNOlCl4J5UOD7mT3QL1dJVfMg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "bom z", "rating": 5, "content": "커피가 맛있었습니다. 음료도 다양하고 공간이 하얗고 쾌적해요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUVtyqiI9_50sQRkS0pZCH68CrUl-FerigLW1-IFCUf86htQTM=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "mj kang", "rating": 4, "content": "커피 맛있는 건 물론이고, 자연친화 일회용컵이 너무 맘에 듭니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIp-eQaXEPTTKHh1T-lyWhyH__9CBxo0Wr7rb9WsghffcH3yMI=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "반경식", "rating": 4, "content": "서초동 뒷골목 커피숍\\n밖에 앉아서 마시는 커피가 좋았는데...\\n이제 추워서 밖에 앉아있기가 어렵네요~ 😢", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXRS2KaP4PYquyvkYUf8Xi4mAH7E5A1kn2wT7gqnaXFufxWFb5a=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "심민현", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기 좋은 커피맛집으로 편안하게  대화 나눌 수 있는 곳입니다^~^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJKQhGzqnhpCHPNgYLEUg3eYbZMos9MpFxOFBrYD1peds8zWA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "정은진 (인생은 알콜)", "rating": 5, "content": "더워서", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUzqK4CiIP4jGdsPS1EgBFhjvv-uKOx8TxOcGbX9ovy_sy6JyR9=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "adi rudo", "rating": 5, "content": "Cozy, friendly cafe. Great to work or meet up with friends. They also have Soy milk, which is great for those who prefer a milk alternative :)", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKedwe8gJQAFeid91wcLPjPCeaYTPv56kVDN3dtxyjNe1YiryI=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "김경문", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWouKeZb1I4C4uWSslB0A6EWIS53mWW_w9bq5oRrA6Ru0Jgu688-Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJnSEeRnihfDURc7bpreSXz9U/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJnSEeRnihfDURc7bpreSXz9U/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJnSEeRnihfDURc7bpreSXz9U/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJnSEeRnihfDURc7bpreSXz9U/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJnSEeRnihfDURc7bpreSXz9U/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJnSEeRnihfDURc7bpreSXz9U/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [0, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [0, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [0, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [0, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [0, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [0, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [0, 0]}]	0101000020E61000009BA0979B39C15F401AC5CD041EBE4240
4.4	37.1442201	127.0738016	2026-03-17 22:08:24.496146	2026-03-17 22:08:24.496146	019cfbe9-6b30-7347-8082-4e85c1afb859	CAFE	ChIJI7XA1h9HezURTQiUfdh6hxM	1342506468	스타벅스 오산원동DT점	[{"author": "천봉길", "rating": 1, "content": "수많은 스벅을 가 봤지만, 일이 믾다며 손님들이 잎에 있는데도  알바생(직원)들의 짜증스러운 대화..\\n커피도 싱겁고,  맛이 없다. 레시피가 모두 똑같을텐데.. 이해할수 없다고...\\n건물이 이뻐 들어갔지만.. 최악..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLBdegpVuHIrG0kmWymn0DsRdofRxAIu-tbRmsqQ73ZLhKXZA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "정로크", "rating": 5, "content": "오산IC 사거리에 좋은 자리에 자리잡고 있습니다. 1, 2층 공간이 넓어 좋습니다. 많은 고객이 방문하고 있었습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUE1I4Mnwm72NA6YRPMp9_S4bFnjQCOx8Nc5vKPS9XyHnOGdpuvDA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "꾸꾸까까빵이", "rating": 4, "content": "원동에 스타벅스가 하나 더 생긴지 몰랐네요\\n기프티콘 쓰러 갔다가 1층에 앉았는데\\n햇빛이 넘 들어와서 더워 죽는 줄 알았어요 ㅜㅜ\\n가려두 소용이 없어서 녹아버리는 줄 알았습니다..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW7NYumSGxdvIZhv4T2AQr4UQ05IuXcmrolzYVPKxHtgseBqHsH=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "한윤희", "rating": 5, "content": "매번 드라이브 쓰루 이용할 때마다 반가운 목소리로 커피를 건네주는 스태프들 덕분에 기분이 좋아지는 곳. 맛있게 드세용~, 좋은 하루 되세용~ 진심에서 우러나오는 최고의 서비스!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVBJPq2n6h3c0DU6w5_moWBVENBULH_-vfIY4EumIMPI-V2GsUU=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "MYEONGHO KIM", "rating": 5, "content": "크고 넓고 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVTQDlnnTUKu0Xn2tP765n8c2LKXMQZkdUtp3ouOI5Pan0gR63Www=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "제이즈그라운드", "rating": 2, "content": "쿠폰있어 주차하고 커피 받아와 차에않았는데 주문이랑 잘못된걸 알았을때 불쾌감 시작. 커피 들고가 주문잘못됐다니 말투 바뀌고 영수증가지고오라해서 비맞고 차를 몇번 왔다갔다했는지.. 기계적인 서비스교육, 늘어나는 지점들, 초심을 잃지마시기를..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJvsM7jmMAle-otFOqUq_3kGrk8FF4uv5aIGO_iIbIeywfwVQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "김도생", "rating": 5, "content": "제게는 커피 맛이 잘 맞아서 좋고 직원분들도 친절하세요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL0vIEzaYSCaC1BlAcMvpN-f8PRHnC154DoPEptrK5d-pZVpA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "송나영", "rating": 5, "content": "넓고 위치좋고요^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLynTFnPgHz7pV4tlR3yRZnrjiSUqiX1X5FQ9p-5c7PhOiXYQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJI7XA1h9HezURTQiUfdh6hxM/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJI7XA1h9HezURTQiUfdh6hxM/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJI7XA1h9HezURTQiUfdh6hxM/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJI7XA1h9HezURTQiUfdh6hxM/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [6, 30], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [6, 30], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [6, 30], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [6, 30], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [6, 30], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [6, 30], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [6, 30], "closeTime": [20, 0]}]	0101000020E61000001E99582AB9C45F408276E2CD75924240
3.8	37.5170866	126.9036819	2026-03-17 22:08:24.496246	2026-03-17 22:08:24.496246	019cfbe9-6b30-7347-8083-15722645815b	CAFE	ChIJIYYwXPuefDURvHlLXA3POYI	13064330	투썸플레이스 영등포CGV점	[{"author": "Dr. Cho", "rating": 4, "content": "CGV 쪽에 있어서 비교적 사람이 적음...", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXsenB4vEyoPL1rXtT30gIhJoRMcyZXKZ2NgXXyuHnHpX6tlLBp=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Soonhee Kwon", "rating": 4, "content": "타임스퀘어내 커피숍들중 사람이 제일 적음 cgv안에 있음 투썸의 인기 케잌들이 늦은 시간까지 다 있었어요. 단 키오스크가 사용이 불편했고 일하시는분들이 피곤해보였어요~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUgHw39uJO5GA8nrpDC-jzM2egdJS3EmtlbCk6M0FxPKneAMs8-=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Paul Park", "rating": 4, "content": "저녁에 가면 사람 별로 없어서 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX6Tr3bQ4JLm5djWTyw_z9zw_jjGMbYVPdwvlxKLyE1RenZ-re3=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "김형준", "rating": 4, "content": "타임스퀘어 CGV 티켓박스 옆에 있음. 초커케익 적당히 달고 부드럽고 맛있고 아메리카노랑 먹으면 꿀조합!😽", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVnX-v_fNTY4ttyF_RV6SqOS4c--fA_JHWDroaEsn5LGbnn9qIq=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "김동현", "rating": 1, "content": "단점을 말하자면\\n테이블이 더러워, 더러워도 닦으면 되지만 안닦아\\n내가 봤던 얼룩이 2주정도 그대로 있더라\\n그리고 의자껍데기는 바꿨으면 하는데...", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKUqckk-2THiKv7IUCbipVwAPQ8RsyjNxoHhR4_eCsQ8sF6lg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "네몽", "rating": 3, "content": "여기 지금 영업하고 있어요. 임시휴업중이라고 해서 지나칠뻔 했네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXLFPmUYkVbwWrtgPCJOVGtwpi-cXG5vHBX5TnkifvDZcWtubdK=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "이영섭", "rating": 5, "content": "투썸플레이스가 전체 매장 전부 커피, 케잌 등 맛은 있음. 아쉬운것이 있는데 여직원이나 여자 알바생들 팔짱끼거나 양손허리 하는 제스처 행동이 어느 매장가더라도 볼수없는게 아쉬운게 있음. 건강을 위해서라도 팔짱끼거나 양손허리 몇분넘게는 해주어야할 필요가 있음.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcRe2ZJFtzyg0O_gDhBdpRBAEfHdZbPYldKnpF7rB7X55hluct=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "이재은", "rating": 3, "content": "영화 기다리면서 먹기는 좋으나.. 영화 관람객들과 뒤섞여서 정신이 없고.. 여기저기 팝콘이 떨어져 있어서 깨끗한 느낌은 아니다..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocINsyYI41pF4nvmlw13KLo-dCvRW3Axh691BzGibqGc-_imMQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJIYYwXPuefDURvHlLXA3POYI/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJIYYwXPuefDURvHlLXA3POYI/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJIYYwXPuefDURvHlLXA3POYI/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJIYYwXPuefDURvHlLXA3POYI/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJIYYwXPuefDURvHlLXA3POYI/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJIYYwXPuefDURvHlLXA3POYI/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000002D9F9BECD5B95F409419CAE42FC24240
5	37.624375	127.0896612	2026-03-17 22:08:24.496357	2026-03-17 22:08:24.496357	019cfbe9-6b30-7347-8084-b6a1e66e017f	CAFE	ChIJQypg6ZekfDURZcCkySx9Zcw	1285620041	카페시벳	[{"author": "모모", "rating": 5, "content": "점심으로 브런치 메뉴 먹으러 자주 가요! 사장님 두 분 다 친절하시고 커피도 맛있어요 언젠가 콜드브루도 꼭 구매해서 먹어볼 거예요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXQubY3YneCQtCD8qs3NkGGp_htS18GSQYz2-Gj6eJBa9NaFFER=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Pinguland Family", "rating": 5, "content": "오곡라떼 맛있다. 목재 인테리어가 편안한 느낌을 주며 맛있는 커피냄새가 진동한도. 식사, 샌드위치도 먹을 수 있다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVOv51uk__Pcth6BdlvT7kCAkcCtNq2PfGMrqU4AqpJxS8l22YIIg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "정미경", "rating": 5, "content": "조그마한 동네카페로 편히 쉴수있는 분위기에 책읽으면서 시간보내기도 좋아요. 자몽에이드도 맛나요^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUCSHCh3dJ9ROMxnS5dxCqfcTxkuhTzipAaG4G4MeWLXlqiKX0U=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "배은혜", "rating": 5, "content": "맛저하고 갑니다!!~!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW-615vsMs7Rwg4saPJshy27bQzn-AK3QZ7-Sb2cexuDSfnU8Ln=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "4SGD", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXXwhr-rc2X7UuUTbsS2UWhOfnCTa7bdwMxiv0Eehbp3dxrirLM=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJQypg6ZekfDURZcCkySx9Zcw/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJQypg6ZekfDURZcCkySx9Zcw/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJQypg6ZekfDURZcCkySx9Zcw/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJQypg6Ze