4.4	37.560162	127.04042869999999	2026-03-17 22:10:14.407016	2026-03-17 22:10:14.407016	019cfbeb-1887-7a66-b0f8-73c9574a7d51	CAFE	ChIJbd4b6qKlfDURVUYpFKdloIU	571137981	디저트39 한양대점	[{"author": "조아라", "rating": 4, "content": "카페가 적당히 넓고 먹고 싶은 메뉴가 많아요\\n롤케익 초코맛을 먹었는데 도지마롤 같은 고급 스러움을 기대하고 먹었는데 생각 보다는 별로인 거 같아요\\n컨디션이 좋지 않아 뱅쇼를 먹었는데 깊은 맛이 나지 않아요 밀크티는 공차에서 파는 맛 같다고 하네요 다음번에 와서 요거트 음료를 마셔보고 싶어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJwatCDu4xaimIvKa1FVBmopFMZJT5q7Jw244umypGFY_c__w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "안Somi", "rating": 5, "content": "딸기밀크티 정말 맛있었어요!! 케익이 다 녹지 않아서 살얼음 같긴했는데 저는 이런걸 더 좋아해서 너무 맛있게 잘 먹었어요!! 한양대에 생겨서 너무 좋아요~~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVH8eT5aVbpmERSb0Fy-U7IT8DiJDr6HMJsYjcE-R44ExDVC_Ty=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Nana", "rating": 5, "content": "직원들 친절하고 편하게 얘기하기 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKN1Kt8O8Vrq70CyogMjnEn3KPlG3UXi9BgwgSrSDc_MODehQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Gu Daa", "rating": 3, "content": "다좋은데 천장의 에어컨 보고 놀람..\\n이날 여러곳 들렀다 집갔는데 담날 목이 칼칼한게 자꾸 이집 에어컨이 생각남.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIqbFtFQnEGWU2szaOznGgKGHc0O9exQV8-BMc018NIYuQHEr0=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "wha young lee", "rating": 4, "content": "맛있어요 가성비 좋은곳은 아니구요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKJZc6zAkN0GUoOULw4yNMk3jMcRuLdaEYm4ZV-ow0rxbCZOQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "이태우", "rating": 5, "content": "음료 디저트 모두 중저가 브랜드보다 고급지고 맛있음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLwvjstgUmy-cxu10UG-A6vEX_VvaSsQDmgTOa4OUC-vf-T7w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "RAYMOND LEE", "rating": 5, "content": "시원하고 가격 적당해서 좋네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWej1Z-2pmN41X2ASs4chUMpiTjGqfRcjzVWv78054ZW0dp2Wo=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "eunbin Ahn", "rating": 5, "content": "양이 많고 가성비 조아요!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJivv9-HRWmst0WgnSoNKlcfUJiUNFh8HLT023aFP-C_VaQrQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJbd4b6qKlfDURVUYpFKdloIU/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJbd4b6qKlfDURVUYpFKdloIU/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJbd4b6qKlfDURVUYpFKdloIU/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJbd4b6qKlfDURVUYpFKdloIU/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJbd4b6qKlfDURVUYpFKdloIU/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000007714426296C25F40213B6F63B3C74240
4.4	37.5350919	127.0009472	2026-03-17 22:10:14.407179	2026-03-17 22:10:14.407179	019cfbeb-1887-7a66-b0f9-6b5b8926c040	CAFE	ChIJo9MWYLGjfDURVQIvgIJTIaI	1249654387	터치 TOUCH	[{"author": "BB", "rating": 5, "content": "와우 넘 맛있어요! 과하게 달지도 않고 눈도 입도 즐거운 곳. 바닐라웨이브랑 세드라랑 콜라보한 피스타치오 딸기케익, 그리고 구움과자 몇종류 먹었는데 케익류가 정말 맛있어요. 조그만 케익이 다 만원을 넘기니 좀 비싸긴 하지만 언젠가 다 먹어보고싶네요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUm1sZt3x7g_qBWvyPi0CO1FkdYJZ--4nqPQa4UJanW71b1A_zK=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "윤우진 (윤라마)", "rating": 4, "content": "예쁜만큼 맛있어요. 윈터 제주는 감귤 한라봉 그 자체를 먹는거 같이 상큼하고 맛있어요. 케이크들은 겉이 타르트같이 바삭하게 되어있는데 같이 주신 일회용 포크랑 나이프가 너무 잘 휘어서 먹기 조금 불편했어요. 참고로 예약 픽업인데도 대기가 엄청 많아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXXll0kOlPFM_6_pfY09HqFXuluVDqAnlIHpBzsIQ82n3hIMCcI=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Jade", "rating": 5, "content": "너무 맛있게 잘 먹었어요! 분위기도 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWwzIaUfrYMIGEYW8pOSCN_cZb0NWtUCAtMM6xiPTsdY8W3AQo=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "클로버로디", "rating": 5, "content": "샵 오픈 날짜는 인스타에 공지 해주셔요. 정말 메뉴 하나하나 너무 맛있고 좀만 늦어도 품절이 됩니다...", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ8slbUfLC00nip2KwHhSrtnhY8EzEUQhCxQzZenjLlJPfCEw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "밍Ming", "rating": 4, "content": "허니비 케이크\\n외관적으로 맛으로도 모두 훌륭한 퀄리티입니다.\\n하지만 디저트나 구움과자들을 예약하지 않고 그냥 가시면 오래 기다려야 한다는 단점이 있습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUkkAdWZWZFX089TXBjgu_qSlRzfAuZWuG_3ERe5SpjgpUYbnpF=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "퐁블루", "rating": 5, "content": "친절한 쉐프님, 맛있는 케이크!\\n깔끔하고 고급스런 인테리어\\n역시는 역시네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLzCBKz7gQN2TFXBmgV9dA1c0ZBPXvjhV97VjCbOYP7cSZZlA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Jason Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "너무 귀엽고 예쁘고 맛있어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK8IStEayqE96Lx1iqqnVujQuJPCqTw_l09_gupihYq_oCxXg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "져니져니", "rating": 5, "content": "케이크 디자인도 맛도 짱짱\\n일주일에 두번 여는 게 아쉽습니다ㅠㅠ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIkbsbHV1mBGWlN7EGv7_8qqPr1X_PQUxPKlflzUjHIqnl3_A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJo9MWYLGjfDURVQIvgIJTIaI/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJo9MWYLGjfDURVQIvgIJTIaI/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJo9MWYLGjfDURVQIvgIJTIaI/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJo9MWYLGjfDURVQIvgIJTIaI/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJo9MWYLGjfDURVQIvgIJTIaI/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJo9MWYLGjfDURVQIvgIJTIaI/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [8, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [8, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [8, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [0, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [8, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [8, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [0, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}]	0101000020E61000007541D8840FC05F40606D31E47DC44240
