=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Jenny Seo", "rating": 4, "content": "2층이 넓고 여유로워서 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWqwxKA1tMXWzkchgONGsR0fdD1SK1dBbxHEq1kZmTo0bkNTG-V=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "쩨리", "rating": 4, "content": "인근 거주민 위주로 방문하는것 같아 조용하고 여유롭습니다.\\n콘센트 자리는 많지 않은 것 같습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX8ikVlhFXc5a8erC11Hqyd_YEIjYQu120cN2hkADkaXItP4rwGRg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOUCe5oqhfDURN_AHBnxoYCs/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOUCe5oqhfDURN_AHBnxoYCs/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOUCe5oqhfDURN_AHBnxoYCs/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOUCe5oqhfDURN_AHBnxoYCs/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOUCe5oqhfDURN_AHBnxoYCs/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOUCe5oqhfDURN_AHBnxoYCs/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOUCe5oqhfDURN_AHBnxoYCs/photos/6.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJOUCe5oqhfDURN_AHBnxoYCs/photos/7.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 30]}]	0101000020E61000001776BDD9