4.8	37.4895473	126.49480639999999	2026-03-17 22:14:02.527162	2026-03-17 22:14:02.527162	019cfbee-939f-7791-8df0-dcb372d54ec0	CAFE	ChIJuWI-7TiFezURzlH2N6RUkHs	1989938489	더 바이닐	[{"author": "홍츤츤", "rating": 5, "content": "인천에 볼일이 있어 친구가 추천해준 곳이었는데\\n분위기도 좋고 내부인테리어도 멋지고 사진이 잘 찍히는 곳.\\n담에 기회가 생긴다면 다시 가고 싶은곳.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWzSUQSlF2YpZ6CWB3QleGIL8KxdVGL5psgOC_v8H4H105CJ6o3Aw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Won Seop Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "LP 까페; 무더위 날릴 너무 시원한 실내에서 커피나 간단한 주류 주문 가능한 곳\\n입구 주변 수국 등 꽃들이 배치되어 정서적으로 안정되는 느낌", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXEZJaDmMRQa45h9ykTW4UHDqrMUoVq1v_tdLFdyVVYfefnto4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "HEUNGSIK SUK", "rating": 4, "content": "낮엔 카페 저녁엔 바~\\n주인장의 품격을 느낄수 있는 편안한 장소, 음악도 좋음.\\n커피도 맛있음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIpOsX6id1XsHTbTz4z0jPybovUgtW6YB76TQmY12L8AvwdVg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "HOPE K", "rating": 5, "content": "운서역가까이에 있는카페바\\n정원가꾸기가 취미인듯한사장님\\n엘피가 많고 신청곡을받음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUcnsqJKhJQ7z-a6gIOvXS_aMRSBtT81gJYEXe2N_LAnJYAmjs=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Eugene Blanche", "rating": 5, "content": "영종도에 왔다면 들러보시는걸 추천\\n요즘 희귀한 LP 라이브카페\\n집앞이라 다행~~~~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUVc5Nxz6yfhumCPUQAjT3o4v3CextlDA-4AoSiUJpyaeHG567M=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "JP Park", "rating": 5, "content": "LP 음악 커피 와인 아주 좋네요 ㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU_lKwcRqDzCFomSvCg2rvbq029x0gSXSKCe8w9yFG7yFpmVFiimw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "JH PARKABLE", "rating": 5, "content": "아늑히 모임 장소로 좋습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJz68T38K5iIeWMycIar4SHr9gl_NvhcU4nFHqPapDSPHbJqA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "구읍뱃터", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기  좋아요\\nLP   바", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW_U7CHd6olVg3Jmof8H73pmSIDNYBnNy510zOjDIMfyqpattLO=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJuWI-7TiFezURzlH2N6RUkHs/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJuWI-7TiFezURzlH2N6RUkHs/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJuWI-7TiFezURzlH2N6RUkHs/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJuWI-7TiFezURzlH2N6RUkHs/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJuWI-7TiFezURzlH2N6RUkHs/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [11, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [11, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [11, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [11, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [11, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [11, 0]}]	0101000020E61000007E7676E8AA9F5F402CAC657CA9BE4240
