4.1	37.5472016	127.042808	2026-03-17 22:14:02.527592	2026-03-17 22:14:02.527592	019cfbee-939f-7791-8df2-0b54d215d439	CAFE	ChIJVQrlyWqlfDUR8Jrgoboal-g	904308336	타크	[{"author": "HJ2022 SEO", "rating": 3, "content": "성수감성. 가정집 개조한 카페. 내부 목공과 프린팅 작품들이 묘하게 조화. 창으로 통해 보는 풍경이 예술.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX42_uVGtyzlpox8NtstKq6eb-4JWUkn06ZHqb2p_VNI8_SCA7ciA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "food_dairy bang", "rating": 4, "content": "성수동에서 여유롭고 모던한 분위기에 쉬기 좋은 카페, 혼잡하지 않아서 좋고 아몬드크림라떼 너무 맛있음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKoeJUtQTWW6R8FH-b_FAM8kMPjUfSy_NhMMotw4Ijyz9mrNvM=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "J Persona (myaongjji)", "rating": 5, "content": "저녁에 종종 방문했어요. 영업시간도 긴 편이고 분위기도 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWU-M4Icf7dhZx3FbRpqoaUlq_bYYAqGmFhvxj33C2yRu-nBffdBA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "이웅환", "rating": 5, "content": "주말이라 사람이 많았지만 커피 맛있고 분위기 좋네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWdHiVNLYmqH-YqriLAAM_XEfY889sZucW2DANrq1N7gmGU727z=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "조호정", "rating": 4, "content": "매장이깔끔하고 분위기가젊은사람들이오는분위기\\n커피는중간만족도.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXiKEZOK_GXTDuq2qlUVq5O5MCCS2I6zPDMKooEy5WNgTF_JDAO=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "taehee Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "다른 카페에 비해 조용한 분위기에 매장도 생각보다 넓어서 좋았어요. 커피는 잘 몰라도 콜드브루 신맛 안 나고 고소해서 맛있습니다! 구움과자류 휘낭시에, 마들렌 먹어보니 무난했어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVWC4RtMVpaPmyzx_IcRQBxfIP5gtMu7D1hQLx3Jdth2OwQIV-P=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "배꽃나무", "rating": 4, "content": "대처적으로 다 만족해요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWTW3raABrG8uAh99g-QOWLA14PVJBGuj9hrQ0_nghz2B90EdtRPA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "유기형", "rating": 2, "content": "분위기는 좋으나 굳이 시그니처음료를 드시지 않아도 됩니다. 이야기하기 좋습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXQqt7mqA2chcfZxpBKX87Hfw4jxbaj4qoY1jLUOs25nZdsNE2c=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJVQrlyWqlfDUR8Jrgoboal-g/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJVQrlyWqlfDUR8Jrgoboal-g/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJVQrlyWqlfDUR8Jrgoboal-g/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJVQrlyWqlfDUR8Jrgoboal-g/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJVQrlyWqlfDUR8Jrgoboal-g/photos/4.png"}]	[]	0101000020E61000007500C45DBDC25F40D128B8B30AC64240
4	37.492929	127.1253351	2026-03-17 22:14:02.527801	2026-03-17 22:14:02.527801	019cfbee-939f-7791-8df3-c76455d490f8	CAFE	ChIJjS4EI4ilfDUR0gMlW_98kiw	138553260	이디야커피 송파문정점	[{"author": "FeelGood U", "rating": 4, "content": "차분하고 편안하고 깔끔하고 커피도 맛있어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUbFiWJda8QCm7Sv4iaTYYOO-sJF2TmxoDLNE0-skRIT4kGGeR9=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "김성규", "rating": 1, "content": "사장 불친절 손님한테화냄 자기가 못알아듣고 뭐요? 아니 그러니까 이런식의말투로 손님 응대함 뒤에 알바생이 민망했는지 메뉴 나 대신 말해줌", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL3mFQHXPX8X7a3wd4Pc4PJmyU9jp1-GfUWmqDB5Wk1P15wtA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "허재형", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기도 좋고 커피도 맛있고\\n사장님 서비스 최고예요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLgVXpbZQE9tsSFJCyLDWaXwJQywIfiUEAbCbglnnhrzxA1kQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "나혜선", "rating": 4, "content": "장소는 넓고 깨끗해요. 사장님도 친절하시고", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWitUAVXM2-kvBznoXOQhSW1ji0FyroJ7mBUO-I5xA-id-G6Ic0ZQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "감자만두", "rating": 5, "content": "사람 안많아서 조용함. 매장 깔끔 굿굿", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJtSA17C6QYhQHVDW9m9m8J395hbNgYuFZBXDX9cpOZ0x-xCQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "카마도온달", "rating": 5, "content": "너무 잘 마셨습니다 감사합니다 ~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXuPJteD3__kRRtiMDn00Ke9keYPqblwRhQRlQytyqFFeI4euOX=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "신범수", "rating": 4, "content": "조용한 커피숍 입니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUMAPBjxgXLH-mgSi4dRmUOuY27-yWflhV9U2H1lbJtDOdBObS2=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "최영수", "rating": 3, "content": "커피 한잔의 여유", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIT4VO0RGovCBnyRTj6NlhfwkX468DK3VtQSoU5jxpTCf5ZZQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJjS4EI4ilfDUR0gMlW_98kiw/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJjS4EI4ilfDUR0gMlW_98kiw/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJjS4EI4ilfDUR0gMlW_98kiw/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}]	0101000020E61000009EE2827D05C85F40FF1F274C18BF4240
