3.9	37.6348552	126.87104219999999	2026-03-17 22:18:08.813519	2026-03-17 22:18:08.813519	019cfbf2-55ad-7a5f-90b4-d7c086a2830c	CAFE	ChIJWd-SulWXfDURfZcnIDDiWJI	26909729	투썸플레이스 고양원흥점	[{"author": "eunju shin", "rating": 4, "content": "도래울마을에서 비교적 늦게까지 하는 카페입니다  날씨가 좋아 테라스에서 마셧는데 주변에 흡연하시는 분들이 많네요\\n무슨 슈 였는데 멋있었어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLlNDloGHEYYS5Q7gu-qIqlkHwQ8WxNa1NZtF1Uu32S50KqpA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "소피Sophie", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님도 친절하고 너무좋았어요.\\n자주 이용할것같아요~ 원흥근처에 늦은시간까지 이용할수있는 카페는 11시마감하는 투썸 인것같아요~^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJEPeZxznYDUgUdBG74tmEscOfTm3U7iiqTMI3omn2J_pbLDnnI=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Juyoung KIM", "rating": 4, "content": "사장님은 안좋겠지만 사람이 많지 않아 여유롭게 즐길수 있어 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKigBuT-CDhKiIuj_RY840yZPsdUc-xNk-D6fXrfTRXgMMzoQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "이주헌", "rating": 5, "content": "이곳 커피  참 맛있습니다 카프치노가 특히진한향\\n으로 입맛을 사로잡네요  꼭  한번 가보시기 추천\\n드림니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK_E5XGywkS9kOQ30Hd1DMvnjGRQNPscOk2pk06bLB4vyD-hg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Willy J", "rating": 5, "content": "넓고 편하고 좋다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVlNWH-2D9CdwxXCU8AI_RBADNxQug7nPVKwuq6_qsYesw4w71v=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Peter Jang", "rating": 4, "content": "2층 공부하기 좋음^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXeyMNWmnktLThoGFgMhWT49mTRxcKMvn9bh1MYy_sAg0WFMBEv=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "이덕주", "rating": 4, "content": "투썸플레이스 넓고 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ0xP7Ul8lRbnvxKdRXkGMF4C6BoRLXhv6uiqPBOJBNo2fL2A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "JONGRAK SON", "rating": 4, "content": "일반적은 투썸과 동일합니다. 좌석 밀집도가 낮아서 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIV5i2nAjmEG6D2xoOv58hBe3JIlkfF9fBDrgnftTz7XSCWVw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWd-SulWXfDURfZcnIDDiWJI/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWd-SulWXfDURfZcnIDDiWJI/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWd-SulWXfDURfZcnIDDiWJI/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWd-SulWXfDURfZcnIDDiWJI/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWd-SulWXfDURfZcnIDDiWJI/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000E59BC827BFB75F4007D968EF42D14240
4.2	37.5169741	126.90925779999999	2026-03-17 22:18:08.813682	2026-03-17 22:18:08.813682	019cfbf2-55ad-7a5f-90b5-8c9237f89c10	CAFE	ChIJsS2F4CCffDURKo5xB2bFDII	337672656	스타벅스 영등포역점	[{"author": "KH K", "rating": 5, "content": "외국인들 은근있음 매장넓습니다\\n주문은 느리나\\n매장은 큼\\n자리도 넉넉함 타임스퀘어나 신세계매장에있는 스벅엔 사람미어터지는반면 여기는 한산함\\n종이빨대에서 플라스틱빨대로변경", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIAvY401gLu8wegIZTEnmUwrcwkUqO-kE-XBXL41bQNbQl4LOA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "traces of life", "rating": 4, "content": "2025.9~커피포장\\n\\n2025.5~계산시스템이 좀 느려요\\n\\n2024.6~여전히 손님 많아서 주문후 커피 나오는시간이 좀 느려요\\n\\n☆2024.1.20\\n1층으로 된곳입니다\\n매장은 넓어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXXcAn3CgnJIGVh-ICz2Gsfa0krZMieAE7-CjbsUPrfcez4YYpuyw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "NAMTAEK KIM", "rating": 4, "content": "스벅 영등포역 주변에 3군데 중 낮에 손님이 많아 자리가 없었는데 저녁시간에는 간간이 있네요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWLY7MxfxKfSz-KGZCufNnPbi0OwrN5BV8yPf_fSiziqWkz1do8Tg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "munu lee", "rating": 3, "content": "그냥 무난했다.  피스타치오딸기케잌 7300 디카페인아메리카노 5000 디카페인카페라떼 5500", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJqlJRCh0Lyki7dGe6ZYqjJddeRCvKupTBjB108yK1yZAX_xA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "정하남", "rating": 5, "content": "영등포역에서 가까우며 매장이 넓고 좌석이 많아 이용하기에 편리했음 다른 지점보다 유독 좌석이 편한 것 같은데 근처 들릴 때마다 공부하러 자주 방문할 것 같음 스타벅스 굿즈 종류도 많아 비교해 구입하기에 좋았고 알바생들도 친절해 이용하는데 매우 만족했음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWGm6GghlI05KdZMt26G2ZSzY3DI7waivhgUDqtReJ3puXpjwn6=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "고법", "rating": 5, "content": "매장 세련되고 멋있습니다.\\n근처에 스벅은 죄다 타임스퀘어에 몰려있어서, 영등포역 근처 가시려면 이곳 추천 드려요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW53gbu1DnrCMkBRDEvmuzeHV9yI2ceUfch6T3TlC48ivFXbykdYw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "김종수", "rating": 3, "content": "20년전 퇴직한 대기업회사 입사동기 4명이 모처럼 만나 술 한잔하고 커피가 땡겨 간 커피전문점.\\n영등포역에서 여의도방향 우측 도로변(경인로)에 있음.\\n스타벅스 체인점중 하나.\\n아이스커피 4잔 마심", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVaPQ7bRHSbeSil3Obq5GYXVHqcc2u51BPfpcEBdPNo8ENS4MGR=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "여행하는 감자 [Patatita Viajera]", "rating": 4, "content": "영등포역 근처에있는 스타벅스로 매장이 커서 자리도 많고 널찍해요.\\n근데 자리 넓은만큼 사람도 많아서\\n운이 안좋으면 자리가 없을수도있어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXIWnIJHvD2MAdsjqN7O0PvICdjcXT8SD09cYlGnAGa5P-M2iM=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJsS2F4CCffDURKo5xB2bFDII/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJsS2F4CCffDURKo5xB2bFDII/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJsS2F4CCffDURKo5xB2bFDII/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJsS2F4CCffDURKo5xB2bFDII/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJsS2F4CCffDURKo5xB2bFDII/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJsS2F4CCffDURKo5xB2bFDII/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJsS2F4CCffDURKo5xB2bFDII/photos/6.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJsS2F4CCffDURKo5xB2bFDII/photos/7.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "M