4.1	37.5067745	127.10859839999999	2026-03-17 22:20:18.0719	2026-03-17 22:20:18.0719	019cfbf4-4e97-78a4-8fe8-a5d62b3251ed	CAFE	ChIJJ0kLFi2lfDUR3Gz3XHj6jms	1667001201	메가MGC커피 석촌점	[{"author": "전망대", "rating": 4, "content": "숍이란 다 그려유~~♡", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV5BFm2Zvzzceaom12wJ_GyVgoQebkyVxuND_TCwLw-_RDnGms=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "B", "rating": 1, "content": "가격이 싸니까 그냥 말씀 안드렸는데... 아메리카노 마시고나면... 아래 커피찌꺼기가 정말 너무 많을때가 잇어요 ㅠㅠ\\n\\n그리고 오늘 딸기쉐이크시켰는데 얼음 좀 심각한거 아닌지 ㅎㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUNFjTXJwdunI8NOv4zi0L8DF31ihR8gNDp4K1D6sH-juAdnwCVyA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "쉬농소", "rating": 5, "content": "인근이라 늘가는 메가입니다\\n솔직히 스타벅스커피맛보담 몇배로 더맛있음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWCHeCUV6d4CDx1gD2Aa9jJbVL7Aahqloie8ja8sJi1lvSdo4Wy=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Rim Hur", "rating": 4, "content": "주로 태이크아웃을 하지만. 실내가 꽤 넓어서 충분히 좌석도 있습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWUmULP3lAlNqCm9iaeRX8pRfKYdTEO6qSRWqLBg9OzKIfIfSEhfQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "페리도트", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기 괜찮고 알바생이 친절했던\\n기억이 남아있어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWtJG0dGs2d78zoZQ1-B-HtUP2ZkkrjRF4v0iX0Dk3ksu0qJ3TV=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "MAN폭주전사", "rating": 5, "content": "시원하구 넘좋아요 화장실이 외부에있어 불편합니다 남녀 공용 ㅠ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXNFAzb63UAL0NTal5B9A1ekjflS--rm8rmvCYz4OAnElzKvQg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "TERRY", "rating": 5, "content": "직원들 친절하고 음료 맛있어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVJmWypCnmvDxhn5HtFydK1HplRKGNgk6hgpy8ExnI_OjbaTXX9Kg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "별마루", "rating": 5, "content": "앉을자리도 넉넉하고 가성비 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocISOT95Nx8BzlIgIxEfUqF3g71S2W8jMdbexcrZzIc5hJa_1w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJJ0kLFi2lfDUR3Gz3XHj6jms/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJJ0kLFi2lfDUR3Gz3XHj6jms/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJJ0kLFi2lfDUR3Gz3XHj6jms/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000007719B446F3C65F402FF99FFCDDC04240
4	37.5291796	126.92082359999999	2026-03-17 22:20:18.072111	2026-03-17 22:20:18.072111	019cfbf4-4e98-7a45-ae80-464921b7e823	CAFE	ChIJ84oF3CSffDURmm1TQ9yDg5Q	1809893739	도프커피서여의도점	[{"author": "komoedia", "rating": 4, "content": "세 종류의 원두로 선사되는 아메리카노, 다양한 메뉴와 감각적인 인테리어가 인상적.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXnM5a-V6rpX4PQxwhvJ3g3lvdfkiceRea9F41JLeL_QMnXTaNf=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Changdae Cho (Chris)", "rating": 4, "content": "회사 근처 카페~ 좋아라 하는 라떼 맛 준수 합니다~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW0Hh1Dx1C6KcnOgNgmjTSik1hgzw9FUWUSjPXHx03bjDCQ1aBx=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ84oF3CSffDURmm1TQ9yDg5Q/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ84oF3CSffDURmm1TQ9yDg5Q/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ84oF3CSffDURmm1TQ9yDg5Q/photos/2.png"}]	[]	0101000020E6100000A3D81BC6EEBA5F40EDDA3928BCC34240
4.5	37.555718899999995	127.0233154	2026-03-17 22:20:18.072214	2026-03-17 22:20:18.072214	019cfbf4-4e98-7a45-ae81-a5e8704c764b	CAFE	ChIJCTL2zAijfDURYirG2yde0Co	949706937	디엠카페	[{"author": "Young Eun Nam", "rating": 5, "content": "건물 뒤, 카페 이용하는 동안 무료 주차 너무 편하고 좋았어요. 커피도 맛있는데 케이크가 진짜 맛있네용~\\n4층 전용 엘베도 있어서 기다림 없이 이용하는 것도 좋았고, 아기 기저귀 교환대가 화장실에 있어서 편했어요~\\n소파 넓직하니 호텔 라운지 같은 느낌이고, 그림이랑 모자가 전시되어있어서 재밌었어요~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVogVK7KjgJ2MSKS_AqE7W0ODrZons8ZXXwwZKxM2lSQ-vZ-Qmu=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Heejin Yang", "rating": 5, "content": "건물뒷편 주차장쪽으로 돌아서 들어오면 4층으로 전용 엘리베이터를 타고 들어오게된다. 입구까지 복도를 걸오들어오는 벽면에 미술작품이 걸려있고 역시 입구자동문을 열고 들어오면 미술작품을 먼저 구경할 수 있다. 주문하러 들어오는 동안 어디에 앉을까? 둘러봐야할 만큼 매우 널찍한 소파가 더 널찍한 라운지에 재미있게 자리잡고 있다. 흡사 호텔라운지같은 카페이다.\\n모닝커피 1잔에 여유를 충분히 누릴 수 있는 서비스공간을 제공받을 수 있어서 매우 만족스럽다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW-SvaY0ywmLBPqZyakdtiz5xOi0hZfhkuJ-HNTFU_x5zIFPCP-=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "김근수", "rating": 5, "content": "조용하고 아늑합니다.\\n주차장도 있어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXU466zgrVCkBgSdjKWpTUlm3lo_87IakaSoZzs-hCXP5De5jJ-=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "마녹", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocICaxyV1mDKejnc3fZYyha8eWKQJnf7M7gZCjWZ-GVQshsiaQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "김동홍", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKoDKqdT1TJXJmccfoZRfcUx7yDLOWxFUTgqVOjPjpVdZO_uA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "양지은", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLj70I-xRYemckP8sJ9BDxBq--dzIsQ7okSKZayhyZWOv0IiQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Kwang Min Shin", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXS_jhu0MbYISGilJQlIdzm85SRgl-gcvATYPqKxkvhFPRwjqmPoA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Louis Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUSGmgyFy7Cv2BlafwRxQ-a0q0yAfCXnupS02sJAYyve4HXlfE=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJCTL2zAijfDURYirG2yde0Co/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJCTL2zAijfDURYirG2yde0Co/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJCTL2zAijfDURYirG2yde0Co/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJCTL2zAijfDURYirG2yde0Co/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [18, 30]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [18, 30]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [18, 30]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [18, 30]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [18, 30]}]	0101000020E6100000901FE0FF7DC15F4071A202CC21C74240
4.8	37.546090199999995	127.04321089999999	2026-03-17 22:20:18.072559	2026-03-17 22:20:18.072559	019cfbf4-4e98-7a45-ae83-ffe31ce4561a	CAFE	ChIJ2TESSJykfDUR-PDrcs504KE	763859536	투데이즈이너프	[{"author": "점심맛집과 카페탐방, 간혹 술집", "rating": 5, "content": "작은 카페인데 커피는 잘하는것 같다.\\n커피양은 적다. 맛은 라떼중 다섯손가락안에 든다.\\n아기자기한 분위기에 조용히 분위기 느끼기 좋다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVmSXX-IfBWDkaPqHPeQ9-HvDlD9uUXbQjhUYzyXY1EXGYFxPB-Vg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "HJ2022 SEO", "rating": 4, "content": "직접 로스팅한 원두로 추출한 커피라니. 대만족. 공간 커피 서비스 모두 좋네요. 공간도 작지만 대화나누기에 테이블 간격이 좁지않아서 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX42_uVGtyzlpox8NtstKq6eb-4JWUkn06ZHqb2p_VNI8_SCA7ciA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Shadrack Tab", "rating": 5, "content": "분위기 좋은 서울숲 적은카페\\n에스프레소가 맛납니다\\n커피 진짜 맛있어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX8nkqPVn3TVPZvpeWbWbo6ZAe3PFJmdCfYOTUMthS7Xlk54gfIPA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "길정현", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님 친절하시구 아늑하니 좋아요! 커피가 넘넘 맛있어요😀 또 오고 싶어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLQErb2H094-JGU3cmlTsyRCyy8V3LkPYbDISN-MWoegzFdOQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "김정난", "rating": 5, "content": "성수의 히든잼 커피바☕️💜\\n자리에 앉아서 해리포터 책 같은 메뉴판을 보면 하나하나 커피 설명이 적혀있고 주문서에 표시해사 가져다드리면 직접 로스팅한 커피를 가져다주심😳최고", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWd1D1QywhjufGPa1b42nZHjxR8RTEGj0T0N16e8BgjmqGyGqTccg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "왕선미 (진달래)", "rating": 5, "content": "너~~무 맛있는 에스프레소 !\\n에스프레소에 진심인 사장님덕분에 잘마시고 왔습니다~~ 재방문의향100%", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKkGBdGkN9Z0wK5rpkKdlgg-P1vcyxtsQMuvfpmM02NYLtcog=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "hotaru", "rating": 4, "content": "ソウルの森と言えばSM entertainmentの社屋があったり、おしゃれなカフェが多かったりと観光客や地元民でいつも賑わう街。色んな華やかなカフェがある中で、こじんまりと落ち着いた雰囲気のお店を見つけて入店。エスプレッソカフェでメニューはほとんどエスプレッソ。カフェラテやアメリカーノもない。「大人が楽しむためのカフェ」というコンセプトがステキだった。エスプレッソ以外には紅茶がいくつか準備されていて、今回はローズの紅茶とビスコッティを注文。バラの香りがふわっと広がり甘みもあっておいしかった。\\n次はエスプレッソに挑戦してみたい。", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW75r9_2EENyNqhLDwVFNi88Bs0nnNH6XpCaWM_0SLK8ZNo_H4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Manato Kasaba", "rating": 4, "content": "ソウルのハズレにある日本の原宿のような街を歩く途中にソウルの森近くに発見。おしゃれな半地下と統一した緑のブランドが素晴らしい。そしてカフェオレ頼んだがとても濃厚クリーミーで美味しかった。エスプレッソそのものが美味しいかも！", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX1zW7Nt0bVY-7GN-WoNVEZaXm-8iP3tNTh7N4OAEnmEj76VppmgQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ2TESSJykfDUR-PDrcs504KE/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ2TESSJykfDUR-PDrcs504KE/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ2TESSJykfDUR-PDrcs504KE/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ2TESSJykfDUR-PDrcs504KE/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ2TESSJykfDUR-PDrcs504KE/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ2TESSJykfDUR-PDrcs504KE/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [9, 30], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [18, 0]}, {