3.9	37.4691536	126.4335179	2026-02-16 19:14:30.360846	2026-03-17 22:23:46.190137	019c65f1-c8d8-71f7-8073-06b41a8d726d	CAFE	ChIJN8RcMwCRezURuzcCY2BnmyA	52577959	투썸플레이스 인천공항T2B1F점	[{"author": "Jason. J", "rating": 5, "content": "25.4월 아메리카노, 샐러드번 하나 7500원.\\n승무원분들이 많이 줄을서기에 특별한게있나해서 한번 주문해봤다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUxYpBKJbkRbxwi0iFGhLzRAo-FjLqR--v3cflwEoYAiaAuHFXg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "BONG", "rating": 4, "content": "음료하나 시키고 15분 이상 대기..\\n대기가 너무 길어서 버스 놓치거나 음료 포기하는 사람도 보임\\n\\n공항 내 직원들 이용도가 높아보임\\n\\n리무진엔 음료 갖고 타지도 못하니 타이밍 봐서 조심해서 주문하자", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXvj7Tx0YtFi-ReH_4dVNNarw_zGg5rR9dQBex7SQiwmVRo-cLG=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Drew Esa", "rating": 5, "content": "Oh, the sponge cakes here are so delicious! I couldn't resist and tried the mandarin one! In addition, there are various sandwiches, salads, buns, and of course drinks—tea, coffee, and shakes. It's very convenient to get your order—your number is displayed on the board, and you just walk up to it.\\nThe cutlery is disposable, and the staff quickly clean the tables as they become available. It's important to note that the chairs at the tables are soft, which makes them comfortable. But keep in mind that if you simply leave your belongings in the cafe and go somewhere for 30 minutes, your behavior will be considered disrespectful to other guests and your seat will simply be taken.\\nI highly recommend \\"A twosome place\\" for a light breakfast or lunch before your flight.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXFZCfjSYB7SDm0OE9lS_3r_O6f_uINN6RzLmq0RhG7bzGrFxECWw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "MAT", "rating": 5, "content": "We tried their Cranberry Chicken Sandwich and it was good, big enough for two. Service was fast, and the place had good seating.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWF9QRyupx1ZLcybkxLEurA1FvvJElk-7Ct7L9bZmm5_Vo1OJqCiA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Himani Handa", "rating": 5, "content": "Tried their blueberry almond croissant — absolutely loved it! Conveniently located in Terminal 2.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWKXtebP2E_ZZVdksxQP9tAWkhZjexaGQ1bAk7MspTUK3vmDqeB3w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "なめろう", "rating": 4, "content": "The blueberry yogurt fresh cream cake is smooth and sweet. I could pay by credit card so I didn’t have to change money.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW-HJHd6VsekqV08P7-zGnH55kiAiC6BJ94B-Is_VcO3OjO93SI=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Sanzhar Nurumzhanov", "rating": 1, "content": "Глупые кассиры. Если у вас Apple pay настаивайте чтобы вы оплачивали на кассе. Они глупые специально тратят ваше время чтобы вы платили в терминале", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIXWBjAsMlyGVvoMT_Bz7Ca5GTDACIHYil1rE7lSK_fqMm8bA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "K", "rating": 4, "content": "Cold brew latte tasted quite burnt, not really a fan.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXH2DbQdtARcTRPIOKHj0W1qKfm1RQi_XpselbAHSVajON1MRU=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJN8RcMwCRezURuzcCY2BnmyA/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJN8RcMwCRezURuzcCY2BnmyA/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJN8RcMwCRezURuzcCY2BnmyA/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJN8RcMwCRezURuzcCY2BnmyA/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJN8RcMwCRezURuzcCY2BnmyA/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJN8RcMwCRezURuzcCY2BnmyA/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [6, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [6, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [6, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [6, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [6, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [6, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [6, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000C2AEDCC1BE9B5F407C66A4390DBC4240
4.4	37.4874362	126.67939709999999	2026-02-16 19:14:30.361014	2026-03-17 22:23:49.042432	019c65f1-c8d9-7db6-9aa2-4828a6ad7584	CAFE	ChIJwb7SNwB_ezURU8i7C7NnOSw	1838749766	디벨로핑룸 가좌점	[{"author": "쉼표 (쉼표)", "rating": 5, "content": "디저트가 생각보다 맛났어요!\\n\\n공간이 조금만 더 넓었으면 좋을텐데\\n옆사람들 소리가 장난이 아님\\n그래도 느낌있는 카페", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUEQdJLBu0er6tC_MgjImfFlzJDLWQKYHJDXq49dqT0kcJWmxF8=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "루코네미케", "rating": 5, "content": "다양한 스페셜티 원두를 취급하는 디벨로핑룸의 가좌점입니다\\n취향껏 원두를 골라서 맛있는 브루잉 커피로 맛볼 수 있는 곳이예요\\n인테리어도 멋지고 음악도 편안해요\\n강아지 동반 이용 가능하고 주차공간도 있습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVDtoxhQnWL9V3YjKwuedhWFyEdEc7PPK5ryWZRPhTB76IVSQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "박인수", "rating": 1, "content": "일요일 오픈시간 좀 지나서 방문했는데 스콘은 나오지도 않았고 파운드랑 쿠키는 전날 팔다 남으신거 파시는듯 파운드 너무 딱딱했고 쿠키는 눅눅했습니다\\n저렴한 가격도 아닌데 이런 마인드로 장사 하시면 안되지 않을까요? ㅠㅠ 다신 재방문 안해요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKnHCOeTVHY-dHcDHiOxv584Yt-MAghpaOXI-PxKQp0mZKiXA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "꾸깨", "rating": 4, "content": "커피 맛 괜찮은 흔치 않은 곳.\\n주차도 공간도 디저트맛도 모두 괜찮아 자주 이용.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVHcm-xxlk8ovuPpcaDqNRgcZn_NLiRcv8cYr2RHNhq8E3yi7dd=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "두목", "rating": 5, "content": "커피 굿\\n스콘 굿\\n인테리어 약간 아쉽지만 굿\\n주차 굿", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVBpniJgy4vu6dI9rtUE0d1zkC90SMkX7cuhIqeUHDP9W7piGQ38Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Eunhee Choi", "rating": 5, "content": "공간도 커피도 정말 좋아요🤍", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJrCtBVSztO0Aip2COmhKjGyA2xsqQbiQaJM7waZ2curBpWzQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "박현욱", "rating": 5, "content": "나은병원 옆에 개성있는 카페다 1층에서 주문 후 3층까지 감성있는 테이블이 있다 남자직원이 아주 친절했다 즐겁게 커피먹을 수 있는 집이다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXk0QvMMCnZrUlWcxmECAu4eVzwVaJxsQutTkmo_DTah-30-SjN=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "이재석", "rating": 5, "content": "맛있는 커피 마시고 싶을때 갑니다.\\n넓지않아 시간 잘못 잡으면 자리 없을 수 있습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK_oVzU5_k-IQLkFvO_IEUsWBvdDwbLCDb0IQxpFmkP-P8LpA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJwb7SNwB_ezURU8i7C7NnOSw/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJwb7SNwB_ezURU8i7C7NnOSw/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJwb7SNwB_ezURU8i7C7NnOSw/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJwb7SNwB_ezURU8i7C7NnOSw/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}]	0101000020E6100000D25FF93D7BAB5F4079F1344F64BE4240
4.9	37.498843799999996	126.6762942	2026-02-16 19:14:30.361179	2026-03-17 22:23:50.696399	019c65f1-c8d9-7db6-9aa3-af3994b82fbc	CAFE	ChIJyYH-4AZ_ezURoLNxy0BrWIY	2130007421	룸포디저트	[{"author": "이석재", "rating": 4, "content": "육교밑에 위치한 한적한 카페\\n도로쪽으로 큰 창이 있어서\\n차분히 창밖을 바라보면서 여유를 즐기기 좋은 곳 스콘이나 디저트류는 가격은 착하나 밀가루향이강해 음료만 시켜도 좋을듯", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW7wY0MvcW-Ms4DKfBnUxvM4acHQyxgsiAI9GSq0t4GUvJwjWY=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "김민성", "rating": 5, "content": "아늑하고 편안한 카페에용 ㅎ\\n오래 머무르기 좋아요\\n커피와 함께 디저트가 아주 맛있어요\\n진한 풍미의 리얼초코라떼 아주 강추입니다.\\n고가밑이라 주차도 편해요\\n다들 오실때마다 책장의 방명록 남겨봐요~ㅋ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXQe6RFYxEcNeuFFFwSkpN8tFeMjkUN9hydeTD2q6WwKNam6_foMw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "양희석", "rating": 5, "content": "우리 애들도 반한 맛!!  사장님 두분 너무 친절하시고 케익도 넘나 맛있는것 !!♡♡ 가좌동 케잌 맛집!! 커피 맛집!! 인증", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW830_l3nZJz4SOYuEGqcGA_IuSUbZtBugI-puntMnBfWmc8c9y=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "문태경", "rating": 5, "content": "젊은 사장님의 선한 기운이 있는\\n커피가 맛있는 디저트전문점 룸포디", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVp891hahjZ3NFqg-16boFnHdpUYhggaSOiKpMvlHU436U-TiPj=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "김은하", "rating": 5, "content": "처음 방문했지만\\n카페라떼 맛있었어요\\n사장님도 친절하시고 ^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXHIqzaLGGYFovjUtvvwNehGO9pEOB-RA5lQJ_Tj97-EJ0KZjDu=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "최성", "rating": 5, "content": "너무 맛있게 잘 먹고 갑니다 !!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXftmoecU8jGf6kK-8YaoAfF8NK6Hu59TIOh9SB5znUU7p0dEvf=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "우주최강펭수", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVFQFzjLwvkvtlPgKx8WPEogBCK27PhIDH80pHsWG21TTi7MP3a=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "힘내자", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI5lA8AEz37S_SqP5NCLra-UHYKPxAXm9SUCuVx7cDw7k48=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJyYH-4AZ_ezURoLNxy0BrWIY/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJyYH-4AZ_ezURoLNxy0BrWIY/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJyYH-4AZ_ezURoLNxy0BrWIY/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJyYH-4AZ_ezURoLNxy0BrWIY/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJyYH-4AZ_ezURoLNxy0BrWIY/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJyYH-4AZ_ezURoLNxy0BrWIY/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJyYH-4AZ_ezURoLNxy0BrWIY/photos/6.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJyYH-4AZ_ezURoLNxy0BrWIY/photos/7.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}]	0101000020E61000005EDE776748AB5F40FB67171DDABF4240
3.9	37.4658741	126.4326851	2026-02-16 19:14:30.361329	2026-03-17 22:23:54.685628	019c65f1-c8d9-7db6-9aa4-c456380a6c6c	CAFE	ChIJv2OcyHmQezURW3qRFCao8rY	664712942	스타벅스 인천공항T2에어점	[{"author": "박나영", "rating": 5, "content": "사람이 많지만 근무하시는분들도 많아서 빨리 받았어요.\\n\\n귀여운 우리나라 특색있는 키링이 5가지 종류있었어요\\n한개에 23000원", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocII60AyG4hObTht9sZ-0jv90NLNDlpgBaxgEd0SbdRlzr7ljg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "Sunny Ten", "rating": 5, "content": "여행갈때마다 들리는데\\n매번 줄이 엄청 길지만\\n직원분들 손이 빨라서\\n금방금방 주문할수있어요\\n햄에그 샌드위치 살짝 데워주셔서\\n커피랑 같이 먹으니 꿀맛이네요ㅎㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVwWSpwnIAVA6S1qYTegHSVDNjDyzmgL9uVmGvYUdyxoZutKBfz=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "fly aday", "rating": 3, "content": "공항점에만 파는 초코바나나오트프라푸치노를 주문했는데 사진과 비주얼이 너무 다르네요 그냥 바나나오트프라푸치노 색상에 다 녹아서 나왔어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWaJhr8RyvcWTTOjDhIw7mrp4KAVVZoCebwXW34bqLTVQWJMadv=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "이더", "rating": 5, "content": "탑승동 유일한 스타벅스여서 당연하게도 많은 여행객들이 찾아 항상 붐비는 더군요. 다양한 언어가 들리지만 직원분들 능숙하게 주문 확인 잘하시고 빠르게 음료 제조하십니다. 테이크아웃 전용 매장이라 테이블 없지만 주변에 쉴 수 있는 공간 많아 문제 없을거 같습니다. 아쉬운점은 사이렌오더가 안되며 현금영수증 원하실 불러드려야 합니다. 아! 리워드 적립 안되요 ㅠ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU-c6kR_twWWNN3j3aJFZhlYbjU6b_RjigXIMB1d8TIbHcT4dQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "NAMTAEK KIM", "rating": 4, "content": "인천공항 2터미널 247번 앞 스타벅스 ~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWLY7MxfxKfSz-KGZCufNnPbi0OwrN5BV8yPf_fSiziqWkz1do8Tg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "ᄎᄋ", "rating": 5, "content": "지역별 컵을 다 팔아서 정말 좋아요 제주도살까하다 핑크가 이쁜 경주로 샀습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVVpy0GEVXkoOOJOQtmmnJ29uT9_OQ9EnJcrC6DoWYzocJDMjM8=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "최찬돌 (찬돌이)", "rating": 3, "content": "사람 많습니다. 직원들 곡소리가 들리는 것 같네요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVS42cBvI5e-ls434kQj2SD1AmYje5vJyOlKQmthVkZfSEFPsQ_=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "김진아", "rating": 3, "content": "카라멜 프라푸치노 ~~맛있어요\\n주문줄이 너무길어요\\n스타벅스 앱으로 바로주문 안돼서.. (내위치 매장인식을못해서) 큐알코드 찍어서 결제했어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJVPZ6QJf2ZZpQzvwlmE2ADfYaEpPlbuCZnuF-4p-hhYrBGBw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJv2OcyHmQezURW3qRFCao8rY/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJv2OcyHmQezURW3qRFCao8rY/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJv2OcyHmQezURW3qRFCao8rY/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJv2OcyHmQezURW3qRFCao8rY/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJv2OcyHmQezURW3qRFCao8rY/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJv2OcyHmQezURW3qRFCao8rY/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [1, 0], "closeTime": [23, 59]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [1, 0], "closeTime": [23, 59]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [1, 0], "closeTime": [23, 59]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [1, 0], "closeTime": [23, 59]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [1, 0], "closeTime": [23, 59]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [1, 0], "closeTime": [23, 59]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [1, 0], "closeTime": [23, 59]}]	0101000020E6100000DB7DD81CB19B5F40D7C633C3A1BB4240
