3.9	37.4489613	126.45138779999999	2026-03-17 22:24:00.019087	2026-03-17 22:24:00.019087	019cfbf7-b193-7243-b478-bccae4fc06c9	CAFE	ChIJpY-GFWKaezURs3FMqLQjk4s	191443990	스타벅스 인천공항T1랜드B1점	[{"author": "jin kim", "rating": 5, "content": "이년만에 공항 스타벅스.\\n여행전 기분좋음이 맛에 추가되는 기분.\\n주의할점은 사이렌오더 기프트카드, 쿠폰등의 서비스가 모두 않된다. 앱카드는 사용가능", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVmz9tBR6kywSfxhpo300nuRai-fZtCIO34du7uAhqcXUEFtG7L=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "퀸비blair_ha", "rating": 5, "content": "음료 빨리 나옴.\\n이태리에서 2주동안 있다가 부산오니까 아메리카노 (특히 아이스) 너무 그리웠다 ㅋㅋㅋ\\n자리가 썩 편하진 않고 충전할 곳은 없으니 참고", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVLbk3ZCzMRvTRJVblQcW3lz-BLe1uTEpZ-hJvv_afrFC8W3NhR7Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Jay Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "친절하고 주문 빨리나와요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ0Fu2HPQhO-mcPcyQ1Rjs1BQPkXtoi7em0mAy5_MFpY8-Tow=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Hoseok Lee", "rating": 4, "content": "샌드위치가 다른 매장에 비해 종류가 다양하지 않다. 앉을 좌석이 부족하다. 맞은편 푸드코트 좌석을 사용할 수 있도록 하면 좋을텐데...", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKB79HZRY830xkpcOYOHnSapffA05ilLyLC01G3lVBXpWaYIQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Traveling foodie", "rating": 5, "content": "한국 오자마자 5월 2일까지만 판매한다는 슈크림 라떼를 마셨고 직원들도 친절하였다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWQlE0ewIdiI0rk36NMKiTcuckqech93qAmtnhQfFSPNcSgDS4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "dongwoo kim", "rating": 4, "content": "출국장 나와서 공항철도 가는 12번에 있어요\\n아침엔 상큼한 과일음료로", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVA-0WAsTE7xjdomJ2YhvEUlOniZZG9vK2cn7Sy3CXZyu3py665=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "mylife75", "rating": 5, "content": "장시간 비행의 피로를 시원한 아이스 라떼로 해결할수 있는 곳입니다, 최근에 open해서 깨끗하고 깔끔하고 좋습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW7KIGGnyyBBOGj7mdAZQqX1oBO7LxBie3tOnmHsfKWDRTTbffqzA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "sandcastle KN", "rating": 3, "content": "이것저것 골라먹을수 있긴한데 양이적고 봉지상품맛이난다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWA5ILRK-tbCUAaNpERQ-bUrPM1VYdmcu2WALmIXdVUtfbfEE4Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJpY-GFWKaezURs3FMqLQjk4s/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJpY-GFWKaezURs3FMqLQjk4s/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJpY-GFWKaezURs3FMqLQjk4s/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJpY-GFWKaezURs3FMqLQjk4s/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJpY-GFWKaezURs3FMqLQjk4s/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJpY-GFWKaezURs3FMqLQjk4s/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [6, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [6, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [6, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [6, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [6, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [6, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [6, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000000EB4A789E39C5F40B7555A9077B94240
