3.7	37.7405938	127.0488536	2026-03-17 22:29:22.499075	2026-03-17 22:29:22.499075	019cfbfc-9d43-7afd-912e-f6329f3ed011	CAFE	ChIJcwDA-jDHfDUR9sCjcnxBl7s	472329223	메가MGC커피 의정부로데오점	[{"author": "99수니", "rating": 1, "content": "동송읍 놀러가서 먹고 반해 사먹었는데 형편없음 라임 모히또에 애플민트만 2개 들었음. 지방 읍단위에서도 라임도 썰은거 들어있고 과육도 꽤 들어 있었는데 여기는 시럽만 타줌. 그냥 마트에서 캔 음료수 3800원어치 사먹는게 나을 뻔.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLlbM17m3ALkjWWWIBVoq95kQWbWknxXcuFFXzd9oCVqnK0rw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "VERITA", "rating": 5, "content": "값싸고 양 많고 배부른 맛!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUQmScwa6OWqUQtCBTMtK0DeHOIVupcK9xYG2mX1V2ZZfHIpAT4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "최동욱", "rating": 5, "content": "진하고양도많아서좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK-BG3uQIGkX1PdgFGrT2mHk3Z6LFoyAlZa8A7U0YhN0BqcOQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "s-joon Kang", "rating": 5, "content": "This  cafe is clean but noisy. but very delicious.\\nThe coffee is big and very cool. Service is not bad.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVRIk0ftcsSm-Lc_b3dnt7xBtdK2qvnNTP0ib7bUEsXq8A3amQb=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "김남혁", "rating": 5, "content": "I ate strawberry latte. This was cheaper than other stores, but size was mega", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX1PWLFPYwzbT_9Nju-xiFlvf7jLLYkVwUSskQJ2V_Z6xlVuVU=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "조혜란", "rating": 1, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKxgvmEQj2FTDrSz32iO6qGi7LZ1ABZV7zO9ytGC3KKQfvNrw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJcwDA-jDHfDUR9sCjcnxBl7s/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJcwDA-jDHfDUR9sCjcnxBl7s/photos/1.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [0, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [0, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [0, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [0, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [0, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [0, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [0, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000AE92D96A20C35F40684F13C7CBDE4240
3.8	37.3986826	127.1319157	2026-03-17 22:29:22.499162	2026-03-17 22:29:22.499162	019cfbfc-9d43-7afd-912f-64a299560856	CAFE	ChIJNU23TIypfDURXJgOumlnSIw	27083857	블랙허니(빈스마켓)	[{"author": "jang-wook lee", "rating": 5, "content": "더운 여름, 사진을 찍으러 왔다가 시원한 커피 한 잔에 활기를 얻은 곳.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWqCQeJlgGRG_tY4F86-pPGrBN-xqR60KvlrfbOmI4U5gMbAZLd=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "마이클조단", "rating": 3, "content": "커피가 ㅜㅜ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLKm_oPjPL6aHjmdftGYOQVUwspmhHrpjeYHkz7esU173_Apg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Comida Coreana Fácil", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW5Q8n06HMt_SOrsmd6BDHqQvCsD4lesIebGf3_BSroPrLzZRvT=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Sungjin PARK", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXOT0AxtbS8xV5g-66dDvXTyaI2EecjkQpRQchHeWwhbjOnx7ag=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "권순호", "rating": 3, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXOwGCdHx-WAKyuVkHGx8VnZjzdhw6kkMZmku7orO-MNLGyk253=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJNU23TIypfDURXJgOumlnSIw/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJNU23TIypfDURXJgOumlnSIw/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJNU23TIypfDURXJgOumlnSIw/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJNU23TIypfDURXJgOumlnSIw/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJNU23TI