4.3	37.506251	126.93991299999999	2026-02-16 19:14:47.316556	2026-03-17 22:29:31.184213	019c65f2-0b14-7be0-b89f-78b0c92d0da7	CAFE	ChIJ3X-op1-ffDURO33Er1_9hos	653219506	컴포즈커피 동작도서관점	[{"author": "JONGHOON KIM", "rating": 4, "content": "매장 크기는 20인내외 이용가능+ 여름철엔 야외 자리도 소수있음.\\n\\n크기는 크지않지만 친절하고, 가격도 아주 비싸진 않다.\\n모든 면에서 방문하기 매우 무난한 그런 까페.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWxFiy6oEd-IFMpA4tH2_HPVBOMpm3f_cSEsl5TkwNLebNEBlff=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "스테고마그마", "rating": 5, "content": "저렴한 가격으로 맛도 괜찮습니다.\\n쿠폰으로 구매하면 적립이 안되어서 아쉽네요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJTeFjMVNt-paedcCbf_jimwf-qNkzldQcTdrrcny3QPfmCSA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "경미", "rating": 4, "content": "아메리카노에 헤이즐넛시럽을 추가하면 맛이 좋습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXf_7mVVZO3P5-xY0rjQ3lxv2Ki8lBPye6zme4kc1OSyl87pkhk=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "SH", "rating": 4, "content": "동네까페다 보니 동네 어르신들이 제법 많아요.그런 분위기 개의치않으시다면 음료 저렴하고 자리에 콘센트도 있어서 좋습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWSiZ6NJbIVQcIZ1GKoIJIt9_Ay1sTENkmWfkn9qw6V174hWGw8zg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Kevin _Yun", "rating": 4, "content": "넓고 쾌적하며 깔끔합니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWzb4CoNgJmVZEmr3SFuEe1ikrLbDRxItZG_SzV63G_RKpOzNTp=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "김영희", "rating": 5, "content": "날씨가 무지 더운날 친구들과 들른곳에서 커피와 디저트를 먹었는데 맛있었네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLo5yXdNE7d1MsABq7izrIm60O7d8ciDFJvGWDuzCChXd0xiw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "고길현", "rating": 4, "content": "새롭게 오픈한 카페라서 깔끔하고, 사장님이 친절하세요. 화장실이 매장 안에 없다는 게 큰 단점ㅠ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXQkZAS8Q4UFl7BS1Wz36rSMOseX-_QfSyFrRU3RyN0LBPUOFlEBw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "이성희", "rating": 4, "content": "가격이 저렴하고 블루베리 스무디가 맛있어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWEWR9myL_GvMZ1q3UF63xoVZKSIPay8ByZpxib0yCesPS1sFIy=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ3X-op1-ffDURO33Er1_9hos/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ3X-op1-ffDURO33Er1_9hos/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ3X-op1-ffDURO33Er1_9hos/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ3X-op1-ffDURO33Er1_9hos/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ3X-op1-ffDURO33Er1_9hos/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000007405DB8827BC5F409D4830D5CCC04240
