4.5	37.4296491	126.99111669999999	2026-02-16 19:14:52.006299	2026-03-17 22:31:03.493356	019c65f2-1d66-77eb-a1c3-2bdd2d644550	CAFE	ChIJRysvsnhfezUR9TWgx7m80qI	2127747352	메가MGC커피 과천힐스테이트점	[{"author": "J", "rating": 4, "content": "다양한 메뉴.\\n커피, 스무디, 프라페, 에이드, 주스, 디저트.\\n세번 가봤는데 직원들 메뉴처리 실수가 2번 있었다. 오픈 초기라 적응하는 단계.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJTbIGOz5MOG4lf1GpraWbw2WTXIv2S8RyP94mi-qkiws1vPyku=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "왕만두", "rating": 5, "content": "커피가 맛있습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVXNJJCZIY8GnCDNCG1flcdi07-DF4mzL5hRSH8n0pJkarHWLLx-g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "애쿠", "rating": 1, "content": "왜 메가오더로 미리 시켜놓은 제 커피를 다른사람을 먼저 주는지... 전 이해가 안가네요 ㅎㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXfyqtmbj_mewVRh79yvu9LKBWkR5pcV97uJFm2kaxl8jPCmYA0=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "조호정", "rating": 4, "content": "가성비가좋은매장이고 위치가좋아서 가볍게 마시기좋음.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXiKEZOK_GXTDuq2qlUVq5O5MCCS2I6zPDMKooEy5WNgTF_JDAO=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "장자윤", "rating": 5, "content": "친절하고 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKfbq0ab-N2aiZcyVwFGHfKKppcMAVCfSYLTX-mJ0AbRbNsiA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "YOUNGCHUL WON", "rating": 5, "content": "친절해요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXdEIXygZ9LRbjYLTjitKTfQBp8anfP1wydG3xX7tqNo9i5TXSe=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Kyengtae Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIckJk8QVtAgQXFyfBUR6ZgFXgfj5gOgaI_LLhyIN0XlDa1JQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "peter Oh", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIRzuEPXhd77JiYJxfvCnVmwaeRo7nuSD9z3s5IKNoxl_Y4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRysvsnhfezUR9TWgx7m80qI/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRysvsnhfezUR9TWgx7m80qI/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRysvsnhfezUR9TWgx7m80qI/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRysvsnhfezUR9TWgx7m80qI/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRysvsnhfezUR9TWgx7m80qI/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000003E41BD746EBF5F40BFA0E0BDFEB64240
3.9	37.4263244	126.9915297	2026-02-16 19:14:52.006512	2026-03-17 22:31:06.14304	019c65f2-1d66-77eb-a1c4-17323579c9cb	CAFE	ChIJWZ99tZ5fezURPIindaghLYg	7961575	스타벅스 과천이마트점	[{"author": "박태경 (AniQ)", "rating": 4, "content": "편리한 위치와 깔끔한 매장, 가벼운 휴식 공간\\n\\n과천 이마트 안에 위치한 스타벅스 매장이라 쇼핑 전후에 들르기 정말 편리합니다. 매장은 깔끔하고 좌석도 넉넉해서 혼자 와서 커피 마시며 잠깐 휴식하기 좋습니다. 시그니처 로스팅 커피 맛도 안정적이고, 가벼운 샌드위치나 디저트류도 함께 즐길 수 있어 식사 대용으로도 괜찮습니다. 무료 Wi-Fi가 제공되어 노트북 작업이나 간단한 업무를 보기에도 좋아요. 다만, 주말이나 저녁 시간대에는 쇼핑객 때문에 약간 붐빌 수 있으니 참고하세요.\\n\\n2025_0930_화:", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXLaot2LPv72oJff7Cx8gBRjyNzRy3iFz5A1fRltToBii4o6ADz=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "Anthony G", "rating": 5, "content": "이용하기 좋아요. 매장은좁지만 속도빠름.\\n주차는 지하무료", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIaTftyLB3kjr-_ootv_TlTUOdCAl2RbeSHINhoIJza3pKiew=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Minjung ko (Higela)", "rating": 4, "content": "이마트 갔다가 골프치고\\n스타벅스 한잔~ 여기 인기있는지점인가요? 사람 짱많아요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWpALW9PFKJeuMHbd3SZ_RTAG6Ybz-S-GJElR-IekYL2GCbE4kw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "keunhye jang", "rating": 3, "content": "음식도 맛있고 서비스도 그렇게 나쁘진 않았는데 시끄러워서 공부도 못하고 감상도 못하는 장소네요...", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWwmrKbHXM1jBNcKA4uTH0Nw5aUrUmWYKl6Q8oqx8oXUeZ-2L82=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "jeanie c", "rating": 5, "content": "더블에스프레소칩 프라프치노 취저 인데요. 직원분들 엄청 친절하시고 직원분이 줄설때 거리두기 맞쳐서 줄서달라고 ... 이런 매장에선 첨 들었네요. 울 직원분 목 많이 아프시겠지만 홧팅!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVne5FAKtOqTOqRUoC_Wnpf0uUilOT9zj4HxwobDSgLPo8B_toH5g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "왕만두", "rating": 4, "content": "이마트 건물 1층에 위치한 스타벅스입니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVXNJJCZIY8GnCDNCG1flcdi07-DF4mzL5hRSH8n0pJkarHWLLx-g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "TY", "rating": 3, "content": "이마트 안에 있다. . 넓지도 사람이 많지도 않고 . 주차 되지만 쾌적한 것은 아님", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWScxoEzdSWFSJLY-pAeqeJPxuOXHslOEik49FROo6mpOa44GvqhQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "EunMi Pak", "rating": 4, "content": "반대편 스타벅스는 학생들이 많고요 여긴 이름처럼 위치 특성상 아주머니들도 많고 수다떠는 사람이 많아요... 직원분들도 부지런하시고 음료도 정성스럽게 주시구요... 단 노트북을 설치할 수 있는테이블에도 수다수다 그룹이 너무 점령한다는 아쉬움 ㅎㅎ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLZMUUl5gm0o7TsNTH4gEI2HwTuF-t-45y_q0cFuwLUxSZdaw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWZ99tZ5fezURPIindaghLYg/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWZ99tZ5fezURPIindaghLYg/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWZ99tZ5fezURPIindaghLYg/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWZ99tZ5fezURPIindaghLYg/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWZ99tZ5fezURPIindaghLYg/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJWZ99tZ5fezURPIindaghLYg/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}]	010