4.3	37.5156437	127.0331131	2026-03-17 22:32:08.482885	2026-03-17 22:32:08.482885	019cfbff-25a2-7e1c-ae78-96d693403bf8	CAFE	ChIJrzEX7RKjfDURCt6gHZZkEqs	98758197	넵타임커피	[{"author": "Jeehoon Shin", "rating": 4, "content": "테린느가 정말 맛있는 카페. 분위기도 한적하고 조용해서 좋다. 의자와 테이블 배치가 살짝 불편한 감이 있다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVELavBa_fx5KrF-1omaIUQ-FV6vglngi6a3FjlPUOu3qiYt38F=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "이규태", "rating": 5, "content": "디저트 잘 안먹는데 말차초코테린느랑 넵타임라떼를 같이 먹으면 정말 맛있습니다! 사장님도 친절하시구 오랜만에 방문했는데 매장 분위기도 더 이뻐지고 좋았습니다!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLDZr2WXQkQBarj0_JZTA9CciQA62ksLhJOqiefK58Dymz_Ng=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "알러뷰다녤", "rating": 5, "content": "커피와 디저트까지 맛있고 조용한 분위기 좋은 카페였어요  나중에 또 방문하고 싶은곳이에요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJoInPKxPNi5aMxW8avCDMdSiD_iIbJnyxP6dVkhEy5fTHajw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "최종현", "rating": 5, "content": "테린느 맛집입니다. 아메리카노 주문하시면 꼭 같이 시켜보세요. 사장님이 운영을 열심히 하시는데 디저트에서 묻어나는 것 같아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW9xERVvKu7Buuse_KCfS9oHMT5f5qP6oO3_0Uqx5qtHOpOOT3B=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "전인훈", "rating": 5, "content": "테린느가 진짜 맛있어요. 초코 브라우니 케익을 만들면 가운데 부분이 진짜 꾸덕하게 맛있는데 딱 그 부분 맛이 나네요.\\n\\nThey sell some brownie kinda things called terinne??(not sure about the spelling) It has heavenly taste. Better than any brownies I have had. Totally worth trying!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIs1wtHcRcvYy-VETleIxtialoRTvfzFDO4ANHbEj3vAgd35A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Vincent Gong", "rating": 5, "content": "회사 근처라 자주 가는 카페에요. 시그니처 라떼도 좋고 개인적으로는 근방 카페 중 콜드 브루가 최고인 듯 👊🏻", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXus4dTr26kzCnAxDyM7k-Dt13G4cG0QLsC3vhQD7PVNYo_0jk=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "김정훈", "rating": 3, "content": "무난한 동네 카페. 근처 프랜차이즈 카페가 소란스러울때 가끔 찾습니다. 점심시간엔 사람이 많은 편입니다. 가격은 착한편이에요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIKTHySZqlps5EwRqpjq4ChP1x7wyvJisKAjHnZSrJsvxvDaA6y=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "기호", "rating": 5, "content": "주말에 자주 가는 편인데 직원분도 친절하시고 맛도 너무좋아서 완전 강추!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLpJgHkYLV-3_coFHTn9Ir_c5-nBaJ0xWMX3kCdDp4BfkuTIg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJrzEX7RKjfDURCt6gHZZkEqs/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJrzEX7RKjfDURCt6gHZZkEqs/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJrzEX7RKjfDURCt6gHZZkEqs/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJrzEX7RKjfDURCt6gHZZkEqs/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJrzEX7RKjfDURCt6gHZZkEqs/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJrzEX7RKjfDURCt6gHZZkEqs/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJrzEX7RKjfDURCt6gHZZkEqs/photos/6.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [19, 0]}]	010