4	37.5131008	127.1034334	2026-03-17 22:32:08.483747	2026-03-17 22:32:08.483747	019cfbff-25a3-7a8b-b31e-c734a78508a7	CAFE	ChIJa05F9EalfDURfHtpXtPAiEY	2111674647	뮬리노 에스프레소바 롯데월드몰점	[{"author": "재구언", "rating": 4, "content": "롯데월드몰에서 에스프레스 전문으로 판매하는 곳\\n매장 좌석이 많거나 편한건 아니지만 그래도 커피맛은 좋다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUek1lwt3Spzcu8dNngJkgL4kJbW8VycfZloLZcQKtvy7hVq0IO=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Seungho Park", "rating": 3, "content": "에스프레소바가 생겨 반가웠으나 가격을 생각하면 많이 아쉽네요. 메뉴선택을 잘못한건지 솔트카라멜 에스프레소는 에쏘맛을 느끼기 어려울정도… 고릴라떼는 아이스로 나오는데 그냥 무난한 맛입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU7j1CWSghC8DMscr7gsNFEAsmsBZ2ZLJzdOGWBxlB70qKFHwNmSQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "정하늘", "rating": 5, "content": "Good espresso, specially menu make me have good memories", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWp45eZhd06QD3gTQWhxFgslGHGSqagV5E6t5v7pOE3NIjFq564=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Y.E. Song", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXyvPDvLuoNimeB5v34UOKwYR-FRllUeQH60Dsu2RRKPDz9k0qM8Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJa05F9EalfDURfHtpXtPAiEY/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJa05F9EalfDURfHtpXtPAiEY/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJa05F9EalfDURfHtpXtPAiEY/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "