4.7	37.4943668	127.15179769999999	2026-03-17 22:32:08.484042	2026-03-17 22:32:08.484042	019cfbff-25a4-7b91-8655-bcb6d609cc83	CAFE	ChIJkZ0C14SvfDURzZ5qFewaW5A	317889701	메가커피	[{"author": "june kim", "rating": 5, "content": "주변 로또 구매하다가 잠시 들렸던곳인데\\n넓지는 않지만 앉을곳 많습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWF-LTyeEHT5uZCRsUe49LIwFUo_nCWm8Ue7TapC5xEUXcMyqtQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "YeauNam Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "편하게 여가시간을 보낼수있는 곳 .", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXtiWhQ7USzwT3qP67D-eSX5RkBiRJNZUiX_nZbQ6lcSOYLoTk=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "PAPA SAFETY", "rating": 5, "content": "동네커피셥\\n가성비 와 위치가 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWwvDGE6PXhdy9ERx7OoKxNuRaG4uU5-dOo1KGCWhTPDfQeLqxdCw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "김정희", "rating": 4, "content": "고르는 재미 먹는 재미가 있는곳.\\n어머니 아버지와 나와 아들의 사랑방", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLyy_aiuTq-cfi6DWhmL3SID7yxoL43_w3iZVK4ONu-nY3Uog=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "김용득", "rating": 4, "content": "가성비 좋고 맛도 좋아 매일 가는 메가...", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWhKtezJuGOo0oj3Efy0AkNkxaHD4LrVAzYZ5uQwwvvZ8lwrooJ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "김상욱", "rating": 5, "content": "단 짠의 대표적인 돼지갈비집, 가끔 생각날 때 가는 곳", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKgEjZlDvYZbmxWGN7gyunRmzJ0__AAo6a1REYzIAxsH2VhTw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "윤솜", "rating": 5, "content": "좋아요 친절하시고 맛있어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWEUIfXZtlqEB7vyI-ZArBREt4M3pU0d5GKJdWShfFtXb15VzaW=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "신상윤", "rating": 4, "content": "커피 포장 잘해주는곳", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXmGSC6tyS6miz_7THvSxryGE7QUalvoVvepk2699SVoRLWykc4_w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJkZ0C14SvfDURzZ5qFewaW5A/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJkZ0C14SvfDURzZ5qFewaW5A/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJkZ0C14SvfDURzZ5qFewaW5A/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000E946B30DB7C95F40351D4B6947BF4240
4	37.5902132	127.0185037	2026-03-17 22:32:08.484184	2026-03-17 22:32:08.484184	019cfbff-25a4-7b91-8656-11e5eb05779e	CAFE	ChIJ678wiMe8fDURUXjXDcR4Gug	132368169	카페뮬	[{"author": "김태훈", "rating": 3, "content": "강아지 동반이 가능한건 좋았으나 대학생들 공부하는 분위기에 너무 조용해서 이야기 나누기가 부담스러웠어요. 커피는 별로.. 맛이 없었음.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU9JX2HRhUUslzzGYL3gM_IhlJ53djMXt3gu7eDx1etljeBoQPYLg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "선이", "rating": 5, "content": "ㅠㅠ 밖에서 손님이 들어오기만을 창밖을 보며 기다리는 커다랗고 귀여운 강아지!!가 있읍니다……… 너무 귀엽고 매장도 엄청 크고 넓고 공부하기 좋아요\\n제발 강아지보러오세요오세요오세요오세요오세요오세요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV_ggUGXWGjv8XFI74PMIlGCWum8mSx_pWoFUlRga3FpXfAZB9ttw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Kristin K", "rating": 4, "content": "넓고 여유로운 까페에서 맛있는 원두를 골라 마시는 라떼. 거기다 멋지고 상냥한 강아지 쵸파 ♥", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVyUPxeMV8_DdFibQUjk0AOj6K-KH2dnnx5uKpgPPrb8D2cOurnFQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "김지현", "rating": 3, "content": "커피는 많이 비싸요ㅠㅠ\\n카페안에 있는 쵸파가 정말 귀여워요\\n사람도 너무 좋아해서 쵸파보러 가끔 이용..", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX9Un28S7JBOGPq7WHy3DGt7R2vWcX3NFKrrMJYkdDKHW1AqaVRGw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "sooin", "rating": 4, "content": "커다란 강아지가 트레이드 마크인 곳. 순하고 사람을 잘 따른다.\\n음료값이나 케익값은 4~6천원대로 적당한 듯 살짝 비싸다. 매장이 굉장히 넓은데 냉난방이 아주 쎄고, 담요도 넉넉히 준비되어 있다. 주말에는 새벽 2시까지 운영하는 곳이라 늦게까지 작업할 때 들르게 되는 곳이다.\\n크레이프 케이크 추천!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVUpI5z2fCzirceG0hQ80RNEhK5hIHW5XsTx9AeP9ItplbfEjYo=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "이성안", "rating": 4, "content": "공간이 넓직하구 사람없을때는 일하기 좋은 분위기에요, 의자는 조금 불편, 강아지가 넘  귀엽습니다 사람오면 마중나오네요 똘똘하게 생겼어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKUfQdWdMUPZudw_gZH9tMQ6kjp4uKSha2utIK3m6J3tXWj8Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "CH Song", "rating": 5, "content": "성신여대에서 노트북하기 좋은 카페\\n마스코트 강아지가 있음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUQwzIy4giBseIdGmM-ClQMpFiooIWv5EAyCm4sJvdaXKWzbXHm=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "벳나비", "rating": 5, "content": "정말 좋은 카페에요\\n커피도 맛있고\\n특히 댕댕이 좋아하시는 분이면 강추강추~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLRbceL9c_yr3awUhBTSY4qnUmXM2rTK5P9GvZhXx2KtTMZcv4=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ678wiMe8fDURUXjXDcR4Gug/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ678wiMe8fDURUXjXDcR4Gug/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ678wiMe8fDURUXjXDcR4Gug/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ678wiMe8fDURUXjXDcR4Gug/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [2, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [2, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [2, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [2, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [2, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [12, 0], "closeTime": [2, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [2, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000B896242A2FC15F4071D52B1B8CCB4240
4	37.481302	127.1480376	2026-03-17 22:32:08.484332	2026-03-17 22:32:08.484332	019cfbff-25a4-7b91-8657-2725e56a565a	CAFE	ChIJ166zRQCvfDURJIPwzGwSMtQ	2095387641	메가MGC커피 위례지웰점	[{"author": "Simon Shim", "rating": 4, "content": "메가MGC커피는  체인점으로 가성비 좋고 양도 넉넉해서 자주 이용하는 곳이에요.\\n스타필드시티 위례 건너편에 위치하고있으며, 건물 외부쪽으로 키오스크 주문대와 Take out이 가능한 곳이 있으며 내부에도 키오스크가있어 주문을 편하게 할 수 있습니다.\\n맛은 체인점이다보니 아주 와~맛있다는 아니지만 기본정도는 유지한다고 보시면 되겠네요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXaeNLolpLpGNYuIoYhgMLDoJKUjj9X4vi-c7Zs5gPT-MzTFkc=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ166zRQCvfDURJIPwzGwSMtQ/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ166zRQCvfDURJIPwzGwSMtQ/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ166zRQCvfDURJIPwzGwSMtQ/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ166zRQCvfDURJIPwzGwSMtQ/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E610000003A5B27279C95F40ECBFCE4D9BBD4240
4.4	37.5022829	127.0393941	2026-03-17 22:32:08.484452	2026-03-17 22:32:08.484452	019cfbff-25a4-7b91-8658-b820c68a15f3	CAFE	ChIJnRnxGymjfDURoh9tZHcDsoA	1714048998	바른커피	[{"author": "Eun A park", "rating": 5, "content": "맛있는 바른커피\\n아침엔  따뜻한 찐 계란도 주셔서 아침을 든든하게 채울수 있어요\\n미인 사장님 두분이 언제나 미소로 맞아주셔서 기분좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIeA3fTzMDRcWlqKXtzqXbcpNVyfkXZUELTwbBcuwu12mrGfNw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "주식회사샘물터", "rating": 4, "content": "아침에 달걀을 주는 까페입니다. 미숫가루 라떼 조금 달지만 얼음 없이 깔끔하게 먹을 수 있어요. 식사 대용으로 아주 좋습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUeEeS2MqSE9n-mqucyTl2oHeGCSNsTM53Did6v_Xrfqi1Az2NZ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "차승환", "rating": 4, "content": "아침에 커피 시키면 삶은 계란도 하나씩 주셔서 좋아요~ 배달 픽업도 엄청 많이들 오시네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKIDpEAYVCbgOAG61qhWN4zAFATrL1K7hI2fHZ4ilN91VjOAw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "HS Oh", "rating": 5, "content": "가격도 괜찮고 가끔 커피뿐 아니라 간식거리도 주는 곳이에요\\n지금까지는 삶은 계란. 샌드위치 먹어봤네요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ7Z5VwPQqvMQMxKREEjaMx4sfVHMB9lnvuSsuO2VbZpKm0cg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Danny Oh", "rating": 5, "content": "오전에 가면 삶은달걀을 주는 분위기 좋은 커피숍이에요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWjiyZ6Ooal8c9lFDFI_4nAEeoBarmzrKsnTIl2sbbQ_s2YVWW9=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "jong hyun kim", "rating": 5, "content": "맛 서비스 최고예요!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjULPGVsnj22qNp5yTTqVtpdVBW-9GQ3pKmj92k_1NxKTclLD3rMXw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "JADE KELLY", "rating": 5, "content": "아침7시 안되서 나오니 문연곳이 여기뿐이었는데 아아도 맛났고 뜨끈한 찐계란 주셔서 감동😍", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI8d2hkoVLKIk5Z8HQpewxq3mEdIjdTG54kgq6zn1UAqvV8YRk=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "조영애", "rating": 5, "content": "모닝세트할인받아서 잉글리쉬머핀이랑 아메리카노 마셨어여 맛이썽~~~~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLaohrEvijIXpUjNVf8Fl0kesXBatsGxfVU57drecviNZlObA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJnRnxGymjfDURoh9tZHcDsoA/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJnRnxGymjfDURoh9tZHcDsoA/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJnRnxGymjfDURoh9tZHcDsoA/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJnRnxGymjfDURoh9tZHcDsoA/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [10, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000F1C9D46E85C25F40866B5ACE4AC04240
