4.3	37.4870024	127.1304303	2026-03-17 22:32:08.484927	2026-03-17 22:32:08.484927	019cfbff-25a4-7b91-865b-c5355688b39a	CAFE	ChIJ4eNDVEavfDUR2xSwpwt7Dgc	402024643	텐더터틀 커피 로스터스	[{"author": "Hwan", "rating": 5, "content": "카페라떼가 부드럽고 맛있어요. 매장도 넓고 쾌적해요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXe2Df9EdymOAo8SQjYNrHUWdBEeAF-GFXc7tLdYn1TDcFLRpVW=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "지윤", "rating": 4, "content": "가게 이름처럼 거북이가 많아요~\\n수족관에서 커피마시는거 같아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKowHp3uHKtNhDcXZnWd1eD0KDj3WfLfet3RKUkYz0YTvmfGA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "CHANG HO SHIN", "rating": 4, "content": "흔한 동네 커피집이지만,   거북이가 많아 흥미롭고 어항관리가 잘되있슴.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXL7ve89lS0PtMusmg5kPGgtl9JUrlQbRSgWpjjBf_QFRYGBsiuFg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "백루미", "rating": 4, "content": "거북이랑 커피한잔.\\n여기 백향과차 에이드 둘다맛있어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcrYd9BjcxLpU3cwtjSaNieIGBBR54rfAXhUo7kR-ODZo2fu-4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "yohan", "rating": 5, "content": "거북이가 수족관에 다양한 종류로 있는게 신기해요. 꽃도 같이 있어서 데이트코스로 추천", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWuJd--wjNlGWoh6R4cuxP-p9HJzcnyRT0wU9beAFAFQOw-Z4o=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "박베너", "rating": 3, "content": "어라 매장이 확 바뀌었네요.... 가격도 좀 올라고요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJQzrMBdsiP9MXhk-AjG22-qkI_reljGlACYf3YEpR_xB60dlnF=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Leo Kil (Leo)", "rating": 3, "content": "수족관이 있다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUiEiA6N2wE9XmUYyGs1fC5QZr0EhoIbcjuFZnf0Pm9pq-F4GCF=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "유너부리", "rating": 5, "content": "거북이 엄청 많음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ0cmFVvo_uXJmdO9VX1E8dCKAq-S1FuAQ7wxQAe_SfrKnfzQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ4eNDVEavfDUR2xSwpwt7Dgc/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ4eNDVEavfDUR2xSwpwt7Dgc/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ4eNDVEavfDUR2xSwpwt7Dgc/photos/2.png"}]	[]	0101000020E6100000143A54F858C85F4069893A1856BE4240
