4.7	37.512046399999996	127.08417259999999	2026-03-17 22:33:26.177128	2026-03-17 22:33:26.177128	019cfc00-5521-75a8-a316-71a90042d05f	CAFE	ChIJRR0hJeulfDURw4RBLGD0MMQ	1862236942	커스텀커피 잠실엘스점	[{"author": "YJ J", "rating": 5, "content": "지하에 카페가 언제들어왔대? 라며 별생각 없이 테이크아웃해서 마셨어요.  들고나와서 한모금 마시자마자 아 맛있다. 라고 입밖으로 내뱉은거 오랜만이에요. 특히 우유가 고소한 딱 그 온도를 잘 맞춘커피는 더더욱 오랜만이었구요. 이름도 커스텀커피라 당연히 개인카페일줄 알았는데 프랜차이즈 였네요. 지하인게 좀 아쉽지만 종종들를것 같아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIpS1LWDAG9qixjLLkihEkXJOGUuu3q3ICK-4B_cKoQ88D6ZRuB=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Yj Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "라떼 맛있어요! 앉아서 마실 공간이 많거나 쾌적하진 않아서 별 하나 뺐어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-IZIX7QdhVjj4ehkENqczlySIudyjdE7bzTb40KQLUKNlgmpB=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "시서우", "rating": 5, "content": "최고의 라떼, 최고의 딸기라떼\\n너무친절하고 깔끔하다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIfX_P4yYH9b-ufS0CwuamHOuMTxq8w3hRwKEVzrhqTt_3n7Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "홍구", "rating": 5, "content": "간단히 테이크아웃 하기 좋은\\n아쉬운건 지하1층", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLyF4qFmK2-U1_fiVlESnWdbhe2kgT-bSOL_63LxpAgFfmV8A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "jang ramul", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVlqid7xa8mSK_8Ni5djgjffcPOhYz0B7mG71wWxWYw2r4jpGlV=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Sydney s", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWUCQiloFJYAwxGP--rixneNfLZwihMmHnP0LIws4go5zEIensT=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "황지호", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLkjO0_Ol3N3pswqLLl8_09Fe3j4nC0wHKJ_l_GSiFT4yK6eJan=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "설상환", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ6kFruUdDaZIMB-iWQVSiQL6tIXPOuOOme4UzLLhnqr8NtKQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRR0hJeulfDURw4RBLGD0MMQ/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRR0hJeulfDURw4RBLGD0MMQ/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRR0hJeulfDURw4RBLGD0MMQ/photos/2.png"}]	[]	0101000020E6100000080E791563C55F406B0487BC8AC14240
4.6	37.5241681	126.9645936	2026-03-17 22:33:26.177258	2026-03-17 22:33:26.177258	019cfc00-5521-75a8-a317-e6d9ce2ab5ef	CAFE	ChIJUXybi6ehfDURLmPGeyoO9Aw	184973403	봄날 플라워카페	[{"author": "Bochog", "rating": 5, "content": "The best thing this place is giving you BTS memorabilia when you are a fan of BTS. Just a walk to Hybe HQ.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVrBSIZwuS7lQGBIfA5Kz99cda_qZJ_XV8uCh-yFN0TwE0ckCnP=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Akko tin", "rating": 3, "content": "Flower&Cafe\\n\\nHYBE裏側、一番右側にあるお店。\\nJK BDイベでは、グッズの数が限定で、午後に行ったらもうなかった。\\n店内はそんなに広くないけど、優しい色つかいのお店だった。", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXVLarwybRdNsTPmfgZs44IfzUmcuInECIQINF0h8EPe6t-Pva92g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Jessica Torres", "rating": 5, "content": "Yummy drinks, great ambiance and very kind staff! 🥰", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXoTnV2xUlvL6y1cZzkaiCjOCVxkq3Xr7pc1H8bS0MfoR-ewuA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "eniram copp", "rating": 5, "content": "Very Nice People and good brevage", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUIaZrj8F1Z8KPgQ2bG2WTz_D7HvOZ1YRku3ev7GvMEDQ9Bizmt=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Ananda Arroyo", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWEhjY-yFmx9aO3PhzW5B62bg-tUt6QwmxHVT7lx0YMi66Tcpu0=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJUXybi6ehfDURLmPGeyoO9Aw/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJUXybi6ehfDURLmPGeyoO9Aw/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJUXybi6eh