4.6	37.5700962	126.9902001	2026-02-16 19:14:57.073622	2026-03-17 22:37:46.54181	019c65f2-3131-79c2-b86f-d7b9394abc28	CAFE	ChIJRxm1WGajfDURDYz7jbmgVPM	1920641814	브루다커피 종로3가점	[{"author": "--", "rating": 5, "content": "저가커피인데 놀랍게 맛있어요! 크런치 슈가 라떼는 이 가격인데 하프커피만큼 맛있어서 놀랐어요!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUErfohdIUoBf53mhvhtDFfS44o7x9KvQfX4lzMSpFr-XgwD7HY=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "FULL Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "종로에서 가성비 굿인 카페\\n분위기도 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXscyOzzqbLz0mqxguwqsxc-Qn13TklzuDbJX3Ol-PptvFe1CWFHg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "Michael W.", "rating": 5, "content": "I'm looking for a simple breakfast with a cup of coffee and a piece of bread. I saw the sign in front of the coffee shop shows a salt bread and a cup of coffee. Perfect, this is what I'm looking for. The coffee shop is a self-order system and I have problems with the order. The girl who works there was very nice and offered to help. I got what I wanted, and both the salt bread and the coffee taste very good.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUChZ-TZB0XTqluQ04MhZVE30j1vJjSFjFoQDmM7KyrG7uTIX4q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Buster Got it", "rating": 4, "content": "The only 1,000 won (70 cents or 60 cents euro) as of November 12th of 2025, Hot Americano or Iced Americano coffee shop in Seoul. The coffee is not bad at all. It is on the similar level as Mega or Paik. This is a much smaller chain coffee shop than the Compose, Mega or Paik. Service is very fast and they have settings inside. Decent choice is bakery or pastry.\\n\\nScale 1-10:\\nDrink-7\\nPrice-10\\nService-7\\nAtmosphere-8\\nCleanliness-8", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX2CwvbJP6pHXxlDxkyoizaK8hnPXm19KJEj3vMU657XZUPiRk=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Matthias F.", "rating": 5, "content": "Morgens hier gefrühstückt, der Kaffee ist sehr gut, und das Muffin Sandwich schmeckt auch. Dazu ein Coocki und der Tag kann. Der Inhaber ist freundlich und hilfsbereit und mit Google Übersetzer kann man sich verständigen.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXBcOypTVi9E-XODxQiL5TtSaDjW5PXhP-zlolZmAZui6fCyMXg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRxm1WGajfDURDYz7jbmgVPM/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRxm1WGajfDURDYz7jbmgVPM/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRxm1WGajfDURDYz7jbmgVPM/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRxm1WGajfDURDYz7jbmgVPM/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRxm1WGajfDURDYz7jbmgVPM/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJRxm1WGajfDURDYz7jbmgVPM/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [21, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000BD7F3D705FBF5F4075498BE9F8C84240
4.2	37.6121133	127.07682059999999	2026-02-16 19:15:01.786274	2026-03-17 22:37:47.832161	019c65f2-439a-7e24-a51d-dd7202b29dfa	CAFE	ChIJmQWYbDW7fDURQZbpqYcZQB4	676388278	컴포즈커피 먹골중랑점	[{"author": "신지윤", "rating": 3, "content": "컴포즈는 음료와 와플이 맛있어서 자주가는데\\n매장관리에는 너무 무관심한것 같아요\\n매번 갈때마나 메인자리에 저렇게 걸레인지 행주인지 널려있고 알바는 가방 옷들이 항상있고 테이블도 닦지않아 너무 더러워요~~\\n갈때마다 저러니~~너무 위생상 좋지  않아요\\n쫌 관리좀 했으면 좋겠네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXzXtFk_2ZVvGuGOd89sk5rngAks0HzsjOtlt82sh0z6_LSfNHIDA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "tobias Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVqs6quzlSEPlffj3j4atByHKT51rK797CLxUs9NQ0vRxVgLsc=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "KM Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "사람이 많음\\n와플 완전 감동.\\n바로 구워주고 사이즈 가격대비 최고.\\n아이와 와플사러 자주감.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXPeXYx4lrvmNbDCiSfO3HtvmmNNHk0-dbUO8l3uJ-SK_KXmBen=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "박진희", "rating": 5, "content": "커피에 산미 가 있어 좋습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIoORxuV_uXkQ3FkXL6D_k8ZJwwO8Mmzo2leVkZIoP3OOLqyg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "천라지망", "rating": 4, "content": "생각보다 가격이 저렴하지 않음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIBy7Gz-557jNPqd7k5BK68IR73hu7b_2nMq2_kruXRa9aEMg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "뽀글이TV", "rating": 5, "content": "너무좋아요 최곱니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVzAABjZQW8Dl57dlBj6hVA8wk86mLnlp5yzC71vQGfMeUP-IGPrA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "jk kim", "rating": 5, "content": "최고의서비스 최고의맛", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKhGfxOk-8t-1N1R_R7RB7I07rB1R_vHykG-GD_pu5yPrCH2A=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "솔도레미", "rating": 2, "content": "라데빙수 테이블있다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVCmPG05uXtle7tpBCSyZpuQV6_XzKflErROP8Buwgy4pBM9RE=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJmQWYbDW7fDURQZbpqYcZQB4/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJmQWYbDW7fDURQZbpqYcZQB4/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJmQWYbDW7fDURQZbpqYcZQB4/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJmQWYbDW7fDURQZbpqYcZQB4/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000002E2AF3A0EAC45F402B7986BA59CE4240
4.3	37.3310422	127.127736	2026-02-16 19:14:57.073781	2026-03-17 22:37:48.502829	019c65f2-3131-79c2-b870-a747da85c30e	CAFE	ChIJj8BQefJXezURhl43ngc09r0	891681205	카페알리에	[{"author": "Catherine HWANG", "rating": 5, "content": "유럽풍 빈티지카페 분위기가 너무 좋고. 커피도 맛있지만 유기농 수제쿠키가 정말 맛있네요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr559mx5N0QtP6T6Y7OU50JW2Oi2FYSyLKZAYfbvKaDCG7FA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "마루", "rating": 5, "content": "커피맛도 좋고 다른 음료도 모두 품질이 좋고 맛있어요.\\n수제청으로 만든 자몽티 청귤티 모두 맛있고, 수지 쿠키와 마카롱도 넘 맛있어요.\\n무엇보다 사장님이 너무 좋으세요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUcBw7DnAvFKAzobt6nRUqk94wo0MLLtwwZsTXs2SqUap3jUzi3=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Se Kweon Roh", "rating": 4, "content": "가격대는 좀 있는, 일요일이 휴무여서 좀 아쉬운 것 빼고는 전반적으로 괜찮은 카페입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXEWI4UOOC2sJONFrGK3PyZ8wmQnteOGh-UpXfiPMovtCFZcWYI=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "13층여자", "rating": 4, "content": "아메리카노 투샷 맛있었어요\\n10시오픈~\\n일요일은 휴무입니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVg757Fero1kI527jTVZqNocjLz3VZzL75xG01CQPmj0eEKQcp4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "김진성", "rating": 5, "content": "죽전  내대지마을에  위치한  분위기  좋은  까페입니다     지인들과의  모임할겸  방문했는데  까페  구석구석  다  포토죤이더라구요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVxjegDlDv0FVMdY_zpjCDlDy7W_4ystdgb4O9sctR8_XXnuow=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Andy Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "편안한 음악과 매장 내 분위기도 좋았어요.\\n찾잔과 그릇도 예쁘고 좋은 것을 쓰며 차 한 잔 한 잔 정성들여 만들어 내놓는 것으로 보여 대접받는 느낌이었습니다. 자주 갈 것 같습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXR4ddNWc9L-vQM0CFJenVz2YKNUXL5ChEefn2r7i-pxnuJdZqCHg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "young Shin", "rating": 4, "content": "커피도 맛있는데 로즈 밀크티가 맛있었어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLTtm49tQ0SQ37htsPg_js39ZBpO39YGcL3qiOyGoIflEHoHA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "정아", "rating": 5, "content": "이런곳이  ~^^\\n참 반갑네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocITyFMhJCgYczNpn2Ab3EEpzca5IIg0TO9PPk8JLGBD_O_-pQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJj8BQefJXezURhl43ngc09r0/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJj8BQefJXezURhl43ngc09r0/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJj8BQefJXezURhl43ngc09r0/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJj8BQefJXezURhl43ngc09r0/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}]	0101000020E610000066A19DD32CC85F40464C3F975FAA4240
