4.1	37.5792855	127.08692219999999	2026-03-17 22:38:21.754705	2026-03-17 22:38:21.754705	019cfc04-d7ba-78b9-a493-66d9d6799832	CAFE	ChIJZxxWouO6fDUR2McuEq4ZNRI	1433298247	투썸플레이스 사가정역점	[{"author": "박지영", "rating": 5, "content": "주차가 되어 좋았고, 다양한 음료 메뉴와 디저트는 역시 투썸이 최고네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVu-KEsLMupUVLtHXiIS3ojq4329OGp4SmWn2hRrqlKTSQLMVlo0w=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Ga Hyun Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "차 마시기 좋아요 케익사러 자주가요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX5aa3soE1WhI12cEAHJ-zJ-oX1Qqxk2rgHqyxnUaalAoQBCluaGQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "HyunKwan Kim", "rating": 3, "content": "주차장도 있고, 공간도 넓고 좋은데, 패브릭 의자들이 너무 더러워서 가죽? 혹은 비닐? 의자만 골라서 앉게 됩니다. 오래된 천 의자들 바꿔주시거나 커버를 씌워주시면 훨씬 자주 갈 것 같아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV_rdqpChJe4hGKjmRk8VE-Mu7biaPjT9sqdy0mHvLrU2nh8exj=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "LEO SHIN", "rating": 5, "content": "주차장도 있고, 자리도 넓고 테이블간 간격도 넓어서 요즘같은 시기에 약속잡기 좋은 곳 이라고 생각합니다.\\n또 주차장이 있는 것이 큰 장점입니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI7CxBf4XHNpuWMoxrS4G1Lw933erHzRh3mDw0dwRK1z2XNtA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "가치리치", "rating": 5, "content": "매장이 넓으니 여유로운 느낌이 들었어요~\\n주차가 되서 좋았어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUOpdKwgkNI-EM9kSQubdBz9JdGd84AXQe5SuDy-49YVYM3EbNR=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "그린보드", "rating": 4, "content": "케잌도 맛있고 매장도 넓고 쾌적해요\\n화장실청소만 조금더 깨끗하면 좋겠어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW3IX83NvXhnMIPGPSCEAD9fiBJ2nOPowLjbz2gTQowXMy7EGnu-Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "JunGyu Park (ParkJunGyu)", "rating": 5, "content": "조용하고 사람많지않았으나 점점 많아짐.깨끗하고 주차가능해요 5대정도? 앞에 스벅보다 맛있음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKhtvS-iSYs0twcshYVPQkwfh_xE3IE9KMm8tzYmHetsRPQyQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "냥조랭이", "rating": 4, "content": "커피 맛이 다른 곳보다 조금 연함요 그래도 점원 분들 친절하고 음악소리도 적당했어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW6QX_uOwGQ_ETYf2ofqwQ3Ne0gPienNmkgEwDjFcTCFqdBPfma=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZxxWouO6fDUR2McuEq4ZNRI/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZxxWouO6fDUR2McuEq4ZNRI/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZxxWouO6fDUR2McuEq4ZNRI/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJZxxWouO6fDUR2McuEq4ZNRI/photos/3.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [9, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000F792212290C55F4004C6FA0626CA4240
4.1	37.6593482	126.6661293	2026-03-17 22:38:21.754801	2026-03-17 22:38:21.754801	019cfc04-d7ba-78b9-a494-292116a82bd4	CAFE	ChIJlW9b3AKHfDUReBTHBQ3Ju1Y	8413172	투썸플레이스 김포DT점	[{"author": "카곰", "rating": 4, "content": "주차장과 드라이브 쓰루가 있는 투썸입니다. 걸어오기에는 멀고 자차를 이용하면 편한 곳입니다.\\n근처 아울렛 있어 쉬어가기 좋아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU362gqHBcuYp2GQuUssG5OLAma-DqQwqLwmVOf5civv4fvB965qA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "백영희", "rating": 5, "content": "드라이브 스루도 할수있고 또 매장도 1층 2층으로 되어있어 넓고 쾌적한 환경이네요\\n사람도 별로 많지않아 조용해서 얘기 나누기도 좋고 외곽이라 드라이브삼아 한번씩 가면 좋겠어요~커피 디저트도 맛있어요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVfLuoxxcmkxqKqwOBm5Cj9XWrSmrqNUDxsnXmEOHY9XsVg2NmX=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "휘자", "rating": 4, "content": "25.07.04.(금) 방문\\n\\n지나가는길에 들리기 좋음\\n매장 깔끔함\\n\\n@93hwijin", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUx4z3VjU_OkkukUThE_ahh7_UmkzqJiaQaQne5mQjVtz3TeGJP=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "YJ Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "유니클로 갔다가 들르기 좋음 (영수증 지참시 음료 10% 할인)", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJgpI-RX1EfJC3KM2OElnsZAX5iHwd5wBk3tbJ_zNBjNsw-Vg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "최혜선", "rating": 5, "content": "개인적으로 투썸 커피 좋아해요.\\n탄맛이 덜해서요ㅎㅎ\\n저녁시간에 가니 낮시간보다\\n사람이 없어서 조용하니 좋으네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLlaBk3o0nJpj7r3FgXH--DxHhZRdSRBlehieIKVc4t--Pt8g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "해랑", "rating": 5, "content": "할인 많이되서 옷보러갈때 커피한잔 먹는다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLD0IsLRxWoNevE8zih7-veqR7NBVFsRkuo02iKkWe2RT9ocxYy=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "마이드", "rating": 4, "content": "주차장넓고 매장 쾌적. 자리가 많은편은 아니다.\\n아기의자있음. 콘센트 일부좌석에 있음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUenUXW0T6gRNvLiIZZb03zdrgYwNr2yg15qwd_rMn4qvssVRdX=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Heeje Sung", "rating": 4, "content": "디티를 이용하기에 초보운전자는 조금 힘들수 있습니다\\n디티 진입로가 좁고 굴곡이 져있습니다\\n주차공간이 있으며 2층으로 매장이 되어 있습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLZBhWT8V4HUOKHiPzInd7r5Ss-jFsy3vZlQs-jQES287Dvbw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJlW9b3AKHfDUReBTHBQ3Ju1Y/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJlW9b3AKHfDUReBTHBQ3Ju1Y/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJlW9b3AKHfDUReBTHBQ3Ju1Y/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJlW9b3AKHfDUReBTHBQ3Ju1Y/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJlW9b3AKHfDUReBTHBQ3Ju1Y/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJlW9b3AKHfDUReBTHBQ3Ju1Y/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [23, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000129AC9DCA1AA5F4096D6958565D44240
