4.2	37.5751661	127.0853125	2026-03-17 22:38:21.755009	2026-03-17 22:38:21.755009	019cfc04-d7bb-76a2-aa94-f803425bf6d3	CAFE	ChIJzSIxV-C6fDUR8cyTMGII-T4	133403995	투썸플레이스 용마산역점	[{"author": "Stan Baek", "rating": 5, "content": "자주 방문하는 곳. 2층 공간이 넓고, 깨끗해서 업무 집중도가 높음.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXf5ZmrNXttE1ENbL_zYoCWy0PAwQagcjuF3I4wwWYxfK-gbmtP=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "미네", "rating": 4, "content": "2층으로 되어있는 투썸플레이스\\n2층이 생각보다 넓고 자리가 많다\\n사람이 많진 않은 편이라 생각보다 조용한 편\\n인테리어도 잘해두고 밝은편이라 카공족들이 좋아할만한 카페\\n화장실이 작고 변기칸이 너무나도 협소하다는 것만 빼면 전반적으로 좋음\\n\\n정확하진 않지만 건물 옆 주차장이 있었던것 같다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKpmaxJRfmB87w7TqV2nCA4u3z5m4bMDfEDXZl69tu96nlkKw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "이은정", "rating": 3, "content": "주차되고요, 깨끗한매장\\n화장실 물어봤는데 직원들의 불편한말투 .. 아쉬웠습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ-k0NAmvSHqwtMjoSOjJYJpO8zNCZZlJYOxxXC39N33y6Z_A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "방금상", "rating": 5, "content": "전망도 좋고, 깔끔하고, 2층까지 직접 가져다 주셔서 전체적으로 만족합니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIAQWdoq-88GoTBgG5KpnFxOBbuuo5N5dMS5ePO1DNH4naUCw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Jam Peach", "rating": 3, "content": "공부하는 학생이 대부분이라 넓은 편이지만 자리는 별로 없다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKl_uT0MUWk1_vIrNp5K68y7l_cCcN1lNWHA_uzWMG-g4Tut3_F=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "YONG HO LIM", "rating": 4, "content": "쾌적하고 좋아요. 충전시설이 잘 갖춰져있어요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIGZkgZbsv5CcX_kisD_XVnIVLUvCrnR9kVC2NV-Cbyszof1XPn=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Joo-Man Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "투썸플레이스의 기본에따라 운영되는곳 커피맛은 중상정도", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVMompgJND-TssrxZZJ1hlon_OiwEvSEYj2R-oIl30ybuJ5NcjO=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Dohwan Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "사람이 적고, 공부하러 오는 사람이 많아서 좋습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX_DWe1c7aCnI_IWfxRJ2k_LDpxCetXWVW1AMBIQBwIBV1pO8sxYw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJzSIxV-C6fDUR8cyTMGII-T4/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJzSIxV-C6fDUR8cyTMGII-T4/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJzSIxV-C6fDUR8cyTMGII-T4/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [21, 30]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 30], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [21, 30]}]	0101000020E6100000295C8FC275C55F4049A2F20A9FC94240
