4.8	37.571790799999995	126.99088929999999	2026-02-16 19:14:57.072141	2026-03-17 22:38:23.613727	019c65f2-3130-7231-830f-7896776ce5c7	CAFE	ChIJlXAY_IejfDURxEXnnXsatGk	1788660961	헤이포엣	[{"author": "Rabbit D.", "rating": 5, "content": "작지만 조용한 음악과 함께 커피한잔 즐길수 있는곳. 디저트전문점은 아니지만 준비된 케이크도 아주 맛있어 커피와 달달한 케잌의 콜라보를 느낄수 있었다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLQHFZk84pPyisSBLFFytRrNTFuWwhXiLzkChf5MVv_LkZ9nA8=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "Winnie Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "자그마한 개인 카페로 내부 모던 하면서 아늑한 분위기예요.간단한 쿠키류의 디저트도 있습니다..\\n라떼 맛있습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVhzhQW1FdGmnelxvHGisYunF8vZ9RefAjqUXXjvMNXNPknGlhi9g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "현우성", "rating": 5, "content": "늦게까지 하는 카페 찾다 우연히 들어간 곳.\\n분위기 좋고, 깔끔하고, 맛있고, 가격까지 쌈.\\n사장님들도 친절하셔서 기분 좋게 머물다 갑니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI-1hwoj8SwgENmOAnzFu98YcPuy3gezOxo7jRVroZRzdscywU=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "Jamie.B", "rating": 4, "content": "A cafe located in a back alley of Jongno 3-ga. It's small but clean and quiet, so it's a good place to stay for a while. The latte was delicious.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU4yTU-iZSHxatybUWwqUsBti6Shzw-ibnDTzz3plTeKXL5eqHW=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Daniel Yi", "rating": 5, "content": "Cafe Hey Poet is a hidden gem in Donui-dong, next to Ikseon-dong. It's a place with delicious coffee, cakes, and tea. (Group reservation guests can also enjoy beer or soju.) The music is great, and the owner speaks English and is cool. It's perfect for a relaxing stop while strolling through Jongno. I regained my energy and left in a good mood after having walnut cake with rooibos tea. I'm planning to visit again ~! :)", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKPfG8aEMFrN-JMvBzu7xmdP7jwYgRcPIkJQ9WobfaJDC1JUg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJlXAY_IejfDURxEXnnXsatGk/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJlXAY_IejfDURxEXnnXsatGk/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJlXAY_IejfDURxEXnnXsatGk/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJlXAY_IejfDURxEXnnXsatGk/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJlXAY_IejfDURxEXnnXsatGk/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJlXAY_IejfDURxEXnnXsatGk/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000345DF4BA6ABF5F40AB13E17030C94240
5	37.564220399999996	127.0798509	2026-02-16 19:15:10.181962	2026-03-17 22:38:26.758537	019c65f2-6465-745a-93cd-1c7066e9e493	CAFE	ChIJqe-M-yi7fDURJJWbi8zC_p0	1544788324	카페후르츠	[{"author": "연이", "rating": 5, "content": "중곡제일시장 지나 골목에 위치해있어요.\\n바로 눈에 띄는 위치는 아니지만\\n들어가면 아늑하고 편안해서 오래 있고 싶어지는 곳이에요.\\n음악도 좋고 소품도 예쁘고 커피와 디저트,\\n특히 요거트로 만든 카사타케이크가 너무 맛나요!!\\n사장님도 정말 친절하십니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVIY9RSBTtufAVkU2Sze7CyYKZE0K6kFfbSlVvKW1Tk3qErEXY=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "어메이징 Grace葛瑞絲", "rating": 5, "content": "점심 후 커피는 필수죠. 길을 걷다가 이 커피숍을 발견했어요. 너무 예쁘고 귀엽게 꾸며져 있어서 오늘은 한복한 티타임을 즐겼어요. ㅋㅋ\\n\\n기대를 크게 하지 않고 들어왔는데 커피 맛이 괜찮네요. 제가 근처에 사는 주민이라면 자주 들르게 될 것 같아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjViZ8XsX5D7DzGOQHgD4qbkFiHrkLIIvxQEHa4vGeIdwrAMSOYn=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "김상민", "rating": 5, "content": "잠깐 앉아서 대화 나누기에 좋은 카페.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLke5pa9MlGcHyPGTlU2VOQD8uLzEgHInY2VgG9idIsIgkD=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "RUBY's Things", "rating": 5, "content": "늘 감사합니다!!^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUxN-diIX2e3gv7BT4cmNzYBkS9Zpq6hrw1mIfS2X_Q8h5DhIU=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "hogyun shin", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUoW8m5xuRaKb0bkdtIOma-0ElV7oionF_eHHMSz9zhUpHeSQBTUQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "산줄기", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKmRJS3s5yMl5bR4uKJu3SmJ8Ivu5X1CfOLIhFIDjFXB_3ApQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJqe-M-yi7fDURJJWbi8zC_p0/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJqe-M-yi7fDURJJWbi8zC_p0/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJqe-M-yi7fDURJJWbi8zC_p0/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJqe-M-yi7fDURJJWbi8zC_p0/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJqe-M-yi7fDURJJWbi8zC_p0/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJqe-M-yi7fDURJJWbi8zC_p0/photos/5.png"}]	[]	0101000020E61000009803F3461CC55F4036DEC25F38C84240
4.4	37.5554628	126.8590165	2026-02-16 19:15:05.50793	2026-03-17 22:38:40.40038	019c65f2-5223-7d1e-affd-a7c42c240f37	CAFE	ChIJUUTr1XOdfDURjUO6a0dNnXk	494829986	사이유지	[{"author": "신날치 Shinnalchi", "rating": 4, "content": "근처에 볼일 있어서 인테리어가 마음에 들어서 들려봤던 곳. 시간대가 한적할 때 가서 그런지 더욱 더 여유로웠다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWnTmQq1fB0b0Zj8bLnIbzWbYNrpSKqaqsvqqt8YZDSXSHki4zC_w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "리미티드고구마", "rating": 5, "content": "일단 적립 포인트가 도토리인게 너무 귀여움\\n커피도 맛있음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUcwXNBxWkWBY0cXds8pjpnKKOl-04ak17tqY_7HpS4o4MIrc88=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "박찬후", "rating": 5, "content": "개인적으로 이 주변에서는 가장 맛있는 커피라고 생각함. 쿠폰으로 도토리 주는 감성도 괜찮은 듯.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUh34dbwqU1yzy9Km1sJw-KtSoYu2g6m0R_dMN4OXYtaC4vESri=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "JY Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "잘마셨습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWPSA4NxRIIfHMfK9C1EP1wvfOhRhQqaD12nmVFPjkxPXfCLXfl=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Wonjún Park (Júne)", "rating": 4, "content": "especially comfortable of inside toilets. and comfy air", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW-sD-ji8M1Wstht2agoa2NZUyTBCR8yqzNLWuz3Qzl8wbKpI0NXA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Tom Dongmin is", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVcPbDLmTC90BJal1G8sY58urpZTgeXXrnfb56-N6m8kliykOaVjw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "Wonjún Park (Tómy)", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWBRpHkhQKGSND8Uo-zi6WwydGGorLjZDCDgaf_Iel7kdne9XvcAQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJUUTr1XOdfDURjUO6a0dNnXk/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJUUTr1XOdfDURjUO6a0dNnXk/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJUUTr1XOdfDURjUO6a0dNnXk/photos/2.png"}]	[]	0101000020E61000005C8E5720FAB65F408212B06719C74240
4.4	37.5519854	126.86464169999999	2026-02-16 19:15:05.506966	2026-03-17 22:38:43.699213	019c65f2-5222-79d6-89ad-8eb2ba80dfa0	CAFE	ChIJgwgU0pmdfDURBAyOjEI-nxc	16682720	고양이똥	[{"author": "Jin Park", "rating": 4, "content": "다른 브런치카페보다 가성비 좋습니다\\n네이버예약으로 예약하고 가셔요\\n맛도 괜찮습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLwOb2HAwn3flQPNbhPgLJiwnKVTi_Aqv4E1AXbLnaqUgkOjQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "칼린타로", "rating": 5, "content": "이미 유명해서 사진으로 설명을 덧붙입니다 브런치도 커피도 다 맛있어요 양도 많지도 적지도 않은 적당한 느낌이고 무엇보다 소화력이 약한 제가 한그릇 다 비우고도 더부룩하지 않아 부담없이 즐길수 있었습니다 💕 아 전 개인적으로 바질페스토오일파스타였나 그것을 제일 애정합니다 이날은 아보카도샌드위치?를 먹었는데 감자튀김도 넘 맛나요^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX5cT0R043YuIaIGiNeNmEwafgplklWulnECsmahRkC2orQaHj1=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "ming", "rating": 5, "content": "오픈한지 얼마 안되서 갔는데도 웨이팅이 꽤 있어서 놀랐습니다. 근데 웨이팅 좌석도 담요도 놓고 괜찮았어요. 얼마 안있다 들어갔는데 내부 인테리어가 웬만한 홍대-연남의 주택 개조 카페같이 좋았고, 메뉴들도 하나하나 다 먹어보고 싶었구요. 무엇보다 직원분들이 너무 친절하셨습니다. 애기들도 와서 즐기더라고요. 음식 양도 브런치인가 싶을 정도로 많고 만족스러웠어요. 강추합니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUimduSL5-KySbIILlosANz25IdPKcphwbiQcP5n1ukQ1wFGgkD=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "YANG HEE CCHUNG", "rating": 4, "content": "미리 예약해서 2층 중에 조용한 공간 좋았고 음식은 가격대가 약간 높게 느껴졌어요\\n커피도 판매하지만 만약 차를 마실 땐 원하는 잔을 고르면 거기에 담아주십니다^^", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ_VAiDYNwEVibYHN_q5mNoks88ryYKlTv80su9F1r14mXCCw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "힘을내요", "rating": 4, "content": "브런치 먹으러 갔는데 12시 좀 지나니까 테이블 꽉 참. 12시 전에 가세요.\\n가격은 좀 있는편..?\\n아보카도오픈샌드위치와 스파이시로제파스타 시켰는데 샌드위치 양 적어염... 금방 배꺼짐..ㅜ.ㅜ 둘이서 세개 시키면 배부를듯. 분위기 나름 괜찮고 파니니도 맛있어 보이고 사진찍기 좋아서 데이트하러 온 커플도 많았고 가족끼리 점심먹으러, 모임으로 온 팀들도 있었음. 연령대 다양하게 즐기는 곳", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIsr9VjYON_KANlZkLxUyespdYNdCLZN8rNTyL25QVQ05f11Q=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "lue B", "rating": 5, "content": "평일에도 줄서서 먹을때 있어요~!\\n버섯크림파스타 소스가 너무 맛있어서 일행들이 밥에 말아먹고싶다고 해요\\n리조또 메뉴 추가됐으면 좋겠어요~~!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXYfk2XLvwEbIt3bmJdqPCNVZNPFvQdDCUehThKPTVQZTkRQvpJ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "김둘둘", "rating": 4, "content": "브런치 메뉴 가격대가 상당하지만 파스타가 생각보다 정말 맛있어서 놀랐습니다. 가격이 조금만 더 쌌다면 최고일텐데!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVPAkRoViRoL1jbXxiO1PRZe8VweOeGn8uirv7FYzB959-NfpbGkA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Yein Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "가게 바로 앞에 주차불가. 새우카넬로니가 정말 맛있어요. 버섯듬뿍 들어간 버섯크림파스타도 추천", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXzg0ZMMtOr7G0nLeg7YUG9bWU-f91veNi3uT-ghru4Z5dEyAet=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJgwgU0pmdfDURBAyOjEI-nxc/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJgwgU0pmdfDURBAyOjEI-nxc/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJgwgU0pmdfDURBAyOjEI-nxc/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJgwgU0pmdfDURBAyOjEI-nxc/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJgwgU0pmdfDURBAyOjEI-nxc/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJgwgU0pmdfDURBAyOjEI-nxc/photos/5.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJgwgU0pmdfDURBAyOjEI-nxc/photos/6.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJgwgU0pmdfDURBAyOjEI-nxc/photos/7.png"}, {"photoUri": "