4.2	37.317049499999996	126.83760339999999	2026-02-16 19:15:03.55833	2026-03-17 22:41:17.351646	019c65f2-4a86-73f1-b86d-0c8218610fe9	CAFE	ChIJi2x1ZhtvezURfg1XUdtCWwY	10534790	스타벅스 안산중앙역점	[{"author": "ti ming", "rating": 4, "content": "매장 넓고 좌석 많ㅇ음 케이크랑 빵류 많았고\\n서비스도 좋음\\n주말엔 사람많으니 일찍 가세요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXzjyxSbRnWlwJBDpLZdRm_PcGllbIFmgKCO-S8CeZjAJ545ns=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}, {"author": "Jaebong Jang", "rating": 4, "content": "맛있게 커피를 마실수 있는 스벅스벅~~", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUAjzazowrNyAeynvVYf0rZVcW3Z3VO1Jdd-vbZi7yM98ryk0L-6g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "손희연", "rating": 4, "content": "비가 오는 휴일임에도 거리에 나와서 따뜻한 차한잔을 마실수있는 곳. 조용하고 좋다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK7NF1reixDSucH5NTepUw7C6aYS0CWK8ukTpxV8G7MfwjQyQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "정혜영", "rating": 3, "content": "항상 사람들이 너무 많아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJLWHkG2MsVJ5uGzM6GYLfcIsZQs2jce4Lv3HIwaxFCynURzw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "theji du", "rating": 5, "content": "다좋은데 신메뉴 키위 어쩌구 이거는 제입맛에는 안맞네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJtTAKnARx5Z6120NpocU4ludcBLLMif0MDdzBgcgHkd6ux2g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "이인호 (사청)", "rating": 5, "content": "친절함! 스타벅스만큼.\\n맛은 스타벅스 커피맛 맛있음\\n화장실 2층 상가건물에 있어요 깔끔한건 글쎄요..구식임\\n사람이 기본적으로많아서 조용하게 있기는 어렵습니다.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXfPopLW60zEZfLgO6E0uYvp7JmrUigXN_RkiG3EPDuK-TlzTA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "심용섭", "rating": 3, "content": "일단 비싸요..역시 스벅..2층이 있어서 전경을 바라볼수 있어서 좋네요..딱히 분위기도 일반커피숍 정도..스벅이면 뭔가 좀 있을줄 알았는데 파스구찌보다 못한 테이블도 그렇고..단순히 커피한잔 하는곳.,", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocICakBrxQxHYzxAGoIi_K3vMUpywLtaxJBF64HO3Rplbespsw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Dulcamara M", "rating": 4, "content": "직원들이 친절하고, 공간의 여유도 많음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVkDQNf0jkDUr4iwTnqASrGQ27XkC9bpn-tCckMN_3R9T5xmq4=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJi2x1ZhtvezURfg1XUdtCWwY/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJi2x1ZhtvezURfg1XUdtCWwY/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJi2x1ZhtvezURfg1XUdtCWwY/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJi2x1ZhtvezURfg1XUdtCWwY/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJi2x1ZhtvezURfg1XUdtCWwY/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJi2x1ZhtvezURfg1XUdtCWwY/photos/5.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [13, 0], "closeTime": [10, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [8, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E61000002D814A4B9BB55F4048DBF81395A84240
