4.5	37.4684451	127.1401557	2026-03-17 22:41:31.93801	2026-03-17 22:41:31.93801	019cfc07-bea2-7a24-a60d-6e0e07a51c09	CAFE	ChIJrR2kBTmvfDURcPk9N7-WWMg	1195890730	쁘띠슈슈314	[{"author": "Mr.ticket", "rating": 5, "content": "매장에서 먹고 너무 맛있어서 포장했어요! 다음에는 선물로 주문하려해요\\n특히 생과일타르트 종류가 제일 베스트고 과일 진짜 신선하고 달아서 꿀맛이였습니당", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUe365IAohPwun5lZu40p1UpzwPIST_cXCjr70m7-4lrPqe3KE=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Sunah Kim (Seon11)", "rating": 5, "content": "종류도 많고 커피도 맛있어서 좋아영 ㅎㅎㅎ 위례 친구네집 집들이갈때 샀는데 다들 아주 맛있게 먹었습니당 :)", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJLkTvjUuwWQVbkU1ajqSc4rK7JCQ3HTFKQWV0SBDmIMrUGuA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "milk shin", "rating": 5, "content": "인생 타르트 발견\\n찐으로 맛있어요👍\\n다음에 또 오겠습니다!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV4d4bnmDzin-VIJjuipVjAWKKzKkE_rJYxIbNdP5_fwfNy_is=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "윤정최", "rating": 5, "content": "오랜만에 맛있는 타르트발견!!!\\n과일도 어디서 사시는지 왕맛존맛", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIihvFZ3xHq-cNFSXrYx1vlNCElQ08YvkHdj0HgPz57uAuPeQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "도도한세니", "rating": 5, "content": "사장님이 친절하시고 타르트는 최고예요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUmUUr4WnlZtOrEyNZ_mtvU3PRwQ36TUi9BjHjmyRowhBe1oso=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "ᄒᄋ", "rating": 5, "content": "방문할때마다 친절하시고 유기농타르트 맛집입니다!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVKPuPS2uyB-5oWLkBv42HylwQt7zGSrxDVMlwQPmveAcuZMPs=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Suwon AHN", "rating": 1, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXIGOnQpybwAzuNyeTdZooEWJ6n_K3ppzniXUANK7MqKsgrPu9Rrw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "백초희", "rating": 5, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJP1m0lTHEaaqtkTrBiIoZ1m7D5M9P6UwkYoM5LKvSwDwN3ow=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[]	[]	0101000020E610000045F69C4FF8C85F40583C5002F6BB4240
4.5	37.4848578	127.1224604	2026-03-17 22:41:31.938192	2026-03-17 22:41:31.938192	019cfc07-bea2-7a24-a60e-9ed301db563f	CAFE	ChIJ5agsaTGlfDURhue1_c3H2AI	859154993	Switch	[{"author": "Jhyun Han", "rating": 4, "content": "매장이 넓은편이고 호박죽 넘 맛있고 아보카도 샌드위치 먹었는데 좋아요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVCddGYRDUZDs_-C7UCA0BZ3Jf98r_ENvaShjgn9aMDS4gDcHOb=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Shan Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "Nice food and friendly staff!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVpCz79IWsi0mgKCYIjhhBhCouOOpEPx_RNq1py9S56GsjfHYpl=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ5agsaTGlfDURhue1_c3H2AI/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ5agsaTGlfDURhue1_c3H2AI/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ5agsaTGlfDURhue1_c3H2AI/photos/2.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 0], "closeTime": [20, 0]}]	0101000020E610000086432564D6C75F40F21A05D20FBE4240
3.6	37.4777559	127.1231253	2026-03-17 22:41:31.938368	2026-03-17 22:41:31.938368	019cfc07-bea2-7a24-a60f-aeb98e88f607	CAFE	ChIJM4lFu22lfDUR3r6qESfNLWE	2022610026	매머드커피 가든파이브점	[{"author": "Moon Youngchae", "rating": 4, "content": "저렴하지만 맛있는 다양한 음료와 커피를 마실 수 있다 이름답게 빅사이즈라 가성비가 좋으며 여사장님 두분이 운영하는데 깔끔하고 친절하다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUBPlY3wEG-fbvECiEc7s9rE-5AOQmlGO_qCd2d38E4ysbua6wj9w=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "레고김태호", "rating": 5, "content": "바닐라 라떼 맛있어요\\n직원은 친절하네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV4XDMoCYsQuoSY1RG1hBNaMK_wWhqzPX0pI204wGrNxjjvjxQk=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Tommy Squirtle", "rating": 1, "content": "서비스업 기본 개념이 없음", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV_-7SNvO1d-8EbUDVKVPDbJ73FO4ytcSZrcCxU-9YVID_7Lr0=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "소낙비", "rating": 5, "content": "알바 아가씨가 아주 친절해요. 양 많아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLMGAQ6ABaYdGQGGqyrXfRGOkjNWLlmDpRqeyL8Kl3HJLCN=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "KindDevilG", "rating": 4, "content": "가격도 저렴하고 길목에 있어 사람이 많은편", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXS32lnUVfajj5GH1oQkZvbyMeeG_loml8wZm0kKz0sqcg7rgEu=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "안쪼매난뚜.", "rating": 5, "content": "기대없이갔다가또생각나게된커피 또마시러갑니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLNigrf8jstvx5UZOvvd5IUsJbz5B1sYqjg1XSrPMH-rrYPbg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100"}, {"author": "Anne Gauthier", "rating": 1, "content": "매우 불친절", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRJk53RlOQ9KYzxJ4jqvs1p0btPPBZB0PYXoepzQDzKG2idA=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "고진규", "rating": 5, "content": "가성비가 최고임.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIwArtrbU9WOAj_IT-R4vy0PC6un1hvG29sJYNjUaQ2NJcozg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJM4lFu22lfDUR3r6qESfNLWE/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJM4lFu22lfDUR3r6qESfNLWE/photos/1.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [20, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [7, 30], "closeTime": [20, 0]}]	0101000020E6100000DA33F048E1C75F404BFCF61A27BD4240
4.7	37.653225899999995	127.0505477	2026-02-16 19:15:03.558817	2026-03-17 22:41:42.071705	019c65f2-4a86-73f1-b870-b4d1350f9daf	CAFE	ChIJ7Rwk3EW5fDURWbVueWFtr6k	2111250465	더쌍화	[{"author": "최상희", "rating": 5, "content": "부모님 모시고 갔는데  쌍화차맛도 좋고, 사장님께서 먹는 설명을 곁들어 주시니 좋으네요!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVsLEMB6r-IbtbZ0nEzkic8iYiXbwHyuQIOmpN03BTbDHwnR_t0xQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "이을식", "rating": 5, "content": "창동역주변에 더쌍화  전통한방찻집 홀도넓고\\n아늑한분위기 쌍화차 한잔\\n하며 휴식을 취할수있는집", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX21QEOljH4nHHXpUpo-c0b1OcSFU7U3xvWNPC7q_zul9oWlzs4Xw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "경피닉스", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVeqvyVKUckV_pfKTVzNQrHFrR4Ds42ok_OENsOld7IGpXmYL1G=s120-c-rp-mo-ba5-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ7Rwk3EW5fDURWbVueWFtr6k/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ7Rwk3EW5fDURWbVueWFtr6k/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ7Rwk3EW5fDURWbVueWFtr6k/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ7Rwk3EW5fDURWbVueWFtr6k/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJ7Rwk3EW5fDURWbVueWFtr6k/photos/4.png"}]	[]	0101000020E6100000D5986B2C3CC35F4038B302E89CD34240
4.2	37.5707421	127.00569399999999	2026-03-17 22:41:43.498272	2026-03-17 22:41:43.498272	019cfc07-ebca-7664-99a1-1f150beae344	CAFE	ChIJhclzPwCjfDURVsKMujh6LJg	308983214	더쌍화 본사	[{"author": "조연경 (화려한나비)", "rating": 5, "content": "멋진 전통카페다. 맛있고 이쁘고 친절하고 분위기 좋고. 외국친구들 부모님 다 같이 또 가고 싶다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWYZ2Fne89MroI0obCKAL3sJ9goRKFgOO-5NJLvrSMp5KJjDfrGBg=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Winnie Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "골목 들어서면 보이는 연 등에 양쪽 모두 다 같은 곳입니다. 건물들이 서로 나눠져 있을 뿐이에요.\\n대로변 보다 골목 안쪽에 있는 곳에 들어오면은 한옥 스타일에 다양한 개인 방으로 들어갈 수가 있습니다\\n온돌방인데 정말 찜질방처럼 바닥이 뜨끈뜨끈 해요\\n떡다과상 맛있었습니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVhzhQW1FdGmnelxvHGisYunF8vZ9RefAjqUXXjvMNXNPknGlhi9g=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "AJ's studio", "rating": 4, "content": "2026.1월 첫방문 | 동대문역 9번출구에서 도보 300m거리로 골목 안쪽으로 들어오면 더쌍화본사와 만난다. 알록달록한 원색으로 치장된 간판과 분위기가 약간의 촌스러운 레트로풍이지만 이마저도 경험으로 좋았다. 이곳은 한의원에서 전통한방찻집을 운영하는 곳이어서 건강한 음료에 큰 기대를 하고 방문한 카페였는데, 의녀복장을 하신 직원분들이 서빙해 주시며 하나하나 디저트와 한방차에 대한 자세한 설명까지 해주시는 부분이 인상적이었다.\\n\\n황실쌍화세트(1만원)과 장금이쌍화세트(8천원)을 주문했고, 쌍화차는 인공적인 단맛이 적고 약같은 맛이어서 으른이들이 좋아할 맛이자, 쌀쌀한 겨울에 감기까지 도망갈 그런 퀄리티의 쌍화차였다. 디저트 하나하나 플레이팅에도 정성가득. 담번 방문에는 대추차 도전 예정이다. 주차는 불가", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUEOMX64QTBJbdVJxTWusyCiFMcu2QlDVWCS_Er73Dv_JGmMwmdeQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "풍운", "rating": 4, "content": "쌍화차가 진하고 좋아요. 어른들이 많이 오시고 분위기도 나름 괜찮네요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUNPZy-51QxkjgeBFKQ21aQbH-1Wa4zIyicqKakVKW7lJ39s1U=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "Changsoo Kim", "rating": 4, "content": "을지로에서 가볼만 한곳", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLgeRRLKPECA1-9lflosLccsaCcb7A2eKcfQ7BmtwgTy-dUew=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}, {"author": "lee kyusam", "rating": 2, "content": "너무달아요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKX2nelYFj04CX-hPZXYFOq4NLqnyp4HYHx3M-B5IK5I9WqSw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "大石貴子", "rating": 5, "content": "薬膳のスイーツ、体にいい、罪悪感のないスイーツを求めてる方にはお勧め‼️\\n店員さんも感じがよくてお店の雰囲気も素敵でした💓", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXPbTmzkJd_2y7TJnq-sZ1epOOfjiHt4uoUDjCxqSrq1qQbcfA=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "유석중", "rating": 4, "content": "", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJDIwjQVEzIOXfewqok1ZRPKT0hSQPT7aDNWs0mXghGngWU7A=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJhclzPwCjfDURVsKMujh6LJg/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJhclzPwCjfDURVsKMujh6LJg/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJhclzPwCjfDURVsKMujh6LJg/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJhclzPwCjfDURVsKMujh6LJg/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJhclzPwCjfDURVsKMujh6LJg/photos/4.png"}]	[{"day": "FRIDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "THURSDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "WEDNESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "MONDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SUNDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "SATURDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}, {"day": "TUESDAY", "openTime": [11, 0], "closeTime": [22, 0]}]	0101000020E610000023F25D4A5DC05F40A5F9BE130EC94240
4.5	37.5715046	126.98888629999999	2026-03-17 22:41:43.498726	2026-03-17 22:41:43.498726	019cfc07-ebca-7664-99a2-01d28fb12920	CAFE	ChIJq4AUR6-jfDURw0CPC4gTfa8	1457813988	더쌍화커피	[{"author": "zzemi", "rating": 4, "content": "분위기 한국 전통적. 장금이가 서빙.다과상이 푸짐하게 나옴. 쌍화탕 완전 진함. 건강한 삼도 나옴. 가성비 굿. 주말에 가면 미어터짐!!!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXhzmldk6kUfAP_BxazJ3mtqKor8rPidxglTQALMFYpBqCkr_gw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "스텔라고", "rating": 5, "content": "엄마가 쌍화차를 좋아하셔서 우연히 들렀다가 자주 찾게되어서 리뷰 남겨봅니다. 한옥 분위기도 좋고 직원분들도 친절하시고 무엇보다 쌍화차가 맛있어요.셋트로 나오는 구성은 조금씩 바뀌는듯 한데 정말 대접받는 기분이네요.", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLGHn1Vw2B8xvgtFWoLe1K-wNGHUAKzf5LoqU566wgcmXDZ9vUL=s120-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100"}, {"author": "jake Kim", "rating": 5, "content": "날이 쌀쌀해 쌍화차\\n생각나서 가봄..\\n가끔 지나다 어르신들 가득 하길래\\n신기하다 했는데 이유를 알았음!!\\n가성비 너무 좋아요.\\n\\n전통 쌍화차(5,000원)\\n쌍화차에 삼도 들어있고\\n닭죽(?)/홍삼정(?)/조청(?)/헛개환/용안정과\\n이 구성 세트가 5,000원임🥰\\n\\n손님들 평균 나이가 60대임\\n우리가 어려보여서 그런가 다들 쳐다보심ㅋ\\n가성비가 좋아서 손님들이 많은거였음.\\n\\n카운터에서 주문ㅡ계산하면\\n자리로 가져다주심.\\n사실 견과류 많이 들어간 쌍화차\\n먹으러 간거였는데 그건 계란동동 쌍화차였음.\\n\\n다음에 계란동동 쌍화차 먹으러\\n또 갈께요~재방문 의사 100%⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUYbDpME7LL7cGzRdHpzUNurq9UIMmFAbTlRHIls6_thihvBnhl=s120-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100"}, {"author": "JJ Oh", "rating": 5, "content": "차하나 커피하나 시켰는데 나오는게 엄청남\\n꼭 들러보세요", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU9CMhUR3Bilj9KTs3o8oi0MKmB9J7wcF4ZAD_oXYk8n4zMA4e5JQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100"}, {"author": "Ki Lo", "rating": 1, "content": "키오스크 불편", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUvt73tKArzwwb8nbn8RsyNanJvc4scSiASS2foiEi38C5SmR2Q=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "Charlie Yun 다이아몬드 국제딜러 윤영진.", "rating": 4, "content": "종로3가 회사인데 우연히 들린 쌍화커피\\n대박입니다\\n추천합니다", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXL8j97r1PKI67jzjamBfemoQJyTb98vrWNWWKgFib2KUDZSpwR=s120-c-rp-mo-ba8-br100"}, {"author": "Gain Lee", "rating": 5, "content": "This is a wonderful place to experience Ssanghwa tea, one of Korea’s traditional herbal teas. 🍵\\nThe tea is served beautifully like a small set meal, making it as delightful to look at as it is to drink. The flavor is rich and comforting — perfect when you need a moment of rest during your trip.\\n\\nThe interior is decorated in a traditional Korean style, so you feel as if you’ve stepped into a hanok (Korean house). It’s a great spot for foreigners who want to enjoy authentic Korean culture. Highly recommended if you want a memorable cultural experience in Korea!", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV0X1Krb-xaoEYAUfGJuP3SYL5E8tqPaLnd2iNXHhzEn4VBU_Fh=s120-c-rp-mo-br100"}, {"author": "美鈴Misuzu", "rating": 5, "content": "場所柄、お年寄りの韓国人が利用する店\\nインテリアが韓国ぽいので観光客には良いと思う。店内にトイレも有る。\\n種類は二種の中から選ぶ。\\n昔ながらの韓国ぽいカフェを探しているならお勧めなカフェ", "publishTime": null, "translatedContent": null, "authorProfileImage": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU4G6pXqSRGwMveIcPVFVwk3d8TbFaTrpMf1KXx2z3HmpS7Xbto=s120-c-rp-mo-ba7-br100"}]	[{"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq4AUR6-jfDURw0CPC4gTfa8/photos/0.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq4AUR6-jfDURw0CPC4gTfa8/photos/1.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq4AUR6-jfDURw0CPC4gTfa8/photos/2.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq4AUR6-jfDURw0CPC4gTfa8/photos/3.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq4AUR6-jfDURw0CPC4gTfa8/photos/4.png"}, {"photoUri": "https://moisam-server.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/places/ChIJq4AUR6-jfDURw0CPC4gTfa8/photos/5.png"}]	[]	0101000020E6100000987DC3E949BF5F40BC410F1027C94240
